UID:1tg5oqp3472mcmckamp80usnhs@google.com
CREATED:20230923T233322Z
DESCRIPTION:<b>ATCI monthly competitions are held at the end of each calend
 ar month on Saturdays and Sundays</b>\, weather permitting. <u></u>If you a
 re new to our program\, come and try it\, so you will be more comfortable a
 nd better prepared next month!<br><br><u></u>The only differences between t
 he regular training sessions and the tournaments are that we are more close
 ly reproducing official competition conditions\, which include:<u></u><br><
 ul><li><u></u>No coaching while you are on the shooting line (but\, as in a
  real tournament\, y<u></u>ou can always ask the coach for help in between 
 the ends.) </li><li>This is your chance to find out how well you can do the
  form on your own\, and learn how to go into ¨trusting¨ compared with ¨trai
 ning¨ mode.</li><li><u></u>You will shoot more arrows :  2 practice ends + 
 two rounds (<u></u>60 arrows at 9m and 13.5m or 72 arrows at 20m-70m)</li><
 li><u></u>You will score every arrow for two rounds. <u></u></li><li><u></u
 >The ends will be timed. You´ll have 4 min to shoot 6 arrows.<u></u></li><l
 i>Everyone will be shooting at close-to-official competition spacing\, so t
 here will be two archers on each target about 3 ft apart\, depending on the
  number of registrations</li><li>There will be a maximum of 20 archers on t
 he shooting line at the same time. Awesome! (Lots of arrow flying towards t
 he targets!)</li></ul><br>Your goal is always to replicate the NTS step(s) 
 mindfully and consistently on every shot.<br><u></u><b>Outside of the compe
 tition weekends</b>\, the focus of your regular lessons will be on one or t
 wo of the Steps of Shooting of the NTS (National Training System) shot cycl
 e\, to help you focus and improve your form\, which\, as we all know\, lead
 s to greater precision (tighter groups of arrows) and ultimately greater ac
 curacy (tight groups of arrows dead center).<br><u></u><br><b>JANUARY</b><b
 r><b>     </b><b>7-13</b>   Welcome to 2023 !  Understanding  NTS CONCEPTS 
 especially TRANSFER<br><b>    14-20</b><b>  </b>NTS Step 1: STANCE <br>    
 <b>21-27  </b>NTS Step 2:  NOCK <br><b>    28+29</b><b> </b><b> </b><b>ATCI
  MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT </b><br><b>FEBRUARY</b><br><b>     
 30-5</b>    NTS Step 3: HOOK &amp\; GRIP   <br><u></u>     <b>6-12  </b>  N
 TS Step 4: SET    <br><b>     13-19</b>  REVIEW Steps 1-4 <br>     <b>25+26
   </b><b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT </b><b>(INDOOR NATIONA
 LS!!!!</b>)<br><b>MARCH</b><br><b>     </b><b>27-5:   </b>NTS Step 5: SET-U
 P <br><b>     6-12</b>    NTS Step 6 DRAW to LOAD    <br><u></u><b>     13-
 19 </b> REVIEW Steps 1-6<b> (Spring Break 13-17)</b><br><b>     </b><b>25+2
 6</b><b> </b> <b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b><b>    </b>
 <br><b>APRIL</b><br><b>     27-2   </b>NTS Step 7  ANCHOR   <br>       <b>3
 -9  </b> NTS Step 8  TRANSFER to HOLD  <br>     <b>10-16 </b>NTS Step 9 EXP
 AND / AIM<br><b>     17-23 </b>NTS Step 10 RELEASE and FOLLOW-THROUGH <br><
 b>     24-30 </b>REVIEW Steps 1-10<br><b>     29+30 ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITIO
 N and STAR PIN SHOOT</b><br><b>MAY</b><br><b>     1-7     </b>NTS Step 11 F
 EEDBACK<br>     <b>8-14   </b>MENTAL PROGRAM<br>     <b>15-21 </b>MENTAL PR
 OGRAM<br><b>     22-31 </b>PUTTING IT ALL TOGETHER !!<br><b>     27+28 ATCI
  MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b><b>     </b><br><b><br></b>You d
 o not need to score every class. In fact\, it would be more beneficial to y
 ou if you scored only during the ATCI Monthly Competition and Star Pin Shoo
 t\, which happen the last week of each month. This is because working on th
 e NTS Steps of Shooting (your form) is more easily done without the distrac
 tion of the target face or scoring\, and you will improve faster.<br><br>As
  you reach higher levels\, you will learn the NTS Steps in progressively gr
 eater detail.<br>The NTS Steps are cumulative with each step most successfu
 lly completed if the previous steps have been completed mindfully. <br><br>
 Your ability to learn and understand the NTS Steps\, and use deep focus on 
 these Steps while shooting outdoors and while using your stretchband/string
  loop at home will propel you to higher levels fast!<br><br><b>Goals by the
  end of the semester: </b><br>See Coach Racae´s email ¨2023 New Year´s Goal
 s¨
LAST-MODIFIED:20230923T233408Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
