UID:3f166n7i5dsmriudlekmdhtt90@google.com
CREATED:20130917T202621Z
DESCRIPTION:This class is for junior and adult competitive archers who want
  to compete in local\, state\, national and international tournaments\, and
  train for a place on the Junior United Sates Archery Team and/or Junior Dr
 eam Team. Archers are admitted into this OPT (Olympic Path Training) class 
 through satisfying certain requirements before October each year\, together
  with Coach Alex's approval. It is a once-a-year appointment. Once in OPT\,
  the archer will need to meet or exceed progressively higher yearly require
 ments in order to stay in OPT. If you are interested in joining the OPT Pro
 gram\, ask Coach Alex or Coach Racae for an OPT Application and Requirement
 s.\n\nIf you're not sure if the class is meeting due to bad weather\, call/
 text Coach Alex at 512 203 2368.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230120T192522Z
LOCATION:Indoor range November - March\; Outdoor field March - October
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OPT
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
