 ete round (30 arrows)\, you may not recognize your final score\, because it
  will have been averaged by taking your recorded score from your scorecard\
 , dividing by the number of arrows you shot to get an arrow average\, and t
 hen multiplying that by 30 to get a full round score. After the last first-
 time class each weekend\, final scores may also be sent to all Outdoor 1 pa
 rticipants in an email with more information before your next class.
