DESCRIPTION:PREREQUISITE: <br>INDOOR 1: First-time Class<br>(To register fo
 r Indoor 1\, click the Sign Up button at the top of <a href="http://www.arc
 herytrainingcenter.com">www.archerytrainingcenter.com</a>.)<br>INDOOR 2: at
  9m<br>INDOOR 3A: at 13.5m<br><br>OPEN to Juniors/Parents/Adults in<br>INDO
 OR 3B/4/5/6+ (18m)<br><br>Enrollment links at: <a href="http://www.archeryt
 rainingcenter.com/Classes">http://www.archerytrainingcenter.com/Classes</a>
 <br><br>Fees: <br>RECREATIONAL: <br>$15 for up to 3 hours\, when not covere
 d in the monthly or progressive fees.<br>There are also reduced Monthly fee
 s when you regularly come to more than 3 hrs/week and Progressive fees when
  you are at 18m and regularly come to more than 5 hrs/week. Ask Coach Racae
  for more information.<br>&nbsp\;<br>Your name will be on the list below wh
 en we receive your registration form and fee in advance of the class. When 
 you attend\, and the class is near full\, you should pay at least one class
  in advance to guarantee you have a place on the shooting line next time. <
 br><br>When classes are not full\, it's okay to just drop in occasionally f
 or the class and pay at that time. However it is difficult to tell how many
  people will be dropping in\, so to secure your place\, it is better to reg
 ister and pay in advance to prevent overcrowding. We can only take 10 peopl
 e on the shooting line at one time. <br><br>When we have more than 10 arche
 rs\, we will form a second line\, as in a tournament\, which will reduce th
 e number of arrows shot per person within the time. (You can see the actual
  attendance and class composition by looking at past classes at <a href="ht
 tp://www.archerytrainingcenter.com/calendar">www.archerytrainingcenter.com/
 calendar</a>.)<br><br>Scores are also listed below\, if you kept score\, wh
 ich is not required\, except on Master Challenge weeks. You need 230 pts on
  40cm target or 240 pts on 60cm target to graduate out of your distance int
 o Indoor 3A 13.5m\, and again at 13.5m to get into Indoor 3B at 18m (full d
 istance).<br>PB = Personal Best. <br><br>Registered archers:<br>1. Josephin
 e L.\, JOAD 18m - paid<br>2. Lily R.\, JOAD 13.5m\, paid<br>3. <br>4. <br>5
 . <br>6. <br>7. <br>8. <br>9.<br>10.
