  old or under. \nWe are part of USOC's Safe Sports Program\, so parents be 
 prepared to stay in the range to fulfill the two adults in attendance rule 
 (instructor counts as one adult).\n\nT/W/Th: 3:30-5:00\nW: 7:00-8:30\n\nFee
 s:\n$10/hr or $15 for 1.5 hrs\nFree to those who are enrolled in two other 
 classes each week or CAP archers
