UID:36ikq7ko8dets4ie3jvhsn79q0@google.com
CREATED:20190815T191720Z
DESCRIPTION:PREREQUISITE: \nINDOOR 1: First-time Class\n(To register for In
 door 1\, click the Sign Up button at the top of www.archerytrainingcenter.c
 om.)\nINDOOR 2: at 9m\nINDOOR 3A: at 13.5m\n\nOPEN to Juniors/Parents/Adult
 s in\nINDOOR 3B/4/5/6+ (18m)\n\nEnrollment links at: http://www.archerytrai
 ningcenter.com/Classes\n\nFees: \nRECREATIONAL: \n$15 for up to 3 hours\, w
 hen not covered in the monthly or progressive fees.\nThere are also reduced
  Monthly fees when you regularly come to more than 3 hrs/week and Progressi
 ve fees when you are at 18m and regularly come to more than 5 hrs/week. Ask
  Coach Racae for more information.\n \nYour name will be on the list below 
 when we receive your registration form and fee in advance of the class. Whe
 n you attend\, and the class is near full\, you should pay at least one cla
 ss in advance to guarantee you have a place on the shooting line next time.
  \n\nWhen classes are not full\, it's okay to just drop in occasionally for
  the class and pay at that time. However it is difficult to tell how many p
 eople will be dropping in\, so to secure your place\, it is better to regis
 ter and pay in advance to prevent overcrowding. We can only take 10 people 
 on the shooting line at one time. \n\nWhen we have more than 10 archers\, w
 e will form a second line\, as in a tournament\, which will reduce the numb
 er of arrows shot per person within the time. (You can see the actual atten
 dance and class composition by looking at past classes at www.archerytraini
 ngcenter.com/calendar.)\n\nScores are also listed below\, if you kept score
 \, which is not required\, except on Master Challenge weeks. You need 230 p
 ts on 40cm target or 240 pts on 60cm target to graduate out of your distanc
 e into Indoor 3A 13.5m\, and again at 13.5m to get into Indoor 3B at 18m (f
 ull distance).\nPB = Personal Best. \n\nRegistered archers:\n1. \n2.\n3. \n
