CREATED:20221219T213314Z
DESCRIPTION:<br>Several of our ATCI archers will be participating in the 20
 23 Indoor Nationals and JOAD Indoor Nationals. Great shooting to you all! (
 May the form be with you!)<br><br>It's always a good idea to visit the Indo
 or Nationals at College Station the year before you may be participating to
  observe\, so you are more prepared next year.&nbsp\;<br>Drive out to Texas
  A&amp\;M College Station the weekend of <b>Feb. 24-26</b>.&nbsp\;<br>Here 
 is some general information\, format and rules:<br>JOAD Indoor Nationals&nb
 sp\;<a href="https://www.usarchery.org/events/event-information/41047">http
 s://www.usarchery.org/events/event-information/41047</a>.&nbsp\;<br>Indoor 
 Nationals:&nbsp\;<a href="https://www.usarchery.org/events/event-informatio
 n/41065" id="ow9458" __is_owner="true">https://www.usarchery.org/events/eve
 nt-information/41065</a><br>Before you go to a competition\, make sure to&n
 bsp\;<span style="background-color: var(--textfield-surface)\; color: var(-
 -on-surface)\;">read and understand the competition format and rules and&nb
 sp\;</span><span style="background-color: var(--textfield-surface)\; color:
  var(--on-surface)\;">review these guidelines:</span><br>&nbsp\;<a href="ht
 tps://www.usarchery.org/events/rules" style="background-color: var(--textfi
 eld-surface)\;" id="ow9462" __is_owner="true">https://www.usarchery.org/eve
 nts/rules</a><br><a href="https://www.usarchery.org/events/event-resources"
  id="ow9466" __is_owner="true">https://www.usarchery.org/events/event-resou
 rces</a><br><br>If you're shooting\, you'll enjoy yourself more if you have
  three things consistent and reliable according to your level of experience
 :<br><ul><li>your mental program</li><li>your form</li><li>your equipment (
 tuned\, repaired and ready\, and you have back up</li></ul><br><i>Coach Rac
 ae will be at the Indoor Nationals and JOAD Indoor Nationals during the Fri
 day 2/24 afternoon\, and Saturday 2/25 morning and JOAD lines. She will be 
 back at the ATCI south field on Sunday\, Feb 26.</i>
LAST-MODIFIED:20221219T213314Z
LOCATION:TX A&M Univ\, Phys. Edu. Act. Bldg.\, 632 Penberthy R.\, College S
 tation\, Texas\, United States of America\, 77843
