DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><u></u><b>UPDATE: With the news that Austin/T
 ravis County is now in Stage 5 of COVID-19 risk-based guidelines\, I have m
 ade the decision to postpone the start of our archery training classes this
  semester until Austin drops back down to Stage 4. (See my email to you.)</
 b><br><br>I know this is disappointing to most of you - and no one wants to
  attend the training classes more than I do. I love to coach you. My main c
 oncern\, however\, as always\, is to keep everyone who attends our classes 
 as safe as possible.&nbsp\;<br><br>Not to worry! We will start classes soon
  again!<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; 
 &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nb
 sp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\
 ; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; Coach Racae<br><br>REGISTER NOW !<br>This class i
 s open to adults\, juniors\, and parents who have taken and graduated out o
 f Outdoor 1: First-time Class and are shooting at distances of 9m to 70m. I
 t is a mixed class of different distances.&nbsp\;<br><br>Sign up any time f
 or as many or as few Outdoor 2-9 Classes as you like.<br><br>Register at on
 e of these links depending on your level:<br><a href="https://docs.google.c
 om/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfhDoxxJ9Ce7AtP_RpCukDqlwQRYE3f0JWOdCeK2UG97HCHXw/viewf
 orm">2022 Winter/Spring Outdoor 2 at 9m and Outdoor 3 at 13.5m</a><br><a hr
 ef="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfzAdwWy-f__WYpyNi4-xDg1fqJ320
 v5jpHRUNxntEM31pu3Q/viewform">2022 Winter/Spring Outdoor 4-9 at 20m-70m</a>
 <br><br>More information and registration forms are available on&nbsp\;<a h
 ref="http://www.archerytrainingcenter.com">www.archerytrainingcenter.com</a
 >.<br><br><b>Registered archers&nbsp\;</b>at 9m on 40-cm target face unless
  otherwise noted:<u></u><br><u></u><br>1. <b>Christopher N</b>.\, adult - O
 utdoor 3 at 13.5m on 40-cm target face - pd - <b>substituted 2/20</b><br>2.
  <b>Cyrenna V.\, </b>adult - Outdoor 3 at 13.5m on 40-cm target face - pd -
  <b>substituted 2/19</b><br>3. <b>Marissa I.\, </b>adult - pd - substitute 
