 /viewform">2023 Outdoor 1: First-time Class for Juniors and Parents</a><br>
 <br>Sign up for just ONE Outdoor 1 class\, because most people graduate out
  of this class into Outdoor 2 after the first lesson.<br><br>Your name will
  be added below and your place reserved on a first registered and paid basi
 s and after we receive 3 things:  <br><b>2023 OUTDOOR 1 REGISTRATION FORM  
  +  MEMBERSHIP AND WAIVERS PACKET +   FEE</b><b><br></b><u></u><br><b>USA A
 rchery Level 4 NTS Coach Racae Meyer and other instructors/coaches.</b><br>
 <b>See </b><a href="https://www.archerytrainingcenter.com/who-we-are"><u>ht
 tps://www.archerytrainingcenter.com/who-we-are</u></a><b><br></b><br><b>Reg
 istered archers </b>at 9m on 40-cm target face unless otherwise noted:<br><
 br><u></u><b>YOUR PLACES ARE NOT RESERVED UNTIL WE RECEIVE THE ABOVE\, INCL
 UDING YOUR FEE</b><br><u></u><br><b>Target Assignments:</b><u></u><br>5A. <
 b>Brian F.\, </b>adult - pd - <b>substituted 2/18</b><br>5B.<br><br>6A. <b>
 Thomas B.\, </b>adult - pd - <b>substituted 2/18</b><br>6B. <b>Andrew B.\, 
 </b>9\, on 60-cm target face - pd - <b>substituted 2/18</b><br><br>7A. <b>R
 yan B.\, </b>13\, on 60-cm target face - pd - <b>substituted for 1/28 - sub
 stituted 2/25</b><br>7B. <b>Nathan B.\, </b><span>9\, on 60-cm target face 
 - pd -</span><span> </span><b>substituted for 1/28 - substituted 2/25</b><b
