DESCRIPTION:<b>What we worked on:</b><br>tension and direction towards targ
 et with bow arm - really pushing towards the 10 ring<br>Setting and keeping
  shoulders level\, down\, and in place<br>Draw elbow needs to be horizontal
  in line with hand and arrow at least at height of shoulders before DRAW to
  LOAD<br>Synchronized release: Release string at same time as flicking bow 
 hand down in the ¨Sit΅motion\, keeping ¨V¨ part of hand grip in line with a
 rm bones.<br>Follow-through - use stretchband over head drill to feel ¨Fina
 l¨ position with draw elbow\, shoulder muscles\, bow arm tricep to grip all
  in line.<br><b>Homework:</b><br>Get a shoelace fingersling\, learn how to 
 tie it\, and use it to practice synchronized release\n\nJoin with Google Me
 et: https://meet.google.com/cnt-ufuj-dgh\n\nLearn more about Meet at: https
 ://support.google.com/a/users/answer/9282720
