 50 pts at 18m)\nINDOOR 5 (251-270 pts at 18m)\nINDOOR 6 (271-280 pts at 18m
 )\nINDOOR 7 (281-290 pts at 18m)\nINDOOR 8 (291-300 pts at 18m)\n\nEnrollme
 nt links at: http://www.archerytrainingcenter.com/Classes\n\nFees: \nRECREA
 TIONAL: \n$20/cl for 1 hr.\nThere are also reduced \nMonthly fees for those
  who come at least 3 hours/week and \nProgressive fees for those who meet t
 he weekly attendance requirements for their level.\nTalk to Coach Racae or 
 \nLook under "Classes" on our website.
