 k! Just too dangerous out there.. </i><i>I´m canceling the open range\, and
  all the evening weekday classes this week.</i><br><i>Shooting really great
  shots with great form is reduced under these conditions\, so it is a much 
 better use of your time\, if you spend the time working in front of your mi
 rrors with your stretchbands/string loops\, and trying to understand / feel
  / do the NTS shot cycle. </i><br><i>See you on the weekend. We´ve got two 
 out of three archer tents up\, and four really nice new dark blue pop-up te
 nts for spectators\, so it should be fine in the mornings on Saturday and S
 unday. I´m looking forward to seeing you then!</i><br>                     
                                                    <i><b>Coach Racae </b></
