UID:AC4BCC07-CD22-4B84-BC86-3C859C17DFEE
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Chicago:20161207T183000
CREATED:20160921T233823Z
DESCRIPTION:Instructor Dale\n\nPREREQUISITES: \nINDOOR 1: First-time Class\
 ,  (To register for Indoor 1\, click the Sign Up button at the top of www.a
 rcherytrainingcenter.com.) \nINDOOR 2 at 9m\, \nINDOOR 3A at 13.5m\n \nOPEN
  to all archers (JOAD and Adults) at 18m.\nHigher levels can also choose to
  register for lower-level classes until lower level classes are full with I
 ndoor 2 and Indoor 3A archers. \n\nEnrollment links at:\nhttp://www.archery
 trainingcenter.com/news\n\nTime / Attendance Requirements: \nRECREATIONAL: 
 None \nPROGRESSIVE: Must continuously meet the time/attendance requirements
  to remain in the Progressive Program. Those who fall short of the weekly t
 ime/attendance requirements will automatically be considered Recreational\,
  and Recreational class fees will apply.  These classes are designed to pre
 pared archers for CAP (Competitive Archery Program).\n\nFees:  \nRECREATION
 AL FEES: \nAll fees are payable in advance of the Indoor at 18m class to se
 cure your place in the class: \nTues 6:30-7:30pm: 1-hr class - $20\nWed  6:
 30-8:00pm: 1.5-hr class - $30\nSat   3:30-5:30pm:  2-hr class - $40\nSun  3
 :30-5:30pm:  2-hr class - $40\n+ Enrollment fee: $20 (always due once per s
 emester) \n\nPROGRESSIVE (min. attendance required):  \nIndoor 3B:       $6
 0/wk (min. 5 hrs)  \nIndoor 4:         $66/wk (min. 6 hrs) \nIndoor 5:     
     $80/wk (min. 8 hrs)  \n\nMONTHLY FEES for ADULTS at 18m:\n\nAdult class
 es only (Tues 7:30-8:30 + Sun 6:00-7:00):\nAUG   $   40     \nSEPT $ 120 \n
 OCT   $ 120     \nNOV   $ 120      \nDEC   $   80     \n\nAdult classes + W
 ed. 6:30-8:00:\nAUG   $  90  \nSEPT $ 207  \nOCT  $ 243  \nNOV  $ 243   \nD
 EC  $ 126   \n\nMONTHLY FEES for JUNIORS at 18m:\nRecreational hourly fees 
 apply. At this level archers should be in the range at least 5 hrs/wk to im
 prove over time. If your schedule allows for this\, you are a Progressive a
 rcher\; if not\, you are a recreational archer.
LAST-MODIFIED:20161207T235338Z
LOCATION:10203 Old Manchaca Road\, Austin\, TX 78748
