RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Chicago:20210824T150000
CREATED:20210805T024048Z
DESCRIPTION:<b>What we worked on today:</b><br><b>Reviewing and eliminating
  excess movements:</b><br><ul><li><b>Shoulder:</b><ul><li>Bow shoulder - ti
 ghtening bow-side lats to keep shoulder down</li><li>Keeping shoulders rela
 xes\, down\, and back at Set Up</li><li>Feeling when shoulder goes up\, whi
 ch muscles do that</li></ul></li><li><b>Lower body</b>&nbsp\;below waist st
 ays in position\, fixed from Stance and Set</li><li><b>Torso&nbsp\;</b><ul>
 <li>only revolves around central axis of spine -&nbsp\;</li><li>keeps the v
 ertical part of the ¨T¨ - no back and forth or side to side</li></ul></li><
 li><b>Head&nbsp\;</b><ul><li>stays in position from Set -&nbsp\;</li><li>no
  movement towards bow\,&nbsp\;</li><li>no dropping down to aim\;&nbsp\;</li
 ><li>jaw is horizontal\, parallel to ground</li></ul></li></ul><br><b><br><
 /b>\n\nJoin with Google Meet: https://meet.google.com/cnt-ufuj-dgh\n\nLearn
  more about Meet at: https://support.google.com/a/users/answer/9282720
LAST-MODIFIED:20211108T203346Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:VIRTUAL NTS Form - Kevin
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
