 or 2 - CONGRATULATIONS!!!</b><br><b>Kate R\, 10.\, </b>on 60-cm target face
  - pd.- substituted for 4/8 - <b>146 pts </b><br><b>Brevin P.\, </b>10\, on
  60-cm target face - pd - <b>141 pts </b><br><br>Space will be limited to 1
 0-15 archers per session depending on the number of family groups in attend
