 s because of dealer supply fluctuations<br>fp = form pack (stretchband and 
 string loop)\, optional but really needed to practice form\, warm up before
  classes ($4)<br><br>At the end of each Outdoor 1 class\, your scores will 
 be posted. If we did not finish a complete round (30 arrows)\, you may not 
 recognize your final score\, because it will have been averaged by taking y
 our recorded score from your scorecard\, dividing by the number of arrows y
 ou shot to get an arrow average\, and then multiplying that by 30 to get a 
 full round score. After the last first-time class each weekend\, final scor
 es may also be sent to all Outdoor 1 participants in an email with more inf
 ormation before your next class.
