 li>finger sling</li><li>adjustable sight</li><li>stabilizer</li><li>clicker
 </li><li>cushion plunger</li><li>tie-on nocking point</li></ul></li></ul></
 li><li>Genesis bow</li><li>Compound<ul><li>Arrow rests<ul><li>Drop-away</li
 ><li>Blade</li><li>Containment</li><li>Shoot-through rests</li></ul></li><l
 i>Tie a D-loop</li><li>Attach sights\, stabilize\, side bars</li><li>Mechan
 ical release aids<ul><li>Caliper (trigger)</li><li>Thumb</li><li>Back tensi
 on</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; -</html-blob>
