CREATED:20140923T160414Z
DESCRIPTION:We'd be very happy to host a team-building archery event for yo
 ur corporate group. \nThese sessions are proving to be very popular\, and w
 e appreciate the opportunity!\n\nSCHEDULING:\nPlease look at our website's 
 calendar and select a time slot of about 3 to 3.5 hours.\nIt's best to allo
 w at least 3 hrs.\, as we may run over by as much as 30 minutes\, depending
  on everyone's arrivals and abilities. If this will be a problem\, please l
 et us know.\n\nARRIVALS:  We'll all start together\, so it's good to have e
 veryone arrive on time or together. (You may want to carpool from where you
 're having lunch\, as there is limited parking at our facilities for a max.
  of 8-10 cars.)\n\nFEE:    For a first-time team-building 2-hr to 3-hr sess
 ion\, there is a minimum indoor range booking fee of $125 for 1-5 people\, 
 and then $25/person for 6-10 people. When you arrive at the range\, you can
  pay for the session individually or by corporate check payable to Archery 
 Training Center\, or by credit card (+2.75%).\n\nEQUIPMENT:    We provide a
 ll equipment necessary. \n\nWAIVERS:  There will be waivers for each archer
  to fill out and sign when they first come in\, and before entering the ran
 ge.\n\nSPECIAL INSTRUCTIONS:    Also\, please let us know if there are any 
 special concepts you would like us to emphasize to help you build your team
 . After the initial "learning how to shoot" part\, there will be time for t
 eam games\, which everyone always enjoys.\n\nThank you for your interest in
  Olympic target archery!\n\nWe look forward to your time with us.\n\nIf you
 'd like to discuss this in more detail\, please call Coach Racae at 512 436
  8813.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260404T082256Z
LOCATION:10203 Old Manchaca Rd\, Austin\, TX 78748\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY: Corporate Team Event - Intel - Swati -10
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20180921T180000Z
DTEND:20180921T213000Z
DTSTAMP:20261004T164458Z
UID:0f9ivff23vbk2u0k5u2drg5dui@google.com
CREATED:20180918T230023Z
DESCRIPTION:If you'd like to register for a Corporate Team Event\, just fil
 l out the fields at this link:<br><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/
 e/1FAIpQLSc2Lh5MTw61OLmxV93RlHO58HEOBhrnYycyQIqEKrb_QsaQLg/viewform">2018 C
 orporate Team Events</a><br><br>We'd be very happy to host a Corporate Team
  Archery Event for your group on a mutually convenient date.&nbsp\;<br>Thes
 e sessions are proving to be very popular\, and we appreciate the opportuni
 ty!&nbsp\;<br>Book now so you're ready for our indoor corporate archery tou
 rnaments!<br><br>A few of the corporations which schedule events with us ar
 e Facebook\, Intel\, Dell\, AMD\, Home Away\, National Instruments\, Texas 
 Mutual Insurance\, Electronic Arts\, ERCOT\, Vectra Networks\, Austin Child
 ren's Advocacy\, Glatfelder Insurance\, Kerbey Lane\, RackSpace\, Abilitie\
 , Black Locus\, Boosterthon\, WP Engine\, Camp Gladiator\, Marriott Interna
 tional and others.&nbsp\;<br><br>We also would like to thank your company f
 or its vital\, indirect support of USA Archery's Junior Olympic Archery Dev
 elopment (JOAD) program! Support like yours grows Olympians!&nbsp\;<br><br>
 Below is a typical agenda for a Corporate Team Event with us\, and some oth
 er general info\, which may make things run more smoothly.&nbsp\;<br><br>CA
 PACITY: 1-20 participants. 10 places on the shooting line. If you'll have o
 ver 10 participants\, even numbers are best\, so we can create teams of two
 . We may run over by 30 minutes for larger groups.<br><br>AGENDA (approx.- 
 depends on number and pace of participants)<br><br>1:00 Arrival\; waivers (
 to be signed by participants over 18 years old or adults/parents/guardians)
 <br>1:15 Selecting two-person teams\; equipment review and selection (bows\
 , arrows\, finger tabs\, arm guards\, targets\, etc.)<br>1:55 Safety rules\
 ; whistle system<br>2:10 Form (positions) training (stance\, nocking\, hook
 ing/gripping\, set\, mindset\, set-up\, drawing\, anchor\, loading\, aiming
 \, expanding\, release)<br>2:45 Ranking Round - shooting in teams\; quantit
 y of arrows will depend on number and pace of participants<br>3:45 Olympic 
 Round: Based on ranking round\; each team picks a country to represent\; al
 l teams progress in a match play to the Gold\, Silver\, and Bronze medal ma
 tches\, with other teams cheering them on!<br>4:15 Awards Ceremony and podi
 um presentations\, photos!<br><br>Everyone has a great time at these events
 \, so we look forward to meeting your team!
LAST-MODIFIED:20260404T082324Z
LOCATION:10203 Old Manchaca Rd.\, Austin\, TX 78748
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Corporate Team Event - Texas Mutual Insurance - Ken I.
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
