DESCRIPTION:Level 3 NTS Instructor Joel (2032328331)\n\nOpen Practice sessi
 ons at this location are reserved for competitive and advanced archers.\n\n
 If you participated in the 2024 or 2025 Aggie Invitationals\, you are in! Y
 ou should receive an email with info and instructions before your first ses
 sion at this location.\n\nIf you haven't yet made the 2026 Indoor Competiti
 on Team\, but have your own equipment\, and have scored 240 on the 60-cm ta
 rget face or 230 on the 40-cm target face in a 30-arrow indoor round at 9m\
 , contact Coach Racae.\n\n A USA Archery certified Level 2 - 4 coach or ins
 tructor will be using the 18m range for their own or their family's indepen
 dent practice\, but will open it so other archers\, who have registered for
  at least one Training Class each week\, and have paid the Facility Fee eac
 h month\, can also have additional practice. No coaching or equipment advic
 e provided.\n\nSpace is limited to 12 archers\, so sign up early and pay th
 e Training Class and Facility Fees in advance to secure your place! .   \n\
 nTraining Class fee: $52/archer/class\n(1x/wk required to attend Open Pract
 ice)\nFacility fee (required each month): $205/month/archer due Nov 15\, De
 c 15\, and Jan 15  \n(Move out : Feb 15)\nOpen Practice Included in facilit
 y fee (1-2x/wk recommended)\nPrivate Lesson fee: $125/hr/archer (2x/mo reco
 mmended)\n\n Registered archers today: \n\n1. Joel Y\, adult\n2. Abby Y\, 1
 3\n3. Sara T\, 15\n4. Emma A.\, 14\n5.\n6.\n7. \n8.     \n9.     \n10.\n11.
 \n12.
