DESCRIPTION:Registered archers:\n\n50m - Nick E\n40m - Finn E\n\n30m Colby 
 K.!\n30m Sophia D.\n30m Adrianne M.\n\n20m Anna P.\n20m Rhys E\n\nOutdoor 4
 + Training Class \nis added to the ATCI Classes calendar when a USA Archery
  certified Level 2-4 coach or instructor coaches a training class. Form rec
 tification\, mental coaching\, and equipment tuning and advice provided. \n
 Fee: $52/two-hour class/archer or multi-class discount pack (see below). (N
 o fee for coaches/instructors and their family when coaching the class.)\n\
 nOutdoor 4+ Open Practice\nis added to the ATCI Classes calendar when a USA
  Archery certified Level 2-4 coach or instructor will be using the field fo
 r their own or their family's independent practice\, but will open the fiel
 d so other archers\, who have registered for at least one Training Class ea
 ch week\, can also have additional practice. No coaching or equipment advic
 e provided. \nFee: $50/month/archer (No fee for coaches/instructors and the
 ir family..)\n\nOutdoor 4+ Coach/Instructor Private Practice\nis just for U
 SA Archery certified Level 2-4 coaches or instructors and their family with
  no other archers in attendance. This will be added to the Outdoor South Fi
 eld calendar that only coaches/instructors have access to\, and is not view
 able by other archers or the public. (No fee for coaches/instructors and th
 eir family..)\n\nOUTDOOR Multi-Class Discount Packets:\n\n  10 hours : $250
  (= five 2-hr classes at $50/class) - $10 savings\n\n  16 hours : $384 (= e
 ight 2-hr classes at $48/class) - $32 savings\n\n  24 hours : $552 (= twelv
 e 2-hr classes at $46/class) - $72 savings
