BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20190219T210000Z
DTEND:20190219T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20261004T164458Z
UID:2tnsgq9ovefdm8fldv8m1qlgjb@google.com
CREATED:20190216T014047Z
DESCRIPTION:<br><br><br>We train all our archers in Olympic target archery\
 , and specifically in the National Training System (NTS)\, as researched an
 d instructed at the Olympic Training Center in Chula Vista\, CA by National
  Coach KiSik Lee and practiced by the resident athletes and US national arc
 hery teams.<br><br>Private lessons with Coach Racae are available to adults
  and juniors at different levels of experience\, most can be one or two hou
 rs long\, and are intensive.&nbsp\;<br><br><b>Times</b><br>Private lessons 
 are available at times listed below\, which are adjacent to regularly sched
 uled classes. (Check the website calendar first to make sure the time is no
 t already booked).&nbsp\;<br>T/W: 3:00-5:30 PM<br>Sat: 6:00-7:00 PM<br>Sun:
  10:30-11:30 AM<br>If you prefer a time outside of the hours listed above\,
  but still not during regularly scheduled class hours\, an additional $25/h
 r fee will be added to the regular fee below.<br><br><b><i>Contact Coach Ra
 cae at <a href="mailto:archerytrainingcenteraustin@gmail.com" target="_blan
 k">archerytrainingcenteraustin@gmail.com</a>&nbsp\;</i></b><br><b><i>to req
 uest a time after selecting one of the following types of private lessons:&
 nbsp\;</i></b><br><br><b>NTS Overview</b>: (age: 10+) : 2 hrs : Fee: $100<b
 r>For beginning archers with experience of less than one (1) year who want 
 an overview of the NTS (the form) and are ready to receive\, understand\, a
 nd implement a lot of information and instruction in a very short period of
  time\, with repetitive drills on the NTS form positions.&nbsp\;<br><br><b>
 NTS Review</b>: (age 10+) : 1 or 2 hrs: Fee: $50/hr<br>For archers at any l
 evel who are regular attendees of the group classes and who feel they need 
 more one-on-one time with Coach Racae to better know\, understand\, and imp
 lement the NTS form positions.<br><br><b>NTS Details</b>: (age: 10+) : 1 or
  2 hrs: Fee: $50/hr<br>For archers at Indoor 3A (13.5m) level or above\, wh
 o are regular attendees of the group classes\, want their form to be evalua
 ted in detail\, and are willing to work on the NTS form positions in order 
 to break through to a higher level or prepare for the annual  Competitive A
 rchery Program (CAP) Draft Tournament\, where the minimum qualifying score 
 (MQS) is 250 pts at 18m.<br><br><b>Mental Management</b> <i>(coming soon)</
 i> : 1 or 2 hrs: Fee: $75/hr<br>For archers at any level who believe they w
 ould benefit from understanding what to think\, and when to think it\, how 
 to adopt a better attitude\, more positive outlook\, and appropriate focus.
  There are many elements\, so each of these private lessons will cover thos
 e areas that will be of most benefit to you personally\, based on your goal
 s.&nbsp\;<br><br><b>Goal Setting</b> <i>(coming soon)</i> : 1 or 2 hrs: Fee
 : $75/hr<br>For archers at any level who want to have a detailed structure 
 to their training. Be prepared to answer a lot of questions in advance of t
 he lesson in order to set specific goals and then work on what is needed to
  do now to reach your ultimate goal!<br><b><i><br></i></b>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260404T082256Z
LOCATION:10203 Old Manchaca Rd.\, Austin\, TX\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Private Lesson (NTS Overview) with Coach Racae - David J.
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
