DESCRIPTION:<b>WAIVERS:</b> Everyone needs to <b>sign the waivers in advanc
 e </b>of arriving at the range\, so we are not delayed in starting. Here's 
 the link: <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdYr3Yh5msvPHC_
 -ukFsifcvhYXRrzVRvcdyP4Ybx9O5zgUug/viewform"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>2024 Corp
 orate Team Events Waivers Packet</u></u></u></u></u></u></u></a>  <br><br><
 b>DIRECTIONS:</b> <b>Google Map "Donut Taco Palace"</b> to find us quickly 
 - We are right next door in Unit 102. (Some people are still being misdirec
 ted.) There is a target on the glass door and the unit is facing 290W servi
 ce road going west on the corner of Industrial Oaks Blvd and 290W. <br><br>
 <b>ARRIVAL</b>: For a 1:30 pm start\, please <b>arrive by 1:15 pm</b>\, bec
 ause we will all be starting together at 1:30 pm. <br><br><b>CARPOOLING / P
 ARKING:</b> Please meet and carpool earlier from another location or from a
  big box store parking lot across the highway (like Target or At Home on th
 e corner of Mopac and 290W). It's easy and convenient to do. (Parking in fr
 ont of the range and along Industrial Oaks Blvd may be limited\, depending 
 on the number of participants.)<br><br><b>DRESS RECOMMENDATIONS: </b><br>Fl
 at athletic shoes are best\, as we will be throwing our weight forward a li
 ttle\, so balance and weight distribution is important. The bowstring can g
 et slowed or entangled in your clothing or hair\, so wearing tightly fittin
 g clothes\, no wide skirts\, shirts without buttons on the front pockets an
 d tying your hair back is preferable. Longer brim baseball caps often preve
 nt the string from reaching your face\, so shorter brims or bucket hats are
  better. <br>:<br><b>All participants need to complete waivers online befor
 e the event.</b><br><b>Here is the direct link to complete: </b><a href="ht
 tps://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdYr3Yh5msvPHC_-ukFsifcvhYXRrzVRvcdy
 P4Ybx9O5zgUug/viewform"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>2024 Corporate Team Events 
 Waivers Packet</u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></a>  <br><br>Waivers have be
 en received from those shown below in <b>bold with (W)</b><b><br><br>1. Pau
 l C.\, (W) -  168 pts -&gt\; Indoor 2</b><br>2. <b>Sahil K. (W) - 95 pts -&
 gt\; Indoor 2</b><br><span>3. </span><b>Victor A. (W) - </b><span><b>67 pts
  -&gt\; Indoor 2</b></span><br>4. <b>Aaron A. (W) - DNA</b><br><b>5. Aida G
 . (W) - 175 pts -&gt\; Indoor 2<br></b>6. <b>Dmitry K. (W) - 82 pts -&gt\; 
 Indoor 2</b>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260404T082256Z
LOCATION:5446 West US Hwy 290 service road\, Unit 102\, Austin\, TX 78735
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:CORPORATE TEAM EVENT - META
