DESCRIPTION:These training sessions at 18m at the new temporary Westlake lo
 cation are for competitive archers only who have <br>graduated out of Indoo
 r 2 at 9m and Indoor 3 at 13.5m\, AND<br>registered and paid $225 in advanc
 e for the temporary 18m space (Jan+Feb)\, AND<br>registered and paid the In
 door 4+ class fees below for each class or multi-class packet  (Fees stay a
 t 2024 rates for competitive archers) AND<br>registered for the Texas State
  at Kealing Middle School in Austin in January AND/OR<br>registered for the
  Indoor Nationals and/or JOAD Indoor Nationals in February at Texas A&amp\;
 M.<br>Enter your name directly below for the sessions you would like to att
 end. (There is no registration form for these 18m indoor sessions.)<br><br>
 Make sure you have all your equipment in your backpack\, not pre-assembled.
  <br>Arrive early so you have your bow set up by the time the class starts.
 <br>You must wait at the front door and call the coach to send someone to l
 et you in.<br>Double check the ATCI calendar just before driving to class t
 o make sure there is a session that day. <br>Also check periodically to see
  if additional classes have been added that week.<br>Sat 10:00-12:00  Coach
  L4 Racae Meyer 512 975 1850<br>Sun 10:00-12:00 Coach L4 Racae Meyer 512 97
 5 1850<br>Mon 6:00-7:30 Coach L3 Joel Yu 203 232 8331    <br>Tues 5:30-7:00
  Coach L3 Lindsay Lawley-Rerecich 512 914 7934 or Instructor L2 Matt Rereci
 ch 512 914 7914<br>Wed 6:00-7:30 Coach L3 Joel Yu 203 232 8331  <br>Thurs 6
 :00-7:30 Coach L3 Nick Erickson 512 608 7032<br><br>There are six places on
  the shooting line. We will form two or three lines when necessary to accom
 modate all archers who have registered and to more closely simulate competi
 tive conditions.<br>ext Coach Racae at 512 975 1850 with your questions<br>
 Always check this calendar before driving to class in case there has been a
  last-minute scheduling change or cancellation.<br><br>Registered archers<b
 r><ol><li><b>Sofia</b> <b>W</b>.<b>\, </b>13\, USAA\, pd - 2 hrs<br></li><l
 i><b>Colby K</b>.\, adult\, USAA\, pd - 2 hrs</li><li><b>Luke T</b>\, 16\, 
 OB\, USAA\, pd - 2 hrs</li><li><b>Finn E.\, </b>12\, OB\, USAA\, pd - 2 hrs
 </li><li><b>Nick E</b>.\, coach\, 2 hrs</li></ol><br><b>Hannah T\,</b><span
 > adult \, USAA\, pd <b>DNA</b></span><b><br></b><br><span><br></span>SINGL
 E Class fees :<br>   $26/archer / 1 hr<br>   $39/archer / 1.5 hrs<br>   $52
 /archer / 2 hrs<br><br>MULTI-Class Discount Packets (Can be used however an
 d whenever convenient):<br>  10 hours : $250 (= five 2-hr classes at $50/cl
 ass) - $10 savings<br>  16 hours : $384 (= eight 2-hr classes at $48/class)
  - $32 savings<br>  24 hours : $552 (= twelve 2-hr classes at $46/class) - 
 $72 savings<br>Book and pay in advance for any convenient time during the c
 lass times listed.<br><br>Please sign in and out at the 18m indoor range no
