 </b><br><b><i><br></i></b><br>If you would like to volunteer to do some wor
 k in the 9m range to get it in shape for the Indoor 2-6 class later in the 
 afternoon\, please add your name below:<ol><li>Sophia D. - I can come after
  the classes if needed to clean</li><li>.Sofia W &amp\; Monica - We can com
 e by about 2:00 to help.</li><li>Joel Y</li><li>.</li><li>.</li></ol>The mo
 vers <span>have a two-hour window to move the target stands and cores (9:30
 -11:30am)</span><br><span>from the 18m range to the 9m range.</span><br><br
 >Jobs to do at the 9m range:<br><ul><li>The tops need to be put back on top
  of the target stands and cores stored in the tops. (They may also need to 
 be cut down so target stands can fit side-by-side.)</li><li>Side frames on 
 the target stands need to be removed or modified so target stands fit behin
 d existing stands.</li><li>Shooting line needs to be remeasured and furnitu
 re pushed back a few inches.</li><li>Miscellaneous items need to be arrange
 d and stored behind and to the sides of the target stands</li></ul>
