DESCRIPTION:Schedule and Coaches (so far):<br>(All sessions must be supervi
 sed by a USA Archery certified instructor or coach.)<br>    * Sat 10:00-12:
 00  Coach L4 Racae Meyer (512 975 1850)<br>    * Sun 10:00-12:00 Coach L4 R
 acae Meyer (512 975 1850)<br>    * Thurs 6:00-7:30 Coach L3 Nick Erickson  
 ( cell 512-608-7032)<br><br>These training sessions at 18m at the new tempo
 rary Westlake location are for competitive archers only who have <br>    * 
 graduated out of Indoor 2 at 9m and Indoor 3 at 13.5m\,<br>    * registered
  and paid $225 in advance for the temporary 18m space\,<br>    * registered
  and paid the Indoor 4+ class fees below for each class or multi-class pack
 et  (Fees stay at 2024 rates for competitive archers)<br>    * registered f
 or the Texas State at Kealing Middle School in Austin in January and/or<br>
     * registered for the Indoor Nationals and/or JOAD Indoor Nationals in F
 ebruary at Texas A&amp\;M.<br><br>Enter your name directly below for the se
 ssions you would like to attend. (There is no registration form for these 1
 8m indoor sessions.)<br><br>There are six places on the shooting line. We w
 ill form two or three lines when necessary to accommodate all archers who h
 ave registered and to more closely simulate competitive conditions.<br><br>
 Text Coach Racae at 512 975 1850 with your questions.<br><br>Always check t
 his calendar before driving to class in case there has been a last-minute s
 cheduling change or cancellation.<br><br>Registered archers:<br><ol><li><b>
 Abby Y.</b>\, 12\, on 60cm <b> - 248 pts</b></li><li><b>Nick E.\, </b><span
 >adult</span><b> - 246 pts  </b></li><li><b>Finn E.\, 12</b><span>\, on 60c
 m</span><b> - 245 pts</b></li><li><b>Joel Y.\, </b>adult <b>- 234 pts</b></
 li><li><b>Sofia W.\, 13\, </b>on 60cm<b> - 200 pts</b></li><li><b>Colby K.<
 /b> adult <b> - 157 pts</b></li><li><b>Rhys E.\, 10\, </b>on 60cm<b> - 57 p
 ts</b></li></ol><br>(The following class fees are in addition to the $225 r
 ental fee for the 18m space)<br>Book and pay in advance for any convenient 
 time during the class times listed.<br><br>Please sign in and out at the 18
 m indoor range noting your times.<br><br>SINGLE Class fees :<br>   $26/arch
 er / 1 hr<br>   $39/archer / 1.5 hrs<br>   $52/archer / 2 hrs<br><br>MULTI-
 Class Discount Packets (Can be used however and whenever convenient):<br>  
 10 hours : $250 (= five 2-hr classes at $50/class) - $10 savings<br>  16 ho
 urs : $384 (= eight 2-hr classes at $48/class) - $32 savings<br>  24 hours 
