 irst session at this location.\n\nIf you haven't yet made the 2026 Indoor C
 ompetition Team\, but have your own equipment\, and have scored 240 on the 
 60-cm target face or 230 on the 40-cm target face in a 30-arrow indoor roun
 d at 9m\, contact Coach Racae.\n\nA USA Archery certified Level 2 - 4 coach
  or instructor will be using the 18m range for their own or their family's 
 independent practice\, but will open it so other archers\, who have registe
 red for at least one Training Class each week\, and have paid the Facility 
 Fee each month\, can also have additional practice. No coaching or equipmen
 t advice provided.\n\nSpace is limited to 12 archers\, so sign up early and
  pay the Training Class and Facility Fees in advance to secure your place! 
 .   \n\nTraining Class fee: $52/archer/class \n(1x/wk required to attend Op
 en Practice)\nFacility fee (required each month): $205/month/archer due Nov
