DESCRIPTION:Level 2 NTS Instructor Anna (443 386 6184) \n\nOpen Practice se
 ssions at this location are reserved for competitive and advanced archers.\
 n\nIf you participated in the 2024 or 2025 Aggie Invitationals\, you are in
 ! You should receive an email with info and instructions before your first 
 session at this location.\n\nIf you haven't yet made the 2026 Indoor Compet
 ition Team\, but have your own equipment\, and have scored 240 on the 60-cm
  target face or 230 on the 40-cm target face in a 30-arrow indoor round at 
 9m\, contact Coach Racae.\n\n A USA Archery certified Level 2 - 4 coach or 
 instructor will be using the 18m range for their own or their family's inde
 pendent practice\, but will open it so other archers\, who have registered 
 for at least one Training Class each week\, and have paid the Facility Fee 
 each month\, can also have additional practice. No coaching or equipment ad
 vice provided.\n\nSpace is limited to 12 archers\, so sign up early and pay
  the Training Class and Facility Fees in advance to secure your place! .   
 \n\nTraining Class fee: $52/archer/class \n(1x/wk required to attend Open P
 ractice)\nFacility fee (required each month): $205/month/archer due Nov 15\
 , Dec 15\, and Jan 15  \n(Move out :  Feb 15)\nOpen Practice Included in fa
 cility fee (1-2x/wk recommended)\nPrivate Lesson fee: $125/hr/archer (2x/mo
  recommended)\n\n Registered archers today:   \n\n1. Anna P\, adult\, pd\n2
 .  Finn E\n3.  Nick E\n4.  Joel Y\n5.  Abby Y\n6. Sara T\n7.  Everett Z\n8.
   Adrianne M\, adult \n9.      \n10.\n11.\n12.
