DESCRIPTION:These training sessions at 18m at the new temporary Westlake lo
 cation are for competitive archers only who have \n    * graduated out of I
 ndoor 2 at 9m and Indoor 3 at 13.5m\, AND\n    * registered and paid $225 i
 n advance for the temporary 18m space (Jan+Feb)\, AND\n    * + registered a
 nd paid the Indoor 4+ class fees below for each class or multi-class packet
   (Fees stay at 2024 rates for competitive archers) AND\n    * registered f
 or the Texas State at Kealing Middle School in Austin in January AND/OR\n  
   * registered for the Indoor Nationals and/or JOAD Indoor Nationals in Feb
 ruary at Texas A&M.\nEnter your name directly below for the sessions you wo
 uld like to attend. (There is no registration form for these 18m indoor ses
 sions.)\nMake sure you have all your equipment in your backpack\, not pre-a
 ssembled. \nArrive early so you have your bow set up by the time the class 
 starts.\nYou must wait at the front door and call the coach to send someone
  to let you in.\nDouble check the ATCI calendar just before driving to clas
 s to make sure there is a session that day. Also check periodically to see 
 if additional classes have been added that week.\n    * Sat 10:00-12:00  Co
 ach L4 Racae Meyer 512 975 1850\n    * Sun 10:00-12:00 Coach L4 Racae Meyer
  512 975 1850\n    * Mon 6:00-7:30 Coach L3 Joel Yu 203 232 8331    \n    *
  Tues 5:30-7:00 Coach L3 Lindsay Lawley-Rerecich 512 914 7934 or Instructor
  L2 Matt Rerecich 512 914 7914\n    * Wed 6:00-7:30 Coach L3 Joel Yu 203 23
 2 8331  \n    * Thurs 6:00-7:30 Coach L3 Nick Erickson 512 608 7032\nThere 
 are six places on the shooting line. We will form two or three lines when n
 ecessary to accommodate all archers who have registered and to more closely
  simulate competitive conditions.\n\nText Coach Racae at 512 975 1850 with 
 your questions.\n\nAlways check this calendar before driving to class in ca
 se there has been a last-minute scheduling change or cancellation.\n\nRegis
 tered archers\n    1. Abby Y\, 12\, OB\, USAA\, pd - 2 hrs\n    2. Sophia D
 \, adult\, USAA\, pd - 2 hrs\n    3. Colby K.\, adult\, USAA\, pd - 2 hrs\n
 \n(The following class fees are in addition to the $225 rental fee for the 
 18m space)\nBook and pay in advance for any convenient time during the clas
 s times listed.\n\nPlease sign in and out at the 18m indoor range noting yo
 ur times.\n\n\nSINGLE Class fees :\n   $26/archer / 1 hr\n   $39/archer / 1
 .5 hrs\n   $52/archer / 2 hrs\n\nMULTI-Class Discount Packets (Can be used 
 however and whenever convenient):\n  10 hours : $250 (= five 2-hr classes a
 t $50/class) - $10 savings\n  16 hours : $384 (= eight 2-hr classes at $48/
 class) - $32 savings\n  24 hours : $552 (= twelve 2-hr classes at $46/class
 ) - $72 savings
