 ons at this location are reserved for competitive and advanced archers.\n\n
 If you participated in the 2024 or 2025 Aggie Invitationals\, you are in! Y
 ou should receive an email with info and instructions before your first ses
 sion at this location.\n\nIf you haven't yet made the 2026 Indoor Competiti
 on Team\, but have your own equipment\, and have scored 240 on the 60-cm ta
 rget face or 230 on the 40-cm target face in a 30-arrow indoor round at 9m\
 , contact Coach Racae.\n\n A USA Archery certified Level 2 - 4 coach or ins
