  at the Olympic Training Center in Chula Vista\, CA by National Coach KiSik
  Lee and practiced by the resident athletes and US national archery teams.\
 n\nPrivate lessons with Coach Racae are available to adults and juniors at 
 different levels of experience\, most can be one or two hours long\, and ar
 e intensive. \n\nTimes\nPrivate lessons are available at the times listed b
 elow\, which are adjacent to regularly scheduled classes. \n(Check the webs
 ite calendar first to make sure the time is not already booked). \nTues/Wed
 : 4:30-5:30 PM\nFri: 5:00-8:00 PM\nIf you prefer a time outside of the hour
 s listed above\, but still not during regularly scheduled class hours\, an 
 additional $25/hr fee will be added to the regular fee.\n\nContact Coach Ra
 cae at archerytrainingcenteraustin@gmail.com or call 512 975 1850\nto reque
 st a list of the different types of private lessons\, fees\, and an availab
 le time.
