DESCRIPTION:<b>Thursday\, Sept 12 2:00-5:00 pm</b><br><br><b>WAIVERS:</b> E
 veryone needs to <b>sign the waivers in advance </b>of arriving at the rang
 e\, so we are not delayed in starting. Here's the link: <a href="https://do
 cs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdYr3Yh5msvPHC_-ukFsifcvhYXRrzVRvcdyP4Ybx9O5
 zgUug/viewform" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>2024
  Corporate Team Events Waivers Packet</u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></
 u></u></u></u></a>  <br><br><b>DIRECTIONS:</b> <b>Google Map "Donut Taco Pa
 lace"</b> to find us quickly - We are right next door in Unit 102. (Some pe
 ople are still being misdirected.) There is a target on the glass door and 
 the unit is facing 290W service road going west on the corner of Industrial
  Oaks Blvd and 290W. <br><br><b>ARRIVAL</b>: For a 2:00 pm start\, please <
 b>arrive by 1:45 pm</b>\, because we need to start together at 1:00 pm. <br
 ><br><b>CARPOOLING / PARKING:</b> Please meet and carpool earlier from anot
 her location or from a big box store parking lot across the highway (like T
 arget or At Home on the corner of Mopac and 290W). It's easy and convenient
  to do. (Parking in front of the range and along Industrial Oaks Blvd may b
 e limited\, depending on the number of participants.)<br><br><b>DRESS RECOM
 MENDATIONS: </b><br>Flat athletic shoes are best\, as we will be throwing o
 ur weight forward a little\, so balance and weight distribution is importan
 t. The bowstring can get slowed or entangled in your clothing or hair\, so 
 wearing tightly fitting clothes\, no wide skirts\, shirts without buttons o
 n the front pockets and tying your hair back is preferable. Longer brim bas
 eball caps often prevent the string from reaching your face\, so shorter br
 ims or bucket hats are better. <br>:<br><b>All participants need to complet
 e waivers online before the event.</b><br><b>Here is the direct link to com
 plete: </b><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdYr3Yh5msvPHC
 _-ukFsifcvhYXRrzVRvcdyP4Ybx9O5zgUug/viewform" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><
 u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>2024 Corporate Team Events Waivers Packet</u><
 /u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></a>  <br><br>Waivers ha
 ve been received from those shown below in <b>bold with (W)</b><br><b>Indiv
 idual Ranking</b><ol><li><b>Alberto De I. (W) - Japan - 132 pts </b><u></u>
 (averaged)<b> -&gt\; INDOOR 2</b></li><li><b>Gabriel A. </b><u></u><u></u><
 b>(W) - Mexico - 102 pts -&gt\; INDOOR 2</b></li><li><b>Luis E. (W) - Mexic
 o - 96 pts </b>(averaged)<b> -&gt\; INDOOR 2</b></li><li><b>Amanda H. </b><
 u></u><u></u><b>(W) - Japan - 73 pts </b>(averaged)<b> -&gt\; INDOOR 2</b><
 /li><li><b>Zarja P. </b><u></u><u></u><b>(W) - Slovenia - 63 pts </b>(avera
 ged)<b> -&gt\; INDOOR 2</b></li><li><b>Alexiz A. </b><u></u><u></u><b>(W) -
  Tuvalu? - 56 pts </b>(averaged)<b> -&gt\; INDOOR 2</b></li><li><b>Karina C
 </b>.<u></u><u></u><b>(W) 57 pts - Malta? </b>(averaged)<b> -&gt\; INDOOR 2
 </b></li><li><b>Stacey F. </b><u></u><u></u><b>(W) - Malta - 54 pts </b>(av
 eraged)<b> -&gt\; INDOOR 2</b></li><li><b>Destini H. </b><u></u><u></u><b>(
 W) - Slovenia - 40 pts </b>(averaged)<b> -&gt\; INDOOR 2</b></li><li><b>San
 dra O. </b><u></u><u></u><b>(W) - Tuvalu  - Scorecard? -&gt\; INDOOR 2</b><
 /li><li>Brandon W. - DNA</li></ol><br><b>Olympic Team Rounds (Match Play)</
