 -ukFsifcvhYXRrzVRvcdyP4Ybx9O5zgUug/viewform"><u><u><u>2023/2024 Corporate T
 eam Events Waivers Packet</u></u></u></a>  <br><br><b>DIRECTIONS:</b> <b>Go
 ogle Map "Donut Taco Palace"</b> to find us quickly - We are right next doo
 r in Unit 102. (Some people are still being misdirected.) There is a target
  on the glass door and the unit is facing 290W service road going west on t
 he corner of Industrial Oaks Blvd and 290W. <br><br><b>ARRIVAL</b>: For a 1
 :00 pm start\, please <b>arrive by 12:45 pm</b>\, because we will all be st
 arting together at 1:00 pm. <br><br><b>CARPOOLING / PARKING:</b> Please mee
 t and carpool earlier from another location or from a big box store parking
  lot across the highway (like Target or At Home on the corner of Mopac and 
 290W). It's easy and convenient to do. (Parking in front of the range and a
 long Industrial Oaks Blvd may be limited\, depending on the number of parti
 cipants.)<br><br><b>DRESS RECOMMENDATIONS: </b><br>Flat athletic shoes are 
 best\, as we will be throwing our weight forward a little\, so balance and 
 weight distribution is important. The bowstring can get slowed or entangled
  in your clothing or hair\, so wearing tightly fitting clothes\, no wide sk
 irts\, shirts without buttons on the front pockets and tying your hair back
  is preferable. Longer brim baseball caps often prevent the string from rea
 ching your face\, so shorter brims or bucket hats are better. <br>:<br><b>A
 ll participants need to complete waivers online before the event.</b><br><b
 >Here is the direct link to complete: </b><a href="https://docs.google.com/
