DESCRIPTION:INDOOR 1: First-time class is for juniors age 8+\, optionally t
 heir parents\, and other adults who would like to try archery for the first
  time and join in future Junior Olympic Archery Development (JOAD) and Adul
 t Training classes. This class is a prerequisite for the FALL PROGRAM class
 es. Fee: $25/archer. \nIf you have more than one year's experience\, contac
 t us for a placement evaluation ($45) instead of attending the Indoor 1 Cla
 ss.\n(You will be on the waiting list after 10 people register - see below.
 )\n\nRegistered archers:\n1.  Michael Fle....\, adult\n2.  Rachel Cro.....\
 , adult\n3.  Lili Xi...\, age?\n4.  Heidi Rat....\, adult\n5. Brandon Fos..
 .\, adult\n6. \n7. \n8. \n9. \n10. \n\nWaiting List: \n11. \n12. \n\nIf you
 r name is on the waiting list\, you have a choice of \ncoming to see if a p
 lace opens up at the last minute\, or \nrescheduling your class for another
  date/time. \nWe can only take 10 archers on the shooting line at one time.
  \nThe instructor may also create two shooting lines\, which may increase t
 he length of the class for everyone and decrease the number of arrows every
 one has time to shoot.\nIf you prefer not to be on the waiting list\, pleas
 e reschedule your class for another date.
