DESCRIPTION:We'd be very happy to host a team-building archery event for yo
 ur corporate group. These sessions are proving to be very popular\, and we 
 appreciate the opportunity!\n\nSCHEDULING:\nWe have openings in between our
  regular classes\, which you can see on our website's Calendar.\nPlease sug
 gest a 3-hr time slot on a couple of convenient dates/times for your group 
 (not on Summer Camp weekdays)\, and we'll do our best to work with you. It'
 s best to allow at least 3 hrs.\, as we may run over by as much as 30 minut
 es\, depending on everyone's arrivals and abilities. If this will be a prob
 lem\, please let us know.\nOnce we have an agreed upon a date/time\, we'll 
 reserve your time on our calendar. \n\nARRIVALS:  We'll all start together\
 , so it's good to have everyone arrive on time or together. (You may want t
 o carpool from your office or where you're having lunch.)\n\nFEE:    For a 
 first-time team-building 2-hr to 3-hr session\, there is a minimum indoor r
 ange booking fee of $125 for 1-5 people\, and then $25/person for 6-10 peop
 le. If your group will be more than 10 people\, the session may run over by
  at least 30 minutes\, so allow 3.5 hrs.\nWhen you arrive at the range\, yo
 u can pay for the session individually or by corporate check payable to Arc
 hery Training Center\, or by credit card (+2.75%).\n\nEQUIPMENT:    We prov
 ide all equipment necessary. \n\nWAIVERS:  There will be waivers for each a
 rcher to fill out and sign when they first come in\, and before entering th
 e range.\n\nSPECIAL INSTRUCTIONS:  Please let us know if there are any spec
 ial concepts you would like us to emphasize to help you build your team.  A
 fter the initial "learning how to shoot" part\, there will be time for team
  games\, which everyone always enjoys.\n\nThank you for your interest in Ol
 ympic target archery!\n\nWe look forward to your time with us.\n\nIf you'd 
 like to discuss this in more detail\, please call us at 512 436 8813 at you
 r convenience.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260404T082256Z
LOCATION:10203 Old Manchaca Road\, Austin\, TX\, United States
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Corporate Team Building: Intel
TRANSP:OPAQUE
