 R 2-6 at 9m</b></u></u></u></u></a> until you score  240 pts on the 60-cm t
 arget face or 230 pts on the 40-cm target face. Then you will graduate to o
 ur outdoor classes !<br><br><b>After you graduate to Outdoor 3-9</b>\, you 
 will be granted access to the ATCI Calendar via an email from Coach Racae\,
  and can just add your name under Registered Archers below.<br><b><br>SCHED
 ULE :</b><br>​Register for ​​as many as your schedule and budget allows to 
 progress faster:<br><b>Sat/Sun 4:00-5:30 pm  <br>T/Th       5:00-6:30 pm</b
 >  and  <b>6:30-8:00 pm</b><br>​Weekdays: Juniors usually come to the 5:00 
 pm class\, and adults to the 6:30 class\, but all classes are open to both 
 adults and juniors.<br><br>Always <b>check this calendar just before drivin
 g to class</b> in case there are last-minutes changes or cancellations! <b>
 If fewer than 4 people register in advance and pay\, the class may be cance
 lled</b> at the coach's discretion\, and you may need to reschedule.<br><br
 >USA Archery Level 4 NTS Coach Racae Meyer unless otherwise noted above<br>
 <br>2025 INDOOR 2-6 at 9m <br><br><b>Registered archers:</b><br>1. <b>Lana 
 F.\, </b>15\, pd (Indoor 2) ill - DNA<br>2. <b>Love</b>\, 13?\, on 60-cm ta
 rget face\, pd? (O3 @ 13.5m)  - 1.5 hrs<br>3. <b>Eben</b>\, adult\, pd? (O4
  @ 20m)  - 1.5 hrs<br>4.<br>5.<br>6.<br>7.<br>8.<br>9.<br>10.<br>11.<br>12.
 <br><br><b>SINGLE Class Fees per archer for one Indoor 2-6 class:</b><br>$3
 1 for 1 hr (arrive 30 min after class starts or leave 30 min before class e
 nds)<br>$43 for 1.5 hrs<br><br><b>MULTI-Class Discount Packets</b><br>  9 h
 ours : $250 (six 1.5-hr classes)<br> 12 hours : $320 (eight 1.5-hr classes)
 <br> 18 hours : $460 (twelve 1.5-hr classes) <br><br>There are 8 places on 
 the shooting line\, and we sometimes have double lines depending on attenda
 nce.<br><br>Sign in/out upon arrival/departure<br>For single classes\, book
  and pay in advance.<br>For multi-class discount packs\, pay in advance and
  book when you are sure of the dates.<br>Coaching and whistle commands at a
 ll times.<br>Instruction in the National Training System.<br>Unfair games d
 epending on attendance.<br><br>Please note: Youths &lt\;12 y.o. should not 
 shoot more than 100 arrows/day!<br><br>Prerequisites for Indoor 2: <br>Adul
 ts: No min. score in Indoor 1 <br>Juniors: 50 pts in Indoor 1<br>Scores nee
 ded at 9m to advance to Indoor 3-6 and Outdoor 3-6:<br><br>                
  On 40-cm                  On 60-cm<br>               target face          
        target face<br>Indoor 3:          230 pts                240 pts    
        -&gt\; Outdoor 3 at 13.5m<br>Indoor 4:          250 pts             
    260 pts           -&gt\; Outdoor 4 at 18m/20m<br>Indoor 5:          270 
 pts                280 pts           -&gt\; Outdoor 5 at 30m<br>Indoor 6:  
         290 pts                300 pts          -&gt\;  Outdoor 6 at 40m
