DESCRIPTION:<b>2022 Winter/Spring Schedule and Goals for Outdoor 2-9 (9m to
  70m):&nbsp\;</b><br>&nbsp\;<br><b>FEBRUARY</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp
 \;</b><b>12-18</b>&nbsp\;Welcome Back: Understanding&nbsp\; NTS Concepts&nb
 sp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>19-25</b>&nbsp\;NTS Steps 1+2: STA
 NCE + NOCK&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>26 - MAR 4: MASTER CH
 ALLENGE TOURNAMENT WEEK (Pin Shoot)</b><br><b>MARCH</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp
 \; &nbsp\;5-11</b>&nbsp\;NTS Step 3: HOOK &amp\; GRIP&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; 
 &nbsp\; &nbsp\;12-18</b>&nbsp\; NTS Step 4: SET&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\; &n
 bsp\; &nbsp\;<b>19-25&nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 5: SET-UP&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nb
 sp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>26 - APR 1: MASTER CHALLENGE TOURNAMENT WEEK (Pin Shoot)
 </b><br><b>APRIL</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;2-8</b>&nbsp\; NTS Step 6
  DRAW to LOAD&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;9-15&nbsp\;</b>&nbsp\;NTS
  Step 7 ANCHOR&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;<b>16-22&nbsp\;</b>NTS Step
  8 TRANSFER to HOLD<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;23-29&nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 9
  EXPAND / AIM&nbsp\;<b><br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>30 - MAY 6: MASTER
  CHALLENGE TOURNAMENT WEEK (Pin Shoot)</b><br><b>MAY</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbs
 p\; &nbsp\;</b><b>7-13&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 10 RELEASE + FOLLOW-THROUG
 H<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>14-20</b>&nbsp\; NTS Step 11: FEEDBAC
 K + Putting it all together!<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>21/22 : EN
 D OF SEMESTER TOURNAMENT WEEKEND (Pin Shoot)</b><br><br>Each week the focus
  of your lessons will be on particular Steps of Shooting of the NTS (Nation
 al Training System) shot cycle\, to help you focus and improve your form\, 
 which\, as we all know\, leads to greater precision (tight groups of arrows
 ) and ultimately greater accuracy (tight groups of arrows dead center).<br>
 <br>Your goal is always to replicate the NTS step(s) mindfully and consiste
 ntly on every shot.<br><br>You do not need to score in every class. In fact
 \, it would be more beneficial to you if you scored only during Master Chal
 lenge Tournament Weeks\, which happen the last week of each month. This is 
 because working on the NTS Steps of Shooting (your form) is more easily don
 e without the distraction of the target face or scoring\, and you will impr
 ove faster.<br><br>As you reach higher levels\, you will learn the NTS Step
 s in progressively greater detail.<br>The NTS Steps are cumulative with eac
 h step most successfully completed if the previous steps have been complete
 d well.&nbsp\;<br><br>Your ability to learn and understand the NTS Steps\, 
 and use deep focus on these Steps while shooting outdoors and while using y
 our stretchband/string loop at home to reinforce form poisitions will prope
 l you to higher levels fast!<br><br><b>Goals by the end of the semester (Ma
 y 22):&nbsp\;</b><br>See Coach Racae´s email ¨2022 New Year´s Goals¨
LAST-MODIFIED:20260404T082256Z
