DESCRIPTION:<b>Alex </b>8\, on 60-cm target face - <i>Worked on first four 
 steps of shot cycle: STANCE\, NOCK\, HOOK\, GRIP. Good focus for age\, exce
 llent results\, fast shooter\; practiced picking up and nocking arrow consi
 stently with arrow always pointing forward\; </i><i>used fingersling (red o
 ne better) and practiced letting the bow go while keeping bow arm up.</i><i
 > Earned Green\, Purple\, Grey\, White USA Archery Star Pins\, and scored 2
 40 pts on 60-cm target face to earn going outdoors on Friday! Yay!  Start a
 t 20m on 122-cm target face.</i><br><br><b>Alejandro - </b><i>Worked on fee
 ling the shot and exploring how much has been aiming and reducing that. Use
 d overhead camera to understand and view alignments: Barrel of the Gun\, an
 d Arrow Line\, closing the third side. through angular motion. Needs more c
 oiling. Tested progression with blindfold. At first arrows way off to the l
 eft and sprinkled\, then closer to aiming point\, and finally even closer t
 o it\, after working on alignments\, back tension\, being more aware of fee
 ling of positions. Reduced leaning forward from ankles for greater\, lower 
 stability. New X10s coming tomorrow. Buying shoelaces for fingerslings.</i>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260404T082256Z
LOCATION:5446 W US Hwy 290 Service Rd\, Unit 102\, Austin\, TX 78735\, USA
