DESCRIPTION:These training sessions at 18m at the new temporary Westlake lo
 cation are for competitive archers only who have  \n    •graduated out of I
 ndoor 2 at 9m and Indoor 3 at 13.5m\, AND\n    •registered and paid $225 in
  advance for the temporary 18m space (Jan+Feb)\, AND\n    •+ registered and
  paid the Indoor 4+ class fees below for each class or multi-class packet  
 (Fees stay at 2024 rates for competitive archers) AND\n    •registered for 
 the Texas State at Kealing Middle School in Austin in January AND/OR\n    •
 registered for the Indoor Nationals and/or JOAD Indoor Nationals in Februar
 y at Texas A&M.\nEnter your name directly below for the sessions you would 
