DESCRIPTION:<b>WAIVERS:</b> Everyone needs to <b>sign the waivers in advanc
 e </b>of arriving at the range\, so we are not delayed in starting. Here's 
 the link: <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdYr3Yh5msvPHC_
 -ukFsifcvhYXRrzVRvcdyP4Ybx9O5zgUug/viewform" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u
 ><u><u><u>2024 Corporate Team Events Waivers Packet</u></u></u></u></u></u>
 </u></u></a>  <br><br><b>DIRECTIONS:</b> <b>Google Map "Donut Taco Palace"<
 /b> to find us quickly - We are right next door in Unit 102. (Some people a
 re still being misdirected.) There is a target on the glass door and the un
 it is facing 290W service road going west on the corner of Industrial Oaks 
 Blvd and 290W. <br><br><b>ARRIVAL</b>: For a 2:00 pm start\, please <b>arri
 ve by 1:45 pm</b>\, because we will all be starting together at 2:00 pm. <b
 r><br><b>CARPOOLING / PARKING:</b> Please meet and carpool earlier from ano
 ther location or from a big box store parking lot across the highway (like 
 Target or At Home on the corner of Mopac and 290W). It's easy and convenien
 t to do. (Parking in front of the range and along Industrial Oaks Blvd may 
 be limited\, depending on the number of participants.)<br><br><b>DRESS RECO
 MMENDATIONS: </b><br>Flat athletic shoes are best\, as we will be throwing 
 our weight forward a little\, so balance and weight distribution is importa
 nt. The bowstring can get slowed or entangled in your clothing or hair\, so
  wearing tightly fitting clothes\, no wide skirts\, shirts without buttons 
 on the front pockets and tying your hair back is preferable. Longer brim ba
 seball caps often prevent the string from reaching your face\, so shorter b
 rims or bucket hats are better. <br>:<br><b>All participants need to comple
 te waivers online before the event.</b><br><b>Here is the direct link to co
 mplete: </b><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdYr3Yh5msvPH
 C_-ukFsifcvhYXRrzVRvcdyP4Ybx9O5zgUug/viewform" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u>
 <u><u><u><u><u>2024 Corporate Team Events Waivers Packet</u></u></u></u></u
 ></u></u></u></u></a>  <br><br>Waivers have been received from those shown 
 below in <b>bold with (W)</b><b><br></b><p></p><ol><li><b>Blake S. (W)</b><
 /li><li><b>Alvaro L.</b> <b>(W)</b></li><li><b>Stephen H.</b> <b>(W)</b></l
 i><li><b>Andres P. (W)</b></li><li><b>Sandip G.(W)</b></li><li>Scott W.</li
 ></ol><u></u><p></p><p><u></u></p><p><u></u></p><p><u></u></p><p><u></u></p
 >
