DESCRIPTION:Luke's Birthday Party!\n\nWe hold birthday parties for our memb
 ers! If you would like to schedule one\, please read the information below\
 , and contact us when you're ready.\n\nSCHEDULING:\nAfter you\, as the host
 \, have taken the Indoor 1: First-time Class\, please look at our website's
  calendar and select a 2.5-hr time slot outside of the regular classes list
 ed. Please allow an additional 30 min. on either side of your party before 
 and after our classes\, to allow for parking turnover. Give us two alternat
 ive dates/times\, if possible. \n\nCONTACT:\nEmail racae@archerytrainingcen
 ter.com\, or call 512 436 8813 when you are ready to book a time for your b
 irthday party or have questions.\n\nFEE:\nThe minimum fee is $125 for 1-5 a
 rchers\, and then $25/archer for 6-10 for 2.5 hours.\n\nCAPACITY:\nThere is
  a limit of 10 archers on the shooting line.\n\nAGES:\nThe min. age is 8 ye
 ars old. If the ages of the kids are 8-9 years old\, please tell us.\n\nWAI
 VERS:\nEach parent will also need to waiver before their child will be allo
 wed in the range for the party.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260404T082256Z
LOCATION:10203 OLD Manchaca Rd.\, Austin\, TX 78748
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Birthday Party - Luke S !
TRANSP:OPAQUE
