DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://www.usarchery.org/events/event-information/433
 06">https://www.usarchery.org/events/event-information/43306</a><br><br>Tex
 as State Archery Association's Outdoor State Championship and JOAD State Ou
 tdoor Championship. <br>This is a World Archery Star tournament\, USA Arche
 ry rules and distances.<br><br>To participate\, you must be able to shoot t
 he tournament distance required for your age class (and have your own equip
 ment):<br><br>70m Recurve Seniors (21-50) (equivalent to Outdoor 9 at ATCI)
