DESCRIPTION:<p>These training sessions at 18m at the new temporary Westlake
  location are <b>for competitive archers only</b> who have <br></p><ul><li>
 graduated out of Indoor 2 at 9m and Indoor 3 at 13.5m\, AND</li><li>registe
 red and paid <b>$225 </b>in advance <b>for the temporary 18m space </b>(Jan
 +Feb)\, AND</li><li>+ registered and paid the <b>Indoor 4+ class fees below
  for each class or multi-class packet </b> (Fees stay at 2024 rates for com
 petitive archers) AND</li><li><b>registered for the Texas State</b> at Keal
 ing Middle School in Austin in January AND/OR</li><li><b>registered for the
  Indoor Nationals and/or JOAD Indoor Nationals </b>in February at Texas A&a
 mp\;M.</li></ul><b>Enter your name directly below for the sessions you woul
 d like to attend.</b> (There is no registration form for these 18m indoor s
 essions.)<br><p>Make sure you have all your equipment in your backpack\, no
 t pre-assembled. </p><p>Arrive early so you have your bow set up by the tim
 e the class starts.</p><p>You must wait at the front door and call the coac
 h to send someone to let you in.</p><ul><li><b>Sat 10:00-12:00</b>  Coach L
 4 Racae Meyer 512 975 1850</li><li><b>Sun 10:00-12:00</b> Coach L4 Racae Me
 yer 512 975 1850</li><li><b>Thurs 6:00-7:30 </b>Coach L3 Nick Erickson 512 
 608 7032</li><li>Coach L3 Joel Yu 203 232 8331</li></ul>There are six place
 s on the shooting line. We will form two or three lines when necessary to a
 ccommodate all archers who have registered and to more closely simulate com
 petitive conditions.<br><br>Text Coach Racae at 512 975 1850 with your ques
 tions.<br><br>Always check this calendar before driving to class in case th
 ere has been a last-minute scheduling change or cancellation.<br><br><b>Reg
 istered archers:</b><br><ol><li><b>Nick E</b>\, adult\, usaa - <b>254 pts</
 b></li><li><b>Finn E</b>\, 12\, usaa - <b>221 pts</b></li><li><b>Rhys E</b>
 \, 10 usaa - Did not shoot</li><li><br></li><li><br></li><li><br></li><li>.
 </li><li>.</li><li>.</li><li>.</li><li>.</li><li>.</li><li>.</li><li>.</li>
 <li>.</li><li>.</li><li>.</li></ol><br><b><i>(The following class fees are 
 in addition to the $225 rental fee for the 18m space)</i></b><br>Book and p
 ay in advance for any convenient time during the class times listed.<b><i><
 br></i></b><br>Please sign in and out at the 18m indoor range noting your t
 imes.<br><b><i><br></i></b><br><b>SINGLE Class fees :</b><br>   $26/archer 
 / 1 hr<br>   $39/archer / 1.5 hrs<br>   $52/archer / 2 hrs<br><br><b>MULTI-
 Class Discount Packets</b> (Can be used however and whenever convenient):<b
 r>  10 hours : $250 (= five 2-hr classes at $50/class) - $10 savings<br>  1
 6 hours : $384 (= eight 2-hr classes at $48/class) - $32 savings<br>  24 ho
 urs : $552 (= twelve 2-hr classes at $46/class) - $72 savings
