DESCRIPTION:<b>Thursday\, Oct 17\, 1:30-4:30 pm - 10 participants</b><br><b
 r><b>WAIVERS:</b> Everyone needs to <b>sign the waivers in advance </b>of a
 rriving at the range\, so we are not delayed in starting. Here's the link: 
 <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdYr3Yh5msvPHC_-ukFsifcvh
 YXRrzVRvcdyP4Ybx9O5zgUug/viewform" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>
 <u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>2024 Corporate Team Events Waivers Packet</u></u
 ></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></a>  <br><br>
 <b>DIRECTIONS:</b> <b>Google Map "Donut Taco Palace"</b> to find us quickly
  - We are right next door in Unit 102. (Some people are still being misdire
 cted.) There is a target on the glass door and the unit is facing 290W serv
 ice road going west on the corner of Industrial Oaks Blvd and 290W. <br><br
 ><b>ARRIVAL</b>: For a 1:30 pm start\, please <b>arrive by 1:15 pm</b>\, be
 cause we need to start together at 1:30 pm. <br><br><b>CARPOOLING / PARKING
 :</b> Please meet and carpool earlier from another location or from a big b
 ox store parking lot across the highway (like Target or At Home on the corn
 er of Mopac and 290W). It's easy and convenient to do. (Parking in front of
  the range and along Industrial Oaks Blvd may be limited\, depending on the
  number of participants.)<br><br><b>DRESS RECOMMENDATIONS: </b><br>Flat ath
 letic shoes are best\, as we will be throwing our weight forward a little\,
  so balance and weight distribution is important. The bowstring can get slo
 wed or entangled in your clothing or hair\, so wearing tightly fitting clot
 hes\, no wide skirts\, shirts without buttons on the front pockets and tyin
 g your hair back is preferable. Longer brim baseball caps often prevent the
  string from reaching your face\, so shorter brims or bucket hats are bette
 r. <br>:<br><b>All participants need to complete waivers online before the 
 event.</b><br><b>Here is the direct link to complete: </b><a href="https://
 docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdYr3Yh5msvPHC_-ukFsifcvhYXRrzVRvcdyP4Ybx9
 O5zgUug/viewform" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u
 ><u><u><u><u>2024 Corporate Team Events Waivers Packet</u></u></u></u></u><
 /u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></a>  <br><br>Waivers ha
 ve been received from those shown below in <b>bold with (W)</b><br><ol><li>
