 \;&nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 10 RELEASE + FOLLOW-THROUGH&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\;
  &nbsp\;<b>8-16&nbsp\; &nbsp\;&nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 11: FEEDBACK + Putting it
  all together!<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;<b>17/18&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</b><b>DEC A
 TCI MASTER CHALLENGE TOURNAMENT (Pin Shoot) 10:30am-12:30pm</b><br><b>&nbsp
 \; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;19-JAN 2&nbsp\;<i>MERRY CHRISTMAS !!</i>&nbsp\;- (NO CLAS
 SES)</b><br><br>Each week the focus of your lessons will be on particular S
 teps of Shooting of the NTS (National Training System) shot cycle\, to help
  you focus and improve your form\, which\, as we all know\, leads to greate
 r and consistent precision (tight groups of arrows) and ultimately greater 
 accuracy (tight groups of arrows dead center).<br><br>Your goal is always t
 o replicate the NTS step(s) mindfully and consistently on every shot. If yo
 u stay in the present just doing what you need to do as you need to it\, yo
 ur conscious mind will be occupied\, instead of random thoughts entering yo
 ur head or you being distracted by emotional or environmental elements. You
 ´ll need to build up your mental program alongside your form knowledge\, so
  when your body is trained to shoot excellent shots\, your self image and s
 ubconscious support you\, instead of undermining you. Confidence and consis
 tency in form and mind are major goals.<br><br>You do not need to score in 
 every class. In fact\, it would be more beneficial to you if you scored onl
 y during Master Challenge Tournament Weeks\, which happen the last week of 
 each month. This is because working on the NTS Steps of Shooting (your form
 ) is more easily done without the distraction of the target face or scoring
 \, and you will improve faster.<br><br>As you reach higher levels\, you wil
 l learn the NTS Steps in progressively greater detail.<br>The NTS Steps are
  cumulative with each step most successfully completed if the previous step
 s have been completed well.&nbsp\;<br><br>Your ability to learn and underst
 and the NTS Steps\, and use deep focus on these Steps while shooting outdoo
 rs\, and while using your stretchband/string loop at home to reinforce form
  positions\, will propel you to higher levels faster!
