DESCRIPTION:<b>DIRECTIONS:</b> <b>Google Map "Donut Taco Palace"</b> to fin
 d us quickly - We are right next door in Unit 102. (Some people are still b
 eing misdirected.) There is a target on the glass door and the unit is faci
 ng 290W service road going west on the corner of Industrial Oaks Blvd and 2
 90W. <br><br><b>ARRIVAL</b>: For a 1:30 pm start\, please <b>arrive by 1:15
  pm</b>\, because we need to start together at 1:30 pm. <br><br><b>CARPOOLI
 NG / PARKING:</b> Please meet and carpool earlier from another location or 
 from a big box store parking lot across the highway (like Target or At Home
  on the corner of Mopac and 290W). It's easy and convenient to do. (Parking
  in front of the range and along Industrial Oaks Blvd may be limited\, depe
 nding on the number of participants.)<br><br><b>DRESS RECOMMENDATIONS: </b>
 <br>Flat athletic shoes are best\, as we will be throwing our weight forwar
 d a little\, so balance and weight distribution is important. The bowstring
  can get slowed or entangled in your clothing or hair\, so wearing tightly 
 fitting clothes\, no wide skirts\, shirts without buttons on the front pock
 ets and tying your hair back is preferable. Longer brim baseball caps often
  prevent the string from reaching your face\, so shorter brims or bucket ha
 ts are better.<br><br><b>All participants need to complete waivers online b
 efore the event.</b><br><b>Here is the direct link to complete: </b><a href
 ="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfsWlvFJhlvEMDPIw2f8-x-Lwpwd06cV
 xvA7PGw-lgmRnD00w/viewform?usp=dialog" target="_blank"><u>2026 Waivers for 
 Corporate Team Events</u></a> <br><br>Waivers have been received from those
  shown below in <b>bold with (W) - </b><br><b>* Indicates not on original l
 ist of participants<br>Last update: Tues 2/10/26 at 2:00 pm CST:</b><br><ol
 ><li><b>Justin L. (W)</b></li><li><b>Zeshan R. (W)</b></li><li><b>Dylan K. 
 (W)</b></li><li><b>Jacob V.D. </b><b> (W)</b></li><li><b>Keenan K. </b><b> 
 (W)</b></li><li>Livvie S. (<b>Olivia W</b>?) <b> (W)</b></li><li><b>Kevin B
 . </b><b> (W)</b></li><li><b>Max S. </b><b> (W)</b></li><li><b>Jose F. </b>
