DESCRIPTION:This weekly practice time is being offered on a trial basis thi
 s Spring to see how popular the evening would be. It´s intended to give eve
 ryone more time to practice in the range\, but not as a substitute for the 
 regularly scheduled and coached classes. \n\nDetails:\nOne fee: $25 for the
  evening payable upon arrival.\nYou can sign up at the range in advance to 
 reserve your place on the shooting line\, or just show up\, if it´s not nea
 ring full.\nNO COACHING - just deep\, focused practice!\nOpen to recurve ar
 chers who have taken the Indoor 1: First-time Class and regularly attend at
  least two (2) hours/month in scheduled group coached classes \nAlso open t
 o experienced recurve archers\, who have previously met with Coach Racae.\n
 Olympic recurve bows only (not compounds\, traditional bows\, cross bows)\n
 If junior archers are present\, there must be at least two adults in the ra
 nge at all times (parents\, adult archers).\nMax. draw weight: 45 lbs.\nThi
 s same time can also be booked in advance for one-hour private lessons with
  Coach Racae ($50/hr)\nAll safety rules will be enforced and obeyed.\nAlway
 s look at the website calendar before coming\, in case there is last minute
  change due to weather\, illness\, etc.\nAny questions: Contact Coach Racae
  512 975 1850\n\nSee you soon!
