DESCRIPTION:PLEASE READ and THEN FILL OUT THE FIELDS AT THE BOTTOM OF THE R
 EGISTRATION FORM.<br><br>PREREQUISITE:&nbsp\;<br>This enrollment form is fo
 r JUNIOR archers and their PARENTS who have taken and qualified in the Indo
 or 1: First-time Class.<br><br>PARENTS&nbsp\;<br>can enroll and shoot with 
 their child(ren) in the following classes\, provided they have also taken a
 n Indoor 1: First-time Class.<br><br>CAPACITY: 10 archers per class<br>AGES
 : 8 - 18 years old&nbsp\;<br>DISTANCES: 9m\, 13.5m<br>BOWS: Recurves<br><br
 >EQUIPMENT:&nbsp\;<br>We provide all equipment necessary indefinitely at no
  extra charge. (Recurve bow\, 3 arrows\, armguard\, finger tab\, target)<br
 >When you are ready to order your own equipment\, we pace and specify what 
 you need and help you order it\, so you buy the correct equipment for your 
 strength and experience. Generally\, we do not recommend anyone buys equipm
 ent before they have been with us for at least 8 hours.<br><br>CLASS TIMES 
 and COACHES/INSTRUCTORS:<br>These are the days/times that are available to 
 you. All classes are coached by Coach Racae.<br>MIXED Indoor 2/3/4/5+ class
 es of JOADs\, Parents\, and Adults at 9m/13.5m/18m.<br><br>SAT: 2:30-3:30pm
  (JOAD + Parents only at 9m/13.5m)&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&n
 bsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;3:45-4:45pm (MIXED)&n
 bsp\;<br><br>SUN: 2:30-3:30pm (JOAD + Parents only at 9m/13.5m)&nbsp\;<br>&
 nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\
 ;&nbsp\;3:45-4:45pm (MIXED)&nbsp\;<br><br>TUES: 5:00-6:00pm JOAD + Parents 
 only at 9m/13.5m)&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp
 \;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;6:00-7:00pm (MIXED)&nbsp\;<br><br>WED:
  5:00-6:00pm JOAD + Parents only at 9m/13.5m)&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp
 \;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;6:00-7:00p
 m (MIXED)&nbsp\;<br><br>FEES:&nbsp\;<br>$20/hr for any hour above\, and to 
 secure your place in any class before or after that hour ON THE SAME DAY<br
 >+ Enrollment fee: $20 (always due once per semester)&nbsp\;<br>Additional 
 hour(s) ON THE SAME DAY are open to you at the following reduced fees\, pro
 vided there are spaces remaining in the class: $20/hr\; $30 for 2 hrs\; $40
  for 3 hrs.&nbsp\;<br><br>ENROLLMENT IS ON A FIRST-RECEIVED AND PAID BASIS.
 <br>This enrollment form must be completed and your payment received in ord
 er for you to be enrolled and a place reserved for you. You can enroll any 
 time during the semester for as many or as few classes as you like as long 
 as there are places open.<br>So\, for example\, you can enroll for the enti
 re semester\, each month\, or sprinkle the days throughout the semester dep
 ending on your schedule. (Please bear in mind\, however\, you'll progress f
 aster with regular attendance.)<br><br>DROP INS:<br>Your name will be on th
 e website calendar under the date and time you registered after we receive 
 your fee in advance of the class. When classes are not full\, it's okay to 
 just drop in for the class and pay at that time. When you attend\, and the 
 class is near full\, you should pay at least one class in advance to guaran
 tee you have a place next time. You can see the actual attendance (includin
 g drop-ins) by looking at past classes on the website calendar. If the clas
 s is "FULL"\, it will be so indicated on the calendar.<br><br>ATTENDANCE RE
 COMMENDATIONS (in order to improve over time). Recreational archers have no
  attendance requirements.&nbsp\;<br>INDOOR 2 at 9m : 2 hrs/wk<br>INDOOR 3A 
 at 13.5m : 3-4 hrs/wk<br><br>HOW DOES IT WORK? HOW DO I ADVANCE?<br>Please 
 look under Programs at&nbsp\;<a href="http://www.archerytrainingcenter.com"
 >www.archerytrainingcenter.com</a>\, and read the information to understand
  how it all works.<br><br>Scores are also listed below\, if you kept score\
 , which is not required\, except on Master Challenge weeks. You need 230 pt
 s on 40cm target or 240 pts on 60cm target to graduate out of your distance
  into Indoor 3A at 13.5m\, and again at 13.5m to get into Indoor 3B at 18m 
 (full distance).<br>PB = Personal Best.&nbsp\;<br><br>Registered archers:<b
 r>1. Zoë C.\, JOAD 13.5m - paid .<br>2. Will A.\, JOAD 13.5m - paid .<br>3.
  Emily A.\, JOAD 9m - paid - DNA<br>4. Jeff A.\, Parent 13.5m - paid .<br>5
 . Lily R.\, JOAD 13.5m - paid - DNA ill .<br>6. Gunnar\, JOAD 9m - paid .<b
 r>7. Katalina\, JOAD 9m - paid 251 PB - going to 13.5m !!<br>8. Jackson G.\
 , JOAD 9m - paid<br>9.<br>10.
