 M\, 13\nJoe M\, dad\n\nWaiting List: None\n\nIf your name is on the waiting
  list\, you have a choice of \ncoming to see if a place opens up at the las
 t minute\, or \nrescheduling your class for another date/time. \nWe can onl
 y take 10 archers on the shooting line at one time. \nThe instructor may al
 so create two shooting lines\, which will increase the length of the class 
 for everyone and decrease the number of arrows everyone has time to shoot.\
 nIf you prefer not to be on the waiting list\, please reschedule your class
  for another date.
