DESCRIPTION:This will be a written test on the form for those in Indoors at
  18m. \nIt is voluntary. If you miss taking it on May 20\, you can take it 
 up to May 30\, when we close for Summer Vacation 1.\nStudy the form posters
  as the questions will be created from them. It is not multiple choice\, so
  you'll need to really know the positions. There is no penalty for not taki
 ng the test or for not passing it. It is meant to help you learn the form m
 ore deeply by studying the steps more closely.\nEvery semester we start ove
 r again on the NTS Steps of Shooting\, so if you missed the test this time\
 , you'll have another chance to take it at the end of each semester.\nSumme
 r classes will resume on June 9 and finish on August 11. The Annual Banquet
  is 5:30-7:30pm on August 12.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260404T082256Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Written Form Test for 18m archers
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
