DESCRIPTION:Focused on <br><b>Hook</b>- Turning hand out so string hits und
 erside of fingers\; see index finger turned up\; more pressure on index and
  middle fingers\; stretch between index finger and thumb<br><b>Grip</b>: Pr
 essure and Pivot points\; how much and where? Keeping it the same throughou
 t the shot and shot to shot\; reducing variations<br><b>Anchor: </b>Head po
 sition turned more to left\; deeper into throat and higher into jaw\; no mo
 vement\; touch throat\, no gap.<br>Follow up in at least three weeks.
