DESCRIPTION:We'd be very happy to host a team-building archery event for yo
 ur corporate group. These sessions are proving to be very popular\, and we 
 appreciate the opportunity!\n\nSCHEDULING:\nWe have openings in between our
  regular classes\, which you can see on our website's Calendar.\nPlease sug
 gest a 3-hr time slot on a couple of convenient dates/times for your group 
 (not on Summer Camp weekdays)\, and we'll do our best to work with you. It'
 s best to allow about 3 hrs.\, as we may run over by as much as 30 minutes\
 , depending on everyone's arrivals and abilities. If this will be a problem
 \, please let us know.\nOnce we have an agreed upon date/time\, we'll reser
 ve your time on our calendar. \n\nARRIVALS:  We'll all start together\, so 
 it's good to have everyone arrive on time or together. (You may want to car
 pool from your office or where you're having lunch.)\n\nFEE:    For a first
 -time team-building 2-hr to 3-hr session\, there is a minimum indoor range 
 booking fee of $125 for 1-5 people\, and then $25/person for 6-10 people. W
 hen you arrive at the range\, you can pay for the session individually or b
 y corporate check payable to Archery Training Center\, or by credit card (+
 2.75%).\n\nEQUIPMENT:    We provide all equipment necessary. \n\nWAIVERS:  
 There will be waivers for each archer to fill out and sign when they first 
 come in\, and before entering the range.\n\nSPECIAL INSTRUCTIONS:    Please
  let us know if there are any special concepts you would like us to emphasi
 ze to help you build your team.  After the initial "learning how to shoot" 
 part\, there will be time for team games\, which everyone always enjoys.\n\
 nThank you for your interest in Olympic target archery!\n\nWe look forward 
 to your time with us.\n\nIf you'd like to discuss this in more detail\, ple
 ase call us at 512 436 8813 at your convenience.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260404T082256Z
LOCATION:10203 Old Manchaca Road\, Austin\, TX\, United States
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Corporate Team Building: Dell
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
