DESCRIPTION:Level 3 NTS Coach Nick Erickson (5126087032)\n\nOpen Practice s
 essions at this location are reserved for competitive and advanced archers.
 \n\nIf you participated in the 2024 or 2025 Aggie Invitationals\, you are i
 n! You should receive an email with info and instructions before your first
  session at this location.\n\nIf you haven't yet made the 2026 Indoor Compe
 tition Team\, but have your own equipment\, and have scored 240 on the 60-c
 m target face or 230 on the 40-cm target face in a 30-arrow indoor round at
  9m\, contact Coach Racae.\n\n A USA Archery certified Level 2 - 4 coach or
  instructor will be using the 18m range for their own or their family's ind
 ependent practice\, but will open it so other archers\, who have registered
  for at least one Training Class each week\, and have paid the Facility Fee
  each month\, can also have additional practice. No coaching or equipment a
 dvice provided.\n\nSpace is limited to 12 archers\, so sign up early and pa
 y the Training Class and Facility Fees in advance to secure your place! .  
  \n\nTraining Class fee: $52/archer/class\n(1x/wk required to attend Open P
 ractice)\nFacility fee (required each month): $205/month/archer due Nov 15\
 , Dec 15\, and Jan 15  \n(Move out : Feb 15)\nOpen Practice Included in fac
 ility fee (1-2x/wk recommended)\nPrivate Lesson fee: $125/hr/archer (2x/mo 
 recommended)\n\n Registered archers today: \n\n1. Nick E\n2. Adrianne M\n3.
  Abby Y\n4. Ellie Y\n5. \n6. \n7.\n8.     \n9.     \n10.\n11.\n12.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260114T130037Z
