DESCRIPTION:These training sessions at 18m at the new temporary Westlake lo
 cation are for competitive archers only who have  <br>    •    graduated ou
 t of Indoor 2 at 9m and Indoor 3 at 13.5m\, AND<br>    •    registered and 
 paid $225 in advance for the temporary 18m space (Jan+Feb)\, AND<br>    •  
   + registered and paid the Indoor 4+ class fees below for each class or mu
 lti-class packet  (Fees stay at 2024 rates for competitive archers) AND<br>
     •    registered for the Texas State at Kealing Middle School in Austin 
 in January AND/OR<br>    •    registered for the Indoor Nationals and/or JO
 AD Indoor Nationals in February at Texas A&amp\;M.<br>Enter your name direc
 tly below for the sessions you would like to attend. (There is no registrat
 ion form for these 18m indoor sessions.)<br>Make sure you have all your equ
 ipment in your backpack\, not pre-assembled. <br>Arrive early so you have y
 our bow set up by the time the class starts.<br>You must wait at the front 
 door and call the coach to send someone to let you in.<br>    Double check 
 the ATCI calendar just before driving to class to make sure there is a sess
 ion that day. Also check periodically to see if additional classes have bee
 n added that week. <br>    •    Sat 10:00-12:00  Coach L4 Racae Meyer 512 9
 75 1850<br>    •    Sun 10:00-12:00 Coach L4 Racae Meyer 512 975 1850<br>  
   •    Mon 6:00-7:30 Coach L3 Joel Yu 203 232 8331    <br>    •    Tues 5:3
 0-7:00 Coach L3 Lindsay Lawley-Rerecich 512 914 7934 or Instructor L2 Matt 
 Rerecich 512 914 7914<br>    •    Wed 6:00-7:30 Coach L3 Joel Yu 203 232 83
 31  <br>    •    Thurs 6:00-7:30 Coach L3 Nick Erickson 512 608 7032<br>The
 re are six places on the shooting line. We will form two or three lines whe
 n necessary to accommodate all archers who have registered and to more clos
 ely simulate competitive conditions.<br><br>Text Coach Racae at 512 975 185
 0 with your questions.<br><br>Always check this calendar before driving to 
 class in case there has been a last-minute scheduling change or cancellatio
 n.<br><br>Registered archers<br>    1.  <b>Lily R.\,</b> 15\, USAA\, parent
  coach waiver - 1.5 hrs<br>    2. <b>Miles G.</b>\, 12\, USAA\, OB\, pd - 1
 .5 hrs<br>    3.<br>    4.    <br>    5.   <br>    6.    <br>    7.    <br>
     8.    <br>    9.    <br>    10.    <br>    11.    <br>    12.    <br>  
   13.    <br>    14.    <br>    15.    <br>    16.    <br>    17.    <br>  
   18.    <br><br>(The following class fees are in addition to the $225 rent
 al fee for the 18m space)<br>Book and pay in advance for any convenient tim
 e during the class times listed.<br><br>Please sign in and out at the 18m i
 ndoor range noting your times.<br><br><br>SINGLE Class fees :<br>   $26/arc
 her / 1 hr<br>   $39/archer / 1.5 hrs<br>   $52/archer / 2 hrs<br><br>MULTI
 -Class Discount Packets (Can be used however and whenever convenient):<br> 
  10 hours : $250 (= five 2-hr classes at $50/class) - $10 savings<br>  16 h
 ours : $384 (= eight 2-hr classes at $48/class) - $32 savings<br>  24 hours
  : $552 (= twelve 2-hr classes at $46/class) - $72 savings
