DESCRIPTION:<p>These training sessions at 18m at the new temporary Westlake
  location are <b>for competitive archers only</b> who have <br></p><ul><li>
 graduated out of Indoor 2 at 9m and Indoor 3 at 13.5m\, AND</li><li>registe
 red and paid <b>$225 </b>in advance <b>for the temporary 18m space </b>(Jan
 +Feb)\, AND</li><li>+ registered and paid the <b>Indoor 4+ class fees below
  for each class or multi-class packet </b> (Fees stay at 2024 rates for com
 petitive archers) AND</li><li><b>registered for the Texas State</b> at Keal
 ing Middle School in Austin in January AND/OR</li><li><b>registered for the
  Indoor Nationals and/or JOAD Indoor Nationals </b>in February at Texas A&a
 mp\;M.</li></ul><p><b>Enter your name directly below for the sessions you w
 ould like to attend.</b> (There is no registration form for these 18m indoo
 r sessions.)<br></p><p>Make sure you have all your equipment in your backpa
 ck\, not pre-assembled. </p><p>Arrive early so you have your bow set up by 
 the time the class starts.</p><p>You must wait at the front door and call t
 he coach to send someone to let you in.</p><p><b>Double check the ATCI cale
 ndar just before driving to class to make sure there is a session that day.
  Also check periodically to see if additional classes have been added that 
 week.</b><br></p><ul><li><b>Sat 10:00-12:00 </b> Coach L4 Racae Meyer 512 9
 75 1850</li><li><b>Sun 10:00-12:00</b> Coach L4 Racae Meyer 512 975 1850</l
 i><li><b>Mon 6:00-7:30 </b>Coach L3 Joel Yu 203 232 8331    </li><li><b>Tue
 s 5:30-7:00</b> Coach L3 Lindsay Lawley-Rerecich 512 914 7934 or Instructor
  L2 Matt Rerecich 512 914 7914</li><li><b>Wed 6:00-7:30</b> Coach L3 Joel Y
 u 203 232 8331  </li><li><b>Thurs 6:00-7:30</b> Coach L3 Nick Erickson 512 
 608 7032</li></ul><p>There are six places on the shooting line. We will for
 m two or three lines when necessary to accommodate all archers who have reg
 istered and to more closely simulate competitive conditions.<br><br>Text Co
 ach Racae at 512 975 1850 with your questions.</p><p><b>What we worked on t
 oday:</b><br></p><p><br>Always check this calendar before driving to class 
 in case there has been a last-minute scheduling change or cancellation.<br>
 </p><br><b>Registered archers</b><ol><li><b>Colby K</b>. adult\, USAA\, pd 
 2.0 hrs - <b>187 / 213 (averaged)</b></li><li><b>Sofia W</b>\, 13\, USAA\, 
 pd - 2.0 hrs -<b>221 / 247 (averaged)</b></li><li>.</li><li>.</li><li><br><
 /li></ol><b>SINGLE Class fees :<br>   $26/archer / 1 hr</b><br><b>   $39/ar
 cher / 1.5 hrs</b><br><b>   $52/archer / 2 hrs</b><br><br><b>MULTI-Class Di
 scount Packets</b> (Can be used however and whenever convenient):<br>  <b>1
 0 hours : $250 </b>(=<b> five 2-hr classes </b>at $50/class) - $10 savings<
 br>  <b>16 hours : $384 </b>(= <b>eight 2-hr classes </b>at $48/class)<b> <
 /b>- $32 savings<br>  <b>24 hours : $552 </b>(= <b>twelve</b> <b>2-hr class
 es </b>at $46/class) - $72 savings<br>Book and pay in advance for any conve
 nient time during the class times listed.<br><br><b><i>Please sign in and o
 ut</i></b><i> at the 18m indoor range noting your times. </i>
