DESCRIPTION:<i><b>Thank you for your support of our Olympic Target Archery 
 programs for adults and juniors!</b></i><b><br></b><br><b>WAIVERS:</b> Ever
 yone needs to <b>sign the waivers in advance </b>of arriving at the range\,
  so we are not delayed in starting. Here's the link <a href="https://docs.g
 oogle.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSe4nVUxh99Vi50BKWFl9swZ4fephhjHBHtHpxx7G7I7KIiw5
 A/viewform?usp=preview" target="_blank"><u><b>2025 Waivers for Corporate Te
 am Building Events</b></u></a><br><br><b>DIRECTIONS:</b> <b>Google Map "Don
 ut Taco Palace"</b> to find us quickly - We are right next door in Unit 102
 . (Some people are still being misdirected.) There is a target on the glass
  door and the unit is facing 290W service road going west on the corner of 
 Industrial Oaks Blvd and 290W. <br><br><b>ARRIVAL</b>: Please <b>arrive by 
 2:15 pm</b>\, because we will all be starting together at 2:30 pm. <br><br>
 <b>CARPOOLING / PARKING:</b> Please meet and carpool earlier from another l
 ocation or from a big box store parking lot across the highway (like Target
  or At Home on the corner of Mopac and 290W). It's easy and convenient to d
 o. (Parking in front of the range and along Industrial Oaks Blvd may be lim
 ited\, depending on the number of participants.)<br><br><b>DRESS RECOMMENDA
 TIONS: </b><br>Flat athletic shoes are best\, as we will be throwing our we
 ight forward a little\, so balance and weight distribution is important. Th
 e bowstring can get slowed or entangled in your clothing or hair\, so weari
 ng tightly fitting clothes\, no wide skirts\, shirts without buttons on the
  front pockets and tying your hair back is preferable. Longer brim baseball
  caps often prevent the string from reaching your face\, so shorter brims o
 r bucket hats are better. <br>:<br><b>All participants need to complete wai
 vers online before the event.</b><br><b>Here is the direct link to complete
 : </b><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSe4nVUxh99Vi50BKWFl
 9swZ4fephhjHBHtHpxx7G7I7KIiw5A/viewform?usp=preview" target="_blank"><u><u>
 <b>2025 Waivers for Corporate Team Building Events</b></u></u></a><br><br>W
 aivers have been received from those shown below in <b>bold with (W)</b><br
 ><b>Last update: 6/18/25 at 10:30 am</b><span><br></span><ol><li>Chetan D. 
 </li><li>Karan B.</li><li>Jen M.</li><li><b>Gaoyuan W. (W)</b><br></li><li>
 <b>Gurbakhsh S</b>. <b>(W)</b></li><li><b>Himanshu S.</b><span> </span><b>(
 W)</b></li><li><b>Jerry T. (W)</b></li><li><b>Rajeev S.</b> <b>(W)</b></li>
 <li><b>Sudheer K. (W)</b></li><li><b>Sujaritha D. </b><b>(W)</b></li></ol>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260404T082324Z
