 unt Packets<br>  9 hours : $250 (six 1.5-hr classes)<br> 12 hours : $320 (e
 ight 1.5-hr classes)<br> 18 hours : $460 (twelve 1.5-hr classes) <br><br>Th
 ere are 8 places on the shooting line\, and we sometimes have double lines 
 depending on attendance.<br><br>Sign in/out upon arrival/departure<br>For s
 ingle classes\, book and pay in advance.<br>For multi-class discount packs\
 , pay in advance and book when you are sure of the dates.<br>Coaching and w
