DESCRIPTION:Level 3 NTS Coach Joel (203-232-8331)<br><br>USA Archery certif
 ied Level 2-4 coach or instructor coaches will provide form rectification\,
  mental coaching\, and equipment tuning and advice.<br>Fee: $52/two-hour cl
 ass/archer or multi-class discount pack.<br><br>Class opened with a discuss
 ion on the key points for DRAW TO LOAD. <br><br>1. <b> (50m) Abby Y.</b> 13
 \, 2 hrs - Working on minimizing head mov't and keeping a strong bow arm\, 
 pushing towards target<br>2.(30<b>m</b>) <b>Ellie Y.\, 10\,</b>  - 2 hrs - 
 <i>Working on engaging the core so the back doesn't hollow out and keeping 
 her draw hand in the correct positions at anchor through the release/follow
 -through.</i><br>3. (<b>30m) Anna P</b>\, adult - 2 hrs - <i>Working on coi
 ling and drawing/expanding with the draw side shoulder blade mov't to reach
  full alignment. </i><br>4 (<b>30m</b>) <b>Luke T\, </b> - 2 hrs- <i>Workin
 g on proper set up and coiling. Working on getting the bow arm shoulder in 
 the right position to prevent it from coming up so high during the shot.</i
 >
