DESCRIPTION:These training sessions at 18m at the new temporary Westlake lo
 cation are for competitive archers only who have <br>    * graduated out of
  Indoor 2 at 9m and Indoor 3 at 13.5m\, AND<br>    * registered and paid $2
 25 in advance for the temporary 18m space (Jan+Feb)\, AND<br>    * + regist
 ered and paid the Indoor 4+ class fees below for each class or multi-class 
 packet  (Fees stay at 2024 rates for competitive archers) AND<br>    * regi
 stered for the Texas State at Kealing Middle School in Austin in January AN
 D/OR<br>    * registered for the Indoor Nationals and/or JOAD Indoor Nation
 als in February at Texas A&amp\;M.<br>Enter your name directly below for th
 e sessions you would like to attend. (There is no registration form for the
 se 18m indoor sessions.)<br>Make sure you have all your equipment in your b
 ackpack\, not pre-assembled. <br>Arrive early so you have your bow set up b
 y the time the class starts.<br>You must wait at the front door and call th
 e coach to send someone to let you in.<br>Double check the ATCI calendar ju
 st before driving to class to make sure there is a session that day. Also c
 heck periodically to see if additional classes have been added that week.<b
 r>    * Sat 10:00-12:00  Coach L4 Racae Meyer 512 975 1850<br>    * Sun 10:
 00-12:00 Coach L4 Racae Meyer 512 975 1850<br>    * Mon 6:00-7:30 Coach L3 
 Joel Yu 203 232 8331 <br>    * Tues 5:30-7:00 Coach L3 Lindsay Lawley-Rerec
 ich 512 914 7934 or Instructor L2 Matt Rerecich 512 914 7914<br>    * Wed 6
 :00-7:30 Coach L3 Joel Yu 203 232 8331  <br>    * Thurs 6:00-7:30 Coach L3 
 Nick Erickson 512 608 7032<br>There are six places on the shooting line. We
  will form two or three lines when necessary to accommodate all archers who
  have registered and to more closely simulate competitive conditions.<br><b
 r>Text Coach Racae at 512 975 1850 with your questions.<br><br>Always check
  this calendar before driving to class in case there has been a last-minute
  scheduling change or cancellation.<br>Registered archers<br>    1. <b>Abby
