 kes about 30 min to learn how to cut\, nock\, point\, and fletch arrows. \n
 \nYou will do the rest of your arrows at home\, so have a fletching jig and
  torch available at home. You can use the arrow saw and torch at the range 
 if you are 16+ years old. \n\nWe do not fletch your arrows for you after yo
 u order your own arrows\, so everyone needs to learn how to assemble and re
 pair their own arrows\, and have the equipment to do that.\n\n1. Eleonor H.
