DESCRIPTION:<p>***Due to work travel changes\, Coach Joel will be running t
 his session on February 5 and taking the February 12 session off the calend
 ar.***</p><p><br></p><p>These training sessions at 18m at the new temporary
  Westlake location are <b>for competitive archers only</b> who have <br></p
 ><ul><li>graduated out of Indoor 2 at 9m and Indoor 3 at 13.5m\, AND</li><l
 i>registered and paid <b>$225 </b>in advance <b>for the temporary 18m space
  </b>(Jan+Feb)\, AND</li><li>+ registered and paid the <b>Indoor 4+ class f
 ees below for each class or multi-class packet </b> (Fees stay at 2024 rate
 s for competitive archers) AND</li><li><b>registered for the Texas State</b
 > at Kealing Middle School in Austin in January AND/OR</li><li><b>registere
 d for the Indoor Nationals and/or JOAD Indoor Nationals </b>in February at 
 Texas A&amp\;M.</li></ul><p><b>Enter your name directly below for the sessi
 ons you would like to attend.</b> (There is no registration form for these 
 18m indoor sessions.)<br></p><p>Make sure you have all your equipment in yo
 ur backpack\, not pre-assembled. </p><p>Arrive early so you have your bow s
 et up by the time the class starts.</p><p>You must wait at the front door a
 nd call the coach to send someone to let you in.</p><p><b>Double check the 
 ATCI calendar just before driving to class to make sure there is a session 
 that day. Also check periodically to see if additional classes have been ad
 ded that week.</b><br></p><ul><li><b>Sat 10:00-12:00 </b> Coach L4 Racae Me
 yer 512 975 1850</li><li><b>Sun 10:00-12:00</b> Coach L4 Racae Meyer 512 97
 5 1850</li><li><b>Mon 6:00-7:30 </b>Coach L3 Joel Yu 203 232 8331    </li><
 li><b>Tues 5:30-7:00</b> Coach L3 Lindsay Lawley-Rerecich 512 914 7934 or I
 nstructor L2 Matt Rerecich 512 914 7914</li><li><b>Wed 6:00-7:30</b> Coach 
 L3 Joel Yu 203 232 8331  </li><li><b>Thurs 6:00-7:30</b> Coach L3 Nick Eric
 kson 512 608 7032</li></ul><p>There are six places on the shooting line. We
  will form two or three lines when necessary to accommodate all archers who
  have registered and to more closely simulate competitive conditions.<br><b
 r>Text Coach Racae at 512 975 1850 with your questions.<br><br>Always check
  this calendar before driving to class in case there has been a last-minute
  scheduling change or cancellation.<br></p>Registered archers<br><ol><li><b
 >Abby Y\, </b>12\, OB\, USAA\, pd <b>230 </b>at 40cm</li><li><b>Hannah T.\,
  </b><span>adult\, USAA\, pd - </span><b>211 / 177 pts</b><br></li><li><b>E
 llie Y.\, </b>10\, OB\, USAA\, pd - <b>163 / 172 pts </b>at 18m 60cm</li><l
 i><b>Joel Y.\, </b>coach\, <b>217 / 237 pts</b></li><li><b>Sophia D\,</b> a
 d \,USAA\,f - <b>198 / 233 pts</b><br></li><li><b>Erika OG</b>\, ad\, USAA\
 , pd - <b>144 / 173 pts - </b>plunger adjusted to clear rest\; had to reset
  sight</li><li><b>Javier G</b>\, ad\, USAA\, pd - <b>214 / 201 pts</b></li>
 <li>.</li><li><br></li><li><br></li></ol><b><i>(The following class fees ar
 e in addition to the $225 rental fee for the 18m space)</i></b><br>Book and
  pay in advance for any convenient time during the class times listed.<b><i
 ><br></i></b><br>Please sign in and out at the 18m indoor range noting your
  times.<b><i><br></i></b><br><b>SINGLE Class fees :</b><br>   $26/archer / 
 1 hr<br>   $39/archer / 1.5 hrs<br>   $52/archer / 2 hrs<br><br><b>MULTI-Cl
 ass Discount Packets</b> (Can be used however and whenever convenient):<br>
   10 hours : $250 (= five 2-hr classes at $50/class) - $10 savings<br>  16 
 hours : $384 (= eight 2-hr classes at $48/class) - $32 savings<br>  24 hour
 s : $552 (= twelve 2-hr classes at $46/class) - $72 savings
