DESCRIPTION:<p>These training sessions at 18m at the new temporary Westlake
  location are <b>for competitive archers only</b> who have <br></p><ul><li>
 graduated out of Indoor 2 at 9m and Indoor 3 at 13.5m\, AND</li><li>registe
 red and paid <b>$225 </b>in advance <b>for the temporary 18m space </b>(Jan
 +Feb)\, AND</li><li>+ registered and paid the <b>Indoor 4+ class fees below
  for each class or multi-class packet </b> (Fees stay at 2024 rates for com
 petitive archers) AND</li><li><b>registered for the Texas State</b> at Keal
 ing Middle School in Austin in January AND/OR</li><li><b>registered for the
  Indoor Nationals and/or JOAD Indoor Nationals </b>in February at Texas A&a
 mp\;M.</li></ul><b>Enter your name directly below for the sessions you woul
 d like to attend.</b> (There is no registration form for these 18m indoor s
 essions.)<br><p>Make sure you have all your equipment in your backpack\, no
 t pre-assembled. </p><p>Arrive early so you have your bow set up by the tim
 e the class starts.</p><p>You must wait at the front door and call the coac
 h to send someone to let you in.</p><p><b>Double check the ATCI calendar ju
 st before driving to class to make sure there is a session that day. Also c
 heck periodically to see if additional classes have been added that week.</
 b><br></p><ul><li><b>Sat 10:00-12:00 </b> Coach L4 Racae Meyer 512 975 1850
 </li><li><b>Sun 10:00-12:00</b> Coach L4 Racae Meyer 512 975 1850</li><li><
 b>Mon 6:00-7:30 </b>Coach L3 Joel Yu 203 232 8331    </li><li><b>Tues 5:30-
 7:00</b> Coach L3 Lindsay Lawley-Rerecich 512 914 7934 or Instructor L2 Mat
 t Rerecich 512 914 7914</li><li><b>Wed 6:00-7:30</b> Coach L3 Joel Yu 203 2
 32 8331  </li><li><b>Thurs 6:00-7:30</b> Coach L3 Nick Erickson 512 608 703
 2</li></ul><br>There are six places on the shooting line. We will form two 
 or three lines when necessary to accommodate all archers who have registere
 d and to more closely simulate competitive conditions.<br><br>Text Coach Ra
 cae at 512 975 1850 with your questions.<br><br>Always check this calendar 
 before driving to class in case there has been a last-minute scheduling cha
 nge or cancellation.<br><b>Registered archers:</b><br>Please carefully make
  sure to <br><ul><li>add your name on each date <b>separately</b> and</li><
 li>SAVE ¨<b>This event</b>¨ NOT the other selections\, or you will delete a
 ll future registrations that others have made !</li></ul><ol><li><b>Erika O
 G\, </b>adult\, OB\, USAA\, f2 - 2 hrs</li><li><b>Javier G\, </b>adult\, OB
 \, USAA\, f2 - 2 hrs</li><li><b>Hannah T\,</b> adult\, usaa\, pd - 2 hrs</l
 i><li><b>Jacqui C.\, </b>11\, on 60-cm target face\, pd - 2 hrs</li><li><b>
 Joel Y</b>\, adult\, OB\, USAA\, pd - 2 hrs</li><li><b>Abby Y</b>\, 12\, OB
 \, USAA\, pd - 2 hrs</li><li><b>Miles G</b>.\, 12\, OB\, USAA\, pd - 1.5 hr
 s</li><li>.</li><li>.</li><li>.</li><li>.</li><li>.</li><li>.</li><li>.</li
 ><li>.</li><li>.</li><li>.</li><li>.</li></ol><br><br><br><b>SINGLE Class f
 ees :<br>   $26/archer / 1 hr</b><br><b>   $39/archer / 1.5 hrs</b><br><b> 
   $52/archer / 2 hrs</b><br><br><b>MULTI-Class Discount Packets</b> (Can be
  used however and whenever convenient):<br>  <b>10 hours : $250 </b>(=<b> f
 ive 2-hr classes </b>at $50/class) - $10 savings<br>  <b>16 hours : $384 </
 b>(= <b>eight 2-hr classes </b>at $48/class)<b> </b>- $32 savings<br>  <b>2
 4 hours : $552 </b>(= <b>twelve</b> <b>2-hr classes </b>at $46/class) - $72
  savings<br>Book and pay in advance for any convenient time during the clas
 s times listed.<br><br><b><i>Please sign in and out</i></b><i> at the 18m i
 ndoor range noting your times. </i>
