 stered for the Texas State at Kealing Middle School in Austin in January AN
 D/OR<br>    * registered for the Indoor Nationals and/or JOAD Indoor Nation
 als in February at Texas A&amp\;M.<br>Enter your name directly below for th
 e sessions you would like to attend. (There is no registration form for the
 se 18m indoor sessions.)<br>Make sure you have all your equipment in your b
 ackpack\, not pre-assembled. <br>Arrive early so you have your bow set up b
 y the time the class starts.<br>You must wait at the front door and call th
 e coach to send someone to let you in.<br><b>Double check the ATCI calendar
  just before coming to class to make sure there is a session that day. Also
  check periodically to see if additional classes have been added that week.
 </b><br><ul><li><b>Sat 10:00-12:00 </b> Coach L4 Racae Meyer 512 975 1850</
