 00</b> Coach L3 Lindsay Lawley-Rerecich <span>512 914 7934 </span><span>or 
 Instructor L2 Matt Rerecich 512 914 7914</span></li><li><span><b>Wed 6:00-7
 :30</b> Coach L3 Joel Yu 203 232 8331  </span></li><li><span><b>Thurs 6:00-
 7:30</b> Coach L3 Nick Erickson 512 608 7032</span></li></ul>There are six 
 places on the shooting line. We will form two or three lines when necessary
  to accommodate all archers who have registered and to more closely simulat
 e competitive conditions.  3-arrow ends in 2 minutes.<br><br>Text Coach Rac
 ae at 512 975 1850 with your questions.<br><br>Always check this calendar b
 efore driving to class in case there has been a last-minute scheduling chan
 ge or cancellation.<br><br>Registered archers<br><ol><li><b>Nick E</b>\, ad
 ult\, USAA\, pd 236 pts - Coach</li><li><b>Erika OG</b>\, adult\, USAA\, pd
  234 pts - 1.5 hrs</li><li><b>Finn E</b>\, 12\, USAA\, pd 232 pts - 1.5 hrs
 </li><li><b>Javier G</b>\, adult\, USAA\, pd 223 pts - 1.5 hrs</li><li><b>S
 ofia W</b>.\, 13\, USAA\, pd 201 pts - 1.5 hrs</li><li><b>Miles G.</b>\, 12
 \,ob\, USAA\, pd 180 pts - 1.5 hrs</li><li><b>Hannah T\,</b> adult\, usaa\,
  pd 162 pts - 1.5 hrs</li><li><b>Jacqui\, C\,</b> 137 pts - 1.5 hrs</li><li
 ><b>Rhys E\, 10</b>\, USAA\, pd 18 pts - 1.5 hrs</li></ol><br>(The followin
 g class fees are in addition to the $225 rental fee for the 18m space)<br>B
 ook and pay in advance for any convenient time during the class times liste
 d.<br><br>Please sign in and out at the 18m indoor range noting your times.
 <br><br>SINGLE Class fees :<br>   $26/archer / 1 hr<br>   $39/archer / 1.5 
 hrs<br>   $52/archer / 2 hrs<br><br>MULTI-Class Discount Packets (Can be us
 ed however and whenever convenient):<br>  10 hours : $250 (= five 2-hr clas
 ses at $50/class) - $10 savings<br>  16 hours : $384 (= eight 2-hr classes 
