DESCRIPTION:<b>WAIVERS:</b> Everyone needs to <b>sign the waivers in advanc
 e </b>of arriving at the range\, so we are not delayed in starting. Here's 
 the link: <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdYr3Yh5msvPHC_
 -ukFsifcvhYXRrzVRvcdyP4Ybx9O5zgUug/viewform" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u
 ><u><u><u><u><u>2024 Corporate Team Events Waivers Packet</u></u></u></u></
 u></u></u></u></u></u></a>  <br><br><b>DIRECTIONS:</b> <b>Google Map "Donut
  Taco Palace"</b> to find us quickly - We are right next door in Unit 102. 
 (Some people are still being misdirected.) There is a target on the glass d
 oor and the unit is facing 290W service road going west on the corner of In
 dustrial Oaks Blvd and 290W. <br><br><b>ARRIVAL</b>: For a 2:00 pm start\, 
 please <b>arrive by 1:45 pm</b>\, because we will all be starting together 
 at 2:00 pm. <br><br><b>CARPOOLING / PARKING:</b> Please meet and carpool ea
 rlier from another location or from a big box store parking lot across the 
 highway (like Target or At Home on the corner of Mopac and 290W). It's easy
  and convenient to do. (Parking in front of the range and along Industrial 
 Oaks Blvd may be limited\, depending on the number of participants.)<br><br
 ><b>DRESS RECOMMENDATIONS: </b><br>Flat athletic shoes are best\, as we wil
 l be throwing our weight forward a little\, so balance and weight distribut
 ion is important. The bowstring can get slowed or entangled in your clothin
 g or hair\, so wearing tightly fitting clothes\, no wide skirts\, shirts wi
 thout buttons on the front pockets and tying your hair back is preferable. 
 Longer brim baseball caps often prevent the string from reaching your face\
 , so shorter brims or bucket hats are better. <br>:<br><b>All participants 
 need to complete waivers online before the event.</b><br><b>Here is the dir
 ect link to complete: </b><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQ
 LSdYr3Yh5msvPHC_-ukFsifcvhYXRrzVRvcdyP4Ybx9O5zgUug/viewform" target="_blank
 "><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>2024 Corporate Team Events Waivers Packe
 t</u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></a>  <br><br>Waivers have bee
 n received from those shown below in <b>bold with (W)</b><br><b><br></b>1. 
 <b>Michael G. (W) </b>- 70 pts<br>2. <b>Gayle L. (W) - </b>20 pts<br>3. <b>
 Brempster H. (W)</b> - 41 pts<br>4. <b>Jonathan D. (W) </b>- 52 pts<br>5. <
 b>Cliff G. (W)</b><br>6. <b>Keong Yeow C. (W) </b>- 17 pts<br>7. Nag A.<br>
 8. <b>Zackary B</b>. <b>(W)</b><br>9. <b>Sourabh B. (W) - </b>57 pts<br>10.
  <b>Puneet K. (W)</b><br>11. <b>Tien N.(W)</b><br>12. JP P.<br>13. <b>Khanh
  T. (W) </b>- 66 pts<br>14. <b>Mustapha F. (W)</b><br>15. Penglin N. (W) - 
 39 pts<br>16.<b> Vyas G. (W)</b><br>17. <b>William H. (W) </b>- 81 pts<br>1
 8. 81 pts
