DESCRIPTION:Level 3 NTS Instructor Joel (2032328331) \n\nOpen Practice sess
 ions at this location are reserved for competitive and advanced archers.If 
 you participated in the 2024 or 2025 Aggie Invitationals\, you are in! You 
 should receive an email with info and instructions before your first sessio
 n at this location.If you haven't yet made the 2026 Indoor Competition Team
 \, but have your own equipment\, and have scored 240 on the 60-cm target fa
 ce or 230 on the 40-cm target face in a 30-arrow indoor round at 9m\, conta
 ct Coach Racae. \n\nA USA Archery certified Level 2 - 4 coach or instructor
  will be using the 18m range for their own or their family's independent pr
 actice\, but will open it so other archers\, who have registered for at lea
 st one Training Class each week\, and have paid the Facility Fee each month
 \, can also have additional practice. No coaching or equipment advice provi
 ded.Space is limited to 12 archers\, so sign up early and pay the Training 
 Class and Facility Fees in advance to secure your place! .    \n\n Training
  Class fee: $52/archer/class(1x/wk required to attend Open Practice)Facilit
 y fee (required each month): $205/month/archer due Nov 15\, Dec 15\, and Ja
 n 15  (Move out : Feb 15)Open Practice Included in facility fee (1-2x/wk re
 commended)Private Lesson fee: $125/hr/archer (2x/mo recommended) \n\nRegist
 ered archers today:  \n 1. Joel Y\, adult \n2. Abby Y\, 13 \n3. Ellie Y\, 1
 1\n5. \n6. \n7.  \n8.      \n9.      \n10. \n11. \n12.
