DESCRIPTION:PREREQUISITE: Indoor 1: First-time Class (Register for Indoor 1
  by clicking the Sign-Up button on the top of our website's homepage.) OPEN
  TO: Indoor 2\, 3\, and 4\, and parents who have taken Indoor 1 Register fo
 r Astro Archers at this link: https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1iNEV0zG13PZG
 bmtoNuFmNUkqiCDht2nvptlaVtSkWgA/viewform FEE: $225/wk\; $45/day The first h
 our will be regular shooting\, and then you'll go where few have gone befor
 e...You'll learn about the solar system as you voyage through it colonizing
  for Planet Earth while avoiding asteroids\, fighting off aliens\, and earn
 ing shooting stars to pin on your astrosuit! If you earn the most shooting 
 star points by the end of the summer\, you'll earn the title of Galaxy Comm
 ander and receive your award at the Annual Awards Banquet on August 16!
