 ><u>2025 Waivers for Corporate Team Events </u></u></a><br><br>As each part
 icipant signs the waivers\, it will be indicated below\, so you will be awa
 re of what we have received. <br><br><b>DIRECTIONS:</b> <b>Google Map "Donu
 t Taco Palace"</b> to find us quickly - We are right next door in Unit 102.
  (Some people are still being misdirected.) There is a target on the glass 
 door and the unit is facing 290W service road going west on the corner of I
 ndustrial Oaks Blvd and 290W. <br><br><b>ARRIVAL</b>: For a 1:30 pm start\,
  please <b>arrive by 1:15 pm</b>\, because we need to start together at 1:3
 0 pm. <br><br><b>CARPOOLING / PARKING:</b> Please meet and carpool earlier 
 from another location or from a big box store parking lot across the highwa
 y (like Target or At Home on the corner of Mopac and 290W). It's easy and c
 onvenient to do. (Parking in front of the range and along Industrial Oaks B
 lvd may be limited\, depending on the number of participants.)<br><br><b>DR
 ESS RECOMMENDATIONS: </b><br>Flat athletic shoes are best\, as we will be t
 hrowing our weight forward a little\, so balance and weight distribution is
  important. The bowstring can get slowed or entangled in your clothing or h
 air\, so wearing tightly fitting clothes\, no wide skirts\, shirts without 
 buttons on the front pockets and tying your hair back is preferable. Longer
  brim baseball caps often prevent the string from reaching your face\, so s
 horter brims or bucket hats are better.<br><br><b>All participants need to 
 complete waivers online before the event.</b><br><b>Here is the direct link
  to complete: </b><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSe4nVUx
 h99Vi50BKWFl9swZ4fephhjHBHtHpxx7G7I7KIiw5A/viewform?usp=preview" target="_b
