DESCRIPTION:These training sessions at 18m at the new temporary Westlake lo
 cation are for competitive archers only who have  \n    •    graduated out 
 of Indoor 2 at 9m and Indoor 3 at 13.5m\, AND\n    •    registered and paid
  $225 in advance for the temporary 18m space (Jan+Feb)\, AND\n    •    + re
 gistered and paid the Indoor 4+ class fees below for each class or multi-cl
 ass packet  (Fees stay at 2024 rates for competitive archers) AND\n    •   
  registered for the Texas State at Kealing Middle School in Austin in Janua
 ry AND/OR\n    •    registered for the Indoor Nationals and/or JOAD Indoor 
 Nationals in February at Texas A&M.\nEnter your name directly below for the
  sessions you would like to attend. (There is no registration form for thes
 e 18m indoor sessions.)\nMake sure you have all your equipment in your back
 pack\, not pre-assembled. \nArrive early so you have your bow set up by the
  time the class starts.\nYou must wait at the front door and call the coach
  to send someone to let you in.\n    Double check the ATCI calendar just be
 fore driving to class to make sure there is a session that day. Also check 
 periodically to see if additional classes have been added that week. \n    
 •    Sat 10:00-12:00  Coach L4 Racae Meyer 512 975 1850\n    •    Sun 10:00
