DESCRIPTION:Movers are scheduled from 10:00-12:00 on 11/15 to move 3 target
  stands\, etc. to our temporary new 18m range at 110 Wild Basin Road in Wes
 tlake\, so we can practice for the Indoor Nationals at Texas A&amp\;M in Fe
 bruary.<br>The move should be completed before 2:00 pm. <b>Coach Racae will
  text those who volunteer with a time to be at the new 18m range for set up
 .</b> <br>You'll receive an email with further instructions concerning clas
 s times and access. Info will also be on this calendar after confirmation.<
 br><br><div dir="auto">For Outdoor and Competitive Archers -<div dir="auto"
 ><div dir="auto">We're almost there! The Temporary Use Agreement for the 18
 m range has been signed and the first month's rent sent off. Just need to p
 ick up the keys and move in on Sat.\, 11/15!<div dir="auto"><div dir="auto"
 >I need volunteers on two days:<div dir="auto"><ol><li>On <b>Friday 11/14 a
 bout 5:30<a><u>+</u></a> in the Indoor 9m range</b>.  Bring tools. We need 
 to prepare the targets and stands\, overhead boxes\, cores\, etc. and stage
  everything\, ready for an easy and quick move on Sat 11/15. Movers are sch
 eduled for pick up at the 9m range on Sat from 10:00-12:00. </li><li>On<b> 
 Sat 11/15 after </b><b>move-</b><b>in</b> <b>at the </b><b>n</b><b>ew 18m r
 ange at 110 Wild Basin Road\, Ste 210\,</b> to arrange and set things up. B
 ring tools. (You could shoot afterwards!) </li></ol><div dir="auto">Assumin
 g all goes smoothly\, we should have our first 18m Indoor training session 
 on Sun.\, Nov 16\, 8:30-11:30 in the new 18m Indoor space!
