CREATED:20181129T205648Z
DESCRIPTION:10 people\n\nIf you'd like to register for a Corporate Team Eve
 nt\, just fill out the fields at this link where you will also find more in
 formation:\n2018 Corporate Team Events\n\nWe'd be very happy to host a Corp
 orate Team Archery Event for your group on a mutually convenient date. \nTh
 ese sessions are proving to be very popular\, and we appreciate the opportu
 nity! \nBook now so you're ready for our indoor corporate archery tournamen
 ts!\n\nA few of the corporations which schedule events with us are Facebook
 \, Intel\, Dell\, Samsung\, AMD\, Home Away\, National Instruments\, Texas 
 Mutual Insurance\, Electronic Arts\, ERCOT\, Vectra Networks\, Austin Child
 ren's Advocacy\, Glatfelder Insurance\, Kerbey Lane\, RackSpace\, Abilitie\
 , Black Locus\, Boosterthon\, WP Engine\, Camp Gladiator\, Marriott Interna
 tional and others. \n\nWe also would like to thank your company for its vit
 al\, indirect support of USA Archery's Junior Olympic Archery Development (
 JOAD) program! Support like yours grows Olympians! \n\nBelow is a typical a
 genda for a Corporate Team Event with us\, and some other general info\, wh
 ich may make things run more smoothly. \n\nCAPACITY: 1-20 participants. 10 
 places on the shooting line. If you'll have over 10 participants\, even num
 bers are best\, so we can create teams of two. We may run over by 30 minute
 s for larger groups.\n\nAGENDA (approx.- depends on number and pace of part
 icipants)\n\n1:00 Arrival\; waivers (to be signed by participants over 18 y
 ears old or adults/parents/guardians)\n1:15 Selecting two-person teams\; eq
 uipment review and selection (bows\, arrows\, finger tabs\, arm guards\, ta
 rgets\, etc.)\n1:55 Safety rules\; whistle system\n2:10 Form (positions) tr
 aining (stance\, nocking\, hooking/gripping\, set\, mindset\, set-up\, draw
 ing\, anchor\, loading\, aiming\, expanding\, release)\n2:45 Ranking Round 
 - shooting in teams\; quantity of arrows will depend on number and pace of 
 participants\n3:45 Olympic Round: Based on ranking round\; each team picks 
 a country to represent\; all teams progress in a match play to the Gold\, S
 ilver\, and Bronze medal matches\, with other teams cheering them on!\n4:15
  Awards Ceremony and podium presentations\, photos!\n\nEveryone has a great
  time at these events\, so we look forward to meeting your team!
LAST-MODIFIED:20260404T082256Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:CORPORATE TEAM EVENT : Samsung SARC : Kruse
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
