 \, I with shoulders\, arms\, back\, head against wall</li></ul><br><b>Ceili
 ng camera:</b><br><ul><li>Attach camera to ceiling above shooting line\, so
  we can see your alignments from above</li></ul><br><b>Equipment:</b><br><u
 l><li>Made shoelace fingersling - wear this from now on - tie the loop so t
 here is  about 1" between pivot of hand and pivot point on bow grip</li><li
 >Set center of target at 51" above garage floor - or in line with shooting 
 position\, so you're not bending at the waist too much</li></ul><br><b>NTS 
 Steps of Shooting: </b>What we covered today - See email for more details<b
 r><b>Step 1: Stance</b><br><b>Step 2: Nock</b><br><b>Step 3: Hook and Grip<
