DESCRIPTION:There is more registration and hotel info on the board at arche
 ry! Look for Texas Shootout !\nWe´ll see you there!\n\nTo be nominated to t
 he 2020 US Olympic Archery Team\, archers must compete in the Trials as set
  by USA Archery and the US Olympic Committee. \nFor the Tokyo 2020 Games\, 
 there are four stages of the Trials.\nParticipation is open to any USA Arch
 ery member who is also a citizen of the United States.\nArchers wanting to 
 participate in the Trials need to complete a separate registration and be r
 egistered in the Recurve Senior division.\nThis is your chance to earn a sp
 ot on Team USA! Compete with the best of the best on the Road to Tokyo!\nTr
 ials participants receive a special commemorative t-shirt from the event an
 d memories for a lifetime!\nStage 1: Aug 15-16 during the 135th US National
  Target Championships. (Registration is now open) \nStage 2: Sept 28\, 30\,
  Oct. 1 during the Texas Shootout. (Registration is now open)\nStage 3: Apr
 il 8-11\, 2020 in Chula Vista\, CA\nStage 4: May 25-26\, 2020 during the Ga
 tor Cup in Newberry\, FL
LAST-MODIFIED:20260404T082256Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Stage 2: Olympic Team Trials at Texas A&M
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
