DESCRIPTION:These training sessions at 18m at the new temporary Westlake lo
 cation are for competitive archers only who have  <br>    •graduated out of
  Indoor 2 at 9m and Indoor 3 at 13.5m\, AND<br>    •registered and paid $22
 5 in advance for the temporary 18m space (Jan+Feb)\, AND<br>    •+ register
 ed and paid the Indoor 4+ class fees below for each class or multi-class pa
 cket  (Fees stay at 2024 rates for competitive archers) AND<br>    •registe
 red for the Texas State at Kealing Middle School in Austin in January AND/O
 R<br>    •registered for the Indoor Nationals and/or JOAD Indoor Nationals 
 in February at Texas A&amp\;M.<br>Enter your name directly below for the se
 ssions you would like to attend. (There is no registration form for these 1
 8m indoor sessions.) <br>Make sure you have all your equipment in your back
 pack\, not pre-assembled. <br>Arrive early so you have your bow set up by t
 he time the class starts.<br>You must wait at the front door and call the c
 oach to send someone to let you in.<br>Double check the ATCI calendar just 
 before driving to class to make sure there is a session that day. Also chec
 k periodically to see if additional classes have been added that week. <br>
     •Sat 10:00-12:00  Coach L4 Racae Meyer 512 975 1850<br>    •Sun 10:00-1
 2:00 Coach L4 Racae Meyer 512 975 1850<br>    •Mon 6:00-7:30 Coach L3 Joel 
 Yu 203 232 8331    <br>    •Tues 5:30-7:00 Coach L3 Lindsay Lawley-Rerecich
  512 914 7934 or Instructor L2 Matt Rerecich 512 914 7914<br>    •Wed 6:00-
 7:30 Coach L3 Joel Yu 203 232 8331  <br>    •Thurs 6:00-7:30 Coach L3 Nick 
 Erickson 512 608 7032<br>There are six places on the shooting line. We will
  form two or three lines when necessary to accommodate all archers who have
  registered and to more closely simulate competitive conditions.  Text Coac
 h Racae at 512 975 1850 with your questions.  Always check this calendar be
 fore driving to class in case there has been a last-minute scheduling chang
 e or cancellation.<br><br>Registered archers<br>    1.  <b>Finn E\, </b>12\
 , USAA - 1.5 hrs<br>    2.<b> Nick E\,</b> adult\, USAA COACH <br>    3.<b>
 Miles G.</b>\, 12\, USAA\, OB\, pd - 1.5 hrs<br>    4.<b>Colby K</b>.\, adu
 lt\, USAA\, pd - 1.5 hrs<br>    <br> <b>Sofia W.</b>\, 13\, USAA\, pd <b>DN
 A</b> sick<br> <b>Jacqui C</b>.\, 11\, on 60-cm target face\, pd <b>DNA</b>
 <br><br>(The following class fees are in addition to the $225 rental fee fo
 r the 18m space)<br>Book and pay in advance for any convenient time during 
 the class times listed.<br><br>Please sign in and out at the 18m indoor ran
 ge noting your times.<br><br><br>SINGLE Class fees :<br>   $26/archer / 1 h
 r<br>   $39/archer / 1.5 hrs<br>   $52/archer / 2 hrs<br><br>MULTI-Class Di
 scount Packets (Can be used however and whenever convenient):<br>  10 hours
  : $250 (= five 2-hr classes at $50/class) - $10 savings<br>  16 hours : $3
 84 (= eight 2-hr classes at $48/class) - $32 savings<br>  24 hours : $552 (
 = twelve 2-hr classes at $46/class) - $72 savings
