DESCRIPTION:<b>WAIVERS:</b> Everyone needs to <b>sign the waivers in advanc
 e </b>of arriving at the range\, so we are not delayed in starting. Here's 
 the link: <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdYr3Yh5msvPHC_
 -ukFsifcvhYXRrzVRvcdyP4Ybx9O5zgUug/viewform" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u
 ><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>2024 Corporate Team Events Waivers Packet</u
 ></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></a>  As each part
 icipant signs the waivers\, it will be indicated on the calendar\, so you w
 ill be aware of what we have received. <br><br><b>DIRECTIONS:</b> <b>Google
  Map "Donut Taco Palace"</b> to find us quickly - We are right next door in
  Unit 102. (Some people are still being misdirected.) There is a target on 
 the glass door and the unit is facing 290W service road going west on the c
 orner of Industrial Oaks Blvd and 290W. <br><br><b>ARRIVAL</b>: For a 7:00 
 pm start\, please <b>arrive by 6:45 pm</b>\, because we need to start toget
 her at 7:00 pm. <br><br><b>CARPOOLING / PARKING:</b> Please meet and carpoo
 l earlier from another location or from a big box store parking lot across 
 the highway (like Target or At Home on the corner of Mopac and 290W). It's 
 easy and convenient to do. (Parking in front of the range and along Industr
 ial Oaks Blvd may be limited\, depending on the number of participants.)<br
 ><br><b>DRESS RECOMMENDATIONS: </b><br>Flat athletic shoes are best\, as we
  will be throwing our weight forward a little\, so balance and weight distr
 ibution is important. The bowstring can get slowed or entangled in your clo
 thing or hair\, so wearing tightly fitting clothes\, no wide skirts\, shirt
 s without buttons on the front pockets and tying your hair back is preferab
 le. Longer brim baseball caps often prevent the string from reaching your f
 ace\, so shorter brims or bucket hats are better.<br><br><b>All participant
 s need to complete waivers online before the event.</b><br><b>Here is the d
 irect link to complete: </b><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAI
 pQLSdYr3Yh5msvPHC_-ukFsifcvhYXRrzVRvcdyP4Ybx9O5zgUug/viewform" target="_bla
 nk"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>2024 Corporate Team 
 Events Waivers Packet</u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></
 u></u></u></u></a>  <br><br>Waivers have been received from those shown bel
 ow in <b>bold with (W) - </b><br>Last update: 12/11/24 at 11:10 am CST<br><
