 orporate Team Events Waivers Packet</u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></a>  <b
 r><br><b>DIRECTIONS:</b> <b>Google Map "Donut Taco Palace"</b> to find us q
 uickly - We are right next door in Unit 102. (Some people are still being m
 isdirected.) There is a target on the glass door and the unit is facing 290
 W service road going west on the corner of Industrial Oaks Blvd and 290W. <
 br><br><b>ARRIVAL</b>: For a 5:00 pm start\, please <b>arrive by 4:45 pm</b
 >\, because we will all be starting together at 5:00 pm. <br><br><b>CARPOOL
 ING / PARKING:</b> Please meet and carpool earlier from another location or
  from a big box store parking lot across the highway (like Target or At Hom
 e on the corner of Mopac and 290W). It's easy and convenient to do. (Parkin
 g in front of the range and along Industrial Oaks Blvd may be limited\, dep
 ending on the number of participants.)<br><br><b>DRESS RECOMMENDATIONS: </b
 ><br>Flat athletic shoes are best\, as we will be throwing our weight forwa
 rd a little\, so balance and weight distribution is important. The bowstrin
 g can get slowed or entangled in your clothing or hair\, so wearing tightly
  fitting clothes\, no wide skirts\, shirts without buttons on the front poc
 kets and tying your hair back is preferable. Longer brim baseball caps ofte
 n prevent the string from reaching your face\, so shorter brims or bucket h
 ats are better. <br>:<br><b>All participants need to complete waivers onlin
 e before the event.</b><br><b>Here is the direct link to complete: </b><a h
 ref="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdYr3Yh5msvPHC_-ukFsifcvhYXRr
 zVRvcdyP4Ybx9O5zgUug/viewform"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>2024 Corporate Te
 am Events Waivers Packet</u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></a>  <br><br>W
 aivers have been received from those shown below in <b>bold with (W)</b><b>
 <br><br></b>1. <span>Ryan C.. </span><br>2. Andrews T.<br>3. Kumar B. <b>83
  pts</b><br>4. Mindy E.<br><span>5. Yogi B.</span>
