DESCRIPTION:Coach Racae \n2.5-hr Class $25/archer  \nEnrollment link: Click
  the Sign Up button at the top of www.archerytrainingcenter.com\n\nINDOOR 1
 : First-time class is for juniors age 8+\, optionally their parents\, and o
 ther adults who would like to try archery for the first time and join in fu
 ture Junior Olympic Archery Development (JOAD) and Adult Training classes. 
   \nThis class is a prerequisite for all classes. \n \nIf you have more tha
 n one year's experience\, contact racae@archerytrainingcenter.com for a pla
 cement evaluation ($45) instead of attending the Indoor 1 Class.  \n\n(You 
 will be on the waiting list after 10 people register - see below.)  \n\nReg
 istered archers: \n1.  Abrar P.\, adult - confirmed\n2.  Edgar C.\, adult\n
 3.  Margie C.\, adult\n4.  Agnieszka M.\, adult - confirmed\n5.  Clayton P.
 \, adult\n6.  \n7.  \n8.  \n9.  \n10.   \nWaiting List:  \n11.  \n12.   \nI
 f your name is on the waiting list\, you have a choice of  coming to see if
  a place opens up at the last minute\, or  rescheduling your class for anot
 her date/time.  We can only take 10 archers on the shooting line at one tim
 e.  If you prefer not to be on the waiting list\, please reschedule your cl
 ass for another date.
