DESCRIPTION:PREREQUISITE: INDOOR 1: First-time Class\n(To register for Indo
 or 1\, click the Sign Up button at the top of www.archerytrainingcenter.com
 .)\n\nOPEN to Juniors/Parents in\nINDOOR 2 (9m) and\nINDOOR 3A (13.5m) \n\n
 Click Indoor 2/3A enrollment links at: http://www.archerytrainingcenter.com
 /Classes\n\nFees: \nRECREATIONAL: \n$20/cl for 1 hr.\nThere are also reduce
 d \nMonthly fees for those who come at least 3 hours/week and \nProgressive
  fees for those who meet the weekly attendance requirements for their level
 .\nTalk to Coach Racae or \nLook under "Classes" on our website.\n\nYour na
 me will be on the list below when we receive your fee in advance of the cla
 ss. When classes are not full\, it's okay to just drop in for the class and
  pay at that time. When you attend\, and the class is near full\, you shoul
 d pay at least one class in advance to guarantee you have a place next time
 . You can see the actual attendance by looking at past classes. Scores are 
 also listed\, if you kept score\, which is not required\, except on Master 
 Challenge weeks. PB = Personal Best. You need 230 pts on 40cm target or 240
  pts on 60cm target to graduate out of your distance to 13.5m\, and again a
 t 13.5m to get back to 18m (full distance).\n\nRegistered archers:\n1. Jose
 phine L.\, JOAD 13.5m - paid\n2. Lily R.\, JOAD 13.5m - paid\n3. Emily A.\,
