DESCRIPTION:Join Austin area Yale alumni for an afternoon of beginning arch
 ery lessons at the Archery Training Center.<br><a href="https://www.archery
 trainingcenter.com/" target="_blank"><b>https://www.archerytrainingcenter.c
 om/</b></a><br>Colby Keith (SY ’97)\, Level 2 USAA Instructor will conduct 
 a course to provide introductory instruction for archery skills with recurv
 e bows.<br>You will learn basic form and shooting skills at the indoor 9 m 
 range of the Archery Training Center. After instruction on the basic aspect
 s of safety and bow usage\, you will shoot an entire round of 30 arrows.<br
 >The event is limited to a maximum number of 12 people. The minimum age is 
 8 years old\, and children must be accompanied by an adult who must also pa
 rticipate.<br>Date: <b>May 2nd</b><br>Time: <b>1:30 pm – 4:30 pm</b><br>Fee
  per person to be paid.<br><b><i>(Please mark on your payment it is for the
  Yale Club event)</i></b><ul><li>via <b>Zelle </b>($47/archer) through your
  bank using 512 975 1850 or Archery Training Center\, Inc. as payee (this i
 s the preferred method of payment)\,</li><li>via <b><a href="http://paypal.
 me/atciaustin" target="_blank">paypal.me/atciaustin</a></b> ($48/archer) or
  </li><li>via <b>Venmo</b> ($48/archer): Archery Training Center\, Inc. @AT
 CIAustin   512 975 1850 </li></ul><br><br>To register\, please <b>RSVP to C
 olby Keith </b>at <a href="mailto:ajaxtelamon@gmail.com" target="_blank">aj
 axtelamon@gmail.com</a>.<br>Waiver forms must be completed here to particip
 ate:<br><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfL80nHmcHv4Og9kD
 5dkwjZTgix9UpfxZd01Q2M3V0V0Dze2w/viewform?pli=1" target="_blank"><b>2026 AT
 CI Membership and Waivers Packet</b></a><br>We look forward to seeing you a
 t this fun event to gain beginning skills as an archer!<br><br><b>Registere
 d archers!</b><br><ol><li><b>Elizabeth N</b>.\, pd + waivers</li><li><b>Mic
 hael W</b>.\, pd + waivers</li><li><b>Vicente W</b>.\, pd + waivers</li><li
 ><b>Mark B</b>.\, pd + waivers</li></ol>
