DESCRIPTION:<b>WAIVERS:</b> Everyone needs to <b>sign the waivers in advanc
 e </b>of arriving at the range\, so we are not delayed in starting. Here's 
 the link: <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdYr3Yh5msvPHC_
 -ukFsifcvhYXRrzVRvcdyP4Ybx9O5zgUug/viewform" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u
 ><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>2024 Corporate Team Events Waivers Pac
 ket</u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></a>
   As each participant signs the waivers\, it will be indicated on the calen
 dar\, so you will be aware of what we have received. <br><br><b>DIRECTIONS:
 </b> <b>Google Map "Donut Taco Palace"</b> to find us quickly - We are righ
 t next door in Unit 102. (Some people are still being misdirected.) There i
 s a target on the glass door and the unit is facing 290W service road going
  west on the corner of Industrial Oaks Blvd and 290W. <br><br><b>ARRIVAL</b
 >: For a 1:30 pm start\, please <b>arrive by 1:15 pm</b>\, because we need 
 to start together at 1:30 pm. <br><br><b>CARPOOLING / PARKING:</b> Please m
 eet and carpool earlier from another location or from a big box store parki
 ng lot across the highway (like Target or At Home on the corner of Mopac an
 d 290W). It's easy and convenient to do. (Parking in front of the range and
  along Industrial Oaks Blvd may be limited\, depending on the number of par
 ticipants.)<br><br><b>DRESS RECOMMENDATIONS: </b><br>Flat athletic shoes ar
 e best\, as we will be throwing our weight forward a little\, so balance an
 d weight distribution is important. The bowstring can get slowed or entangl
 ed in your clothing or hair\, so wearing tightly fitting clothes\, no wide 
 skirts\, shirts without buttons on the front pockets and tying your hair ba
 ck is preferable. Longer brim baseball caps often prevent the string from r
 eaching your face\, so shorter brims or bucket hats are better.<br><br><b>A
 ll participants need to complete waivers online before the event.</b><br><b
 >Here is the direct link to complete: </b><a href="https://docs.google.com/
 forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdYr3Yh5msvPHC_-ukFsifcvhYXRrzVRvcdyP4Ybx9O5zgUug/viewform
 " target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>
 2024 Corporate Team Events Waivers Packet</u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></
 u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></a>  <br><br>Waivers have been r
 eceived from those shown below in <b>bold with (W) </b>(Last update: 11/19 
 at 12:30 pm)<br><p></p><ol><li><b>Benjamin M. (W)</b></li><li><b>Bryan H. <
 /b><b>(W)</b></li><li><b>Eric C. </b><b> (W)</b></li><li><b>Hong R. </b><b>
  (W)</b></li><li><b>Jeff W.</b><b> (W)</b></li><li><b>Tej P. T. </b><b> (W)
 </b></li><li><b>Yati K.</b><b> (W)</b></li><li><b>Akshaya R. (W)</b></li><l
 i><b>Prasanna D. (W)</b></li><li><b>Puspal C</b>. <b>(W)</b>.</li><li><b>Ch
 ristopher F. (W)</b></li><li><b>Naveen D. (W)</b></li><li>Ashish G.</li><li
 >Bhavesh B</li></ol><u></u><p></p><p><u></u></p><p><u></u></p><p><u></u></p
 ><p><u></u></p><p><u></u></p><p><u></u></p><p><u></u></p><p><u></u></p><p><
