 >For newer archers\, register using the 2025 INDOOR 2-6 at 9m Registration 
 form<br><br>SCHEDULE :<br>​Register for ​​as many as your schedule and budg
 et allows to progress faster:<br>Sat/Sun 4:00-5:30 pm - <br>T/W/Th  5:00-6:
 30 pm  and  <br>T/W/Th   6:30-8\;:00 pm<br>​Weekdays: Juniors usually come 
 to the 5:00 pm class\, and adults to the 6:30 class\, but all classes are o
 pen to both adults and juniors.<br><br>Always check this calendar just befo
 re driving to class in case there are last-minutes changes or cancellations
 !<br><br>USA Archery Level 4 NTS Coach Racae Meyer<br><br>After you graduat
 e out of Indoor 1\, sign up for 2025 INDOOR 2-6 at 9m<br><br>Registered arc
 hers:<br>1.<b> Hannah T</b>\, adult\,  USAA\, pd - 1.5 hrs<br>2\, <b>Colby 
 K.!!!</b> adult\, USAA\, pd - 1.5 hrs<br>3. <br>4.<br>5.<br>6.<br>7.<br>8.<
 br>9.<br>10.<br>11.<br>12.<br>NEW 2025 Winter/Spring Fees <br><br>SINGLE Cl
 ass Fees per archer for one Indoor 2-6 class:<br>$31 for 1 hr (arrive 30 mi
 n after class starts or leave 30 min before class ends)<br>$43 for 1.5 hrs<
 br><br>MULTI-Class Discount Packets<br>  9 hours : $250 (six 1.5-hr classes
 )<br> 12 hours : $320 (eight 1.5-hr classes)<br> 18 hours : $460 (twelve 1.
 5-hr classes) <br><br>There are 8 places on the shooting line\, and we some
 times have double lines depending on attendance.<br><br>Sign in/out upon ar
 rival/departure<br>For single classes\, book and pay in advance.<br>For mul
 ti-class discount packs\, pay in advance and book when you are sure of the 
 dates.<br>Coaching and whistle commands at all times.<br>Instruction in the
  National Training System.<br>Unfair games depending on attendance.<br><br>
 Please note: Youths &lt\;12 y.o. should not shoot more than 100 arrows/day!
 <br><br>Prerequisites for Indoor 2: <br>Adults: No min. score in Indoor 1 <
 br>Juniors: 50 pts in Indoor 1<br>Scores needed at 9m to advance to Indoor 
 3-6 and Outdoor 3-6:<br><br>                 On 40-cm                  On 6
 0-cm<br>               target face                 target face<br>Indoor 3:
           230 pts                240 pts           -&gt\; Outdoor 3 at 13.5
 m<br>Indoor 4:          250 pts                260 pts           -&gt\; Out
 door 4 at 18m/20m<br>Indoor 5:          270 pts                280 pts     
       -&gt\; Outdoor 5 at 30m<br>Indoor 6:          290 pts                
 300 pts          -&gt\;  Outdoor 6 at 40m
