 u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></a>  <br><br>Waivers have been r
 eceived from those shown below in <b>bold with (W) </b>(Last update: 11/18 
 at 2:15 pm)<br><p></p><ol><li><b>Dennis S</b>.<b>(W)</b></li><li><b>Hun H. 
