DESCRIPTION:Please make sure to register for Indoor 2-6 classes at least a 
 few hours before class (instead of just showing up) as you risk the possibi
 lity of the class being cancelled  for lack of or low registrations. <br><b
 r><br>Always check the calendar before driving to class in case there are c
 ancellations or changes.<br><br>If you have been with us for a while\, and 
 have been given access to the ATCI Calendar via an email from Coach Racae\,
  just add the archer´s name under Registered Archers below a few hours befo
 re class and then click ¨Save¨ and ¨This event¨ (not some other checkbox or
  you will remove all other future registrations!!!).<br><br>For newer arche
 rs\, register at least a few hours before class using the 2025 INDOOR 2-6 a
 t 9m Registration form.<br>SCHEDULE :<br>​Register for ​​as many as your sc
 hedule and budget allows to progress faster:<br>Sat/Sun 4:00-5:30 pm - <br>
 T/W/Th  5:00-6:30 pm  and  <br>T/W/Th   6:30-8\;:00 pm<br>​Weekdays: Junior
 s usually come to the 5:00 pm class\, and adults to the 6:30 class\, but al
 l classes are open to both adults and juniors.<br><br>Always check this cal
 endar just before driving to class in case there are last-minutes changes o
 r cancellations!<br><br>USA Archery Level 2 Instructor Matt Rerecich and Le
 vel 1 Instructor Lily.<br><br>After you graduate out of Indoor 1\, sign up 
 for 2025 INDOOR 2-6 at 9m<br><br>Registered archers:<br>1. <b>Chi C</b>.\, 
 adult\, USAA\, OB\, pd - 1.5 hrs<br>2. <b>Kendall C</b>.\, 11\, on 60-cm ta
 rget face\, USAA\, OB\, pd - 1.5 hrs<br>3. <b>Logan C</b>.\, 8\, on 60-cm t
 arget face\, USAA\, OB\, pd - 1.5 hrs<br>4. <b>Matt L</b>\, 13\, pd - 1.5 h
 rs<br>5. <b>Jacqui C</b>.\, 11\, on 60-cm target face\, USAA\, OB\, pd - 1.
 5 hrs<br>6. <b>Lily R.\, </b>16 - instructor<br>7.<br>8.<br>NEW 2025 Winter
 /Spring Fees <br><br>SINGLE Class Fees per archer for one Indoor 2-6 class:
 <br>$31 for 1 hr (arrive 30 min after class starts or leave 30 min before c
 lass ends)<br>$43 for 1.5 hrs<br><br>MULTI-Class Discount Packets<br>  9 ho
 urs : $250 (six 1.5-hr classes)<br> 12 hours : $320 (eight 1.5-hr classes)<
 br> 18 hours : $460 (twelve 1.5-hr classes) <br><br>There are 8 places on t
 he shooting line\, and we sometimes have double lines depending on attendan
 ce.<br><br>Sign in/out upon arrival/departure<br>For single classes\, book 
 and pay in advance.<br>For multi-class discount packs\, pay in advance and 
 book when you are sure of the dates.<br>Coaching and whistle commands at al
 l times.<br>Instruction in the National Training System.<br>Unfair games de
 pending on attendance.<br><br>Please note: Youths &lt\;12 y.o. should not s
 hoot more than 100 arrows/day!<br><br>Prerequisites for Indoor 2: <br>Adult
 s: No min. score in Indoor 1 <br>Juniors: 50 pts in Indoor 1<br>Scores need
 ed at 9m to advance to Indoor 3-6 and Outdoor 3-6:<br><br>                 
 On 40-cm                  On 60-cm<br>               target face           
       target face<br>Indoor 3:          230 pts                240 pts     
       -&gt\; Outdoor 3 at 13.5m<br>Indoor 4:          250 pts              
   260 pts           -&gt\; Outdoor 4 at 18m/20m<br>Indoor 5:          270 p
 ts                280 pts           -&gt\; Outdoor 5 at 30m<br>Indoor 6:   
        290 pts                300 pts          -&gt\;  Outdoor 6 at 40m
