DESCRIPTION:PREREQUISITE: Indoor 1: First-time Class (Register for Indoor 1
  by clicking the Sign-Up button on the top of our website's homepage.) OPEN
  TO: Indoor 2\, 3\, and 4\, and parents who have taken Indoor 1 Register fo
