DTSTAMP:20261004T164458Z
UID:3osebd968c903c4vdkaq67opkk_R20230923@google.com
CREATED:20230908T043246Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>During the <b>Fall Training Program (Sept 2-Dec 16)\, </b>we
  will go through the <b>NTS 11 Steps of Shooting</b> and <b>Building Your M
 ental Program</b> over a period of 15 weeks\, concentrating on learning and
  consistently doing one or two steps of the NTS every week. </p><p><b>SEPT<
 /b><br></p><ul><li><b>  S 2 - F 8</b>      <b>Welcome </b>!  Understanding 
  <b>NTS CONCEPTS</b> especially TRANSFER</li><li><b>  S 9 - F 15    </b>NTS
  Step 1:<b> STANCE</b><b> + </b>NTS Step 2: <b> NOCK</b><b> + </b>Building 
 Your Mental Program</li><li>  <b>S 16 - F 22  </b>NTS Step 3: <b>HOOK &amp\
 ; GRIP </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li><li><b>  S 23 - F 29 </b> <b>
 REVIEW </b><b>+ Scoring</b> for Indoor 2</li><li><b>  S 30 - Su 10/1 ATCI M
 ONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT </b>for Outdoor 3-9<b> </b></li></ul>
 <p></p><p><b>OCT</b><br></p><ul><li><b>  S 30 - F 6</b><b>    </b>NTS Step 
 4:<b> SET</b><b>  </b><b>+</b> Building Your Mental Program</li><li>  <b>S 
 7 - F 13    </b>NTS Step 5:<b> SET-UP </b><b>+</b> Building Your Mental Pro
 gram</li><li>  <b>S 14 - F 20  </b>NTS Step 6  <b>DRAW</b> to <b>LOAD </b>+
  Building Your Mental Program</li><li><b>  S 21 - F 27</b>  NTS Step 7  <b>
 ANCHOR </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li><li>  <b>S 28 - F 11/3  </b><
 b>REVIEW </b><b>+ Scoring</b> for Indoor 2</li><li>  <b>S 28 + Su 29  ATCI 
 MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT </b>for Outdoor 3-9</li></ul><p></p>
 <p><b>NOV</b><br></p><ul><li><b>  S 28 - F 3 </b>   NTS Step 8   <b>TRANSFE
 R</b> to <b>HOLD </b><b>+ </b>Building Your Mental Program</li><li>  <b>S 4
  - F 10    </b>NTS Step 9<b>   EXPAND / AIM </b><b>+ </b>Building Your Ment
 al Program</li><li><b>  S 11 - F 17</b>  NTS Step 10 <b>RELEASE  </b><b>+ <
 /b>Building Your Mental Program</li><li>  <b>S 18 - F 24  </b>NTS Step 10 <
 b>FOLLOW-THROUGH</b><span> <span>+ </span></span>Building Your Mental Progr
 am </li><li><b>  S 25 - F 12/1 </b>NTS Step 11 <b>FEEDBACK + REVIEW </b><b>
 + Scoring</b> for Indoor 2</li><li><b>  S 25 + Su 26 </b><b>ATCI MONTHLY CO
 MPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT </b>for Outdoor 3-9</li></ul><br><b>DEC</b><br
 ><ul><li><b>S 2 - F 8       </b>NTS Step 11 <b>FEEDBACK </b><b>+ </b>Buildi
 ng Your Mental Program</li><li><b>S 9 - F 15     </b><b>PUTTING IT ALL TOGE
 THER </b><b>+ Scoring</b> for Indoor 2</li><li><b>S 16 + Su 17 </b><b>ATCI 
 MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT </b>for Outdoor 3-9</li></ul><p></p>
 <p><b> Mon\, January 6 - WINTER SEMESTER STARTS and 11 NTS Steps of Shootin
 g start over again!  </b></p><p><b>INTRO</b></p><p><i>Each week the focus o
 f your lessons will be on particular <b>Steps of Shooting of the NTS (Natio
 nal Training System) </b>shot cycle\, to help you focus and improve your fo
 rm\, which\, as we all know\, leads to greater and consistent precision (ti
 ght groups of arrows) and ultimately greater accuracy (tight groups of arro
 ws dead center)</i>. <i>Concurrently you will be learning how to build a <b
 >strong mental program</b>\, which will improve your focus\, awareness and 
 confidence for competitions later.</i></p><p><i>As you reach higher levels\
 , you will learn the NTS Steps in progressively greater detail.</i></p><p><
 i>The NTS Steps are cumulative with each step most successfully completed i
 f the previous steps have been completed well. </i></p><p><b>Goals by the e
 nd of the fall semester (Aug 13)</b></p><p>Make a list of what you want to 
 accomplish by the end of the semester. Email it to Coach Racae\, so you can
  discuss it together. </p><p>Your two main goals are to replicate the NTS s
 tep(s) mindfully and consistently on every shot\, and build a mental progra
 m that is consistent on every shot. </p><p>If you stay in the present\, jus
 t doing what you need to do as you need to do it\, your conscious mind will
  be occupied\, instead of random thoughts entering your head or you being d
 istracted by emotional or environmental elements. You´ll need to build up y
 our mental program alongside your form knowledge\, so when your body is tra
 ined to shoot excellent shots\, your self image and subconscious support yo
 u\, instead of undermining you. Confidence and consistency in form and mind
  are major goals. </p><p><i>Improving your training\, practicing\, and comp
 etition components\, process\, and skills is a perpetual lifetime quest\, w
 hich you´ll slowly learn to love. You´ll  realize what is under your contro
 l\, and become your own best coach! Those who find all this fun and enjoy t
 he journey are the ones who win - the champions!</i></p><p><i>I know you ca
 n do it -  I'm your biggest fan!</i></p><p><i>​I'm also really looking forw
 ard to seeing you improve\, succeed\, and thrive !​</i></p><p><b><i>       
                                             Coach Racae</i></b></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260512T052633Z
