DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250329
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250330
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;WKST=SU;UNTIL=20250529;BYDAY=SA,SU,MO,TU,WE,TH,FR
DTSTAMP:20261004T164458Z
UID:024a4dcjllcvhinvg389qoghhe@google.com
CREATED:20250313T192649Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><b>SPRING TRAINING PROGRAM - 12 weeks (Mar 29 - May 30)</b> 
 </p><p>We will go through the <b>National Training System (NTS) 11 Steps of
  Shooting</b> and <b>Building Your Mental Program</b> step-by-step during t
 he regular training classes\, covering each one in sequence during the foll
 owing weeks.. </p><p>Learning\, understanding and doing the NTS and buildin
 g a strong mental program are ongoing quests that all archers are continuou
 sly trying to achieve - even at the highest levels !</p><p><b><i>What if yo
 u miss some of the weeks?</i></b><i>  </i>We'll do our best to catch you up
  during your next sessions. </p><p><b><i>Also see more important notes belo
 w\, under the schedule.</i></b></p><p><b>MARCH / APRIL</b></p><ul><li><p><b
 >Sat Mar 29 - Th April 3</b>       <b>WELCOME </b>!  Understanding  <b>NTS 
 CONCEPTS</b> especially TRANSFER + NTS Step 1<b> STANCE + </b><b> </b><span
 >NTS Step 2</span><span> </span><b> NOCK </b></p></li><li><p><b>Sat Apr 5 -
  Th 10   </b>NTS Step 3 <b>HOOK &amp\; GRIP </b>+ <span>NTS Step 4</span><b
 > SET </b><span>+ Building Your Mental Program</span></p></li><li><p><b>Sat
  Apr 12 - Th 17</b>  <span>NTS Step 5</span><span> </span><b>SET-UP </b><sp
 an>+ </span><span>Building Your Mental Program</span></p></li><li><p><b>S</
 b><b>at Apr 19 - Th 24 </b><b> </b><span>NTS Step 6</span><span> </span><b>
 DRAW</b><span> </span><span>to</span><span> </span><b>LOAD </b><span>+ </sp
 an><span>Building Your Mental Program</span></p></li><li><b><b>S</b><b>at A
 pr 26 - F May 2  </b>SCORING WEEK - </b><b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STA
 R PIN SHOOT </b><b>   </b><br></li></ul><p><b>MAY</b></p><ul><li><p><b>Sat 
 May 3 - Th 8</b><span> </span><b> </b><span>NTS Step 7</span><span> </span>
 <b>ANCHOR </b><span>+ </span><span>NTS Step 8</span><b> </b><b> TRANSFER to
  HOLD </b><span>+ Building Your Mental Program</span></p></li><li><p><b>Sat
  May 10 - Th 15 </b> <b> </b><span>NTS Step 9</span><b> </b><b>EXPAND / AIM
  </b><span>+ </span><span>Building Your Mental Program</span></p></li><li><
 p><b>Sat May 17 - Th 22  </b><b> </b><span>NTS Step 10</span><span> </span>
 <b>RELEASE / FOLLOW-THROUGH</b><span> </span><span>+ NTS Step 11</span><spa
 n> </span><b>FEEDBACK +</b><span> </span><span>Building Your Mental Program
 </span></p></li><li><p><b>Sat May 24 - 30  </b><b>SCORING WEEK - </b><b>ATC
 I MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT </b><b>     </b></p></li></ul><p><
 b>INTRO</b></p><p><i>Each week the focus of your lessons will be on one or 
 two particular </i><b><i>Steps of Shooting of the NTS (National Training Sy
 stem) </i></b><i>shot cycle\, to help you focus and improve your form\, whi
 ch\, as we all know\, leads to greater and more consistent precision (tight
  groups of arrows) and ultimately greater accuracy (tight groups of arrows 
 dead center)</i>. <i>Concurrently you will be learning how to build a </i><
 b><i>strong mental program</i></b><i>\, which will improve your focus\, awa
 reness and confidence for competitions later.</i></p><p><i>The NTS is the <
 /i><b><i>most biomechanically efficient and least injurious method of shoot
 ing</i></b><i>\, and is highly and continuously researched out at the Elite
  Athletes Center in Chula Vista\, CA. It is what the Olympians do!</i></p><
 p><i>The 11 NTS Steps are cumulative with each step most successfully compl
 eted if the previous steps have been completed well. As you reach higher le
 vels\, you will learn the NTS Steps in progressively greater detail.</i></p
 ><p><b>Goals by the end of the winter semester (March 27)</b></p><p>Make a 
 list of what you want to accomplish by the end of the semester. Email it to
  Coach Racae\, so you can discuss it together. </p><p>Confidence and consis
 tency in form and mind are your two main goals. Replicate the NTS step(s) m
 indfully and consistently on every shot\, and build a strong mental program
  that is consistent on every shot. </p><p>Your conscious mind commands your
  subconscious mind to put your body into position\, after you train your bo
 dy to be in those positions. When you stay in the present\, just doing what
  you need to do as you need to do it\, your conscious mind will be occupied
 \, instead of random thoughts entering your head or you being distracted by
  emotional or environmental elements. </p><p>You´ll need to build up your m
 ental program alongside your form knowledge\, so when your body is trained 
 to shoot excellent shots\, your self image and subconscious support you\, i
 nstead of undermining you. </p><p><i>Improving your training\, practicing\,
  and competition components\, process\, and skills is a perpetual lifetime 
 quest\, which you´ll slowly learn to love. You´ll  realize what is under yo
 ur control\, and you'll become your own best coach! Those who find all this
  fun and enjoy the journey are the ones who win - the champions!</i></p><p>
 <i>I know you can do it -  I'm your biggest fan!</i></p><p><i>​I'm also rea
 lly looking forward to seeing you improve\, succeed\, and thrive !​</i></p>
 <p><b><i>                                                   Coach Racae<br>
 </i></b></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260512T052633Z
LOCATION:Indoor and Outdoor Ranges
