CREATED:20240616T192510Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>The <b>2024 Texas Outdoor Target Series Championship</b> wil
 l be held at Arrow Minded Outdoors\, 5835 FM1863\, Bulverde\, TX 78163. </p
 ><p>The TOTS Champion will be the top scoring archer of each division based
  on:</p><p>·      Each archer’s <b>highest two TOTS</b> event scores </p><p
 >·      Each archer’s 72-arrow Championship score times 2.  We will shoot t
 wo rounds of 36 arrows during the Championship\, unlike other TOTS tourname
 nts.</p><p>TOTS Champion awards are given to the divisions listed on the TO
 TS website at <a href="https://texasarchery.org/events/tots">https://texasa
 rchery.org/events/tots</a></p><p>The front gate will be open at 7:30 am for
  archer/spectator setup and warmup. Official first end scoring start time i
 s 9 am.</p><p>For distances and target faces specific to age groups and div
 isions\, please see the USA Archery Event Reference Guidebook\, page 13\, a
 t <a href="https://publications.usarchery.org/books/xvbn/">https://publicat
 ions.usarchery.org/books/xvbn/</a></p><p>While there are no Traditional nor
  Longbow divisions with TOTs\, you can still shoot! You will be scored with
  Barebow (Recurve)\, so please sign up under that division.</p><p>If we run
  out of space during registration\, we will have a waiting list. More infor
 mation to follow as we get closer to the tournament!</p><p>Some quick notes
  regarding our range:</p><p>·      We will have water on site\, but we sugg
 est everyone to bring their own hydration and snacks.</p><p>·      Please d
 o not wear open-toed shoes. Stickers/briars are abundant in the area\, as w
 ell as small critters. Short-top shoes (like Hey Dudes) are fine\, as the g
 rass will be cut short.</p><p>·      Please bring your own chairs! We also 
 have some shade under trees in the spectator area\, but we encourage everyo
 ne to bring umbrellas and/or portable canopies as well.</p><br> ·      Plea
 se note there is a discrepancy in Google Maps. Do NOT enter the address\, i
 nstead search for "Arrow Minded Outdoors". There are two dark grey flags on
  each side of our entrance\, directly off FM1863 on the north side of the r
 oad\, on top of a hill.<br> <br>If there are any questions regarding the ve
 nue or registration\, please e-mail us at <a href="mailto:info@arrowminded.
 co">info@arrowminded.co</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260404T082343Z
LOCATION:Arrow Minded Outdoors\, 5835 FM1863\, Bulverde\, TX 78163
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:2024 Texas Outdoor Target Series (TOTS) Championship
