DESCRIPTION:<i><b>Thank you for your support of our Olympic Target Archery 
 programs for adults and juniors!</b></i><b><br></b><br><b>WAIVERS:</b> Ever
 yone needs to <b>sign the waivers in advance </b>of arriving at the range\,
  so we are not delayed in starting. Here's the link <a href="https://docs.g
 oogle.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSe4nVUxh99Vi50BKWFl9swZ4fephhjHBHtHpxx7G7I7KIiw5
 A/viewform?usp=preview" target="_blank"><u><u><b>2025 Waivers for Corporate
  Team Building Events</b></u></u></a><br><br><b>DIRECTIONS:</b> <b>Google M
 ap "Donut Taco Palace"</b> to find us quickly - We are right next door in U
 nit 102. (Some people are still being misdirected.) There is a target on th
 e glass door and the unit is facing 290W service road going west on the cor
 ner of Industrial Oaks Blvd and 290W. <br><br><b>ARRIVAL</b>: Please <b>arr
 ive by 12:45 pm</b>\, because we will all be starting together at 1:00 pm. 
 <br><br><b>CARPOOLING / PARKING:</b> Please meet and carpool earlier from a
 nother location or from a big box store parking lot across the highway (lik
 e Target or At Home on the corner of Mopac and 290W). It's easy and conveni
 ent to do. (Parking in front of the range and along Industrial Oaks Blvd ma
 y be limited\, depending on the number of participants.)<br><br><b>DRESS RE
 COMMENDATIONS: </b><br>Flat athletic shoes are best\, as we will be throwin
 g our weight forward a little\, so balance and weight distribution is impor
 tant. The bowstring can get slowed or entangled in your clothing or hair\, 
 so wearing tightly fitting clothes\, no wide skirts\, shirts without button
 s on the front pockets and tying your hair back is preferable. Longer brim 
 baseball caps often prevent the string from reaching your face\, so shorter
  brims or bucket hats are better. <br>:<br><b>All participants need to comp
 lete waivers online before the event.</b><br><b>Here is the direct link to 
 complete: </b><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSe4nVUxh99V
 i50BKWFl9swZ4fephhjHBHtHpxx7G7I7KIiw5A/viewform?usp=preview" target="_blank
 "><u><u><u><b>2025 Waivers for Corporate Team Building Events</b></u></u></
 u></a><br><br>Waivers have been received from those shown below in <b>bold 
 with (W)</b><br><b>Last update: 6/25/25 at 8:40 am</b><b><br></b><br><b>TEA
