 arget="_blank"><u><b>2026 INDOOR 2-6 at 9m Registration Form</b></u></a> un
 til you score  240 pts on the 60-cm target face or 230 pts on the 40-cm tar
 get face. Then you will graduate to our outdoor classes !<br><br><b>After y
 ou graduate to Outdoor 3-9</b>\, you will be granted access to the ATCI Cal
 endar via an email from Coach Racae\, and can just add your name under Regi
 stered Archers below..<br><b><br>SCHEDULE :</b><br>​<span>All classes are 1
 .5 hours</span><br><span>Register for ​​as many as your schedule and budget
  allows to progress faster:</span><br><b>Sat/Sun   4:30-6:00 pm  </b><br><b
 >Tues         </b><b>5:00-6:30 pm </b>and <b>6:30-8:00 pm</b><br><b>Wed    
      5:00-6:30 pm </b>and <b>6:30-8:00 pm </b><br><b>Thurs       5:00-6:30 
 pm</b>  and <b>6:30-8:00 pm</b><br>​Weekdays: Juniors usually come to the 5
 :00 pm class\, and adults to the 6:30 class\, but all classes are open to b
 oth adults and juniors.<br><br><b>Always check this calendar just before dr
 iving to class</b> in case there are last-minutes changes or cancellations!
 <br><br>USA Archery Level 4 NTS Coach Racae Meyer unless otherwise noted ab
 ove.<br><br>The level of each attending archer is noted next to their name 
 below\, to help you decide which classes to join. (Example: Indoor 2 or mor
 e advanced are Outdoor 3+ (O4 @20m\, etc.)<br><br>There is a minimum attend
 ance of 3 registered archers for the class to be held.<br><br><b>Registered
  archers:</b><br>1. <br>2\, <br>3. <br>4.<br>5.<br>6.<br>7.<br>8.<br>9.<br>
 10.<br>11.<br>12.<br><br><b>SINGLE Class Fees per archer for one Indoor 2-6
  class</b><br>Book and pay in advance.<b><br>$30 for 1 hr</b> (arrive 30 mi
 n after class starts or leave 30 min before class ends)<br><b>$45 for 1.5-h
 r class</b><b><br></b><br><b>MONTHLY Discount Fee Packs</b><br>Pay before t
 he 1st of each month\; book dates within the month<br><b>1 class/wk:      $
 218</b> (7.5 hrs\; 5 classes/mo)<br><b>2</b> <b>classes/wk: $372 </b>(13.5 
 hrs\; 9 classes/mo)<br><b>3 classes/wk: $557 </b>(21 hrs\; 14 classes/mo)<b
 r><b>4 classes/wk: $675 </b>(27 hrs\; 18 classes/mo)<br><b>5 classes/wk: $7
 92 </b>(33 hrs\; 22 classes/mo)<br><br><b>MULTI-CLASS Discount Packets</b><
 br>Pay in advance and book when you're sure of the dates.<b><br></b>  <b>9 
 hours : $257</b> (6 classes)<br><b> 12 hours : $330</b> (8 classes)<br> <b>
 18 hours : $477</b> (12 classes) <br><b> 23 hours: $587 </b>(15 classes)<br
 > <b>27 hours: $675 </b>(18 classes)<br><br>There are 8 places on the shoot
 ing line\, and we sometimes have double lines depending on attendance.<br><
 br>Sign in/out upon arrival/departure<br>Coaching and whistle commands at a
 ll times.<br>Instruction in the National Training System.<br>Unfair games d
 epending on attendance.<br><br>Please note: Youths &lt\;12 y.o. should not 
 shoot more than 100 arrows/day!<br><br>Prerequisites for Indoor 2: <br>Adul
 ts: No min. score in Indoor 1 <br>Juniors: 50 pts in Indoor 1<br>Scores nee
 ded at 9m to advance to Indoor 3-6 and Outdoor 3-6:<br><br>                
  On 40-cm                  On 60-cm<br>               target face          
        target face<br>Indoor 3:          230 pts                240 pts    
