 KWFl9swZ4fephhjHBHtHpxx7G7I7KIiw5A/viewform?usp=preview" target="_blank"><u
 ><u><u>2025 Waivers for Corporate Team Events </u></u></u></a><br><br>As ea
 ch participant signs the waivers\, it will be indicated below\, so you will
  be aware of what we have received. <br><br><b>DIRECTIONS:</b> <b>Google Ma
 p "Donut Taco Palace"</b> to find us quickly - We are right next door in Un
 it 102. (Some people are still being misdirected.) There is a target on the
  glass door and the unit is facing 290W service road going west on the corn
 er of Industrial Oaks Blvd and 290W. <br><br><b>ARRIVAL</b>: For a 2:00 pm 
 start\, please <b>arrive by 1:45 pm</b>\, because we need to start together
  at 2:00 pm. <br><br><b>CARPOOLING / PARKING:</b> Please meet and carpool e
 arlier from another location or from a big box store parking lot across the
  highway (like Target or At Home on the corner of Mopac and 290W). It's eas
 y and convenient to do. (Parking in front of the range and along Industrial
  Oaks Blvd may be limited\, depending on the number of participants.)<br><b
 r><b>DRESS RECOMMENDATIONS: </b><br>Flat athletic shoes are best\, as we wi
 ll be throwing our weight forward a little\, so balance and weight distribu
 tion is important. The bowstring can get slowed or entangled in your clothi
 ng or hair\, so wearing tightly fitting clothes\, no wide skirts\, shirts w
 ithout buttons on the front pockets and tying your hair back is preferable.
  Longer brim baseball caps often prevent the string from reaching your face
 \, so shorter brims or bucket hats are better.<br><br><b>All participants n
 eed to complete waivers online before the event.</b><br><b>Here is the dire
 ct link to complete: </b><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQL
 Se4nVUxh99Vi50BKWFl9swZ4fephhjHBHtHpxx7G7I7KIiw5A/viewform?usp=preview" tar
 get="_blank"><u><u><u>2025 Waivers for Corporate Team Events </u></u></u></
 a>  <br><br>Waivers have been received from those shown below in <b>bold wi
 th (W) - </b><br><b>Last update: Mon\, 10/9 at 12:00 am CST:</b><br><ol><li
 ><b>Brandon B. (W)</b></li><li><span><b>Danielle J-H. (W)</b></span></li><l
 i><b>David McK.(W)</b></li><li><b>Cody O. (W)</b></li><li><b>Cindy S.</b><s
 pan> </span><b>(W)</b><br></li><li>Matthew H.</li><li>Robby T.</li></ol>
