DESCRIPTION:We'd be very happy to host a team-building archery event for yo
 ur corporate group. \nThese sessions are proving to be very popular\, and w
 e appreciate the opportunity!\n\nSCHEDULING:\nPlease look at our website's 
 calendar and select a time slot of about 3 to 3.5 hours.\nIt's best to allo
 w about 3 hrs.\, as we may run over by as much as 30 minutes\, depending on
  everyone's arrivals and abilities. If this will be a problem\, please let 
 us know.\n\nARRIVALS:  We'll all start together\, so it's good to have ever
 yone arrive on time or together. (You may want to carpool from where you're
  having lunch\, as there is limited parking at our facilities for a max. of
  8-10 cars.)\n\nFEE:    For a first-time team-building 2-hr to 3-hr session
 \, there is a minimum indoor range booking fee of $125 for 1-5 people\, and
  then $25/person for 6-10 people. When you arrive at the range\, you can pa
 y for the session individually or by corporate check payable to Archery Tra
 ining Center\, or by credit card (+2.75%).\n\nEQUIPMENT:    We provide all 
 equipment necessary. \n\nWAIVERS:  There will be waivers for each archer to
  fill out and sign when they first come in\, and before entering the range.
 \n\nSPECIAL INSTRUCTIONS:    Also\, please let us know if there are any spe
 cial concepts you would like us to emphasize to help you build your team. A
 fter the initial "learning how to shoot" part\, there will be time for team
  games\, which everyone always enjoys.\n\nThank you for your interest in Ol
 ympic target archery!\n\nWe look forward to your time with us.\n\nIf you'd 
 like to discuss this in more detail\, please call Coach Racae at 512 436 88
 13.
