DESCRIPTION:Coach Racae \n2.5-hr Class $25/archer  \nEnrollment link: Click
  the Sign Up button at the top of www.archerytrainingcenter.com\n\nINDOOR 1
 : First-time class is for juniors age 8+\, optionally their parents\, and o
 ther adults who would like to try archery for the first time and join in fu
 ture Junior Olympic Archery Development (JOAD) and Adult Training classes. 
   \nThis class is a prerequisite for all classes. \n \nIf you have more tha
 n one year's experience\, contact racae@archerytrainingcenter.com for a pla
 cement evaluation ($45) instead of attending the Indoor 1 Class.  \n\n(You 
 will be on the waiting list after 10 people register - see below.)  \n\nReg
 istered archers: \n1.  Jonathan D.\, adult - confirmed\n2.  Amanda B.\, adu
 lt - confirmed\n3.  Jensen T.\, age? - confirmed\n4.  David T.\, dad - conf
 irmed\n5.  Jerome B. Jr.\, 15\n6.  Xiang K.\, adult - confirmed\n7.  Xiaoyu
  X.\, adult - confirmed\n8.  Will S.\, 9 - confirmed\n9.  James S.\, dad - 
 confirmed\n10.   Andres G.\, adult - confirmed\nWaiting List:  \n11.  Elisa
  O.\, adult - confirmed\n12.  Gordon L.\, adult \nIf your name is on the wa
 iting list\, you have a choice of  coming to see if a place opens up at the
  last minute\, or  rescheduling your class for another date/time.  We can o
 nly take 10 archers on the shooting line at one time.  If you prefer not to
  be on the waiting list\, please reschedule your class for another date.
