DESCRIPTION:PREREQUISITE: INDOOR 1: First-time Class\n(To register for Indo
 or 1\, click the Sign Up button at the top of www.archerytrainingcenter.com
 .)\n\nOPEN to Juniors/Parents in\nINDOOR 2 (9m) and\nINDOOR 3A (13.5m) \n\n
 Enrollment links at: http://www.archerytrainingcenter.com/Classes\n\nFees: 
 \nRECREATIONAL: \n$20/cl for 1 hr.\nThere are also reduced \nMonthly fees f
 or those who come at least 3 hours/week and \nProgressive fees for those wh
 o meet the weekly attendance requirements for their level.\nTalk to Coach R
 acae or \nLook under "Classes" on our website.\n\nYour name will be on the 
 list below when we receive your fee in advance of the class. When classes a
 re not full\, it's okay to just drop in for the class and pay at that time.
  When you attend\, and the class is near full\, you should pay at least one
  class in advance to guarantee you have a place next time. You can see the 
 actual attendance by looking at past classes. Scores are also listed\, if y
 ou kept score\, which is not required\, except on Master Challenge weeks. P
 B = Personal Best. You need 230 pts on 40cm target or 240 pts on 60cm targe
 t to graduate out of your distance to 13.5m\, and again at 13.5m to get bac
 k to 18m (full distance).\n\nRegistered archers:\n1. Josephine L.\, JOAD 13
 .5m - paid\n2. Erwin H.\, Parent 13.5m - paid\n3. Lea H.\, JOAD 9m - paid\n
 4. Will A.\, JOAD 13.5m - paid\n5. Jeff A.\, Parent 13.5m - paid - 202 PB !
 \n6.  Darian K.\, JOAD 13.5m - paid\n7. Keenan H.\, JOAD 13.5m - paid\n8. N
 icholas T.\, JOAD 13.5m - paid\n9. Sireen M. JOAD 13.5m - paid\n10.
