DESCRIPTION:<h1>2025 TSAA State Indoors</h1><p>Here is the registration Lin
 k.</p><p><a href="https://eyesonscore.com/archer-registration-form/NG4zaE0y
 U29JbFBPOVcraUZqU1Zndz09" target="_blank"><u>https://eyesonscore.com/archer
 -registration-form/NG4zaE0yU29JbFBPOVcraUZqU1Zndz09</u></a></p><p><b>ATCI R
 egistered Archers:</b></p><p></p><ol><li><b>Coach Nick</b>\, SMR</li><li><b
 >Pranav </b>U18</li><li><b>Ananya </b>U15</li><li><b>Daisy </b>U13</li><li>
 <b>Jacqui </b>U13</li></ol><p></p><p>The 2025 Texas State Indoor Championsh
 ips are set for January 11 and 12\, 2025 with a new location now available!
 </p><p>Fort Grard Guns &amp\; Archery 3800 Mineral Wells Hwy\, Weatherford\
 , Texas 76088 for our North Location\;</p><p><b>Kealing Middle School 1607 
 Pennsylvania Ave\, Austin\, TX 78702 for our central location\;</b></p><p> 
 And Texas Archery Learning Center - 5833 Treaschwig Rd. Spring\, TX 77373 f
 or our southeast location.</p><p>Participants must be a member of USA Arche
 ry or the NFAA with a temporary membership. International Guests (non U.S. 
 citizens) - Please go to <a href="http://www.usarchery.org/" target="_blank
 "><u>www.usarchery.org</u></a> to purchase a Temporary Membership for Forei
 gn Nationals.</p><p>Archers will register to shoot a single 60 arrow World 
 Archery indoor round on a 3-spot or single spot target on either Saturday o
 r Sunday. Awards will be mailed out for the divisions.</p><p>Divisions in t
 he State Championship are available for U13\, U15\, U18\, U21\, Senior\, 50
 +\, 60+ and 70+\, in Recurve\, Compound\, Barebow\, Fixed Pins\, Longbow\, 
 and Para. </p><p>U13 and U15 have the option to shoot a 60 cm face.</p><p>L
 ine times are:</p><p>Saturday 10:00 am and 2:00 pm</p><p>Sunday 10:00 am. W
 e will open another line if we get all lines full before the shoot.</p><p>R
 egistration is $60 for U21\, Seniors\, 50+\, 60+\, and 70+ and $45 for Yout
 h (U13\, U15\, and U18)\, plus a $1.99 service fee and any PayPal fees.</p>
 <p>Registration is set to check for age of participants based on the 2025 c
 alendar year.</p><p>All divisions follow World Archery Rules except for Fix
 ed Pins\, which follows the rules set by USA Archery.</p><p><b>Deadline for
  registration January 9th</b>.</p><p>For inquiries about registration pleas
 e contact the event organizer at: <a href="mailto:president@texasarchery.or
 g" target="_blank"><u>president@texasarchery.org</u></a></p><p>Please Note:
  As a registered participant in a USA Archery sanctioned event\, you are re
 quired to adhere to the Minor Athlete Abuse Prevention Policies for the dur
 ation of the event.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260404T082343Z
LOCATION:Kealing Middle School 1607 Pennsylvania Ave\, Austin\, TX 78702
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:2025 TSAA State Indoor Championships
TRANSP:OPAQUE
