 e of the class. When classes are not full\, it's okay to just drop in for t
 he class and pay at that time. When you attend\, and the class is near full
 \, you should pay at least one class in advance to guarantee you have a pla
 ce next time. You can see the actual attendance by looking at past classes.
  Scores are also listed\, if you kept score\, which is not required\, excep
 t on Master Challenge weeks. PB = Personal Best. You need 230 pts on 40cm t
