DESCRIPTION:<i><b>Thank you for your support of our Olympic Target Archery 
 programs for adults and juniors!</b></i><b><br></b><br><b>WAIVERS:</b> Ever
 yone needs to <b>sign the waivers in advance </b>of arriving at the range\,
  so we are not delayed in starting. Here's the link <a href="https://docs.g
 oogle.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSe4nVUxh99Vi50BKWFl9swZ4fephhjHBHtHpxx7G7I7KIiw5
 A/viewform?usp=preview" target="_blank"><b>2025 Waivers for Corporate Team 
 Building Events</b></a><br><br><b>DIRECTIONS:</b> <b>Google Map "Donut Taco
  Palace"</b> to find us quickly - We are right next door in Unit 102. (Some
  people are still being misdirected.) There is a target on the glass door a
 nd the unit is facing 290W service road going west on the corner of Industr
 ial Oaks Blvd and 290W. <br><br><b>ARRIVAL</b>: Please <b>arrive by 6:45 pm
 </b>\, because we will all be starting together at 7:00 pm. <br><br><b>CARP
 OOLING / PARKING:</b> Please meet and carpool earlier from another location
  or from a big box store parking lot across the highway (like Target or At 
 Home on the corner of Mopac and 290W). It's easy and convenient to do. (Par
 king in front of the range and along Industrial Oaks Blvd may be limited\, 
 depending on the number of participants.)<br><br><b>DRESS RECOMMENDATIONS: 
 </b><br>Flat athletic shoes are best\, as we will be throwing our weight fo
 rward a little\, so balance and weight distribution is important. The bowst
 ring can get slowed or entangled in your clothing or hair\, so wearing tigh
 tly fitting clothes\, no wide skirts\, shirts without buttons on the front 
 pockets and tying your hair back is preferable. Longer brim baseball caps o
 ften prevent the string from reaching your face\, so shorter brims or bucke
 t hats are better. <br>:<br><b>All participants need to complete waivers on
 line before the event.</b><br><b>Here is the direct link to complete: </b><
 a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSe4nVUxh99Vi50BKWFl9swZ4fe
 phhjHBHtHpxx7G7I7KIiw5A/viewform?usp=preview" target="_blank"><u><b>2025 Wa
 ivers for Corporate Team Building Events</b></u></a><br><br>Waivers have be
 en received from those shown below in <b>bold with (W)</b><br><b>Last updat
 e: 6/4/25 at 1:10 pm</b><br><b><br></b><ol><li><b>Sonia G.\, (W)</b></li><l
 i><b>Ablnesh T. (W)</b></li><li><b>Kalyan G. (W)</b></li><li><b>Joel D. (W)
 </b></li><li><b>Aaron G (W)</b></li><li><b>Zhisong Y. (W)</b></li><li><b>Ad
 am F. (W)</b></li><li><b>Ajit K. (W)</b></li><li><b>Jill K.\, (W)</b></li><
 li><b>Jaipal N. (W)</b></li><li><b>Cedric T. (W)</b></li><li><br></li></ol>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260404T082324Z
