  our help in ordering equipment\, we have a very detailed list of recommend
 ed equipment for Olympic target archery (different from hunting equipment).
  \nWe'll sit down with you and make sure that all the finer points are take
 n care of\, and that you order equipment appropriate for your level of expe
 rience\, strength\, height\, draw length\, etc. (Specification fee: 4% of g
 ross price of equipment...usually it's around $25.)\nAfter your equipment a
 rrive\, we'll spend about two hours with you teaching you how to string\, s
 et up\, and tune your bow ($20) and how to fletch your arrows ($15)\, etc.\
 , so you'll be ready to shoot in your next class!\nIf you have any question
 s\, please contact racae@archerytrainingcenter.com.
