UID:1l00jfbsctrac4nj98gs2pqfh5@google.com
CREATED:20220603T212841Z
DESCRIPTION:<b>2022 Summer Schedule and Goals for Outdoor 2-9 (9m to 70m)</
 b><br><b><br></b><br><b>Goals by the end of the summer semester (Aug 14):&n
 bsp\;</b><br>Make a list of what you want to accomplish<b><br></b>&nbsp\;<b
 r><b>JUNE</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>2-5</b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &n
 bsp\; Welcome Back: Understanding&nbsp\; NTS Concepts \; Mental Program<br>
 <b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>9-12</b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; NTS Steps 1+2: STA
 NCE + NOCK&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; <b>16-19&nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 3:
  HOOK &amp\; GRIP&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; 25/</b><b>26&nbsp\; JUNE ATC
 I MASTER CHALLENGE TOURNAMENT (Pin Shoot)</b><br><b>JULY</b><br><b>&nbsp\; 
 &nbsp\; &nbsp\;6/30-7/3&nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 4: SET\; NTS Step 5: SET-UP&nbsp
 \;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;7-10</b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;NTS Step 6 D
 RAW to LOAD&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;<b>14-17&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</b>NTS 
 Step 7 ANCHOR&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>21-24&nbsp\;&nbsp\
 ;</b>NTS Step 8 TRANSFER to HOLD<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;30/31&nbsp\; 
 JULY ATCI MASTER CHALLENGE TOURNAMENT (Pin Shoot)</b><br><b>AUGUST</b><br><
 b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;4-7</b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;NTS Step 9 E
 XPAND / AIM&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;11-14</b>&nbsp\; NTS Step 1
 0 RELEASE + FOLLOW-THROUGH<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;<b>18-21</b>&nbsp\;<b>
 &nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 11: FEEDBACK + Putting it all together!<b><br>&nbsp\; &
 nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>27/28&nbsp\; AUGUST ATCI MASTER CHALLENGE TOURNAMENT (
 Pin Shoot)</b><br><br>Each week the focus of your lessons will be on partic
 ular Steps of Shooting of the NTS (National Training System) shot cycle\, t
 o help you focus and improve your form\, which\, as we all know\, leads to 
 greater and consistent precision (tight groups of arrows) and ultimately gr
 eater accuracy (tight groups of arrows dead center).<br><br>Your goal is al
 ways to replicate the NTS step(s) mindfully and consistently on every shot.
  If you stay in the present just doing what you need to do as you need to i
 t\, your conscious mind will be occupied\, instead of random thoughts enter
 ing your head or you being distracted by emotional or environmental element
 s. You´ll need to build up your mental program alongside your form knowledg
 e\, so when your body is trained to shoot excellent shots\, your self image
  and subsonscious support you\, instead of undermining you. Confidence and 
 consistency in form and mind are major goals.<br><br>You do not need to sco
 re in every class. In fact\, it would be more beneficial to you if you scor
 ed only during Master Challenge Tournament Weeks\, which happen the last we
 ek of each month. This is because working on the NTS Steps of Shooting (you
 r form) is more easily done without the distraction of the target face or s
 coring\, and you will improve faster.<br><br>As you reach higher levels\, y
 ou will learn the NTS Steps in progressively greater detail.<br>The NTS Ste
 ps are cumulative with each step most successfully completed if the previou
 s steps have been completed well.&nbsp\;<br><br>Your ability to learn and u
 nderstand the NTS Steps\, and use deep focus on these Steps while shooting 
 outdoors and while using your stretchband/string loop at home to reinforce 
 form poisitions will propel you to higher levels fast!
LAST-MODIFIED:20260404T082343Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:FORM FOCUS: NTS Concepts and Mental Program
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
