DESCRIPTION:<b>WAIVERS:</b> Everyone needs to <b>sign the waivers in advanc
 e </b>of arriving at the range\, so we are not delayed in starting. Here's 
 the link: <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdYr3Yh5msvPHC_
 -ukFsifcvhYXRrzVRvcdyP4Ybx9O5zgUug/viewform" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u
 ><u><u><u><u>2024 Corporate Team Events Waivers Packet</u></u></u></u></u><
 /u></u></u></u></a>  <br><br><b>DIRECTIONS:</b> <b>Google Map "Donut Taco P
 alace"</b> to find us quickly - We are right next door in Unit 102. (Some p
 eople are still being misdirected.) There is a target on the glass door and
  the unit is facing 290W service road going west on the corner of Industria
 l Oaks Blvd and 290W. <br><br><b>ARRIVAL</b>: For a 1:00 pm start\, please 
 <b>arrive by 12:45 pm</b>\, because we will all be starting together at 1:0
 0 pm. <br><br><b>CARPOOLING / PARKING:</b> Please meet and carpool earlier 
 from another location or from a big box store parking lot across the highwa
 y (like Target or At Home on the corner of Mopac and 290W). It's easy and c
 onvenient to do. (Parking in front of the range and along Industrial Oaks B
 lvd may be limited\, depending on the number of participants.)<br><br><b>DR
 ESS RECOMMENDATIONS: </b><br>Flat athletic shoes are best\, as we will be t
 hrowing our weight forward a little\, so balance and weight distribution is
  important. The bowstring can get slowed or entangled in your clothing or h
 air\, so wearing tightly fitting clothes\, no wide skirts\, shirts without 
 buttons on the front pockets and tying your hair back is preferable. Longer
  brim baseball caps often prevent the string from reaching your face\, so s
 horter brims or bucket hats are better. <br>:<br><b>All participants need t
 o complete waivers online before the event.</b><br><b>Here is the direct li
 nk to complete: </b><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdYr3
 Yh5msvPHC_-ukFsifcvhYXRrzVRvcdyP4Ybx9O5zgUug/viewform" target="_blank"><u><
 u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>2024 Corporate Team Events Waivers Packet</u></u>
 </u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></a>  <br><br>Waivers have been received fr
 om those shown below in <b>bold with (W)</b><br><ol><li><b>Adeel M. (W) - <
 /b>38 pts<u></u><u></u></li><li><b>Adrian V. (W)</b> - 27 pts<u></u><u></u>
 </li><li><b>Amy S. (W) </b>32 pts<u></u><u></u></li><li><b>Annette W. (W) -
  </b>39 pts<u></u></li><li><b>Don DeA. (W) </b>- 91 pts<u></u><u></u></li><
 li><b>Drew F. (W) - </b>90 pts<u></u><u></u></li><li><b>Kevin C. (W) </b>- 
 ?<u></u><u></u></li><li><b>Lesley M-M. (W) - </b>?<u></u></li><li><b>Lora G
 . (W) </b>- 36 pts<u></u><u></u></li><li><b>Roderick B. (W) - ?</b><u></u><
 u></u></li><li><b>Ryan C. (W) - </b>74 pts<u></u><u></u></li><li><b>Travis 
 P. (W) </b>- 22 pts<u></u><u></u></li><li><b>Tylor Gr. (W) - </b>53 pts</li
 ></ol>
