UID:7795oobbod7lhnokoikacr1g52@google.com
CREATED:20191011T174535Z
DESCRIPTION:http://www.pearlandarcheryclub.com/taaf-games.html\n\nThe 2020 
 TAAF Winter Games of Texas is set for January 18th & 19th\, 2020\n\nPlease 
 plan on joining us again at Berry Miller Junior High\n\nThe event is a USA 
 Archery sanctioned single STAR FITA (60 arrows)\n\nThere will be 2 availabl
 e line times on both Saturday and Sunday\n\n(Participants will register for
  1 line time)\n\nAwards and Raffle will be held Sunday after PM line.\n\nCo
 st:  $35/Youth and $45/Adult\n\n\n(All proceeds benefit the programs of Gre
 ater Pearland Archery Club a 501c3 Non-Profit Organization)\n\nRegistration
  will Open Soon\n\n\n(Check above link on 10/15/19 for link to registration
  site)\n\nTournament Entry Fee will include 1 Raffle Ticket for a chance to
  win many cool prizes!\n\n\nFood Trucks and Concession will be on site!\n\n
 Youth Age Classes include Yeoman (8-9 y/o)\, Bowman (10-12)\, Cub (13-14)\,
  Cadet (15-17) Junior (18-20)\n\nAdult Age Classes Include Senior (Any Age)
 \, Master 50 (50-59) \, Master 60 (60-69)\, Master 70 (70+)\nParticipant ma
 y only register in one age division per bow style.\n\n(An archer may sign u
 p for multiple line times as long as they are in different bow classes)\n\n
 Bow Styles: Barebow (including Genesis simple compound)\, Olympic Recurve a
 nd Compound\n\n\n(Compound bows limited to 60# draw weight)\n\nTarget Dista
 nce is 18 meters\, except Yeoman\, who will shoot at 9 meters.\nCompound Ar
 chers will shoot 40cm single spot or 3-spot triangle target face. (Inner 10
  ring scoring)\n\nCub and younger Barebow and Olympic Recurve archers will 
 shoot 60cm target face.\n\nCadet and older Barebow and Olympic Recurve arch
 ers will shoot 40cm target face.\n\nYeoman Compound Archers will shoot 40cm
  target face (Outer 10 ring scoring)\n\nEvent is ADA accessible and Para Ar
 chers are encouraged to participate.\n\nUSA Archery Rules and Dress Code to
  be Enforced\n\nIf you have not participated in a sanctioned archery event\
 , do not be afraid.\n\nThis tournament is a great first tournament experien
 ce\, our club will be here to help you learn!\n\nMore on TAAF Website\nHote
 l and Local Information (Coming Soon)
LAST-MODIFIED:20260404T082324Z
LOCATION:Berry Miller Junior High\, 3301 Manvel Rd\, Pearland\, TX 77584\, 
 USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:TAAF Winter Games of Texas at Pearland\, TX
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
