DESCRIPTION:<i><b>Thank you for your support of our Olympic Target Archery 
 programs for adults and juniors!</b></i><b><br></b><br><b>WAIVERS:</b> Ever
 yone needs to <b>sign the waivers in advance </b>of arriving at the range\,
  so we are not delayed in starting. Here's the link <a href="https://docs.g
 oogle.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSe4nVUxh99Vi50BKWFl9swZ4fephhjHBHtHpxx7G7I7KIiw5
 A/viewform?usp=preview" target="_blank"><u><u><u><b>2025 Waivers for Corpor
 ate Team Building Events</b></u></u></u></a><br><br><b>DIRECTIONS:</b> <b>G
 oogle Map "Donut Taco Palace"</b> to find us quickly - We are right next do
 or in Unit 102. (Some people are still being misdirected.) There is a targe
 t on the glass door and the unit is facing 290W service road going west on 
 the corner of Industrial Oaks Blvd and 290W. <br><br><b>ARRIVAL</b>: Please
  <b>arrive by 1:45 pm</b>\, because <b>we will all be starting together at 
 2:00 pm. <br></b><br><b>CARPOOLING / PARKING:</b> Please meet and carpool e
 arlier from another location or from a big box store parking lot across the
  highway (like Target or At Home on the corner of Mopac and 290W). It's eas
 y and convenient to do. (Parking in front of the range and along Industrial
  Oaks Blvd may be limited\, depending on the number of participants.)<br><b
 r><b>DRESS RECOMMENDATIONS: </b><br>Flat athletic shoes are best\, as we wi
 ll be throwing our weight forward a little\, so balance and weight distribu
 tion is important. The bowstring can get slowed or entangled in your clothi
 ng or hair\, so wearing tightly fitting clothes\, no wide skirts\, shirts w
 ithout buttons on the front pockets and tying your hair back is preferable.
  Longer brim baseball caps often prevent the string from reaching your face
 \, so shorter brims or bucket hats are better. <br><br><b>All participants 
 need to complete waivers online before the event.</b><br><b>Here is the dir
 ect link to complete: </b><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQ
 LSe4nVUxh99Vi50BKWFl9swZ4fephhjHBHtHpxx7G7I7KIiw5A/viewform?usp=preview" ta
 rget="_blank"><u><u><u><u><b>2025 Waivers for Corporate Team Building Event
 s</b></u></u></u></u></a><br><br>Waivers have been received from those show
 n below in <b>bold with (W)</b><br><b>Last update: 8/4/25 at 12:10 pm</b><b
 ><br></b><br><b>TEAM:</b><br><ol><li><b>Dongjie X. (W)</b></li><li><b>Yuang
  L. </b><b>(W)</b></li><li><b>Kuan-Yu C. </b><b>(W)</b></li><li><b>Alex W. 
 </b><b>(W)</b></li><li><b>Kishore S.K. </b><b>(W)</b></li><li><b>Yohei Y. <
 /b><b>(W)</b></li><li><b>Amit K. (W)</b></li><li><b>Erik S. (W)</b></li><li
 >Ken</li><li>Luke</li></ol>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260404T082324Z
LOCATION:5446 W US Hwy 290 Service Rd\, Unit 102\, Austin\, TX 78735\, USA
