DESCRIPTION:First-time class for juniors age 8+\, optionally their parents\
 , and other adults who would like to try archery for the first time and joi
 n in future Junior Olympic Archery Development (JOAD) and Adult Training cl
 asses. This class is a prerequisite for all other training classes. If you 
 have more than one year experience\, contact us for a placement evaluation 
 ($45) instead of attending the Indoor 1 Class.  Registered archers: 1. Luci
 an Minn....\, 9 2. Quinn Minn...\, 12 3. David Minn...\, dad 4. 5. 6. 7. 8.
  9. 10.  Waiting List:   If your name is on the waiting list\, you have a c
 hoice of  coming to see if a place opens up at the last minute\, or  resche
 duling your class for another date/time.  We can only take 10 archers on th
 e shooting line at one time.  The instructor may also create two shooting l
 ines\, which may increase the length of the class for everyone and decrease
  the number of arrows everyone has time to shoot. If you prefer not to be o
 n the waiting list\, please reschedule your class for another date.
