DESCRIPTION:Prerequisite: INDOOR 1\n\nThis class is open to:\nINDOOR 2 at 9
 m\nINDOOR 3A at 13.5m \nINDOOR 3B at 18m\nINDOOR 4+ at 18m\nOPT\nOPT Traine
 es\n\nCoach Racae\nUSA Archery Level 3 NTS Coach\n\nFee: $15 for 1 hr\n(Fre
 e to OPT and OPT Trainees)\n\nParents: We are part of the US Olympic Commit
 tee's Safe Sport program\, so we minimally require 2 adults to be present a
 t all times. Please plan to stay with your child whenever necessary to fulf
 ill this requirement.\n\nThese classes were created so juniors have the opp
 ortunity to keep up their practice during their busy summer in between vaca
 tions and other activities. Each class will be coached specific to each ind
 ividual\, and starts on the half-hour. Just drop in when you can\, or sign 
 up in advance to secure your place. It's about as flexible as we can make i
 t for you! See you all summer long! 
