DESCRIPTION:<p>Registration is OPEN for the 2023 TSAA State Indoor Champion
 ships &amp\; Texas State Open Pro/Am!</p><p>Register here: <a href="https:/
 /l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Ftinyurl.com%2F2023TXStateIndoor%3Ffbc
 lid%3DIwAR2PfCUhmUo_IuXVZxiF2FjCN6zzfmxUY5I2R3nlzDK3EJHGrgxye3hnxdw&amp\;h=
 AT20wTW_lYqKL5jACW110y1LUhrCjC83xMhWKqQ5UbFU3POknGyzjUSOVP8jUe1AmDY59t7-O11
 MzaAFvN5Uz_K2GNrN_bU5Gsu47QAgp5-GaWqk7w1WFtm2M5ykKxpDNWLk_lY&amp\;__tn__=-U
 K-R&amp\;c[0]=AT0LFfsfWD2TtPWerUpDPZimeXckP1htRMb00Ke81GpEkp4Qol6ym2dRiqfnY
 pcD-vJZxWUUk0ysliZYRlbB6nuTOx80VtbluowZJIG_PXCidRs-2sAdPe7mJTF1Da03c4wH8Bvu
 WumYCV-KbywagdHM4sD0NJMMvvP98xgB04PwVQzOrngLho5ue2t_wb_CDbLIwrw3eVQ1">tinyu
 rl.com/2023TXStateIndoor</a></p><p>This is the ONLY state championship in T
 exas guaranteeing these kinds of payouts!</p><p>$10k Guaranteed!</p><p>The 
 2023 Texas State Indoor Championships are set for <b>March 2nd\, 3rd\, 4th 
 and 5th.</b></p><p>All participants shall be a member of USA Archery or the
  NFAA with a temporary membership. International Guests (non U.S. citizens)
  - Please go to <a href="http://www.usarchery.org/?fbclid=IwAR1MTbk_KsER0Ha
 MeFxDLwuPwWzgoK_hdFwxi1EZdQjg3hBm-KmDzDbx8Tc">www.usarchery.org</a> to purc
 hase a Temporary Membership for Foreign Nationals.</p><p>Archers will regis
 ter to shoot a 60 arrow World Archery indoor round on either March 2th\, 3r
 d or 4th. Results after Saturday will crown our state champions.</p><p>Regi
 stration is $100 for U21\, Seniors\, 50+\, 60+\, and 70+. Registration is $
 70 for Youth (U13\, U15\, and U18.)</p><p><b>All archers who shoot in the 2
 023 TSAA State Indoor Championships are eligible to shoot in the 2023 Texas
  State Open Pro/Am. The top 16 scores will move on to the Championship!</b>
 </p><p>The Texas State Open Pro/Am will feature bracket matches combining t
 he top 16 men and women for each respected divisions. These will be the one
 s shooting off for the money.</p><p><span><b>Saturday night Youth Shootoff<
 /b></span></p><p><b>Sunday Adult Shootoff</b></p><p>Payout for each divisio
 n (Numbers can go up depending on registration numbers)</p><p><b>Youth Open
 </b></p><p>$1000 Barebow 1st 500 / 2nd 300 / 3rd 200</p><p>$1000 Recurve 1s
 t 500 / 2nd 300 / 3rd 200</p><p>$1000 Compound 1st 500 / 2nd 300 / 3rd 200<
 /p><p><b>Adult Open</b></p><p>$2000 Barebow 1st $1000 / 2nd 600 / 3rd 400</
 p><p>$2500 Recurve 1st 1250 / 2nd 750 / 3rd 500</p><p>$2500 Compound 1st 12
 50 / 2nd 750 / 3rd 500</p><p> <span>Out of state archers are eligible to wi
 n the prize purse for the Texas State Open Pro/Am\, but cannot be crowned s
 tate champion in the Texas State Indoor Championship portion of the tournam
 ent. Out of state archers will need to sign up as a guest.</span></p><p><sp
 an>Registration is set to check for age of participants based on the 2023 c
 alendar year.</span></p><p>Barebow division is for recurve bows only withou
 t sight and other accessories.</p><p><b>Deadline for entries is February 28
 th.</b></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260404T082343Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:TEXAS STATE INDOOR CHAMPIONSHIPS
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
