DESCRIPTION:<p style="font-weight: bold\;">OLYMPIC DOUBLE SILVER MEDALIST</
 p><p style="font-weight: bold\;"><u>JAKE KAMINSKI</u></p><p style=""><b>Fri
 day\, Dec. 6\, 4:00-10:00pm</b></p><p style=""><i>We invited Jake and his w
 ife\, Heather\, and they accepted!!</i></p><p style=""><b>1:00-4:00 PRIVATE
  LESSON</b> opportunities with Jake (Schedule/book with Coach Racae) (Addit
 ional fee: $150/hr)</p><p style=""><b>4:00&nbsp\;DISCUSSION</b> to up our k
 nowledge and priorities on coaching\, form\, mental game\, physical trainin
 g\, bow-tuning with Coach Racae and Instructor Chris.</p><p style=""><b>5:0
 0&nbsp\;INSPIRATIONAL MEET AND GREET</b> with JOADs\, parents\, and adult a
 rchers where Jake will tell us his story of what it takes to get to the Oly
 mpics! You can watch him shoot\, see his medals\, get his autograph on your
  target\, take photos with him\, and he´ll coach some of you a little indiv
 idually.</p><p style=""><b>6:00 FORM CLINIC</b> for archers at 18m or on pe
 riodization as a group\; coaching individual archers with group looking on 
 in order to learn more.</p><p style=""><b>9:30-10:00 FINISH&nbsp\;</b></p><
 p style=""><b>Fee: $20/archer</b></p><p style=""><i>(If you have already pa
 id for a private lesson or the open practice that usually occurs on this da
 te\, there is no extra fee.)</i></p><p style=""><i><b>RSVP&nbsp\;text to Co
 ach Racae&nbsp\; (512 975 1850) or the email you received!</b></i></p><p st
 yle=""><i>Open initially to members of Archery Training Center only.&nbsp\;
 </i></p><p style=""><br></p>
