CREATED:20250722T134949Z
DESCRIPTION:<br><i><b>Private Lessons with Coach Racae </b>are available to
  all outdoor competitive archers on Wed 4:00-8:00. Check the calendar\, and
  when a time has already been booked by another archer\,\, select an adjace
 nt time. Send an email to Coach Racae with a date and time. (Competitive ar
 chers should register for a private lesson at least once per month.)</i><br
 ><i>30 min : $65</i><br><i>60 min: $125</i><br><br><b>Worked on the followi
 ng today:</b><ol><li>Sequence of Set Up\, Draw to Load\, Anchor - smoother 
 as time went by and we worked on it.</li><li>Focused on not bending wrist i
 nward in an effort to get the knuckle in the SCM/jaw pocket. Improved after
  touching front of draw hand to chin\, and then working on Anchor after fee
 ling of a straighter wrist.</li><li>Mid and lower traps should be activated
  along with lats rather than shoulders. </li><li>Core tight\, shoulders and
  chest down.</li></ol><br>Colby\, I should have written the above immediate
 ly after the session for greater detail. I'm sure you know what you need to
  work on - and I'll see you on Wed next week again!
LAST-MODIFIED:20260404T082343Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Private Lesson with Coach Racae - Colby
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
