DESCRIPTION:<b>Canceled due to wet\, icy field conditions\, sleet\, and low
  temperatures (&lt\;40F) Email Coach Racae with substitute date.</b><br><b>
 <br></b><br><b>REGISTER NOW !</b><br>This class is open to <b>adults\, juni
 ors\, and parents</b> <b>who have taken and graduated out of Outdoor 1: Fir
 st-time Class and are shooting at distances of 9m to 70m</b>. It is a mixed
  class of different distances. .<br><br><b>Sign up any time for as many or 
 as few Outdoor 2-9 Classes as you like.</b><br><br>PLEASE NOTE: Class start
  and end times will shift depending on daylight\, weather\, and temperature
  conditions. Classes require a minimum of 4 archers:<br>Jan\, Feb:   6:00 p
 m - 7:30 pm (in the dark\, depending on temperatures/chill factor)<br>Mar-A
 pr:    6:00 pm - 7:30 pm<br>May-Aug:  6:30 pm - 8:00 pm (depending on tempe
 ratures/heat index)<br>Sept-Dec:  6:00 pm - 7:30 pm (partially in the  dark
 !)<br><br><b>Register at one of these links depending on your level:</b><br
 ><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfeoHL9-iDkbFJnbIH2Ad1y3
 Z74wtnfR31CQ7PdSahRoelhGg/viewform">2023 Outdoor 2 at 9m and Outdoor 3 at 1
 3.5m</a><br><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfJfEM3tMQkTg
 9p7HLnorDwepLGgDzqHYq9jcgQN6XTHwKEQg/viewform"><u>2023 Outdoor 4-9 at 20m-7
 0m</u></a><br><br>More information and registration forms are available on 
 <a href="http://www.archerytrainingcenter.com"><u><u><u><u><u>www.archerytr
 ainingcenter.com</u></u></u></u></u></a>.<b><br></b><br><b>OB = Own Bow</b>
 <u></u><br><u></u><b>USAA = USA Archery Membership - </b>required after 3rd
  class - all-access membership - <a href="https://www.usarchery.org/resourc
 e-center/membership/individual-membership"><u><u><u><u><u>https://www.usarc
 hery.org/resource-center/membership/individual-membership</u></u></u></u></
 u></a><b><br></b><br><b>USA Archery Level 3 NTS Coach Jake Lanoux</b><b><br
