UID:dt53f2pd6ceas50a1ahepvn16g@google.com
CREATED:20140805T151945Z
DESCRIPTION:We'd be very happy to host a group archery experience for your 
 group. These sessions are proving to be very popular\, and we appreciate th
 e opportunity!\n\nSCHEDULING:\nWe have openings in between our regular clas
 ses\, which you can see on our website's Calendar.\nPlease suggest a 3-hr t
 ime slot on a couple of convenient dates/times for your group\, and we'll d
 o our best to work with you. It's best to allow at least 3 hrs.\, as we may
  run over by as much as 30 minutes\, depending on everyone's arrivals and a
 bilities. If this will be a problem\, please let us know.\nOnce we have an 
 agreed upon a date/time\, we'll reserve your time on our calendar. \n\nARRI
 VALS:  We'll all start together\, so it's good to have everyone arrive on t
 ime or together. (You may want to carpool from your office or where you're 
 having lunch.)\n\nFEE:    For a first-time team-building 2-hr to 3-hr sessi
 on\, there is a minimum indoor range booking fee of $125 for 1-5 people\, a
 nd then $25/person for 6-10 people. If your group will be more than 10 peop
 le\, the session may run over by at least 30 minutes\, so allow 3.5 hrs.\nW
 hen you arrive at the range\, you can pay for the session individually or b
 y corporate check payable to Archery Training Center\, or by credit card (+
 2.75%).\n\nEQUIPMENT:    We provide all equipment necessary. \n\nWAIVERS:  
 There will be waivers for each archer to fill out and sign when they first 
 come in\, and before entering the range.\n\nSPECIAL INSTRUCTIONS:  Please l
 et us know if there are any special concepts you would like us to emphasize
  to help you build your team.  After the initial "learning how to shoot" pa
 rt\, there will be time for team games\, which everyone always enjoys. \n\n
 Also\, please let us know if any individuals have physical\, mental\, learn
 ing\, emotional or sensory challenges that we should know about in order to
  coach them more successfully and appropriately.\n\nThank you for your inte
 rest in Olympic target archery!\n\nWe look forward to your time with us.\n\
 nIf you'd like to discuss this in more detail\, please call us at 512 436 8
 813 at your convenience.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260404T082324Z
LOCATION:10203 Old Manchaca Rd\, Austin\, TX 78748\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Group : Promises Austin
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
