DESCRIPTION:PREREQUISITE: INDOOR 1: First-time Class\n(To register for Indo
 or 1\, click the Sign Up button at the top of www.archerytrainingcenter.com
 .)\n\nOPEN to Juniors/Parents/Adults in\nINDOOR 2 (9m) and\nINDOOR 3A (13.5
 m) \nINDOOR 3B/4/5+ (18m)\n\nEnrollment links at: http://www.archerytrainin
 gcenter.com/Classes\n\nFees: \nRECREATIONAL: \n$20/cl for 1 hr\; $30/cl for
  2 hrs\; $40/cl for 3 hrs ON THE SAME DAY.\nThere are also reduced Monthly 
 fees when you regularly come to more than 3 hrs/week and Progressive fees w
 hen you are at 18m and regularly come to more than 5 hrs/week. Ask Coach Ra
 cae for more information.\n \nYour name will be on the list below when we r
 eceive your registration form and fee in advance of the class. When you att
 end\, and the class is near full\, you should pay at least one class in adv
 ance to guarantee you have a place on the shooting line next time. \n\nWhen
  classes are not full\, it's okay to just drop in occasionally for the clas
 s and pay at that time. However it is difficult to tell how many people wil
 l be dropping in\, so to secure your place\, it is better to register and p
 ay in advance to prevent overcrowding. We can only take 10 people on the sh
 ooting line at one time. \n\nWhen we have more than 10 archers\, we will fo
 rm a second line\, as in a tournament\, which will reduce the number of arr
 ows shot per person within the time. (You can see the actual attendance and
  class composition by looking at past classes at www.archerytrainingcenter.
 com/calendar.)\n\nScores are also listed below\, if you kept score\, which 
 is not required\, except on Master Challenge weeks. You need 230 pts on 40c
 m target or 240 pts on 60cm target to graduate out of your distance into In
 door 3A 13.5m\, and again at 13.5m to get into Indoor 3B at 18m (full dista
 nce).\nPB = Personal Best. \n\nRegistered archers:\n1.  Lily R.\, JOAD 13.5
 m - paid\n2. Sarah X.\, JOAD 18m - paid \n3. Emma W.\, JOAD 18m - to pay\n4
 . Nick D.\, JOAD 9m - to pay\n5. Katie G.\, JOAD 18m - paid\n6. \n7. \n8. \
 n9.\n10.
