 , adult\n8. Daniel C.\, parent\n9. Kason C.\, 10\n10. \nWaiting List: \n11.
  \n12. \nIf your name is on the waiting list\, you have a choice of coming 
 to see if a place opens up at the last minute\, or rescheduling your class 
 for another date/time. We can only take 10 archers on the shooting line at 
 one time. If you prefer not to be on the waiting list\, please reschedule y
 our class for another time.
