DESCRIPTION:REGISTER NOW !<br>This class is open to adults\, juniors\, and 
 parents who have taken and graduated out of Outdoor 1: First-time Class and
  are shooting at distances of 9m to 70m. It is a mixed class of different d
 istances.&nbsp\;<br>Sign up any time for as many or as few Outdoor 2-7 Clas
 ses as you like.<br>Register at one of these links depending on your level:
 <br><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdzkDP5mwDrW_qgrx2Ynl
 LDYipCtg5LRbHBqkYVHMJkBolOig/viewform">2021 Outdoor 2 at 9m and Outdoor 3 a
