 SlfPLuLe3aLkqThTFZs0qqb8zleJ_0W3B6Xn7mA/viewform">2021 Outdoor 4 - 9 at 20m
  - 70m</a><br><br>More information and other registration forms are availab
 le on&nbsp\;<a href="http://www.archerytrainingcenter.com">www.archerytrain
 ingcenter.com</a>.<br>You need 230 pts on the 40-cm target face\, and 240 p
 ts on the 60-cm target face to move back to 13.5m.<br><br>This class will o
 nly happen if the heat index is 100 or less at 6:00 pm and there are least 
 3 people registered.<br><br>Registered archers:<br>1. Victor C. @ 9m on 60c
 m target face<br>2.&nbsp\;<br>3.&nbsp\;<br>4.<br>5.<br>6.<br>7.<br>8.<br>9.
 <br>10.
