DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><b>2022 Winter/Spring Schedule and Goals for Outdoor
  2-9 (9m to 70m):&nbsp\;</b><br>&nbsp\;<br><b>FEBRUARY</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &n
 bsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>12-18</b>&nbsp\;Welcome Back: Understanding&nbsp\; NTS 
 Concepts&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>19-25</b>&nbsp\;NTS Ste
 ps 1+2: STANCE + NOCK&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>26 - MAR 4
 : MASTER CHALLENGE TOURNAMENT WEEK (Pin Shoot)</b><br><b>MARCH</b><br><b>&n
 bsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;5-11</b>&nbsp\;NTS Step 3: HOOK &amp\; GRIP&nbsp\;<br>
 <b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;12-18</b>&nbsp\; NTS Step 4: SET&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br
 >&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;<b>19-25&nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 5: SET-UP&nbsp\;<br><b>
 &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>26 - APR 1: MASTER CHALLENGE TOURNAMENT WEEK 
 (Pin Shoot)</b><br><b>APRIL</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;2-8</b>&nbsp\;
  NTS Step 6 DRAW to LOAD&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;9-15&nbsp\;</b
 >&nbsp\;NTS Step 7 ANCHOR&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;<b>16-22&nbsp\;<
 /b>NTS Step 8 TRANSFER to HOLD<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;23-29&nbsp\;</b
 >NTS Step 9 EXPAND / AIM&nbsp\;<b><br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>30 - MA
 Y 6: MASTER CHALLENGE TOURNAMENT WEEK (Pin Shoot)</b><br><b>MAY</b><br><b>&
 nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>7-13&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 10 RELEASE + FO
 LLOW-THROUGH<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>14-20</b>&nbsp\; NTS Step 
 11: FEEDBACK + Putting it all together!<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b
 >21/22 : END OF SEMESTER TOURNAMENT WEEKEND (Pin Shoot)</b><br><br>Each wee
 k the focus of your lessons will be on particular Steps of Shooting of the 
 NTS (National Training System) shot cycle\, to help you focus and improve y
 our form\, which\, as we all know\, leads to greater precision (tight group
 s of arrows) and ultimately greater accuracy (tight groups of arrows dead c
 enter).<br><br>Your goal is always to replicate the NTS step(s) mindfully a
 nd consistently on every shot.<br><br>You do not need to score in every cla
 ss. In fact\, it would be more beneficial to you if you scored only during 
 Master Challenge Tournament Weeks\, which happen the last week of each mont
 h. This is because working on the NTS Steps of Shooting (your form) is more
  easily done without the distraction of the target face or scoring\, and yo
 u will improve faster.<br><br>As you reach higher levels\, you will learn t
 he NTS Steps in progressively greater detail.<br>The NTS Steps are cumulati
 ve with each step most successfully completed if the previous steps have be
 en completed well.&nbsp\;<br><br>Your ability to learn and understand the N
 TS Steps\, and use deep focus on these Steps while shooting outdoors and wh
 ile using your stretchband/string loop at home to reinforce form poisitions
  will propel you to higher levels fast!<br><br><b>Goals by the end of the s
 emester (May 22):&nbsp\;</b><br>See Coach Racae´s email ¨2022 New Year´s Go
 als¨</html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260404T082324Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
