DESCRIPTION:For your convenience\, all summer long\, the schedule has opene
 d up!<br><br>Come whenever you want within the time allocated (3:00-6:00pm)
 \, and shoot for 1-3+ hours\, in accordance with your strength and experien
 ce.<br>There is continuous training with Coach Racae\, but since it´s summe
 r\, we will challenge ourselves with some archery games!<br><br>It´s going 
 to be a great summer - and cool in the indoor archery range!<br><br>Sign up
  and pay at <a href="http://www.paypal.me/atciaustin">www.paypal.me/atciaus
 tin</a> in advance to secure your space on the shooting line! (Please write
  the dates and times on your PayPal payment and add an extra 4%.)<br><br>PR
 EREQUISITE: INDOOR 1: First-time Class<br>(To register for Indoor 1\, click
  the Sign Up button at the top of <a href="http://www.archerytrainingcenter
 .com">www.archerytrainingcenter.com</a>.)<br><br>OPEN to all archers (adult
 s\, juniors\, parents) in<br>INDOOR 2 (9m) and<br>INDOOR 3A (13.5m) and<br>
 INDOOR 4+ (18m)<br><br>Enrollment links at: <a href="http://www.archerytrai
 ningcenter.com/Classes">http://www.archerytrainingcenter.com/Classes</a> <b
 r><br>Fees: <br>RECREATIONAL: <br>$20/cl for 1 hr.\, $30 for two hours\, or
  $40 for 3+ hours!<br>There are also reduced Monthly fees and Progressive f
 ees - <br>Look under "Classes" on our website.<br><br>Your name will be on 
 the list below when we receive your fee in advance of the class through <a 
 href="http://www.paypal.me/atciaustin">www.paypal.me/atciaustin</a> (Please
  add an extra 4%). When classes are not full\, it's okay to just drop in fo
 r the class and pay at that time. When you attend\, and the class is near f
 ull\, you should pay at least one class in advance to guarantee you have a 
 place next time. You can see the actual attendance by looking at past class
 es. Scores are also listed\, if you kept score\, which is not required\, ex
 cept on Master Challenge weeks. PB = Personal Best. You need 230 pts on 40c
 m target or 240 pts on 60cm target to graduate out of your distance to 13.5
 m\, and again at 13.5m to get back to 18m (full distance).<br>&nbsp\;<br>Re
 gistered archers:<br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp
 \;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;5:00-6:00 <br>1. Kevin B.\, adult 9m<br>2. Sharon W.\, adul
 t 9m<br>3. David W.\, adult 9m<br>4. Josephine L.\, JOAD 18m<br>5. <br>6. <
 br>7. <br>8. <br>9.<br>10.
