CREATED:20140625T215652Z
DESCRIPTION:We're very happy to host a team-building archery event for your
  corporate group. These sessions are proving to be very popular\, and we ap
 preciate the opportunity!\n\nSCHEDULING:\nJust have a look at the openings 
 in between our regular classes\, which you can see on our website's Calenda
 r\, and then suggest a 3-hr time slot on a couple of convenient dates/times
  for your group (not on Summer Camp weekdays)\, and we'll do our best to wo
 rk with you. It's best to allow at least 3 hrs.\, as we may run over by as 
 much as 30 minutes\, depending on everyone's arrivals and abilities. If you
 r group will be more than 10 people\, the session may run over by at least 
 30 minutes\, so allow 3.5 hrs.\nIf this will present a challenge\, please l
 et us know. \n\nARRIVALS:  We'll all start together\, so it's good to have 
 everyone arrive on time or together\, as we'll need to wait for stragglers.
  \n\nPARKING: You may want to carpool from your office or another nearby pu
 blic parking lot\, because there are only spaces for about 8-10 cars direct
 ly outside our facilities\, and NO parking on the street or at other local 
 businesses.\n\nFEE:    For a first-time team-building 2-hr to 3-hr session\
 , there is a minimum indoor range booking fee of $125 for 1-5 people\, and 
 then $25/person for 6-20 people. \nWhen you arrive at the range\, you can p
 ay for the session individually or by corporate check payable to Archery Tr
 aining Center\, or by credit card (+2.75%).\n\nEQUIPMENT:    We provide all
  equipment necessary. \n\nWAIVERS:  There will be waivers and safety rules 
 for each archer to read\, fill out\, and sign when they first come in\, and
  before entering the range.\n\nSPECIAL INSTRUCTIONS:    Please let us know 
 if there are any special concepts you would like us to emphasize to help yo
 u build your team.  After the initial "learning how to shoot" part\, there 
 will be time for team games\, which everyone always enjoys.\n\nThank you fo
 r your interest in Olympic target archery!\n\nWe look forward to your time 
 with us.\n\nIf you'd like to discuss this in more detail\, please call us a
 t 512 436 8813 at your convenience.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260404T082324Z
LOCATION:10203 Old Manchaca Rd.\, Austin\, TX 78748
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Corporate Team-Building - Intel
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
