 s.<br><br>Always check this calendar just before driving to class in case t
 here are last-minutes changes or cancellations!<br><br>USA Archery Level 4 
 NTS Coach Racae Meyer<br><br>After you graduate out of Indoor 1\, sign up f
 or 2025 INDOOR 2-6 at 9m<br><br><b>Registered archers:</b><br>1. <b>Anzung 
 K</b>.\, 9\, on 60-cm target face\, pd - 1.0 hr<br>2. <b>Melissa K.</b>\, a
 dult\, pd - 1.0 hr<br>3. <b>Jacqui C.\, </b>11\, pd - 1.5 hrs<br>4.<br>5.<b
 r>6.<br>7.<br>8.<br>9.<br>10.<br>11.<br>12.<br>NEW 2025 Winter/Spring Fees 
 <br><br>SINGLE Class Fees per archer for one Indoor 2-6 class:<br>$31 for 1
  hr (arrive 30 min after class starts or leave 30 min before class ends)<br
 >$43 for 1.5 hrs<br><br>MULTI-Class Discount Packets<br>  9 hours : $250 (s
 ix 1.5-hr classes)<br> 12 hours : $320 (eight 1.5-hr classes)<br> 18 hours 
 : $460 (twelve 1.5-hr classes) <br><br>There are 8 places on the shooting l
 ine\, and we sometimes have double lines depending on attendance.<br><br>Si
 gn in/out upon arrival/departure<br>For single classes\, book and pay in ad
 vance.<br>For multi-class discount packs\, pay in advance and book when you
