DESCRIPTION:Instructor Chris\n\nPREREQUISITE: INDOOR 1: First-time Class\n(
 To register for Indoor 1\, click the Sign Up button at the top of www.arche
 rytrainingcenter.com.)\n\nOPEN to Juniors/Parents/Adults in\nINDOOR 2 (9m) 
 and\nINDOOR 3A (13.5m) \nINDOOR 3B (18m)\nINDOOR 4+ (18m)\n\nEnrollment is 
