DESCRIPTION:There is more registration and hotel info on the board at arche
 ry! Look for Texas Shootout !\nWe´ll see you there!\n\n\nTo be nominated to
  the 2020 US Olympic Archery Team\, archers must compete in the Trials as s
 et by USA Archery and the US Olympic Committee. \nFor the Tokyo 2020 Games\
 , there are four stages of the Trials.\nParticipation is open to any USA Ar
 chery member who is also a citizen of the United States.\nArchers wanting t
 o participate in the Trials need to complete a separate registration and be
  registered in the Recurve Senior division.\nThis is your chance to earn a 
 spot on Team USA! Compete with the best of the best on the Road to Tokyo!\n
 Trials participants receive a special commemorative t-shirt from the event 
 and memories for a lifetime!\nStage 1: Aug 15-16 during the 135th US Nation
 al Target Championships. (Registration is now open) \nStage 2: Sept 28\, 30
 \, Oct. 1 during the Texas Shootout. (Registration is now open)\nStage 3: A
 pril 8-11\, 2020 in Chula Vista\, CA\nStage 4: May 25-26\, 2020 during the 
 Gator Cup in Newberry\, FL
