 Sat/Sun 4:00-5:30 pm - <br>T/W/Th  5:00-6:30 pm  and  <br>T/W/Th   6:30-8\;
 :00 pm<br>​Weekdays: Juniors usually come to the 5:00 pm class\, and adults
  to the 6:30 class\, but all classes are open to both adults and juniors.<b
 r><br>Always check this calendar just before driving to class in case there
  are last-minutes changes or cancellations!<br><br>USA Archery Level 4 NTS 
 Coach Racae Meyer<br><br>After you graduate out of Indoor 1\, sign up for 2
