 ter/Spring Fees <br><br>SINGLE Class Fees per archer for one Indoor 2-6 cla
 ss:<br>$31 for 1 hr (arrive 30 min after class starts or leave 30 min befor
 e class ends)<br>$43 for 1.5 hrs<br><br>MULTI-Class Discount Packets<br>  9
  hours : $250 (six 1.5-hr classes)<br> 12 hours : $320 (eight 1.5-hr classe
 s)<br> 18 hours : $460 (twelve 1.5-hr classes) <br><br>There are 8 places o
 n the shooting line\, and we sometimes have double lines depending on atten
 dance.<br><br>Sign in/out upon arrival/departure<br>For single classes\, bo
 ok and pay in advance.<br>For multi-class discount packs\, pay in advance a
 nd book when you are sure of the dates.<br>Coaching and whistle commands at
  all times.<br>Instruction in the National Training System.<br>Unfair games
  depending on attendance.<br><br>Please note: Youths &lt\;12 y.o. should no
 t shoot more than 100 arrows/day!<br><br>Prerequisites for Indoor 2: <br>Ad
 ults: No min. score in Indoor 1 <br>Juniors: 50 pts in Indoor 1<br>Scores n
 eeded at 9m to advance to Indoor 3-6 and Outdoor 3-6:<br><br>              
