 ><span> </span><b>242 pts</b></li><li><b>Anush K.M</b>.\, 12\, on 60-cm tar
 get face\, pd - 1.5 hrs - <b>228 pts</b></li><li><b>Adi S.</b>\, 16\, pd 1.
