 s <b>134 pts</b></li><li><b>Lana F</b>.\, 14\, pd\, 1.5 hrs - <b>122 pts</b
 ></li><li><b>Clara McC</b>\, 10\, on 60-cm target face\, pd - 1.5 hrs- <b>9
 0 pts</b></li></ol><br><b>2025 Winter/Spring Fees </b><br><br>SINGLE Class 
 Fees per archer for one Indoor 2-6 class:<br>$31 for 1 hr (arrive 30 min af
 ter class starts or leave 30 min before class ends)<br>$43 for 1.5 hrs<br><
 br>MULTI-Class Discount Packets<br>  9 hours : $250 (six 1.5-hr classes)<br
 > 12 hours : $320 (eight 1.5-hr classes)<br> 18 hours : $460 (twelve 1.5-hr
  classes) <br><br>There are 8 places on the shooting line\, and we sometime
 s have double lines depending on attendance.<br><br>Sign in/out upon arriva
 l/departure<br>For single classes\, book and pay in advance.<br>For multi-c
 lass discount packs\, pay in advance and book when you are sure of the date
 s.<br>Coaching and whistle commands at all times.<br>Instruction in the Nat
 ional Training System.<br>Unfair games depending on attendance.<br><br>Plea
 se note: Youths &lt\;12 y.o. should not shoot more than 100 arrows/day!<br>
 <br>Prerequisites for Indoor 2: <br>Adults: No min. score in Indoor 1 <br>J
 uniors: 50 pts in Indoor 1<br>Scores needed at 9m to advance to Indoor 3-6 
