DESCRIPTION:What we did today:<br><br>Form is getting really good. <br>Stil
 l a bow arm strength challenge.<br><br>I want Abby to find her own timing a
 nd increase her arrow count.<br>You need to time the shots and record the n
 umber of arrows in a given time.<br>So it's not just the timing of the actu
 al shot\, but also the timing between shots.<br>Breathe between and during!
 <br><br>Drill the bow arm\, increasing its strength\, by shooting 30 arrows
  (in 3 ends of 10) in quick succession while making sure she's <br><ul><li>
 pushing the bow into the target </li><li>practicing synchronized release an
 d </li><li>keeping the bow arm up until she hears the arrow hit the paper</
 li></ul><br>Continue the Holding SPTs\, of course.\n\nJoin with Google Meet
 : https://meet.google.com/yvn-noai-vtp\n\nLearn more about Meet at: https:/
 /support.google.com/a/users/answer/9282720
