 .)\n\nOPEN to Juniors/Parents in\nINDOOR 2 (9m) and\nINDOOR 3A (13.5m) \n\n
 \nClick Indoor 2/3A enrollment links at: http://www.archerytrainingcenter.c
 om/Classes\n\nFees: \nRECREATIONAL: \n$20/cl for 1 hr.\nThere are also redu
 ced Monthly fees and Progressive fees - \nLook under "Classes" on our websi
 te.\n\nYour name will be on the list below when we receive your fee in adva
 nce of the class. When classes are not full\, it's okay to just drop in for
  the class and pay at that time. When you attend\, and the class is near fu
 ll\, you should pay at least one class in advance to guarantee you have a p
 lace next time. You can see the actual attendance by looking at past classe
 s. Scores are also listed\, if you kept score\, which is not required\, exc
 ept on Master Challenge weeks. PB = Personal Best. You need 230 pts on 40cm
  target or 240 pts on 60cm target to graduate out of your distance to 13.5m
 \, and again at 13.5m to get back to 18m (full distance).\n\nRegistered arc
 hers:\n1. Keenan H.\, JOAD 13.5m - paid\n2. Zoe C.\, JOAD 9m - paid\n3. Tru
