 AA\, OB\, pd - 1.5 hrs<br>5. <b>Logan C</b>.\, 8\, on 60-cm target face\, U
 SAA\, OB\, pd - 1.5 hrs<br>6. <b>Andrew P.</b>\, 11\, on 60-cm target face\
 , pd - 1.5 hrs<br>7. <b>Sofia W.</b>\, 13\, pd - 1.5 hrs<br>8. <b>Lily R.\,
 </b> 16 - instructor<br>9.<br>10.<br>11.<br>12.<br>NEW 2025 Winter/Spring F
 ees <br><br>SINGLE Class Fees per archer for one Indoor 2-6 class:<br>$31 f
 or 1 hr (arrive 30 min after class starts or leave 30 min before class ends
 )<br>$43 for 1.5 hrs<br><br>MULTI-Class Discount Packets<br>  9 hours : $25
 0 (six 1.5-hr classes)<br> 12 hours : $320 (eight 1.5-hr classes)<br> 18 ho
 urs : $460 (twelve 1.5-hr classes) <br><br>There are 8 places on the shooti
 ng line\, and we sometimes have double lines depending on attendance.<br><b
 r>Sign in/out upon arrival/departure<br>For single classes\, book and pay i
 n advance.<br>For multi-class discount packs\, pay in advance and book when
  you are sure of the dates.<br>Coaching and whistle commands at all times.<
 br>Instruction in the National Training System.<br>Unfair games depending o
 n attendance.<br><br>Please note: Youths &lt\;12 y.o. should not shoot more
