CREATED:20230908T043246Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>During the <b>Fall Training Program (Sept 2-Dec 16)\, </b>we
  will go through the <b>NTS 11 Steps of Shooting</b> and <b>Building Your M
 ental Program</b> over a period of 15 weeks\, concentrating on learning and
  consistently doing one or two steps of the NTS every week. </p><p><b>SEPT<
 /b><br></p><ul><li><b>  S 2 - F 8</b>      <b>Welcome </b>!  Understanding 
  <b>NTS CONCEPTS</b> especially TRANSFER</li><li><b>  S 9 - F 15    </b>NTS
  Step 1:<b> STANCE</b><b> + </b>NTS Step 2: <b> NOCK</b><b> + </b>Building 
 Your Mental Program</li><li>  <b>S 16 - F 22  </b>NTS Step 3: <b>HOOK &amp\
 ; GRIP </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li><li><b>  S 23 - F 29  </b>NTS
  Step 11 <b>REVIEW</b></li><li><b style="font-weight: bold\;">  S 30 - Su 1
 0/1 ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT </b>for Outdoor 3-9<b> </b>
 </li></ul><p></p><p><b>OCT</b><br></p><ul><li><b>  S 30 - F 6</b><b>    </b
 >NTS Step 4:<b> SET</b><b>  </b><b>+</b> Building Your Mental Program</li><
 li>  <b>S 7 - F 13    </b>NTS Step 5:<b> SET-UP </b><b>+</b> Building Your 
 Mental Program</li><li>  <b>S 14 - F 20  </b>NTS Step 6  <b>DRAW</b> to <b>
 LOAD </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li><li><b>  S 21 - F 27</b>  NTS S
 tep 7  <b>ANCHOR </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li><li>  <b>S 28 - F 1
 1/3  </b><b>REVIEW</b></li><li>  <b>S 28 + Su 29  ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION 
 and STAR PIN SHOOT </b>for Outdoor 3-9</li></ul><p></p><p><b>NOV</b><br></p
 ><ul><li><b>  S 28 - F 3 </b>   NTS Step 8   <b>TRANSFER</b> to <b>HOLD </b
 ><b>+ </b>Building Your Mental Program</li><li>  <b>S 4 - F 10    </b>NTS S
 tep 9<b>   EXPAND / AIM </b><b>+ </b>Building Your Mental Program</li><li><
 b>  S 11 - F 17</b>  NTS Step 10 <b>RELEASE  </b><b>+ </b>Building Your Men
 tal Program</li><li>  <b>S 18 - F 24  </b>NTS Step 10 <b style="font-weight
 : bold\;">FOLLOW-THROUGH</b><span style="font-weight: bold\;"> <span style=
 "font-weight: normal\;">+ </span></span>Building Your Mental Program </li><
 li><b>  S 25 - F 12/1 REVIEW</b></li><li><b>  S 25 + Su 26 </b><b>ATCI MONT
 HLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT </b>for Outdoor 3-9</li></ul><br><b>DEC<
 /b><br><ul><li><b>S 2 - F 8       </b>NTS Step 11 <b>FEEDBACK </b><b>+ </b>
 Building Your Mental Program</li><li><b>S 9 - F 15     </b><b>PUTTING IT AL
 L TOGETHER</b></li><li><b>S 16 + Su 17 </b><b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and 
 STAR PIN SHOOT </b>for Outdoor 3-9</li></ul><p></p><p><b> Mon\, January 6 -
  FALL SEMESTER STARTS and 11 NTS Steps of Shooting start over again!  </b><
 /p><p><b>INTRO</b></p><p><i>Each week the focus of your lessons will be on 
 particular <b>Steps of Shooting of the NTS (National Training System) </b>s
 hot cycle\, to help you focus and improve your form\, which\, as we all kno
 w\, leads to greater and consistent precision (tight groups of arrows) and 
 ultimately greater accuracy (tight groups of arrows dead center)</i>. <i>Co
 ncurrently you will be learning how to build a <b>strong mental program</b>
 \, which will improve your focus\, awareness and confidence for competition
 s later.</i></p><p><i>As you reach higher levels\, you will learn the NTS S
 teps in progressively greater detail.</i></p><p><i>The NTS Steps are cumula
 tive with each step most successfully completed if the previous steps have 
 been completed well. </i></p><p><b>Goals by the end of the fall semester (A
 ug 13)</b></p><p>Make a list of what you want to accomplish by the end of t
 he semester. Email it to Coach Racae\, so you can discuss it together. </p>
 <p>Your two main goals are to replicate the NTS step(s) mindfully and consi
 stently on every shot\, and build a mental program that is consistent on ev
 ery shot. </p><p>If you stay in the present\, just doing what you need to d
 o as you need to do it\, your conscious mind will be occupied\, instead of 
 random thoughts entering your head or you being distracted by emotional or 
 environmental elements. You´ll need to build up your mental program alongsi
 de your form knowledge\, so when your body is trained to shoot excellent sh
 ots\, your self image and subconscious support you\, instead of undermining
  you. Confidence and consistency in form and mind are major goals. </p><p><
 i>Improving your training\, practicing\, and competition components\, proce
 ss\, and skills is a perpetual lifetime quest\, which you´ll slowly learn t
 o love. You´ll  realize what is under your control\, and become your own be
 st coach! Those who find all this fun and enjoy the journey are the ones wh
 o win - the champions!</i></p><p><i>I know you can do it -  I'm your bigges
 t fan!</i></p><p><i>​I'm also really looking forward to seeing you improve\
 , succeed\, and thrive !​</i></p><p><b><i>                                 
                   Coach Racae</i></b></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260512T052633Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:FORM FOCUS
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
