 ter class starts or leave 30 min before class ends)<br>$43 for 1.5 hrs<br><
 br>MULTI-Class Discount Packets<br>  9 hours : $250 (six 1.5-hr classes)<br
 > 12 hours : $320 (eight 1.5-hr classes)<br> 18 hours : $460 (twelve 1.5-hr
  classes) <br><br>There are 8 places on the shooting line\, and we sometime
 s have double lines depending on attendance.<br><br>Sign in/out upon arriva
