 lass discount packs\, pay in advance and book when you are sure of the date
 s.<br>Coaching and whistle commands at all times.<br>Instruction in the Nat
 ional Training System.<br>Unfair games depending on attendance.<br><br>Plea
 se note: Youths &lt\;12 y.o. should not shoot more than 100 arrows/day!<br>
 <br>Prerequisites for Indoor 2: <br>Adults: No min. score in Indoor 1 <br>J
 uniors: 50 pts in Indoor 1<br>Scores needed at 9m to advance to Indoor 3-6 
