DESCRIPTION:<b>WAIVERS:</b> Everyone needs to <b>sign the waivers in advanc
 e </b>of arriving at the range\, so we are not delayed in starting. Here's 
 the link: <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdYr3Yh5msvPHC_
 -ukFsifcvhYXRrzVRvcdyP4Ybx9O5zgUug/viewform"><u><u><u><u>2024 Corporate Tea
 m Events Waivers Packet</u></u></u></u></a>  <br><br><b>DIRECTIONS:</b> <b>
 Google Map "Donut Taco Palace"</b> to find us quickly - We are right next d
 oor in Unit 102. (Some people are still being misdirected.) There is a targ
 et on the glass door and the unit is facing 290W service road going west on
  the corner of Industrial Oaks Blvd and 290W. <br><br><b>ARRIVAL</b>: For a
  2:00 pm start\, please <b>arrive by 1:45 pm</b>\, because we will all be s
 tarting together at 2:00 pm. <br><br><b>CARPOOLING / PARKING:</b> Please me
 et and carpool earlier from another location or from a big box store parkin
 g lot across the highway (like Target or At Home on the corner of Mopac and
  290W). It's easy and convenient to do. (Parking in front of the range and 
 along Industrial Oaks Blvd may be limited\, depending on the number of part
 icipants.)<br><br><b>DRESS RECOMMENDATIONS: </b><br>Flat athletic shoes are
  best\, as we will be throwing our weight forward a little\, so balance and
  weight distribution is important. The bowstring can get slowed or entangle
 d in your clothing or hair\, so wearing tightly fitting clothes\, no wide s
 kirts\, shirts without buttons on the front pockets and tying your hair bac
 k is preferable. Longer brim baseball caps often prevent the string from re
 aching your face\, so shorter brims or bucket hats are better. <br>:<br><b>
 All participants need to complete waivers online before the event.</b><br><
 b>Here is the direct link to complete: </b><a href="https://docs.google.com
 /forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdYr3Yh5msvPHC_-ukFsifcvhYXRrzVRvcdyP4Ybx9O5zgUug/viewfor
 m"><u><u><u><u><u>2024 Corporate Team Events Waivers Packet</u></u></u></u>
 </u></a>  <br><br>Waivers have been received from those shown below in <b>b
 old with (W)</b><br><b>Scores averaged by taking total score / 24 arrows = 
 arrow score x 30 arrows = 1 round<br><br></b>1. <span><b>Natalie D. (W) 150
  pts - 3rd Place</b></span><br>2.<b> Marie G. (W)</b><br>3. <b>Molly W. (W)
  24 pts</b><br>4.<b> Milton A. (W) score? 1st Place<br>5. Bobby B. (W) 101 
 pts<br>6. Rogan C. (W) 168 pts 2nd Place<br>7. Rey J. (W) 76 pts<br>8. Hann
 ah E</b>. <b>(W) 128 pts</b><br>9. <b>Hanisha P. (W)</b>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260404T082324Z
LOCATION:5446 W US Hwy 290 Service Rd\, Unit 102\, Austin\, TX 78735\, USA
