 aid 217<br>6. Brendan L.\, adult 9m - paid 177 / 180 avg´d PB<br>7. Zoe C.\
 , JOAD 13.5m<br>8. Ken B.\, adult 9m - paid 191 avg´d<br>9.<br>10.
