DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><b>2022 Fall Schedule and Goals for Outdoor 2-9 (9m 
 to 70m)</b><b><br></b><br><b>Goals by the end of the fall semester (Dec 18)
 :&nbsp\;</b><br>Make a list of what you want to accomplish and discuss it w
 ith Coach Racae.<b><br></b>&nbsp\;<br><b>SEPT</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nb
 sp\;1</b><b>-7</b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; Welcome Back: Understanding&nbsp\
 ; NTS Concepts \; Mental Program<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>8-14</
 b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; NTS Steps 1+2: STANCE + NOCK&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\;&nb
 sp\;<b>15-21&nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 3: HOOK &amp\; GRIP&nbsp\;<br><b>&n
 bsp\; &nbsp\; 24/</b><b>25&nbsp\; &nbsp\;SEPT ATCI MASTER CHALLENGE TOURNAM
 ENT (Pin Shoot)&nbsp\;</b><b>10:30am-12:30pm&nbsp\;</b><br><br><b>OCT</b><b
 r><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;9/29-10/5&nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 4: SET&nbsp\;<br><
 b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;6-12</b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;NTS Step 5: SET-UP&
 nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;<b>13-19&nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b>NTS Step
  6 DRAW to LOAD&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>20-26&nbsp\; &nb
 sp\;</b>NTS Step 7 ANCHOR&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;29/30&
 nbsp\; &nbsp\;OCT ATCI MASTER CHALLENGE TOURNAMENT (Pin Shoot)&nbsp\;</b><b
 >10:30am-12:30pm&nbsp\;</b><br><br><b>NOV</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;
 3-9</b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;NTS Step 8 TRANSFER to HOLD&nbsp\;<br
 ><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;10-16</b>&nbsp\; NTS Step 9 EXPAND / AIM&nbsp\;&
 nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>19/20&nbsp\; NOV ATCI MASTER CHA
 LLENGE TOURNAMENT (Pin Shoot) 10:30am-12:30pm</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nb
 sp\;24-27&nbsp\; <i>HAPPY THANKSGIVING ! </i>- (NO CLASSES)</b><br><br><b>D
 EC</b><br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;<b>1-7</b>&nbsp\;<b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\
 ;&nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 10 RELEASE + FOLLOW-THROUGH&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; 
 &nbsp\;<b>8-16&nbsp\; &nbsp\; </b>NTS Step 11: FEEDBACK + Putting it all to
 gether!<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;<b>17/18&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</b><b>DEC ATCI MAS
 TER CHALLENGE TOURNAMENT (Pin Shoot) 10:30am-12:30pm</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbs
 p\; &nbsp\;19-JAN 2 <i>MERRY CHRISTMAS !!</i> - (NO CLASSES)</b><br><br>Eac
 h week the focus of your lessons will be on particular Steps of Shooting of
  the NTS (National Training System) shot cycle\, to help you focus and impr
 ove your form\, which\, as we all know\, leads to greater and consistent pr
 ecision (tight groups of arrows) and ultimately greater accuracy (tight gro
 ups of arrows dead center).<br><br>Your goal is always to replicate the NTS
  step(s) mindfully and consistently on every shot. If you stay in the prese
 nt just doing what you need to do as you need to it\, your conscious mind w
 ill be occupied\, instead of random thoughts entering your head or you bein
 g distracted by emotional or environmental elements. You´ll need to build u
 p your mental program alongside your form knowledge\, so when your body is 
 trained to shoot excellent shots\, your self image and subconscious support
  you\, instead of undermining you. Confidence and consistency in form and m
 ind are major goals.<br><br>You do not need to score in every class. In fac
 t\, it would be more beneficial to you if you scored only during Master Cha
 llenge Tournament Weeks\, which happen the last week of each month. This is
  because working on the NTS Steps of Shooting (your form) is more easily do
 ne without the distraction of the target face or scoring\, and you will imp
 rove faster.<br><br>As you reach higher levels\, you will learn the NTS Ste
 ps in progressively greater detail.<br>The NTS Steps are cumulative with ea
 ch step most successfully completed if the previous steps have been complet
 ed well.&nbsp\;<br><br>Your ability to learn and understand the NTS Steps\,
  and use deep focus on these Steps while shooting outdoors\, and while usin
 g your stretchband/string loop at home to reinforce form positions\, will p
 ropel you to higher levels faster!</html-blob>
