 nto the program this semester. The minimum age to register is now 12 years 
 old.&nbsp\;<br><br>If you registered by Sept 15\, and are younger than 12\,
  you´ll stay in the program and take other Outdoor 1 classes as needed and 
 later join Outdoor 2.&nbsp\;<br><br>More information and other registration
  forms are available on&nbsp\;<a href="http://www.archerytrainingcenter.com
 ">www.archerytrainingcenter.com</a>.
