DESCRIPTION:Coach Racae\n\nPREREQUISITE: INDOOR 1: First-time Class\n(To re
 gister for Indoor 1\, click the Sign Up button at the top of www.archerytra
 iningcenter.com.)\n\nOPEN to Adults only in \nINDOOR 2 (9m) and\nINDOOR 3A 
 (13.5m) \nINDOOR 3B+ (18m)\nINDOOR 4+ (18m for additional practice)\n\nEnro
 llment links at: http://www.archerytrainingcenter.com/Classes\n\nFees: \nRE
 CREATIONAL: \n$20/cl for 1 hr.\nThere are also reduced Monthly fees and Pro
 gressive fees - \nLook under "Classes" on our website.\n\nYour name will be
  on the list below when we receive your fee in advance of the class. When c
 lasses are not full\, it's okay to just drop in for the class and pay at th
 at time. When you attend\, and the class is near full\, you should pay at l
 east one class in advance to guarantee you have a place next time. You can 
 see the actual attendance by looking at past classes.\n\nRegistered archers
 :\n1. Farhaneh S. (18m)\n2. Alexandra M. (9m) \n3.  Deborah P. (18m)\n4. Sh
