DESCRIPTION:PREREQUISITE: INDOOR 1: First-time Class<br>(To register for In
 door 1\, click the Sign Up button at the top of <a href="http://www.archery
 trainingcenter.com">www.archerytrainingcenter.com</a>.)<br><br>OPEN to Juni
 ors/Parents/Adults in<br>INDOOR 2 (9m) and<br>INDOOR 3A (13.5m) and <br>IND
 OOR 3B/4/5+ (18m)<br><br>Enrollment links at: <a href="http://www.archerytr
 ainingcenter.com/Classes">http://www.archerytrainingcenter.com/Classes</a><
 br><br>Fees: <br>RECREATIONAL: <br>$20/cl for 1 hr\; $30/cl for 2 hrs\; $40
 /cl for 3 hrs ON THE SAME DAY.<br>There are also reduced Monthly fees when 
 you regularly come to more than 3 hrs/week and Progressive fees when you ar
 e at 18m and regularly come to more than 5 hrs/week. Ask Coach Racae for mo
 re information.<br>&nbsp\;<br>Your name will be on the list below when we r
 eceive your registration form and fee in advance of the class. When you att
 end\, and the class is near full\, you should pay at least one class in adv
 ance to guarantee you have a place on the shooting line next time. <br><br>
 When classes are not full\, it's okay to just drop in occasionally for the 
 class and pay at that time. However it is difficult to tell how many people
  will be dropping in\, so to secure your place\, it is better to register a
 nd pay in advance to prevent overcrowding. We can only take 10 people on th
 e shooting line at one time. <br><br>When we have more than 10 archers\, we
  will form a second line\, as in a tournament\, which will reduce the numbe
 r of arrows shot per person within the time. (You can see the actual attend
 ance and class composition by looking at past classes at <a href="http://ww
 w.archerytrainingcenter.com/calendar">www.archerytrainingcenter.com/calenda
 r</a>.)<br><br>Scores are also listed below\, if you kept score\, which is 
 not required\, except on Master Challenge weeks. You need 230 pts on 40cm t
 arget or 240 pts on 60cm target to graduate out of your distance into Indoo
 r 3A 13.5m\, and again at 13.5m to get into Indoor 3B at 18m (full distance
 ).<br>PB = Personal Best. <br><br>Registered archers:<br>1. José M.\, Adult
  18m - to pay<br>2. Alice M.\, JOAD 9m - paid<br>3. Kason C.\, JOAD 9m - to
  pay<br>4. Zoë C.\, JOAD 13.5m\, paid<br>5. <br>6. <br>7. <br>8. <br>9.<br>
 10.
