 ww.archerytrainingcenter.com</a>.<br><br>To progress to Outdoor 3 at 13.5m\
 , you´ll need to shoot 230 pts on the 40-cm target face (14+ y.o.) or 240 p
 ts on the 60-cm target face (&lt\;14 y.o.).
