 s continuous training with Coach Racae\, but since it´s summer\, we will ch
 allenge ourselves with some archery games!<br><br>It´s going to be a great 
 summer - and cool in the indoor archery range!<br><br>Sign up and pay at <a
  href="http://www.paypal.me/atciaustin">www.paypal.me/atciaustin</a> in adv
 ance to secure your space on the shooting line! (Please write the dates and
