DESCRIPTION:First-time class for juniors age 8+\, optionally their parents\
 , and other adults who would like to try archery for the first time and joi
 n in future Junior Olympic Archery Development (JOAD) and Adult Training cl
 asses. This class is a prerequisite for the SUMMER PROGRAM classes. If you 
 have more than one year experience\, contact us for a placement evaluation 
 ($45) instead of attending the Indoor 1 Class.\n(You will be on the waiting
  list after 10 people register - see below.)\n\nRegistered archers:\n1. Juh
 i Sha...\, 16\n2. Carolina Rod......\, 9\n3. Lalithya D..\, adult\n4. Jason
  Sul.....\, adult\n5. \n6. \n7. \n8. \n9. \n10. \n\nWaiting List: \n11. \n\
 nIf your name is on the waiting list\, you have a choice of \ncoming to see
  if a place opens up at the last minute\, or \nrescheduling your class for 
 another date/time. \nWe can only take 10 archers on the shooting line at on
 e time. \nThe instructor may also create two shooting lines\, which may inc
 rease the length of the class for everyone and decrease the number of arrow
 s everyone has time to shoot.\nIf you prefer not to be on the waiting list\
 , please reschedule your class for another date.
