 TOURNAMENT (Pin Shoot)&nbsp\;</b><b>10:30am-12:30pm&nbsp\;</b><br><br><b>OC
 T</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;9/29-10/5&nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 4: SET&nbsp
 \;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;6-12</b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;NTS Step 5: 
 SET-UP&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;<b>13-19&nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b>N
 TS Step 6 DRAW to LOAD&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>20-26&nbs
 p\; &nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 7 ANCHOR&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\
 ;29/30&nbsp\; &nbsp\;OCT ATCI MASTER CHALLENGE TOURNAMENT (Pin Shoot)&nbsp\
 ;</b><b>10:30am-12:30pm&nbsp\;</b><br><br><b>NOV</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; 
 &nbsp\;3-9</b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;NTS Step 8 TRANSFER to HOLD&nb
 sp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;10-16</b>&nbsp\; NTS Step 9 EXPAND / AIM&
 nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>19/20&nbsp\; NOV ATCI MAS
 TER CHALLENGE TOURNAMENT (Pin Shoot) 10:30am-12:30pm</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbs
 p\; &nbsp\;24-27&nbsp\; <i>HAPPY THANKSGIVING ! </i>- (NO CLASSES)</b><br><
 br><b>DEC</b><br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;<b>1-7</b>&nbsp\;<b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\;
  &nbsp\;&nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 10 RELEASE + FOLLOW-THROUGH&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\; &
 nbsp\; &nbsp\;<b>8-16&nbsp\; &nbsp\; </b>NTS Step 11: FEEDBACK + Putting it
  all together!<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;<b>17/18&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</b><b>DEC A
 TCI MASTER CHALLENGE TOURNAMENT (Pin Shoot) 10:30am-12:30pm</b><br><b>&nbsp
 \; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;19-JAN 2 <i>MERRY CHRISTMAS !!</i> - (NO CLASSES)</b><br>
 <br>Each week the focus of your lessons will be on particular Steps of Shoo
 ting of the NTS (National Training System) shot cycle\, to help you focus a
 nd improve your form\, which\, as we all know\, leads to greater and consis
 tent precision (tight groups of arrows) and ultimately greater accuracy (ti
 ght groups of arrows dead center).<br><br>Your goal is always to replicate 
 the NTS step(s) mindfully and consistently on every shot. If you stay in th
 e present just doing what you need to do as you need to it\, your conscious
  mind will be occupied\, instead of random thoughts entering your head or y
 ou being distracted by emotional or environmental elements. You´ll need to 
 build up your mental program alongside your form knowledge\, so when your b
 ody is trained to shoot excellent shots\, your self image and subconscious 
 support you\, instead of undermining you. Confidence and consistency in for
 m and mind are major goals.<br><br>You do not need to score in every class.
  In fact\, it would be more beneficial to you if you scored only during Mas
 ter Challenge Tournament Weeks\, which happen the last week of each month. 
 This is because working on the NTS Steps of Shooting (your form) is more ea
 sily done without the distraction of the target face or scoring\, and you w
 ill improve faster.<br><br>As you reach higher levels\, you will learn the 
 NTS Steps in progressively greater detail.<br>The NTS Steps are cumulative 
 with each step most successfully completed if the previous steps have been 
 completed well.&nbsp\;<br><br>Your ability to learn and understand the NTS 
 Steps\, and use deep focus on these Steps while shooting outdoors\, and whi
 le using your stretchband/string loop at home to reinforce form positions\,
  will propel you to higher levels faster!<u></u></html-blob>
