CREATED:20161217T202754Z
DESCRIPTION:Coach Racae (Recurves only)\n\nPREREQUISITE:\nINDOOR 1: First-t
 ime Class:\nClick the Sign Up button at the top of www.archerytrainingcente
 r.com\nSaturdays: 11:00am-1:30pm (Fee: $25/cl)\nSundays: 11:00am-1:30pm (Fe
 e: $25/cl)\n\nENROLLMENT LINKS at:\nhttp://www.archerytrainingcenter.com/ne
 ws\n\nADULT RECREATIONAL CLASSES at Indoor 2-5 and distances (9m\, 13.5m\, 
 18m)\n\nPER CLASS FEE: $20/HR \nSundays: 6:00-7:00pm \nTuesdays: 7:30-8:30p
 m \n\nMONTHLY FEES for ADULTS at 18m :\n\nAdult classes ONLY at 18m (Tues 7
 :30-8:30 + Sun 6:00-7:00):\n(Based on coming 6 hrs/month. If there are 6 hr
 s or fewer in the month\, the monthly fees are $20/hr.)\nJAN   $ 120 (8 one
 -hour classes)\nFEB   $ 120  (8 one-hour classes)\nMAR  $ 120 (8 one-hour c
 lasses)\nAPR   $ 120 (8 one-hour classes)\nMAY   $ 120 (7 one-hour classes)
 \n\nAdult classes + Wed. 6:30-8:00 at 18m:\nJAN   $ 188 (12.5 hrs available
 )\nFEB   $ 210 (14 hrs available) \nMAR   $ 233 (15.5 hrs available)\nAPR  
  $ 210 (14 hrs available)\nMAY   $  210 (14 hrs available)\n\nPROGRESSIVE P
 ROGRAM Indoor at 18m\nTraining for those who want to progress faster toward
 s competitive archery by meeting minimum attendance requirements. (8.5 hrs/
 week available)\nSaturdays 3:30-5:30pm\nSundays:  3:30-5:30pm \nSundays:  6
 :00-7:00pm (Adults and Indoor 5 only)\nTuesdays: 6:30-7:30pm \nTuesdays: 7:
 30-8:30pm (Adults and Indoor 5 only) \nWednesdays: 6:30-8:00pm \n\nPROGRESS
 IVE WEEKLY FEES (after meeting previous week's attendance requirement):\nIn
 door 3A at 13.5m: $TBD/wk (min. 4 hrs)\nIndoor 3B at 18m:    $TBD/wk (min. 
 5 hrs)\nIndoor 4 at 18m:      $TBD/wk (min. 6 hrs)\nIndoor 5 at 18m:      $
 TBD/wk (min. 8 hrs)\n\nUSA Archery's Adult Training Program (ATP) follows a
  similar path to the Junior Olympic Archery Development (JOAD) program. \n\
 nYour first step is to take an Indoor 1: First-time Class for Adults. Just 
 click the link or the Sign Up button at the top of this website.\n\nEveryon
 e starts out in our Recreational program at 9 meters. As you improve you pr
 ogress to 13.5 meters then on to 18 meters indoors. \n\nWe welcome adult re
 curve and compound Olympic target archers at all levels of experience. \nRe
 curve archers attend any of the group classes above or book private lessons
  with Coach Racae or Instructor Dale.\nCompound archers book private lesson
 s with Coach Dan.\n\nWhen you decide that you are interested in competing y
 ou'll apply to join USA Archery Level 4 NTS and JDT Coach Alex Meyer's Comp
 etitive Archery Program (CAP).\n\nExperienced competitive archers need to b
 e evaluated by Coach Racae for advanced placement in either the Progressive
  Program or recommendation to the Competitive Archery Program with Coach Al
 ex.\n\nJoin with Google Hangouts: https://plus.google.com/hangouts/_/calend
 ar/M2NkdGhhdDVxNGhmcmcwMGtyYWZ1NGJ0NmtAZ3JvdXAuY2FsZW5kYXIuZ29vZ2xlLmNvbQ.r
 5oo7pf4arjc75j71sh4f2kh4s?hs=121
LAST-MODIFIED:20260513T121423Z
LOCATION:10203 OLD Manchaca Rd.\, Austin\, TX 78748
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:ADULT TRAINING
TRANSP:OPAQUE
