DESCRIPTION:Coach Racae (Recurves only)\n\nPREREQUISITE:\nINDOOR 1: First-t
 ime Class:\nClick the Sign Up button at the top of www.archerytrainingcente
 r.com\nSaturdays: 11:00am-1:30pm (Fee: $25/cl)\nSundays: 11:00am-1:30pm (Fe
 e: $25/cl)\n\nENROLLMENT LINKS at:\nhttp://www.archerytrainingcenter.com/ne
 ws\n\nATTENDEES TONIGHT: (Paid in advance)\n1. Daniel H. (18m)\n2. Boston (
 9m)\n3. Christopher C. (13.5m)\n4. Suzanne J. (9m)\n5. Melissa (18m)\n6. St
 even H. (18m)\n7. Adrian R.\n8.\n9.\n10.\n\nADULT RECREATIONAL CLASSES at I
 ndoor 2-5 and distances (9m\, 13.5m\, 18m)\n\nPER CLASS FEE: $20/HR \nSunda
 ys: 6:00-7:00pm \nTuesdays: 7:30-8:30pm \n\nMONTHLY FEES for ADULTS at 18m 
 :\n\nAdult classes ONLY at 18m (Tues 7:30-8:30 + Sun 6:00-7:00):\n(Based on
  coming 6 hrs/month. If there are 6 hrs or fewer in the month\, the monthly
  fees are $20/hr.)\nJAN   $ 120 (8 one-hour classes)\nFEB   $ 120  (8 one-h
 our classes)\nMAR  $ 120 (8 one-hour classes)\nAPR   $ 120 (8 one-hour clas
 ses)\nMAY   $ 120 (7 one-hour classes)\n\nAdult classes + Wed. 6:30-8:00 at
  18m:\nJAN   $ 188 (12.5 hrs available)\nFEB   $ 210 (14 hrs available) \nM
 AR   $ 233 (15.5 hrs available)\nAPR   $ 210 (14 hrs available)\nMAY   $  2
 10 (14 hrs available)\n\nPROGRESSIVE PROGRAM Indoor at 18m\nTraining for th
 ose who want to progress faster towards competitive archery by meeting mini
 mum attendance requirements. (8.5 hrs/week available)\nSaturdays 3:30-5:30p
 m\nSundays:  3:30-5:30pm \nSundays:  6:00-7:00pm (Adults and Indoor 5 only)
 \nTuesdays: 6:30-7:30pm \nTuesdays: 7:30-8:30pm (Adults and Indoor 5 only) 
 \nWednesdays: 6:30-8:00pm \n\nPROGRESSIVE WEEKLY FEES (after meeting previo
 us week's attendance requirement):\nIndoor 3A at 13.5m: $TBD/wk (min. 4 hrs
 )\nIndoor 3B at 18m:    $TBD/wk (min. 5 hrs)\nIndoor 4 at 18m:      $TBD/wk
  (min. 6 hrs)\nIndoor 5 at 18m:      $TBD/wk (min. 8 hrs)\n\nUSA Archery's 
 Adult Training Program (ATP) follows a similar path to the Junior Olympic A
 rchery Development (JOAD) program. \n\nYour first step is to take an Indoor
  1: First-time Class for Adults. Just click the link or the Sign Up button 
 at the top of this website.\n\nEveryone starts out in our Recreational prog
 ram at 9 meters. As you improve you progress to 13.5 meters then on to 18 m
 eters indoors. \n\nWe welcome adult recurve and compound Olympic target arc
 hers at all levels of experience. \nRecurve archers attend any of the group
  classes above or book private lessons with Coach Racae or Instructor Dale.
 \nCompound archers book private lessons with Coach Dan.\n\nWhen you decide 
 that you are interested in competing you'll apply to join USA Archery Level
  4 NTS and JDT Coach Alex Meyer's Competitive Archery Program (CAP).\n\nExp
 erienced competitive archers need to be evaluated by Coach Racae for advanc
 ed placement in either the Progressive Program or recommendation to the Com
 petitive Archery Program with Coach Alex.\n\nJoin with Google Hangouts: htt
 ps://plus.google.com/hangouts/_/calendar/M2NkdGhhdDVxNGhmcmcwMGtyYWZ1NGJ0Nm
 tAZ3JvdXAuY2FsZW5kYXIuZ29vZ2xlLmNvbQ.r5oo7pf4arjc75j71sh4f2kh4s?hs=121
