  requirements will automatically be considered Recreational\, and Recreatio
 nal class fees will apply.  Fees:  RECREATIONAL: $20 for 1 hr. PROGRESSIVE:
   Indoor 3A:       $48/wk (min. 4 hrs) Indoor 3B:       $55/wk (min. 5 hrs)
