DESCRIPTION:Coach Racae (Recurves only)\n\nPREREQUISITE:\nINDOOR 1: First-t
 ime Class:\nClick the Sign Up button at the top of www.archerytrainingcente
 r.com\nSaturdays: 11:00am-1:30pm (Fee: $25/cl)\nSundays: 11:00am-1:30pm (Fe
 e: $25/cl)\n\nENROLLMENT LINKS at:\nhttp://www.archerytrainingcenter.com/ne
 ws\n\nATTENDEES TONIGHT: (Paid in advance)\n1. Daniel H. (18m)\n2. Boston (
 9m)\n3. Michael G. dna\n4. Adrian R.\n5. Melissa D.\n6. Christopher C.\n7. 
 Nick G. (9m)\n8. Odin C.\n9.\n10.\n\nADULT RECREATIONAL CLASSES at Indoor 2
 -5 and distances (9m\, 13.5m\, 18m)\n\nPER CLASS FEE: $20/HR \nSundays: 6:0
 0-7:00pm \nTuesdays: 7:30-8:30pm \n\nMONTHLY FEES for ADULTS at 18m :\n\nAd
 ult classes ONLY at 18m (Tues 7:30-8:30 + Sun 6:00-7:00):\n(Based on coming
  6 hrs/month. If there are 6 hrs or fewer in the month\, the monthly fees a
 re $20/hr.)\nJAN   $ 120 (8 one-hour classes)\nFEB   $ 120  (8 one-hour cla
 sses)\nMAR  $ 120 (8 one-hour classes)\nAPR   $ 120 (8 one-hour classes)\nM
 AY   $ 120 (7 one-hour classes)\n\nAdult classes + Wed. 6:30-8:00 at 18m:\n
 JAN   $ 188 (12.5 hrs available)\nFEB   $ 210 (14 hrs available) \nMAR   $ 
 233 (15.5 hrs available)\nAPR   $ 210 (14 hrs available)\nMAY   $  210 (14 
 hrs available)\n\nPROGRESSIVE PROGRAM Indoor at 18m\nTraining for those who
  want to progress faster towards competitive archery by meeting minimum att
 endance requirements. (8.5 hrs/week available)\nSaturdays 3:30-5:30pm\nSund
 ays:  3:30-5:30pm \nSundays:  6:00-7:00pm (Adults and Indoor 5 only)\nTuesd
 ays: 6:30-7:30pm \nTuesdays: 7:30-8:30pm (Adults and Indoor 5 only) \nWedne
 sdays: 6:30-8:00pm \n\nPROGRESSIVE WEEKLY FEES (after meeting previous week
 's attendance requirement):\nIndoor 3A at 13.5m: $TBD/wk (min. 4 hrs)\nIndo
 or 3B at 18m:    $TBD/wk (min. 5 hrs)\nIndoor 4 at 18m:      $TBD/wk (min. 
 6 hrs)\nIndoor 5 at 18m:      $TBD/wk (min. 8 hrs)\n\nUSA Archery's Adult T
 raining Program (ATP) follows a similar path to the Junior Olympic Archery 
 Development (JOAD) program. \n\nYour first step is to take an Indoor 1: Fir
 st-time Class for Adults. Just click the link or the Sign Up button at the 
 top of this website.\n\nEveryone starts out in our Recreational program at 
 9 meters. As you improve you progress to 13.5 meters then on to 18 meters i
 ndoors. \n\nWe welcome adult recurve and compound Olympic target archers at
  all levels of experience. \nRecurve archers attend any of the group classe
 s above or book private lessons with Coach Racae or Instructor Dale.\nCompo
 und archers book private lessons with Coach Dan.\n\nWhen you decide that yo
 u are interested in competing you'll apply to join USA Archery Level 4 NTS 
 and JDT Coach Alex Meyer's Competitive Archery Program (CAP).\n\nExperience
 d competitive archers need to be evaluated by Coach Racae for advanced plac
 ement in either the Progressive Program or recommendation to the Competitiv
 e Archery Program with Coach Alex.\n\nJoin with Google Hangouts: https://pl
 us.google.com/hangouts/_/calendar/M2NkdGhhdDVxNGhmcmcwMGtyYWZ1NGJ0NmtAZ3Jvd
 XAuY2FsZW5kYXIuZ29vZ2xlLmNvbQ.r5oo7pf4arjc75j71sh4f2kh4s?hs=121
