DTSTAMP:20261004T164458Z
UID:qi7lv6i40535m079l7p38lv6nn_R20250928@google.com
CREATED:20250623T192513Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>The <b>FALL TRAINING PROGRAM (Aug 30-Dec 19)</b> is the long
 est program\, meaning that we will go through the <b>National Training Syst
 em 11 Steps of Shooting</b> and <b>Building Your Mental Program</b> with pl
 enty of time for revisions and catching up during the semester. You can joi
 n any week by taking the Indoor 1: First-time Class. </p><p>Learning\, unde
 rstanding and doing the NTS and building a strong mental program are ongoin
 g quests that all archers are continuously trying to achieve - even at the 
 highest levels !<br></p><p><i><b>What if you miss some of the weeks?</b>  <
 /i>We'll do our best to catch you up during your next sessions. </p><p><b>A
 UG/SEPT</b><br></p><ul><li><b>Sat Aug 30 - F Sept 5</b>   <b>WELCOME </b>! 
  Understanding  <b>NTS CONCEPTS</b> especially TRANSFER + NTS Step 1:<b> ST
 ANCE</b><b> + </b>NTS Step 2: <b> NOCK</b><b> </b></li><li><b> Sat Sept 6 -
  F 12   </b>NTS Step 3: <b>HOOK &amp\; GRIP </b><b>+ </b>Building Your Ment
 al Program </li><li> <b>Sat 13 - F 19</b>   NTS Step 4:<b> SET</b><b> + </b
 >+ Building Your Mental Program</li><li><b> Sat 20 - F 26  </b>NTS Step 5:<
 b> SET-UP </b><b>+</b> NTS Step 6 <b>DRAW</b> to <b>LOAD + </b>Building You
 r Mental Program</li><li><b> Sat 27 - F Oct 3  </b><b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPETIT
 ION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b><b> </b><b>   </b></li></ul><p></p><p><b>OCTOBER<
 /b></p><ul><li><b>  Sat Oct 4 - F 10</b><b> </b><b> </b>NTS Step 7  <b>ANCH
 OR </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li><li>  <b>Sat 11 - F 17  </b>NTS S
 tep 8  <b>TRANSFER</b><b> to HOLD </b>+ Building Your Mental Program  </li>
 <li><b>  Sat 18 - F 24</b> <b> </b>NTS Step 9<b> EXPAND / AIM </b>+ Buildin
 g Your Mental Program</li><li>  <b>Sat 25 - F 31 </b><b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPET
 ITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b><b>  </b></li></ul><p></p><p><b>NOVEMBER</b><br
 ></p><ul><li><b>Sat Nov 1- F 7  NTS Step 10 <b>RELEASE / FOLLOW-THROUGH</b>
   </b>+ Building Your Mental Program   <br></li><li><b>Sat 8 - F 14 </b> NT
 S Step 11 <b>FEEDBACK </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li><li><b>Sat 15 
 - F 21</b>  <b>PUTTING IT ALL TOGETHER </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</
 li><li><b>Sat 22- W 27  </b><b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT<
 /b></li></ul><br><p><b>DECEMBER</b><br></p><ul><li><b>Sat Nov 29 - F Dec 5 
   PUTTING IT ALL TOGETHER</b> +<b> </b>Building Your Mental Program   <br><
 /li><li><b>Sat 6 - F 12</b>  <b>PUTTING IT ALL TOGETHER</b> + Building Your
  Mental Program  <b> </b></li><li><b>Sat 13 - F 19</b>  <b>ATCI END OF YEAR
  ! COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b></li></ul><p></p><p><b>Sat\, Jan 3 - W
 INTER TRAINING PROGRAM starts. </b></p><p><b>INTRO</b></p><p><i>Each week t
 he focus of your lessons will be on one or two particular <b>Steps of Shoot
 ing of the NTS (National Training System) </b>shot cycle\, to help you focu
 s and improve your form\, which\, as we all know\, leads to greater and mor
 e consistent precision (tight groups of arrows) and ultimately greater accu
 racy (tight groups of arrows dead center)</i>. <i>Concurrently you will be 
 learning how to build a <b>strong mental program</b>\, which will improve y
 our focus\, awareness and confidence for competitions later.</i></p><p><i>T
 he NTS is the <b>most biomechanically efficient and least injurious method 
 of shooting</b>\, and is highly and continuously researched out at the Elit
 e Athletes Center in Chula Vista\, CA. It is what the Olympians do!</i></p>
 <p><i>The 11 NTS Steps are cumulative with each step most successfully comp
 leted if the previous steps have been completed well. </i><i>As you reach h
 igher levels\, you will learn the NTS Steps in progressively greater detail
 .</i></p><p><b>Goals by the end of the fall semester (Dec 19)</b></p><p>Mak
 e a list of what you want to accomplish by the end of the semester. Email i
 t to Coach Racae\, so you can discuss it together. </p><p>Confidence and co
 nsistency in form and mind are your two main goals. Replicate the NTS step(
 s) mindfully and consistently on every shot\, and build a strong mental pro
 gram that is consistent on every shot. </p><p>Your conscious mind commands 
 your subconscious mind to put your body into position\, after you train you
 r body to be in those positions. When you stay in the present\, just doing 
 what you need to do as you need to do it\, your conscious mind will be occu
 pied\, instead of random thoughts entering your head or you being distracte
 d by emotional or environmental elements. </p><p>You´ll need to build up yo
 ur mental program alongside your form knowledge\, so when your body is trai
 ned to shoot excellent shots\, your self image and subconscious support you
 \, instead of undermining you. </p><p><i>Improving your training\, practici
 ng\, and competition components\, process\, and skills is a perpetual lifet
 ime quest\, which you´ll slowly learn to love. You´ll  realize what is unde
 r your control\, and become your own best coach! Those who find all this fu
 n and enjoy the journey are the ones who win - the champions!</i></p><p><i>
 I know you can do it -  I'm your biggest fan!</i></p><p><i>​I'm also really
  looking forward to seeing you improve\, succeed\, and thrive !​</i></p><p>
 <b><i>                                                   Coach Racae</i></b
 ></p>
