 -7:05pm<br>5. Jake L.\, Adult 13.5m - paid 5:40-8:18pm<br>6. Richard F.\, A
 dult 18m - paid 5:32-6:43pm<br>7. Sarah X.\, JOAD 18m - paid 5:22- 7:42pm<b
 r>8. Emma W.\, JOAD 18m - to pay 5:22- 7:42pm<br>9.<br>10.
