 em 11 Steps of Shooting</b> and <b>Building Your Mental Program</b> with pl
 enty of time for revisions and catching up during the semester. You can joi
 n any week by taking the Indoor 1: First-time Class. </p><p>Learning\, unde
 rstanding and doing the NTS and building a strong mental program are ongoin
 g quests that all archers are continuously trying to achieve - even at the 
 highest levels !<br></p><p><i><b>What if you miss some of the weeks?</b>  <
 /i>We'll do our best to catch you up during your next sessions. </p><p><b>A
 UG/SEPT</b><br></p><ul><li><b>Sat Aug 30 - F Sept 5</b>   <b>WELCOME </b>! 
  Understanding  <b>NTS CONCEPTS</b> especially TRANSFER + NTS Step 1:<b> ST
 ANCE</b><b> + </b>NTS Step 2: <b> NOCK</b><b> </b></li><li><b> Sat Sept 6 -
  F 12   </b>NTS Step 3: <b>HOOK &amp\; GRIP </b><b>+ </b>Building Your Ment
 al Program </li><li> <b>Sat 13 - F 19</b>   NTS Step 4:<b> SET</b><b> + </b
 >+ Building Your Mental Program</li><li><b> Sat 20 - F 26  </b>NTS Step 5:<
 b> SET-UP </b><b>+</b> Building Your Mental Program</li><li><b> Sat 27 - F 
 Oct 3  </b><b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b><b> </b><b>   
 </b></li></ul><p></p><p><b>OCTOBER</b></p><ul><li><b>  Sat Oct 4 - F 10</b>
 <b> </b>NTS Step 6 <b>DRAW</b> to <b>LOAD </b>+ Building Your Mental Progra
 m</li><li>  <b>Sat 11 - F 17  </b>NTS Step 7  <b>ANCHOR </b>+ Building Your
  Mental Program  </li><li><b>  Sat 18 - F 24</b> NTS Step 8  <b>TRANSFER</b
 ><b> to HOLD </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li><li>  <b>Sat 25 - F 31 
 </b><b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b><b>  </b></li></ul><p
 ></p><p><b>NOVEMBER</b><br></p><ul><li><b>Sat Nov 1- F 7   </b>NTS Step 9<b
 > EXPAND / AIM </b><b>+ </b><b>Building Your Mental Program   </b><br></li>
 <li><b>Sat 8 - F 14 </b> NTS Step 10 <b>RELEASE / FOLLOW-THROUGH</b> + Buil
 ding Your Mental Program</li><li><b>Sat 15 - F 21</b>  NTS Step 11 <b>FEEDB
 ACK</b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li><li><b>Sat 22- W 27  </b><b>ATCI 
 MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b></li></ul><br><p><b>DECEMBER</b><
 br></p><ul><li><b>Sat Nov 29 - F Dec 5   PUTTING IT ALL TOGETHER</b> and <b
 >Building Your Mental Program   </b><br></li><li><b>Sat 6 - F 12</b>  <b>PU
 TTING IT ALL TOGETHER</b> and <b>Building Your Mental Program   </b></li><l
 i><b>Sat 13 - F 19</b>  <b>ATCI END OF YEAR ! COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOO
 T</b></li></ul><p></p><p><b>Sat\, Jan 3 - WINTER TRAINING PROGRAM starts. <
 /b></p><p><b>INTRO</b></p><p><i>Each week the focus of your lessons will be
  on one or two particular <b>Steps of Shooting of the NTS (National Trainin
 g System) </b>shot cycle\, to help you focus and improve your form\, which\
 , as we all know\, leads to greater and more consistent precision (tight gr
 oups of arrows) and ultimately greater accuracy (tight groups of arrows dea
 d center)</i>. <i>Concurrently you will be learning how to build a <b>stron
 g mental program</b>\, which will improve your focus\, awareness and confid
 ence for competitions later.</i></p><p><i>The NTS is the <b>most biomechani
 cally efficient and least injurious method of shooting</b>\, and is highly 
 and continuously researched out at the Elite Athletes Center in Chula Vista
 \, CA. It is what the Olympians do!</i></p><p><i>The 11 NTS Steps are cumul
 ative with each step most successfully completed if the previous steps have
  been completed well. </i><i>As you reach higher levels\, you will learn th
 e NTS Steps in progressively greater detail.</i></p><p><b>Goals by the end 
 of the fall semester (Dec 19)</b></p><p>Make a list of what you want to acc
 omplish by the end of the semester. Email it to Coach Racae\, so you can di
 scuss it together. </p><p>Confidence and consistency in form and mind are y
 our two main goals. Replicate the NTS step(s) mindfully and consistently on
  every shot\, and build a strong mental program that is consistent on every
  shot. </p><p>Your conscious mind commands your subconscious mind to put yo
 ur body into position\, after you train your body to be in those positions.
  When you stay in the present\, just doing what you need to do as you need 
 to do it\, your conscious mind will be occupied\, instead of random thought
 s entering your head or you being distracted by emotional or environmental 
 elements. </p><p>You´ll need to build up your mental program alongside your
  form knowledge\, so when your body is trained to shoot excellent shots\, y
 our self image and subconscious support you\, instead of undermining you. <
 /p><p><i>Improving your training\, practicing\, and competition components\
 , process\, and skills is a perpetual lifetime quest\, which you´ll slowly 
 learn to love. You´ll  realize what is under your control\, and become your
  own best coach! Those who find all this fun and enjoy the journey are the 
 ones who win - the champions!</i></p><p><i>I know you can do it -  I'm your
  biggest fan!</i></p><p><i>​I'm also really looking forward to seeing you i
 mprove\, succeed\, and thrive !​</i></p><p><b><i>                          
                          Coach Racae</i></b></p>
