DESCRIPTION:Coach Racae (Recurves only)\n\nPREREQUISITE:\nINDOOR 1: First-t
 ime Class:\nClick the Sign Up button at the top of www.archerytrainingcente
 r.com\nSaturdays: 11:00am-1:30pm (Fee: $25/cl)\nSundays: 11:00am-1:30pm (Fe
 e: $25/cl)\n\nENROLLMENT LINKS at:\nhttp://www.archerytrainingcenter.com/ne
 ws\n\nATTENDEES TONIGHT: (Paid in advance)\n1. Daniel (18m)\n2. Steven H. (
 18m)\n3. Kelly K. (18m)\n4. Cassandra (18m)\n5. Dave C. (13.5m)\n6. Adrian 
 (13.5m)\n7. Melissa (13.5m)\n8. Christopher (13.5m)\n9.\n10.\n\nADULT RECRE
 ATIONAL CLASSES at Indoor 2-5 and distances (9m\, 13.5m\, 18m)\n\nPER CLASS
  FEE: $20/HR \nSundays: 6:00-7:00pm \nTuesdays: 7:30-8:30pm \n\nMONTHLY FEE
 S for ADULTS at 18m :\n\nAdult classes ONLY at 18m (Tues 7:30-8:30 + Sun 6:
 00-7:00):\n(Based on coming 6 hrs/month. If there are 6 hrs or fewer in the
  month\, the monthly fees are $20/hr.)\nJAN   $ 120 (8 one-hour classes)\nF
 EB   $ 120  (8 one-hour classes)\nMAR  $ 120 (8 one-hour classes)\nAPR   $ 
 120 (8 one-hour classes)\nMAY   $ 120 (7 one-hour classes)\n\nAdult classes
  + Wed. 6:30-8:00 at 18m:\nJAN   $ 188 (12.5 hrs available)\nFEB   $ 210 (1
 4 hrs available) \nMAR   $ 233 (15.5 hrs available)\nAPR   $ 210 (14 hrs av
 ailable)\nMAY   $  210 (14 hrs available)\n\nPROGRESSIVE PROGRAM Indoor at 
 18m\nTraining for those who want to progress faster towards competitive arc
 hery by meeting minimum attendance requirements. (8.5 hrs/week available)\n
 Saturdays 3:30-5:30pm\nSundays:  3:30-5:30pm \nSundays:  6:00-7:00pm (Adult
 s and Indoor 5 only)\nTuesdays: 6:30-7:30pm \nTuesdays: 7:30-8:30pm (Adults
  and Indoor 5 only) \nWednesdays: 6:30-8:00pm \n\nPROGRESSIVE WEEKLY FEES (
 after meeting previous week's attendance requirement):\nIndoor 3A at 13.5m:
  $TBD/wk (min. 4 hrs)\nIndoor 3B at 18m:    $TBD/wk (min. 5 hrs)\nIndoor 4 
 at 18m:      $TBD/wk (min. 6 hrs)\nIndoor 5 at 18m:      $TBD/wk (min. 8 hr
 s)\n\nUSA Archery's Adult Training Program (ATP) follows a similar path to 
