  </b>at 9m on 40-cm target face:<br><b>Target nos:</b><br>1. <b>Rachel E</b
 >.\, adult - pd<br>2. <b>Andrea E</b>.\, adult - pd<br>3.&nbsp\;<b>Alejandr
