  10-15 archers per session depending on the number of family groups in atte
 ndance or in accordance with CDC Guidelines.&nbsp\;<br>Each person will hav
 e a target stand\, except after 10 people have registered\, two members fro
 m the same family will share one target stand.<br>The archer and a maximum 
 of one spectator will be allowed on the field until further notice or appro
 ved by Coach Racae. Parents can sign up as an archer or watch as a spectato
 r.<br><br>As of Sept 15\, we have reached the maximum number of kids under 
 12 that we accept into the program this semester. The minimum age to regist
 er is now 12 years old.&nbsp\;<br><br>If you registered by Sept 15\, and ar
 e younger than 12\, you´ll stay in the program and take other Outdoor 1 cla
 sses as needed and later join Outdoor 2.&nbsp\;<br><br>If you are not yet 1
 2\, and you registered and paid after Sept 15\, your fee will be returned t
 o you.<br><br>Juniors may need to take Outdoor 1 two or three times before 
