 as you score on average about 5 pts/end of 3 arrows.&nbsp\;<br>Adults don´t
  need a minimum score to graduate into Outdoor 2.<br><br>ap = accessories p
 acket (armguard\, fingertab\, fingersling)\, which will be needed for Outdo
 or 2. ($15)<br>fp = form pack (stretchband and string loop)\, optional but 
 really needed to practice form\, warm up before classes ($4)<br><br>At the 
 end of each Outdoor 1 class\, your scores will be posted. If we did not fin
 ish a complete round (30 arrows)\, you may not recognize your final score\,
  because it has been averaged by taking your recorded score from your score
