 r name is on the waiting list\, you have a choice of \ncoming to see if a p
 lace opens up at the last minute\, or \nrescheduling your class for another
  date/time. \nWe can only take 10 archers on the shooting line at one time.
  \nThe instructor may also create two shooting lines\, which may increase t
 he length of the class for everyone and decrease the number of arrows every
 one has time to shoot.\nIf you prefer not to be on the waiting list\, pleas
 e reschedule your class for another date.
