DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u><b>UPDATE: With the news
  that Austin/Travis County is now in Stage 5 of COVID-19 risk-based guideli
 nes\, I have made the decision to postpone the start of our archery trainin
 g classes this semester possibly until Austin drops back down to Stage 4.&n
 bsp\;</b><br>I will review the situation weekly on Fridays and postpone wee
 kend and Monday classes\, if Austin is still in Stage 5.&nbsp\;<b>(See my F
 riday email to you.)</b><b><br></b><br>I know this is disappointing to most
  of you - and no one wants to attend the training classes more than I do. I
  love to coach you! My main concern\, however\, as always\, is to keep ever
 yone who attends our classes as safe as possible.&nbsp\;<br><br>Not to worr
 y\, we will start classes soon again!<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &n
 bsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp
 \; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; 
