 STER NOW !<br>This class is open to adults\, juniors\, and parents who have
  taken and graduated out of Outdoor 1: First-time Class and are shooting at
  distances of 9m to 70m. It is a mixed class of different distances.&nbsp\;
 <br>Sign up any time for as many or as few Outdoor 2-9 Classes as you like.
