 able on&nbsp\;<a href="http://www.archerytrainingcenter.com">www.archerytra
 iningcenter.com</a>.<br><br><b>Registered archers </b>at 9m on 40-cm target
  face unless otherwise noted:<br>1.&nbsp\;<b>Lily R</b>.\, 12 - Outdoor 5 a
 t 30m on 122-cm target face - pd - <b>substituted virtual lesson</b><br>2.&
