 es)\nAPR   $ 120 (8 one-hour classes)\nMAY   $ 120 (7 one-hour classes)\n\n
 Adult classes + Wed. 6:30-8:00 at 18m:\nJAN   $ 188 (12.5 hrs available)\nF
 EB   $ 210 (14 hrs available) \nMAR   $ 233 (15.5 hrs available)\nAPR   $ 2
 10 (14 hrs available)\nMAY   $  210 (14 hrs available)\n\nPROGRESSIVE PROGR
 AM Indoor at 18m\nTraining for those who want to progress faster towards co
 mpetitive archery by meeting minimum attendance requirements. (8.5 hrs/week
  available)\nSaturdays 3:30-5:30pm\nSundays:  3:30-5:30pm \nSundays:  6:00-
 7:00pm (Adults and Indoor 5 only)\nTuesdays: 6:30-7:30pm \nTuesdays: 7:30-8
 :30pm (Adults and Indoor 5 only) \nWednesdays: 6:30-8:00pm \n\nPROGRESSIVE 
