DESCRIPTION:For your convenience\, all summer long\, the schedule has opene
 d up!<br><br>Come whenever you want within the time allocated\, and shoot f
 or 1-3+ hours\, in accordance with your strength and experience.<br>There i
 s continuous training with Coach Racae\, but since it´s summer\, we will ch
 allenge ourselves with some archery games!<br><br>It´s going to be a great 
 summer - and cool in the indoor archery range!<br><br>Sign up and pay at <a
  href="http://www.paypal.me/atciaustin">www.paypal.me/atciaustin</a> in adv
 ance to secure your space on the shooting line! (Please write the dates and
  times on your PayPal payment\, and add an extra 4%.)<br><br>PREREQUISITE: 
 INDOOR 1: First-time Class<br>(To register for Indoor 1\, click the Sign Up
  button at the top of <a href="http://www.archerytrainingcenter.com">www.ar
 cherytrainingcenter.com</a>.)<br><br>OPEN to all archers (adults\, juniors\
 , parents) in<br>INDOOR 2 (9m) and<br>INDOOR 3A (13.5m) and<br>INDOOR 4+ (1
 8m)<br><br>Enrollment links at: <a href="http://www.archerytrainingcenter.c
 om/Classes">http://www.archerytrainingcenter.com/Classes</a> (coming soon)<
 br><br>Fees: <br>RECREATIONAL: <br>$20/cl for 1 hr.\, $30 for two hours\, o
 r $40 for 3+ hours!<br>There are also reduced Monthly fees and Progressive 
 fees - <br>Look under "Classes" on our website.<br><br>Your name will be on
  the list below when we receive your fee in advance of the class through <a
  href="http://www.paypal.me/atciaustin">www.paypal.me/atciaustin</a> (Pleas
 e add 4%). When classes are not full\, it's okay to just drop in for the cl
 ass and pay at that time. When you attend\, and the class is near full\, yo
 u should pay at least one class in advance to guarantee you have a place ne
 xt time. You can see the actual attendance by looking at past classes. Scor
 es are also listed\, if you kept score\, which is not required\, except on 
