DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><b>JAN 26 UPDATE: Classes will resume on Feb 
 12. Register for new class dates or substitute dates to make up for previou
 sly postponed classes for which you´ve already paid.</b><b><br></b><u></u><
 br><u></u><u></u><b>JAN 7 UPDATE:&nbsp\;</b>With the news that Austin/Travi
 s County is now in Stage 5 of COVID-19 risk-based guidelines\, I have made 
 the decision to postpone the start of our archery training classes this sem
 ester possibly until Austin drops back down to Stage 4.&nbsp\;<br>I will re
 view the situation weekly on Fridays and postpone classes on the weekend if
  Austin is still in Stage 5.&nbsp\;<br><br>I know this is disappointing to 
 most of you - and no one wants to attend the training classes more than I d
 o. I love to coach you! My main concern\, however\, as always\, is to keep 
 everyone who attends our classes as safe as possible.&nbsp\;<br><br>Not to 
 worry\, we will start classes soon again!<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\
 ; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &
