DESCRIPTION:For your convenience\, all summer long\, the schedule has opene
 d up!\n\nCome whenever you want within the time allocated\, and shoot for 1
 -3+ hours\, in accordance with your strength and experience.\nThere is cont
 inuous training with Coach Racae\, but since it´s summer\, we will challeng
 e ourselves with some archery games!\n\nIt´s going to be a great summer - a
 nd cool in the indoor archery range!\n\nSign up and pay at www.paypal.me/at
 ciaustin in advance to secure your space on the shooting line! (Please writ
 e the dates and times on your PayPal payment\, and add an extra 4%.)\n\nPRE
 REQUISITE: INDOOR 1: First-time Class\n(To register for Indoor 1\, click th
 e Sign Up button at the top of www.archerytrainingcenter.com.)\n\nOPEN to a
 ll archers (adults\, juniors\, parents) in\nINDOOR 2 (9m) and\nINDOOR 3A (1
 3.5m) and\nINDOOR 4+ (18m)\n\nEnrollment links at: http://www.archerytraini
 ngcenter.com/Classes (coming soon)\n\nFees: \nRECREATIONAL: \n$20/cl for 1 
 hr.\, $30 for two hours\, or $40 for 3+ hours!\nThere are also reduced Mont
 hly fees and Progressive fees - \nLook under "Classes" on our website.\n\nY
 our name will be on the list below when we receive your fee in advance of t
 he class through www.paypal.me/atciaustin (Please add 4%). When classes are
  not full\, it's okay to just drop in for the class and pay at that time. W
 hen you attend\, and the class is near full\, you should pay at least one c
 lass in advance to guarantee you have a place next time. You can see the ac
 tual attendance by looking at past classes. Scores are also listed\, if you
  kept score\, which is not required\, except on Master Challenge weeks. PB 
 = Personal Best. You need 230 pts on 40cm target or 240 pts on 60cm target 
 to graduate out of your distance to 13.5m\, and again at 13.5m to get back 
 to 18m (full distance).\n \nRegistered archers:\n          3:00-4:00   4:00
 -5:00   5:00-6:00   6:00-7:00\n1.   \n2. \n3.\n4. \n5. \n6. \n7. \n8. \n9.\
 n10.
