DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u><u></u><b>UPDATE:
  With the news that Austin/Travis County is now in Stage 5 of COVID-19 risk
 -based guidelines\, I have made the decision to postpone the start of our a
 rchery training classes this semester until Austin drops back down to Stage
  4.&nbsp\;</b><br>I will review the situation weekly on Fridays and postpon
 e weekend and Monday classes\, if Austin is still in Stage 5.&nbsp\;<b>(See
  my Friday email to you.)</b><b><br></b><br>I know this is disappointing to
  most of you - and no one wants to attend the training classes more than I 
 do. I love to coach you! My main concern\, however\, as always\, is to keep
  everyone who attends our classes as safe as possible.&nbsp\;<br><br>Not to
  worry\, we will start classes soon again!<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp
 \; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; 
 &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nb
 sp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; <i>Coach Racae
 </i><br>REGISTER NOW !<br>This class is open to adults\, juniors\, and pare
 nts who have taken and graduated out of Outdoor 1: First-time Class and are
  shooting at distances of 9m to 70m. It is a mixed class of different dista
 nces.&nbsp\;<br>Sign up any time for as many or as few Outdoor 2-9 Classes 
 as you like.<br>Register at one of these links depending on your level:<br>
 <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfhDoxxJ9Ce7AtP_RpCukDqlw
 QRYE3f0JWOdCeK2UG97HCHXw/viewform">2022 Winter/Spring Outdoor 2 at 9m and O
 utdoor 3 at 13.5m</a><br><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQL
 SfzAdwWy-f__WYpyNi4-xDg1fqJ320v5jpHRUNxntEM31pu3Q/viewform">2022 Winter/Spr
 ing Outdoor 4-9 at 20m-70m</a><br><br>More information and registration for
 ms are available on&nbsp\;<a href="http://www.archerytrainingcenter.com">ww
 w.archerytrainingcenter.com</a>.<br><br><b>Registered archers </b>at 9m on 
 40-cm target face unless otherwise noted:<br><br><b>Target nos:</b><br>1.&n
 bsp\;<b>Kevin B.\,&nbsp\;</b>Outdoor 6 at 40m on 122-cm target face - pd - 
 <b>substituted virtuals</b><br>2.&nbsp\;<b>Lily R</b>.\, 12 - Outdoor 5 at 
 30m on 122-cm target face - pd - <b>substituted virtuals</b><br>3.&nbsp\;<b
 >Matthew R.\,&nbsp\;</b>adult - Outdoor 4 at 20m on 122-cm target face - pd
  - <b>substituted 3/20</b><br>4.&nbsp\;<b>Christopher N.</b>\, adult - Outd
 oor 3 at 13.5m on 40-cm target face - pd - <b>substituted 2/26</b><br>5.&nb
