DESCRIPTION:First-time class for juniors age 8+\, optionally their parents\
 , and other adults who would like to try archery for the first time and joi
 n in future Junior Olympic Archery Development (JOAD) and Adult Training cl
 asses. This class is a prerequisite for the SUMMER PROGRAM classes. If you 
 have more than one year experience\, contact us for a placement evaluation 
 ($45) instead of attending the Indoor 1 Class.\n(You will be on the waiting
  list after 10 people register - see below.)\n\nRegistered archers:\n1. Wil
 liam\n2. Johannes\n3. Melissa\n4. \n5. \n6. \n7. \n8. \n9. \n10. \n\nWaitin
 g List: \n11. \n\nIf your name is on the waiting list\, you have a choice o
 f \ncoming to see if a place opens up at the last minute\, or \nreschedulin
 g your class for another date/time. \nWe can only take 10 archers on the sh
 ooting line at one time. \nThe instructor may also create two shooting line
 s\, which may increase the length of the class for everyone and decrease th
 e number of arrows everyone has time to shoot.\nIf you prefer not to be on 
 the waiting list\, please reschedule your class for another date.
