 \, fingertab\, fingersling)\, which will be needed for Outdoor 2. ($15)<br>
 fp = form pack (stretchband and string loop)\, optional but really needed t
 o practice form\, warm up before classes ($4)<br><br>At the end of each Out
 door 1 class\, your scores will be posted. If we did not finish a complete 
 round (30 arrows)\, you may not recognize your final score\, because it has
  been averaged by taking your recorded score from your scorecard\, dividing
  by the number of arrows you shot to get an arrow average\, and then multip
 lying that by 30 to get a full round score. After the last class on the wee
 kend\, final scores will also be sent to all Outdoor 1 participants in an e
 mail with more information before your next class.
