 <br>7.<br>8.<br>9.<br>10.<br>11.<br>12.<br><br>SINGLE Class Fees per archer
  for one Indoor 2-6 class:<br>$31 for 1 hr (arrive 30 min after class start
 s or leave 30 min before class ends)<br>$43 for 1.5 hrs<br><br>MULTI-Class 
 Discount Packets<br>  9 hours : $250 (six 1.5-hr classes)<br> 12 hours : $3
 20 (eight 1.5-hr classes)<br> 18 hours : $460 (twelve 1.5-hr classes) <br><
 br>There are 8 places on the shooting line\, and we sometimes have double l
 ines depending on attendance.<br><br>Sign in/out upon arrival/departure<br>
 For single classes\, book and pay in advance.<br>For multi-class discount p
 acks\, pay in advance and book when you are sure of the dates.<br>Coaching 
 and whistle commands at all times.<br>Instruction in the National Training 
 System.<br>Unfair games depending on attendance.<br><br>Please note: Youths
  &lt\;12 y.o. should not shoot more than 100 arrows/day!<br><br>Prerequisit
 es for Indoor 2: <br>Adults: No min. score in Indoor 1 <br>Juniors: 50 pts 
 in Indoor 1<br>Scores needed at 9m to advance to Indoor 3-6 and Outdoor 3-6
 :<br><br>                 On 40-cm                  On 60-cm<br>           
     target face                 target face<br>Indoor 3:          230 pts  
               240 pts           -&gt\; Outdoor 3 at 13.5m<br>Indoor 4:     
      250 pts                260 pts           -&gt\; Outdoor 4 at 18m/20m<b
 r>Indoor 5:          270 pts                280 pts           -&gt\; Outdoo
 r 5 at 30m<br>Indoor 6:          290 pts                300 pts          -&
 gt\;  Outdoor 6 at 40m
