DESCRIPTION:WEEK 7\nCoach Racae (Recurves only)\nThis class is only for adu
 lts at 13.5m and 18m\n\nPREREQUISITE:\nADULT TRAINING AT 9m (230 pts at 9m 
 to graduate to 13.5m)\nINDOOR 1: First-time Class:\n   Click the Sign Up bu
 tton at the top of www.archerytrainingcenter.com\n   Saturdays: 11:00am-1:3
 0pm (Fee: $25/cl)\n   Sundays: 11:00am-1:30pm (Fee: $25/cl)\n\nENROLLMENT L
 INKS at:\nhttp://www.archerytrainingcenter.com/classes\n\nATTENDEES TONIGHT
  (Paid in advance):\n1. Daniel H. (18m) \n2. Kelly K (18m) - no\n3. Christo
 pher (13.5) \n4. Steven H. (18m)\n5. Dave C. (13.5m) \n6. Adrian (13.5m) \n
 7. Melissa (13.5m)\n8. Cassandra (18m) \n9. Michael G (18m) - no\n10. Suzan
 ne J (9m)\n\nPER CLASS FEE: $20/HR \nSundays: 6:00-7:00pm \nTuesdays: 7:30-
 8:30pm \n\nMONTHLY FEES for ADULTS at 18m :\n\nAdult classes ONLY at 18m (T
 ues 7:30-8:30 + Sun 6:00-7:00):\n(Based on coming 6 hrs/month. If there are
  6 hrs or fewer in the month\, the monthly fees are $20/hr.)\nJAN   $ 120 (
 8 one-hour classes)\nFEB   $ 120  (8 one-hour classes)\nMAR  $ 120 (8 one-h
 our classes)\nAPR   $ 120 (8 one-hour classes)\nMAY   $ 120 (7 one-hour cla
 sses)\n\nAdult classes + Wed. 6:30-8:00 at 18m:\nJAN   $ 188 (12.5 hrs avai
 lable)\nFEB   $ 210 (14 hrs available) \nMAR   $ 233 (15.5 hrs available)\n
 APR   $ 210 (14 hrs available)\nMAY   $  210 (14 hrs available)\n\nPROGRESS
 IVE PROGRAM Indoor at 18m\nTraining for those who want to progress faster t
 owards competitive archery by meeting minimum attendance requirements. (8.5
  hrs/week available)\nSaturdays 3:30-5:30pm\nSundays:  3:30-5:30pm \nSunday
 s:  6:00-7:00pm (Adults and Indoor 5 only)\nTuesdays: 6:30-7:30pm \nTuesday
 s: 7:30-8:30pm (Adults and Indoor 5 only) \nWednesdays: 6:30-8:00pm \n\nPRO
 GRESSIVE WEEKLY FEES (after meeting previous week's attendance requirement)
 :\nIndoor 3A at 13.5m: $TBD/wk (min. 4 hrs)\nIndoor 3B at 18m:    $TBD/wk (
 min. 5 hrs)\nIndoor 4 at 18m:      $TBD/wk (min. 6 hrs)\nIndoor 5 at 18m:  
     $TBD/wk (min. 8 hrs)\n\nUSA Archery's Adult Training Program (ATP) foll
 ows a similar path to the Junior Olympic Archery Development (JOAD) program
 . \n\nYour first step is to take an Indoor 1: First-time Class for Adults. 
 Just click the link or the Sign Up button at the top of this website.\n\nEv
 eryone starts out in our Recreational program at 9 meters. As you improve y
 ou progress to 13.5 meters then on to 18 meters indoors. \n\nWe welcome adu
 lt recurve and compound Olympic target archers at all levels of experience.
  \nRecurve archers attend any of the group classes above or book private le
 ssons with Coach Racae or Instructor Dale.\nCompound archers book private l
 essons with Coach Dan.\n\nWhen you decide that you are interested in compet
 ing you'll apply to join USA Archery Level 4 NTS and JDT Coach Alex Meyer's
  Competitive Archery Program (CAP).\n\nExperienced competitive archers need
  to be evaluated by Coach Racae for advanced placement in either the Progre
 ssive Program or recommendation to the Competitive Archery Program with Coa
 ch Alex.\n\nJoin with Google Hangouts: https://plus.google.com/hangouts/_/c
 alendar/M2NkdGhhdDVxNGhmcmcwMGtyYWZ1NGJ0NmtAZ3JvdXAuY2FsZW5kYXIuZ29vZ2xlLmN
 vbQ.r5oo7pf4arjc75j71sh4f2kh4s?hs=121
