DESCRIPTION:REGISTER NOW !<br>More information and registration form availa
 ble on&nbsp\;<a href="http://www.archerytrainingcenter.com">www.archerytrai
 ningcenter.com</a>.<br>Sign up for just one Outdoor 1 class\, because most 
 people graduate out of this class into Outdoor 2 after the first lesson.<br
 ><br>As of Sept 9\, the minimum age to register is 12 years old. If you reg
 istered by this date and are younger than 12\, you´ll stay in the program.&
 nbsp\;<br><br>Juniors may need to take Outdoor 1 two or three times before 
 qualifying to get into Outdoor 2 by scoring 50 pts. You´ll make it as soon 
 as you score on average about 5 pts/end of 3 arrows.&nbsp\;<br><br>Adults d
 on´t need a minimum score to graduate into Outdoor 2.<br><br>Your name will
  be added below and your place reserved after we receive your registration 
 form\, waivers\, AND fee.<br><br>ap = purchased accessories packet\, which 
 will be needed for Outdoor 2.<br><br>At the end of each Outdoor 1 class\, y
 our scores will be posted below. If we did not finish a complete round (30 
 arrows)\, you may not recognize your final score\, because it has been aver
 aged by taking your recorded score from your scorecard\, dividing by the nu
 mber of arrows you shot to get an arrow average\, and then multiplying that
  by 30 to get a full round score. After the last class on the weekend\, all
