DESCRIPTION:Coach Racae (Recurves only)\n\nPREREQUISITE:\nINDOOR 1: First-t
 ime Class:\nClick the Sign Up button at the top of www.archerytrainingcente
 r.com\nSaturdays: 11:00am-1:30pm (Fee: $25/cl)\nSundays: 11:00am-1:30pm (Fe
 e: $25/cl)\n\nENROLLMENT LINKS at:\nhttp://www.archerytrainingcenter.com/ne
 ws\n\nADULT RECREATIONAL CLASSES at Indoor 2-5 and distances (9m\, 13.5m\, 
 18m)\n\nPER CLASS FEE: $20/HR \nSundays: 6:00-7:00pm \nTuesdays: 7:30-8:30p
 m \n\nMONTHLY FEES for ADULTS at 18m :\n\nAdult classes ONLY at 18m (Tues 7
 :30-8:30 + Sun 6:00-7:00):\n(Based on coming 6 hrs/month. If there are 6 hr
 s or fewer in the month\, the monthly fees are $20/hr.)\nAUG   $   40   (2 
 hrs)  \nSEPT $ 120   (7 hrs)\nOCT   $ 120   (7 hrs)\nNOV   $ 120   (7 hrs)\
 nDEC   $   80   (4 hrs)\n\nAdult classes + Wed. 6:30-8:00 at 18m:\nAUG   $ 
  70  (3.5 hrs)\nSEPT $ 207  (11.5 hrs)\nOCT  $ 234  (13 hrs)\nNOV  $ 234  (
 13 hrs) \nDEC  $ 140   (7 hrs)  \n\nPROGRESSIVE PROGRAM Indoor at 18m\nTrai
 ning for those who want to progress faster towards competitive archery by m
 eeting minimum attendance requirements. (8.5 hrs/week available)\nSaturdays
  3:30-5:30pm\nSundays:  3:30-5:30pm \nSundays:  6:00-7:00pm (Adults and Ind
 oor 5 only)\nTuesdays: 6:30-7:30pm \nTuesdays: 7:30-8:30pm (Adults and Indo
 or 5 only) \nWednesdays: 6:30-8:00pm \n\nPROGRESSIVE WEEKLY FEES (after mee
 ting previous week's attendance requirement):\nIndoor 3A at 13.5m: $52/wk (
 min. 4 hrs)\nIndoor 3B at 18m:    $60/wk (min. 5 hrs)\nIndoor 4 at 18m:    
   $66/wk (min. 6 hrs)\nIndoor 5 at 18m:      $80/wk (min. 8 hrs)\n\nUSA Arc
 hery's Adult Training Program (ATP) follows a similar path to the Junior Ol
 ympic Archery Development (JOAD) program. \n\nYour first step is to take an
  Indoor 1: First-time Class for Adults. Just click the link or the Sign Up 
 button at the top of this website.\n\nEveryone starts out in our Recreation
 al program at 9 meters. As you improve you progress to 13.5 meters then on 
 to 18 meters indoors. \n\nWe welcome adult recurve and compound Olympic tar
 get archers at all levels of experience. \nRecurve archers attend any of th
 e group classes above or book private lessons with Coach Racae or Instructo
 r Dale.\nCompound archers book private lessons with Coach Dan or Instructor
  Bailey.\n\nExperienced competitive archers need to be evaluated by Coach R
 acae for advanced placement in either the Progressive Program or recommenda
 tion to the Competitive Archery Program with Coach Alex.\n\nWhen you decide
  that you are interested in competing you'll apply to join USA Archery Leve
 l 4 NTS and JDT Coach Alex Meyer's Competitive Archery Program (CAP).
