DESCRIPTION:Coach Racae (Recurves only)\n\nPREREQUISITE:\nINDOOR 1: First-t
 ime Class:\nClick the Sign Up button at the top of www.archerytrainingcente
 r.com\nSaturdays: 11:00am-1:30pm (Fee: $25/cl)\nSundays: 11:00am-1:30pm (Fe
 e: $25/cl)\n\nENROLLMENT LINKS at:\nhttp://www.archerytrainingcenter.com/ne
 ws\n\nATTENDEES TONIGHT: (Paid in advance)\n1.\n2.\n3.\n4.\n5.\n6.\n7.\n8.\
 n9.\n10.\n\nADULT RECREATIONAL CLASSES at Indoor 2-5 and distances (9m\, 13
 .5m\, 18m)\n\nPER CLASS FEE: $20/HR \nSundays: 6:00-7:00pm \nTuesdays: 7:30
 -8:30pm \n\nMONTHLY FEES for ADULTS at 18m :\n\nAdult classes ONLY at 18m (
 Tues 7:30-8:30 + Sun 6:00-7:00):\n(Based on coming 6 hrs/month. If there ar
 e 6 hrs or fewer in the month\, the monthly fees are $20/hr.)\nJAN   $ 120 
 (8 one-hour classes)\nFEB   $ 120  (8 one-hour classes)\nMAR  $ 120 (8 one-
 hour classes)\nAPR   $ 120 (8 one-hour classes)\nMAY   $ 120 (7 one-hour cl
 asses)\n\nAdult classes + Wed. 6:30-8:00 at 18m:\nJAN   $ 188 (12.5 hrs ava
 ilable)\nFEB   $ 210 (14 hrs available) \nMAR   $ 233 (15.5 hrs available)\
 nAPR   $ 210 (14 hrs available)\nMAY   $  210 (14 hrs available)\n\nPROGRES
 SIVE PROGRAM Indoor at 18m\nTraining for those who want to progress faster 
 towards competitive archery by meeting minimum attendance requirements. (8.
 5 hrs/week available)\nSaturdays 3:30-5:30pm\nSundays:  3:30-5:30pm \nSunda
 ys:  6:00-7:00pm (Adults and Indoor 5 only)\nTuesdays: 6:30-7:30pm \nTuesda
 ys: 7:30-8:30pm (Adults and Indoor 5 only) \nWednesdays: 6:30-8:00pm \n\nPR
 OGRESSIVE WEEKLY FEES (after meeting previous week's attendance requirement
 ):\nIndoor 3A at 13.5m: $TBD/wk (min. 4 hrs)\nIndoor 3B at 18m:    $TBD/wk 
 (min. 5 hrs)\nIndoor 4 at 18m:      $TBD/wk (min. 6 hrs)\nIndoor 5 at 18m: 
      $TBD/wk (min. 8 hrs)\n\nUSA Archery's Adult Training Program (ATP) fol
 lows a similar path to the Junior Olympic Archery Development (JOAD) progra
 m. \n\nYour first step is to take an Indoor 1: First-time Class for Adults.
  Just click the link or the Sign Up button at the top of this website.\n\nE
 veryone starts out in our Recreational program at 9 meters. As you improve 
 you progress to 13.5 meters then on to 18 meters indoors. \n\nWe welcome ad
 ult recurve and compound Olympic target archers at all levels of experience
 . \nRecurve archers attend any of the group classes above or book private l
 essons with Coach Racae or Instructor Dale.\nCompound archers book private 
 lessons with Coach Dan.\n\nWhen you decide that you are interested in compe
 ting you'll apply to join USA Archery Level 4 NTS and JDT Coach Alex Meyer'
 s Competitive Archery Program (CAP).\n\nExperienced competitive archers nee
 d to be evaluated by Coach Racae for advanced placement in either the Progr
 essive Program or recommendation to the Competitive Archery Program with Co
 ach Alex.\n\nJoin with Google Hangouts: https://plus.google.com/hangouts/_/
 calendar/M2NkdGhhdDVxNGhmcmcwMGtyYWZ1NGJ0NmtAZ3JvdXAuY2FsZW5kYXIuZ29vZ2xlLm
 NvbQ.r5oo7pf4arjc75j71sh4f2kh4s?hs=121
