 r.com\nSaturdays: 11:00am-1:30pm (Fee: $25/cl)\nSundays: 11:00am-1:30pm (Fe
 e: $25/cl)\n\nENROLLMENT LINKS at:\nhttp://www.archerytrainingcenter.com/ne
 ws\n\nATTENDEES TONIGHT: (Paid in advance)\n1. Daniel H. (18m)\n2. Boston (
 9m)\n3. Suzanne J. (9m)\n4. Melissa (18m)\n5. Steven H. (18m)\n6. Adrian R.
 \n7. Michael G.\n8.\n9.\n10.\n\nADULT RECREATIONAL CLASSES at Indoor 2-5 an
 d distances (9m\, 13.5m\, 18m)\n\nPER CLASS FEE: $20/HR \nSundays: 6:00-7:0
 0pm \nTuesdays: 7:30-8:30pm \n\nMONTHLY FEES for ADULTS at 18m :\n\nAdult c
 lasses ONLY at 18m (Tues 7:30-8:30 + Sun 6:00-7:00):\n(Based on coming 6 hr
 s/month. If there are 6 hrs or fewer in the month\, the monthly fees are $2
 0/hr.)\nJAN   $ 120 (8 one-hour classes)\nFEB   $ 120  (8 one-hour classes)
 \nMAR  $ 120 (8 one-hour classes)\nAPR   $ 120 (8 one-hour classes)\nMAY   
 $ 120 (7 one-hour classes)\n\nAdult classes + Wed. 6:30-8:00 at 18m:\nJAN  
  $ 188 (12.5 hrs available)\nFEB   $ 210 (14 hrs available) \nMAR   $ 233 (
 15.5 hrs available)\nAPR   $ 210 (14 hrs available)\nMAY   $  210 (14 hrs a
 vailable)\n\nPROGRESSIVE PROGRAM Indoor at 18m\nTraining for those who want
  to progress faster towards competitive archery by meeting minimum attendan
 ce requirements. (8.5 hrs/week available)\nSaturdays 3:30-5:30pm\nSundays: 
  3:30-5:30pm \nSundays:  6:00-7:00pm (Adults and Indoor 5 only)\nTuesdays: 
 6:30-7:30pm \nTuesdays: 7:30-8:30pm (Adults and Indoor 5 only) \nWednesdays
 : 6:30-8:00pm \n\nPROGRESSIVE WEEKLY FEES (after meeting previous week's at
 tendance requirement):\nIndoor 3A at 13.5m: $TBD/wk (min. 4 hrs)\nIndoor 3B
  at 18m:    $TBD/wk (min. 5 hrs)\nIndoor 4 at 18m:      $TBD/wk (min. 6 hrs
 )\nIndoor 5 at 18m:      $TBD/wk (min. 8 hrs)\n\nUSA Archery's Adult Traini
 ng Program (ATP) follows a similar path to the Junior Olympic Archery Devel
 opment (JOAD) program. \n\nYour first step is to take an Indoor 1: First-ti
 me Class for Adults. Just click the link or the Sign Up button at the top o
 f this website.\n\nEveryone starts out in our Recreational program at 9 met
 ers. As you improve you progress to 13.5 meters then on to 18 meters indoor
 s. \n\nWe welcome adult recurve and compound Olympic target archers at all 
 levels of experience. \nRecurve archers attend any of the group classes abo
 ve or book private lessons with Coach Racae or Instructor Dale.\nCompound a
 rchers book private lessons with Coach Dan.\n\nWhen you decide that you are
  interested in competing you'll apply to join USA Archery Level 4 NTS and J
 DT Coach Alex Meyer's Competitive Archery Program (CAP).\n\nExperienced com
 petitive archers need to be evaluated by Coach Racae for advanced placement
  in either the Progressive Program or recommendation to the Competitive Arc
 hery Program with Coach Alex.\n\nJoin with Google Hangouts: https://plus.go
 ogle.com/hangouts/_/calendar/M2NkdGhhdDVxNGhmcmcwMGtyYWZ1NGJ0NmtAZ3JvdXAuY2
 FsZW5kYXIuZ29vZ2xlLmNvbQ.r5oo7pf4arjc75j71sh4f2kh4s?hs=121
