 , and other adults who would like to try archery for the first time and joi
 n in future Junior Olympic Archery Development (JOAD) and Adult Training cl
 asses. This class is a prerequisite for the SUMMER PROGRAM classes. If you 
 have more than one year experience\, contact us for a placement evaluation 
 ($45) instead of attending the Indoor 1 Class.\n(You will be on the waiting
  list after 10 people register - see below.)\n\nRegistered archers:\n1. Cla
 y Br.....\, adult\n2. Charlie Sco..\, adult\n3. Mary Sco...\, adult\n4. Pau
 l Wol..\, adult\n5. Branda Wol..\, adult\n6. Mike Erw..\, adult\n7. Vicky B
 ar....\, adult\n8. \n9. \n10. \n\nWaiting List: \n11. \n\nIf your name is o
 n the waiting list\, you have a choice of \ncoming to see if a place opens 
 up at the last minute\, or \nrescheduling your class for another date/time.
  \nWe can only take 10 archers on the shooting line at one time. \nThe inst
 ructor may also create two shooting lines\, which may increase the length o
 f the class for everyone and decrease the number of arrows everyone has tim
 e to shoot.\nIf you prefer not to be on the waiting list\, please reschedul
 e your class for another date.
