DESCRIPTION:Coach Racae (Recurves only)\n\nPREREQUISITE:\nINDOOR 1: First-t
 ime Class:\nClick the Sign Up button at the top of www.archerytrainingcente
 r.com\nSaturdays: 11:00am-1:30pm (Fee: $25/cl)\nSundays: 11:00am-1:30pm (Fe
 e: $25/cl)\n\nENROLLMENT LINKS at:\nhttp://www.archerytrainingcenter.com/ne
 ws\n\nATTENDEES TONIGHT: (Paid in advance)\n1. Daniel (18m)\n2. Steven H. (
 18m)\n3. Kelly K. (18m)\n4. Cassandra G.\n5. Dave C. (13.5m)\n6. Adrian (13
 .5m)\n7. Melissa (13.5m)\n8. Christopher (13.5m)\n9.\n10.\n\nADULT RECREATI
 ONAL CLASSES at Indoor 2-5 and distances (9m\, 13.5m\, 18m)\n\nPER CLASS FE
 E: $20/HR \nSundays: 6:00-7:00pm \nTuesdays: 7:30-8:30pm \n\nMONTHLY FEES f
 or ADULTS at 18m :\n\nAdult classes ONLY at 18m (Tues 7:30-8:30 + Sun 6:00-
 7:00):\n(Based on coming 6 hrs/month. If there are 6 hrs or fewer in the mo
 nth\, the monthly fees are $20/hr.)\nJAN   $ 120 (8 one-hour classes)\nFEB 
   $ 120  (8 one-hour classes)\nMAR  $ 120 (8 one-hour classes)\nAPR   $ 120
  (8 one-hour classes)\nMAY   $ 120 (7 one-hour classes)\n\nAdult classes + 
 Wed. 6:30-8:00 at 18m:\nJAN   $ 188 (12.5 hrs available)\nFEB   $ 210 (14 h
 rs available) \nMAR   $ 233 (15.5 hrs available)\nAPR   $ 210 (14 hrs avail
 able)\nMAY   $  210 (14 hrs available)\n\nPROGRESSIVE PROGRAM Indoor at 18m
 \nTraining for those who want to progress faster towards competitive archer
 y by meeting minimum attendance requirements. (8.5 hrs/week available)\nSat
 urdays 3:30-5:30pm\nSundays:  3:30-5:30pm \nSundays:  6:00-7:00pm (Adults a
 nd Indoor 5 only)\nTuesdays: 6:30-7:30pm \nTuesdays: 7:30-8:30pm (Adults an
 d Indoor 5 only) \nWednesdays: 6:30-8:00pm \n\nPROGRESSIVE WEEKLY FEES (aft
 er meeting previous week's attendance requirement):\nIndoor 3A at 13.5m: $T
 BD/wk (min. 4 hrs)\nIndoor 3B at 18m:    $TBD/wk (min. 5 hrs)\nIndoor 4 at 
 18m:      $TBD/wk (min. 6 hrs)\nIndoor 5 at 18m:      $TBD/wk (min. 8 hrs)\
 n\nUSA Archery's Adult Training Program (ATP) follows a similar path to the
  Junior Olympic Archery Development (JOAD) program. \n\nYour first step is 
 to take an Indoor 1: First-time Class for Adults. Just click the link or th
 e Sign Up button at the top of this website.\n\nEveryone starts out in our 
 Recreational program at 9 meters. As you improve you progress to 13.5 meter
 s then on to 18 meters indoors. \n\nWe welcome adult recurve and compound O
 lympic target archers at all levels of experience. \nRecurve archers attend
  any of the group classes above or book private lessons with Coach Racae or
  Instructor Dale.\nCompound archers book private lessons with Coach Dan.\n\
 nWhen you decide that you are interested in competing you'll apply to join 
 USA Archery Level 4 NTS and JDT Coach Alex Meyer's Competitive Archery Prog
 ram (CAP).\n\nExperienced competitive archers need to be evaluated by Coach
  Racae for advanced placement in either the Progressive Program or recommen
 dation to the Competitive Archery Program with Coach Alex.\n\nJoin with Goo
 gle Hangouts: https://plus.google.com/hangouts/_/calendar/M2NkdGhhdDVxNGhmc
 mcwMGtyYWZ1NGJ0NmtAZ3JvdXAuY2FsZW5kYXIuZ29vZ2xlLmNvbQ.r5oo7pf4arjc75j71sh4f
 2kh4s?hs=121
