DESCRIPTION:Coach Racae\n\nPREREQUISITES: \nINDOOR 1: First-time Class\,  (
 To register for Indoor 1\, click the Sign Up button at the top of www.arche
 rytrainingcenter.com.) \nINDOOR 2 at 9m\, \nINDOOR 3A at 13.5m\n \nOPEN to 
 all archers (JOAD and Adults) at 18m.\n\nEnrollment links at:\nhttp://www.a
 rcherytrainingcenter.com/news\n\n1. Daniel H. dna\n2. Francisca L.\n3. Mich
 ael G.\n4. Cassandra G. dna\n5. Judson M.\n6. Paige M. dna\n7. Kelly K.\n8.
 \n9.\n10.\n\nTime / Attendance Requirements: \nRECREATIONAL: None \nPROGRES
 SIVE: Must continuously meet the time/attendance requirements to remain in 
 the Progressive Program. Those who fall short of the weekly time/attendance
  requirements will automatically be considered Recreational\, and Recreatio
 nal class fees will apply.  These classes are designed to prepared archers 
 for CAP (Competitive Archery Program).\n\nFees:  \nRECREATIONAL FEES: \nAll
  fees are payable in advance of the Indoor at 18m class to secure your plac
 e in the class: \nTues 6:30-7:30pm: 1-hr class - $20\nWed  6:30-8:00pm: 1.5
 -hr class - $30\nSat   3:30-5:30pm:  2-hr class - $40\nSun  3:30-5:30pm:  2
 -hr class - $40\n+ Enrollment fee: $20 (always due once per semester) \n\nP
 ROGRESSIVE (min. attendance required):  \nIndoor 3B:       $TBD/wk (min. 5 
 hrs)  \nIndoor 4:         $TBD/wk (min. 6 hrs) \nIndoor 5:         $TBD/wk 
 (min. 8 hrs)  \n\nMONTHLY FEES for ADULTS at 18m:\n\nAdult classes only (Tu
 es 7:30-8:30 + Sun 6:00-7:00):\nJAN   $ 120    \nFEB   $ 120 \nMAR   $ 120 
     \nAPR   $ 120      \nMAY   $ 120    \n\nAdult classes + Wed. 6:30-8:00:
 \nJAN   $ 188    \nFEB   $ 210 \nMAR   $ 233    \nAPR   $ 210      \nMAY   
 $ 210   \n\nMONTHLY FEES for JUNIORS at 18m:\nRecreational hourly fees appl
 y. At this level archers should be in the range at least 5 hrs/wk to improv
 e over time. If your schedule allows for this\, you are a Progressive arche
 r\; if not\, you are a Recreational archer.
