DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20220609
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20220610
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;WKST=SU;UNTIL=20220613;BYDAY=SA,SU,TH
DTSTAMP:20261004T164459Z
UID:06sa5ko88ncdh1ons3m3bn6m9v@google.com
CREATED:20220603T213305Z
DESCRIPTION:<br><b>2022 Summer Schedule and Goals for Outdoor 2-9 (9m to 70
 m)</b><br><b><br></b><br><b>Goals by the end of the summer semester (Aug 14
 ):&nbsp\;</b><br>Make a list of what you want to accomplish<b><br></b>&nbsp
 \;<br><b>JUNE</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>2-5</b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\
 ; &nbsp\; Welcome Back: Understanding&nbsp\; NTS Concepts \; Mental Program
 <br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>9-12</b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; NTS Steps 1+2:
  STANCE + NOCK&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\;&nbsp\;<b>16-19&nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b>N
 TS Step 3: HOOK &amp\; GRIP&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; 25/</b><b>26&nbsp\
 ; JUNE ATCI MASTER CHALLENGE TOURNAMENT (Pin Shoot)</b><br><b>JULY</b><br><
 b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;6/30-7/3&nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 4: SET\; NTS Step 5: S
 ET-UP&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;7-10</b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;NT
 S Step 6 DRAW to LOAD&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;<b>14-17&nbsp\;&nbsp
 \;</b>NTS Step 7 ANCHOR&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>21-24&nb
 sp\;&nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 8 TRANSFER to HOLD<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;30/
 31&nbsp\; JULY ATCI MASTER CHALLENGE TOURNAMENT (Pin Shoot)</b><br><b>AUGUS
 T</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;4-7</b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;NT
 S Step 9 EXPAND / AIM&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;11-14</b>&nbsp\; 
 NTS Step 10 RELEASE + FOLLOW-THROUGH<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;<b>18-21</b>
 &nbsp\;<b>&nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 11: FEEDBACK + Putting it all together!<b><br
 >&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>27/28&nbsp\; AUGUST ATCI MASTER CHALLENGE TO
 URNAMENT (Pin Shoot)</b><br><br>Each week the focus of your lessons will be
  on particular Steps of Shooting of the NTS (National Training System) shot
  cycle\, to help you focus and improve your form\, which\, as we all know\,
  leads to greater and consistent precision (tight groups of arrows) and ult
 imately greater accuracy (tight groups of arrows dead center).<br><br>Your 
 goal is always to replicate the NTS step(s) mindfully and consistently on e
 very shot. If you stay in the present just doing what you need to do as you
  need to it\, your conscious mind will be occupied\, instead of random thou
 ghts entering your head or you being distracted by emotional or environment
 al elements. You´ll need to build up your mental program alongside your for
 m knowledge\, so when your body is trained to shoot excellent shots\, your 
 self image and subsonscious support you\, instead of undermining you. Confi
 dence and consistency in form and mind are major goals.<br><br>You do not n
 eed to score in every class. In fact\, it would be more beneficial to you i
 f you scored only during Master Challenge Tournament Weeks\, which happen t
 he last week of each month. This is because working on the NTS Steps of Sho
 oting (your form) is more easily done without the distraction of the target
  face or scoring\, and you will improve faster.<br><br>As you reach higher 
 levels\, you will learn the NTS Steps in progressively greater detail.<br>T
 he NTS Steps are cumulative with each step most successfully completed if t
 he previous steps have been completed well.&nbsp\;<br><br>Your ability to l
 earn and understand the NTS Steps\, and use deep focus on these Steps while
  shooting outdoors and while using your stretchband/string loop at home to 
 reinforce form poisitions will propel you to higher levels fast!
