 <br>6. Jed K.\, parent 9m<br>7. Sloane K.\, JOAD 9m<br>8. Lauren M.\, Adult
  18m<br>9. Robert H.\, Adult 9m<br>10. Emma W.\, JOAD 18m<br>11. Sarah X.\,
  JOAD 18m
