DESCRIPTION:Please look at the website calendar before coming to class\, in
  case there are changes or cancellations.\n\nPREREQUISITE: INDOOR 1: First-
 time Class\nThese classes are for JUNIOR archers and their parents who have
  taken and qualified in the Indoor 1: First-time Class by scoring at least 
 50 pts at 9m. (Click the Sign Up button on the website to register for Indo
 or 1: First-time Class.)\n\nPARENTS \ncan enroll and shoot with their child
 (ren) in the above classes\, provided they have also taken an Indoor 1: Fir
 st-time Class.\n\nPLEASE COMPLETE ONE ENROLLMENT FORM FOR EACH ARCHER.\nEnr
 ollment forms will be emailed to you after your Indoor 1: First-time Lesson
 .\n\nDATES:          August 23 - December 14\, 2014\n\nCAPACITY:    10 arch
 ers per class\nAGES:            8 - 18 years old \nDISTANCES:  9m\, 13.5m\,
  18m\n\nCLASS SCHEDULE and COACHES / INSTRUCTORS:\n(Read enrollment info be
 low)\nSaturdays: 12:00-1:30 and 2:00-3:30 USA Archery Level 2 Instructor Lu
 ke\nSundays: 12:00-1:30 and 2:00-3:30 USA Archery Level 1 Instructor Chloe\
 nTues / Wed / Thurs / Fri: 2:00-3:30 (Home School) : USA Archery Level 3 NT
 S Coach Racae\nTues / Thurs: 5:30-7:00: USA Archery Level 3 NTS Coach Racae
 \nWed: 5:30-7:00: USA Archery Level 2 Instructor Dale\n\nDAYS CLOSED:\nSEPT
 . 1\, Labor Day\nSEPT. 30\, Range closed\nOCT. 31\, Halloween\nNOV. 26-30\,
  Thanksgiving\nDEC. 15 - Jan. 3\, Christmas / New Year's\n\nENROLLMENT IS O
 N A FIRST-RECEIVED AND PAID BASIS.\nAn enrollment form must be completed an
 d your payment received in order for you to be enrolled and a place reserve
 d for you.\nYou can enroll any time during the semester for as many or as f
 ew classes as you like as long as there are places open.\nSo\, for example\
 , you can enroll for the entire semester\, each month\, or sprinkle the day
 s throughout the semester depending on your schedule. (Please bear in mind\
 , however\, you'll progress faster with regular attendance.)\n\nREFUNDS\, C
 REDITS\, and SUBSTITUTIONS:\nThere are no refunds or credits for paid days 
 missed Aug. 23 - Dec. 14\, 2014\, except in the case of injury\, long-term 
 illness\, unforeseen move out of the Austin area\, or if we cancel a class.
  If\, however\, you let us know that you will miss a class\, you can substi
 tute another class as long as there are places left in that class during th
 e Fall 2014 semester.\n\nIn the case of physical injury or long-term illnes
 s\, we require a doctor's note saying the archer is unable to practice arch
 ery\, and then a doctor's note saying the archer is fit to return to archer
 y\, before the archer will be allowed back in class.\n\nATTENDANCE RECOMMEN
 DATIONS in order to improve: \nINDOOR 2 at 9m :        One or two 1.5-hr cl
 asses per week.\nINDOOR 3A at 13.5m : Two 1.5-hr classes per week.\nINDOOR 
 3B at 18m :    Two or three 1.5-hr classes per week.\n\nMINIMUM ENROLLMENT:
 \nClasses will be held only if there are 5 or more archers enrolled in the 
 class. \nIf the class does not make this minimum enrollment requirement\, y
 ou will be notified at least one week in advance\, so you can reschedule.\n
 \nHOW DO I ADVANCE?\nYou'll be trained in Indoor 2 at 9m until you score 24
 0 pts and master certain NTS* Shot Cycle positions\, then you'll move back 
 to 13.5m in Indoor 3A until you score 240 pts and master more NTS Shot Cycl
 e positions\, and then to 18m in Indoor 3B until you score 200 pts. twice a
 nd master more NTS Shot Cycle positions. After that you'll be in Indoor 4: 
 Advanced Recreational with Coach Racae!\n\nFEES:\nAll fees are payable in a
 dvance of the class to secure your place in the class.\n$21 / class\, if pa
 id on or before August 3\, 2014 \n$22 / class\, if paid on or before August
  24\, 2014 \n$23 / class\, if paid after August 24\, 2014.\n\n+ Enrollment 
 fee: $20 (always due once per semester)\n\nHOW MUCH DO I OWE? \nMultiply th
 e number of classes x the appropriate fee above.\nAdd the $20 semester enro
 llment fee\n\nHOW DO I PAY IN ADVANCE (after I submit the enrollment form)?
 \nPay the total by Paypal using e-mail address: racae@aajoad.com.\nWe also 
 accept checks and credit cards in person at the indoor range.\nPlease make 
 your check payable to "Archery Training Center\, Inc." and give it to us at
  JOAD* or mail it to us at:\nArchery Training Center\, Inc.\, PO Box 93216\
 , Austin\, TX 78709-3216\n\nSAFE SPORTS:\nParents please note we are part o
 f the US Olympic Committee's Safe Sport program\, so we minimally require o
 ne other adult besides the instructor to be present at all times. Please pl
 an to stay with your child or take turns with other parents staying wheneve
 r necessary to fulfill this requirement. THANKS!\n\nINDOOR 2/3 WAIVERS:\nPl
 ease fill out\, sign\, and return the Photo\, Medical\, and Supervision Rel
 eases attached to the e-mail you received with the enrollment form link..\n
 \nQUESTIONS?\nE-mail us at racae@archerytrainingcenter.com or\nCall us at 5
 12 436 8813\n\n*NTS = National Training System\n*JOAD = Junior Olympic Arch
 ery Development
