 oach Nike\, Instructor Lily\, Christine\, Finn\,  Javier\, Ted<br><br>You w
 ill be shooting at 13.5m on 60-cm target face until your form and groups ti
 ghten up\, and you shoot 240 pts to move back to 18m again unless you have 
 already scored 110 pts on the 40-cm target face at 18m.<br><br>Those who sc
 ored 110 pts/round by Oct 6 stay at 18m:  <br>Abby\, Ananya\, Christine\, D
 aisy\, Erika\, Finn\, Gianna\, Jacqui\, Javier\, Coach Joel\, Joseph\, Kish
 ore\, Instructor Lily\, Coach Nick\, Pranav\, Rhys\, Yugan<br><br>Field wor
 k: This weekend\, Targets 9 + 10 will need to be moved to 13.5m\, spectator
 s may be painting the enclosure fence\, and we will be adding lane numbers 
 to the shooting line.<br><br>Target Assignments:<br><br>Targets 1 should al
 ways stay at 70m so Jake can shoot.<br>Target 2 at 60m<br>Target 3 at 40m<b
 r>Target 4 at 30m<br>Targets 5-8 at 18m <br>Targets 9 + 10 at 13.5m<br>See 
 notes below list.<br><br>Target Assignments:<br><br>-----------------------
 -----------<br>1A. (70m)<br>1B<br><br>2A. (60m)  <br>2B<br><br>3A. (40m)  <
 b>Joel Y.</b>\, Adult\, USAA\, OB\, pd - <b>DNS</b><br>--------------------
 --------------<br>3B<br><br>4A. (30m)  <br>4B <b>Finn E</b>\, 12\, USAA\, O
 B\, pd - <b>260 pts</b><br>----------------------------------<br><b>18m 40-
 cm:</b><br><br>5A. <b>Joseph F</b>.\, 14\, USAA\, OB\, pd - <b>151 pts</b><
 br>5B. <b>Pranav C.</b> 15\, USAA\, OB\, pd - <b>155 pts</b><br><br>6A. <b>
