 pd (moved to Oct 2nd)<br>2. Colby K.\, USAA\, paid - changed to private les
 son<br>3. <br>4.<br>5.<br>6.<br>7.<br>8.<br>9.<br>10.<br>11.<br>12.<br><br>
 SINGLE Class Fees per archer for one Indoor 2-6 class:<br>$31 for 1 hr (arr
 ive 30 min after class starts or leave 30 min before class ends)<br>$43 for
