DESCRIPTION:After you graduate out of Indoor 1\, sign up for 2026 INDOOR 2-
 6 at 9m Registration Form until you score  240 pts on the 60-cm target face
  or 230 pts on the 40-cm target face. Then you will graduate to our outdoor
  classes !\n\nAfter you graduate to Outdoor 3-9\, you will be granted acces
 s to the ATCI Calendar via an email from Coach Racae\, and can just add you
 r name under Registered Archers below.\n\nSCHEDULE :\n​Register for ​​as ma
 ny as your schedule and budget allows to progress faster:\nSat/Sun   4:30-6
 :00 pm  \nWed         5:00-6:30 pm (Juniors < 15 + parents)\n              
    6:30-8:00 pm\nThurs       6:30-8:00 pm\n\nAlways check this calendar jus
 t before driving to class in case there are last-minutes changes or cancell
 ations!\n\nUSA Archery Level 4 NTS Coach Racae Meyer unless otherwise noted
  above.\n\nThe level of each attending archer is noted next to their name b
 elow\, to help you decide which classes to join. (Example: Indoor 2 or more
  advanced are Outdoor 3+ (O4 @20m\, etc.)\n\nRegistered archers:\n1.  Krist
 i H-L.\, adult\, pd (Indoor 2)\n2.  Rob L.\, adult\, pd (Indoor 2)\n3. Jack
 ie L.\, 13\, on 60-cm target face\, pd (Indoor 2)\n4. Ethan N\, adult (O6 @
 40m) (7/12)\n5. Colby Keith\, adult\, (O7 @50m)\n6. Adrianne M. adult (O7 @
 50m)\n7.\n8.\n9.\n10.\n11.\n12.\n\n\nSINGLE Class Fees per archer for one I
 ndoor 2-6 class\nBook and pay in advance.\n$30 for 1 hr (book a 1-hr class\
 , or arrive 30 min after a 1.5-hr class starts or leave 30 min before class
  ends)\n$45 for 1.5-hr class\n\n\nMONTHLY Discount Fee Packs\nPay before th
 e 1st of each month\; book dates within the month\n1 class/wk:      $218 (7
 .5 hrs\; 5 classes/mo)\n2 classes/wk: $372 (13.5 hrs\; 9 classes/mo)\n3 cla
 sses/wk: $557 (21 hrs\; 14 classes/mo)\n4 classes/wk: $675 (27 hrs\; 18 cla
 sses/mo)\n5 classes/wk: $792 (33 hrs\; 22 classes/mo)\n\nMULTI-CLASS Discou
 nt Packets\nPay in advance and book when you're sure of the dates.\n  9 hou
 rs : $257 (6 classes)\n 12 hours : $330 (8 classes)\n 18 hours : $477 (12 c
 lasses) \n 23 hours: $587 (15 classes)\n 27 hours: $675 (18 classes)\n\nThe
 re are 8 places on the shooting line\, and we sometimes have double lines d
 epending on attendance.\n\nSign in/out upon arrival/departure\nCoaching and
  whistle commands at all times.\nInstruction in the National Training Syste
 m.\nUnfair games depending on attendance.\nPlease note: Youths <12 y.o. sho
 uld not shoot more than 100 arrows/day!\n\nPrerequisites for Indoor 2: \nAd
 ults: No min. score in Indoor 1 \nJuniors: 50 pts in Indoor 1\nScores neede
 d at 9m to advance to Indoor 3-6 and Outdoor 3-6:\n\n                 On 40
 -cm                  On 60-cm\n               target face                 t
 arget face\nIndoor 3:          230 pts                240 pts           -> 
 Outdoor 3 at 13.5m\nIndoor 4:          250 pts                260 pts      
      -> Outdoor 4 at 18m/20m\nIndoor 5:          270 pts                280
  pts           -> Outdoor 5 at 30m\nIndoor 6:          290 pts             
    300 pts          ->  Outdoor 6 at 40m
