 rn<br>Understanding groups will get tighter as form improves and draw weigh
 t increases<br>Think the same thoughts on every shot&nbsp\;<br>Say the shot
  cycle\; no backtracking\; no multitasking in order to increase efficiency 
 of consistency<br>Tonight: Aiming: Sight/String/Riser<br><b>Homework:</b><b
 r>Being consistent in thought and deed<br>Focusing on one thing and doing i
 t repeatedly until you´ve got it.<br>Complimenting yourself when you achiev
 e your arrow goal
