 ons before your first session at this location.\n\nIf you haven't yet made 
 the 2026 Indoor Competition Team\, but have your own equipment\, and have s
 cored 240 on the 60-cm target face or 230 on the 40-cm target face in a 30-
 arrow indoor round at 9m\, contact Coach Racae.\n\n\nSpace is limited to 12
  archers\, so sign up early and pay the Training Class and Facility Fees in
  advance to secure your place! \n\nCoach Racae will coach this Training Cla
 ss during the holiday break whenever there are at least 5 archers registere
 d.   \n\nTraining Class fee: $52/archer/class\n(1x/wk required to attend Op
 en Practice)\nFacility fee (required each month): $205/month/archer due Nov
  15\, Dec 15\, and Jan 15  (Move out : Feb 15)\nOpen Practice Included in f
 acility fee (1-2x/wk recommended)\nPrivate Lesson fee: $125/hr/archer (2x/m
