DESCRIPTION:Coach Racae (Recurves only)\n\nPrerequisite: Indoor 1: First-ti
 me Class\nClick the Sign Up button at the top of ATCI website to register. 
 \nSaturdays: 11:00am-1:30pm (Fee: $25/cl)\nSundays: 11:00am-1:30pm (Fee: $2
 5/cl)\n\nEnrollment links:\nhttp://www.archerytrainingcenter.com/news\n\nRE
 CREATIONAL ADULT CLASSES at Indoor 2-5 and distances (9m\, 13.5m\, 18m) \nS
 undays: 6:00-7:00pm (Fee: $20/cl) \nTuesdays: 7:30-8:30pm (Fee: $20/cl) \n\
 nPROGRESSIVE PROGRAM Indoor 2-5\nJOAD and ADULT TRAINING for those who want
  to progress faster toward competitive archery by meeting minimum attendanc
 e requirements.\nSaturdays 3:30-5:30pm\nSundays:  3:30-5:30pm \nSundays:  6
 :00-7:00pm (Adults and Indoor 5 only) \nTuesdays: 6:30-7:30pm\nTuesdays: 7:
 30-8:30pm (Adults and Indoor 5 only) \nWednesdays: 6:30-8:00pm \n\nProgress
 ive weekly fees (after meeting previous week's attendance requirement):\nIn
 door 3A at 13.5m: $48/wk (min. 4 hrs)\nIndoor 3B at 18m:    $55/wk (min. 5 
 hrs)\nIndoor 4 at 18m:      $60/wk (min. 6 hrs)\nIndoor 5 at 18m:      $72/
 wk (min. 8 hrs)\n\nUSA Archery's Adult Training Program (ATP) follows a sim
 ilar path to the Junior Olympic Archery Development (JOAD) program. \n\nYou
 r first step is to take an Indoor 1: First-time Class for Adults. Just clic
 k the link or the Sign Up button at the top of this website.\n\nEveryone st
 arts out in our Recreational program at 9 meters. As you improve you progre
 ss to 13.5 meters then on to 18 meters indoors. \n\nWe welcome adult recurv
 e and compound Olympic target archers at all levels of experience. \nRecurv
 e archers attend any of the group classes above or book private lessons wit
 h Coach Racae or Instructor Dale.\nCompound archers book private lessons wi
 th Coach Dan or Instructor Bailey.\n\nWhen you decide that you are interest
 ed in competing you'll apply to join USA Archery Level 4 NTS and JDT Coach 
 Alex Meyer's Competitive Archery Program (CAP).\n\nExperienced competitive 
 archers need to be evaluated by Coach Racae for advanced placement in eithe
 r the Progressive Program or recommendation to the Competitive Archery Prog
 ram with Coach Alex.\n
