DESCRIPTION:Training classes at this location are reserved for competitive 
 and advanced archers.<br><br>If you participated in the 2024 or 2025 Aggie 
 Invitationals\, you are in! You should receive an email with info and instr
 uctions before your first session at this location.<br><br>If you haven't y
 et made the 2026 Indoor Competition Team\, but have your own equipment\, an
 d have scored 240 on the 60-cm target face or 230 on the 40-cm target face 
 in a 30-arrow indoor round at 9m\, contact Coach Racae.<br><br><br>Space is
  limited to 12 archers\, so sign up early and pay the Training Class and Fa
 cility Fees in advance to secure your place! <br><br>Coach Racae will coach
  this Training Class during the holiday break whenever there are at least 5
