DESCRIPTION:After you graduate out of Indoor 1\, sign up for INDOOR 2-6 at 
 9m until you score  240 pts on the 60-cm target face or 230 pts on the 40-c
 m target face. Then you will graduate to our outdoor classes !\n\nAfter you
  graduate to Outdoor 3-9\, you will be granted access to the ATCI Calendar 
 via an email from Coach Racae\, and can just add your name under Registered
  Archers below.\n\nSCHEDULE :\n​Register for ​​as many as your schedule and
  budget allows to progress faster:\nSat/Sun   4:30-6:00 pm  \nTues         
 5:00-6:30 pm and 6:30-8:00 pm\nWed         5:00-6:30 pm and 6:30-8:00 pm (s
 tarts Aug 23)\nThurs       5:00-6:30 pm  and 6:30-8:00 pm\n​Weekdays: Junio
 rs usually come to the 5:00 pm class\, and adults to the 6:30 class\, but a
 ll classes are open to both adults and juniors.\n\nAlways check this calend
 ar just before driving to class in case there are last-minutes changes or c
 ancellations!\n\nUSA Archery Level 4 NTS Coach Racae Meyer unless otherwise
  noted above.\n\nThe level of each attending archer is noted next to their 
 name below\, to help you decide which classes to join. (Example: Indoor 2 o
 r more advanced are Outdoor 3+ (O4 @20m\, etc.)\n\n2025 INDOOR 2-6 at 9m\n\
 nRegistered archers:\n1. Emily C.\, 15\, (Indoor 2)\, pd 1.5 hrs\n2\, Akhil
  V.C.\, 13\, (Indoor 4)\, pd 1.5 hrs\n3. Matt L\, 13\, O4\, pd 1.5 hrs\n4. 
 Girish P.\, adult\, (Indoor 2)\, pd 1.5 hrs\n5. Yuni\, adult\, (Indoor 2)\,
  pd 1.5 hrs\n6.\n7.\n8.\n9.\n10.\n11.\n12.\n\nSINGLE Class Fees per archer 
 for one Indoor 2-6 class:\n$31 for 1 hr (arrive 30 min after class starts o
 r leave 30 min before class ends)\n$43 for 1.5 hrs\n\nMULTI-Class Discount 
 Packets\n  9 hours : $250 (six 1.5-hr classes)\n 12 hours : $320 (eight 1.5
 -hr classes)\n 18 hours : $460 (twelve 1.5-hr classes) \n\nThere are 8 plac
 es on the shooting line\, and we sometimes have double lines depending on a
 ttendance.\n\nSign in/out upon arrival/departure\nFor single classes\, book
  and pay in advance.\nFor multi-class discount packs\, pay in advance and b
 ook when you are sure of the dates.\nCoaching and whistle commands at all t
 imes.\nInstruction in the National Training System.\nUnfair games depending
  on attendance.\n\nPlease note: Youths <12 y.o. should not shoot more than 
 100 arrows/day!\n\nPrerequisites for Indoor 2: \nAdults: No min. score in I
 ndoor 1 \nJuniors: 50 pts in Indoor 1\nScores needed at 9m to advance to In
 door 3-6 and Outdoor 3-6:\n\n                 On 40-cm                  On 
 60-cm\n               target face                 target face\nIndoor 3:   
        230 pts                240 pts           -> Outdoor 3 at 13.5m\nIndo
 or 4:          250 pts                260 pts           -> Outdoor 4 at 18m
 /20m\nIndoor 5:          270 pts                280 pts           -> Outdoo
 r 5 at 30m\nIndoor 6:          290 pts                300 pts          ->  
 Outdoor 6 at 40m
