DESCRIPTION:Since a lot of archers are at the Texas State on Saturday\, Coa
 ch Racae will be not be coaching at the 18m range on Saturday 1/31\,<br>but
  she will coach on Sunday 2/1 at 9:30-12:30 (note later time) \, provided a
 t least five archers register.<br>Please put your names on the calendar now
  for Sunday 2/1.<br>Sunday will be the last training class at the 18m range
  with Coach Racae before the Indoor and JOAD Indoor Nationals on Feb 6-8.<b
 r>There will be some Open Practices during the week with Coach Nick and Joe
 l\, which will be noted on the calendar as usual.<br>If you are not partici
 pating in the Indoor and JOAD Indoor Nationals\, but have registered for it
 \, please make sure to cancel your registration.<br>You can pick up your AT
 CI shirts on Sunday at the 18m range or during the Indoor 2 class on Wed or
  Thurs evenings at the 9m range.<br>We move out of the indoor 18m range the
  following weekend (2/14-15).<br><br>Training classes at this location are 
 reserved for competitive and advanced archers.<br><br>If you participated i
 n the 2024 or 2025 Aggie Invitationals\, you are in! You should receive an 
 email with info and instructions before your first session at this location
 .<br><br>If you haven't yet made the 2026 Indoor Competition Team\, but hav
 e your own equipment\, and have scored 240 on the 60-cm target face or 230 
 on the 40-cm target face in a 30-arrow indoor round at 9m\, contact Coach R
 acae.<br><br>Space is limited to 12 archers\, so sign up early and pay the 
 Training Class and Facility Fees in advance to secure your place! <br><br>C
 oach Racae will coach this Training Class whenever there are at least 5 arc
 hers registered by Fri 10:00 am (for Sat) and Sat 10:00am (for Sun).   <br>
 <br>Training Class fee: $52/archer/class<br>(1x/wk required to attend Open 
 Practice)<br>Facility fee (required each month): $205/month/archer due Nov 
 15\, Dec 15\, and Jan 15  (Move out : Feb 15)<br>Open Practice Included in 
 facility fee (1-2x/wk recommended)<br>Private Lesson fee: $125/hr/archer (2
 x/mo recommended)<br>Please add your name below to register:<br><br>1.<b> L
 uke T</b>\, 17 OB<br>2. <b>Colby </b>K.\, USAA<br>3. <b>Matt L.</b><br>4.<b
 > Sofia W.</b><br>5.<br>6.<br>7.<br>8.<br>9.<br>10<br>11.<br>12.
