DESCRIPTION:After you graduate out of Indoor 1\, sign up for INDOOR 2-6 at 
 9m until you score  240 pts on the 60-cm target face or 230 pts on the 40-c
 m target face. Then you will graduate to our outdoor classes !<br><br>After
  you graduate to Outdoor 3-9\, you will be granted access to the ATCI Calen
 dar via an email from Coach Racae\, and can just add your name under Regist
 ered Archers below.<br><br>SCHEDULE :<br>​Register for ​​as many as your sc
 hedule and budget allows to progress faster:<br>Sat/Sun   4:30-6:00 pm  <br
 >Tues         5:00-6:30 pm and 6:30-8:00 pm<br>Wed         5:00-6:30 pm and
  6:30-8:00 pm (starts Aug 23)<br>Thurs       5:00-6:30 pm  and 6:30-8:00 pm
 <br>​Weekdays: Juniors usually come to the 5:00 pm class\, and adults to th
 e 6:30 class\, but all classes are open to both adults and juniors.<br><br>
 Always check this calendar just before driving to class in case there are l
 ast-minutes changes or cancellations!<br>Look for your name under Registere
 d Archers or Waiting List below. If there are fewer than 4 people registere
 d\, the class may be cancelled at the coach's discretion. In which case you
 'll need to book another date or we will refund your fee..<br><br>USA Arche
 ry Level 4 NTS Coach Racae Meyer unless otherwise noted above.<br><br>The l
 evel of each attending archer is noted next to their name below\, to help y
 ou decide which classes to join. (Example: Indoor 2 or more advanced are Ou
 tdoor 3+ (O4 @20m\, etc.)<br><br>2025 INDOOR 2-6 at 9m<br><br>Registered ar
 chers:<br>1. <b>Raj D.</b>\, adult\, (Indoor 2)\, pd - 1.5 hrs<br>2. <b>JP 
 D.</b>\, 15\, (Indoor 2)\, pd - 1 hr<br>3. <b>Colby K.</b>\, adult\, (O7@50
 m)\, pd - 1.5 hrs<br>4. <b>Anna P\,</b> adult\, (O6@40m)\, pd - 1.5 hrs<br>
 5. <b>Adrianne M</b>\, adult (O7@50m)\, pd - 1.5 hrs<br><br>SINGLE Class Fe
 es per archer for one Indoor 2-6 class:<br>$31 for 1 hr (arrive 30 min afte
 r class starts or leave 30 min before class ends)<br>$43 for 1.5 hrs<br><br
 >MULTI-Class Discount Packets<br>  9 hours : $250 (six 1.5-hr classes)<br> 
 12 hours : $320 (eight 1.5-hr classes)<br> 18 hours : $460 (twelve 1.5-hr c
 lasses) <br><br>There are 8 places on the shooting line\, and we sometimes 
 have double lines depending on attendance.<br><br>Sign in/out upon arrival/
 departure<br>For single classes\, book and pay in advance.<br>For multi-cla
 ss discount packs\, pay in advance and book when you are sure of the dates.
