 et made the 2026 Indoor Competition Team\, but have your own equipment\, an
 d have scored 240 on the 60-cm target face or 230 on the 40-cm target face 
 in a 30-arrow indoor round at 9m\, contact Coach Racae.<br><br><br>Space is
  limited\, so sign up soon and pay the class fees in advance to secure your
  place! We have 3 target stands\, so 6 archers per line. Ideally\, it would
  be best to keep it to 12 archers each session. There are about 21 archers 
 interested. We may need to create a additional class on one of the two week
 end days\, but we'll see how it goes.<br><br>Move-in: Nov 15<br>Fee: $52/cl
 ass/archer for 3 hours !<br>Facility fee: $205/mo due on Nov 15\, Dec. 15\,
  and Jan. 15<br>Move-out will be after the Indoor Nationals about Feb 15.<b
 r><b>Please add your name below to register:</b><br><br><b>1.</b><br><b>2.<
 /b><br><b>3.</b><br><b>4.</b><br><b>5.</b><br><b>6.</b><br><b>7.</b><br><b>
 8.</b><br><b>9.</b><br><b>10</b><br><b>11.</b><br><b>12.</b>
