CREATED:20260110T201757Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><b>WINTER TRAINING PROGRAM - 11 weeks (Jan 3 - Mar 22)</b> <
 /p><p>We will go through the <b>National Training System (NTS) 11 Steps of 
 Shooting</b> and <b>Building Your Mental Program</b> step-by-step during th
 e regular training classes\, covering each one in sequence during the follo
 wing weeks.. </p><p>Learning\, understanding and doing the NTS and building
  a strong mental program are ongoing quests that all archers are continuous
 ly trying to achieve - even at the highest levels !</p><p><b><i>What if you
  miss some of the weeks?</i></b><i>  </i>We'll do our best to catch you up 
 during your next sessions. </p><p><b><i>Also see more important notes below
 \, under the schedule.</i></b></p><p><b>JANUARY</b></p><ul><li><p><b>  Sat 
 Jan 3 - F 9</b>       <b>WELCOME </b>!  Understanding  <b>NTS CONCEPTS</b> 
 especially TRANSFER + <span>NTS Step 1</span><b> STANCE</b></p></li><li><p>
 <b>  Sat 10- F 16  </b><span>NTS Step 2</span><span> </span><b> NOCK +  </b
 ><span>NTS Step 3</span><span> </span><b>HOOK &amp\; GRIP </b><span>+ Build
 ing Your Mental Program</span></p></li><li><p>  <b>Sat 17 - F 23</b>  NTS S
 tep 4<b> SET + </b>Building Your Mental Program</p></li><li><p><b>  Sat 24 
 - F 30 SCORING WEEK - </b><b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT </
 b><b>   </b></p></li></ul><p><b>FEBRUARY</b></p><ul><li><p><b>  Sat 31 - F 
 6    </b>NTS Step 5 <b>SET-UP +</b> Building Your Mental Program</p></li><l
 i><p>  <b>Sat 7 - F 13  </b>  NTS Step 6 <b>DRAW</b> to <b>LOAD </b>+ Build
 ing Your Mental Program</p></li><li><p><b>  Sat 4 - F 20</b>  NTS Step 7 <b
 >ANCHOR </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</p></li><li><p>  <b>Sat 21 - F 2
 7  </b><b>SCORING WEEK - </b><b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR      PIN 
 SHOOT </b><b>     </b></p></li></ul><p><b>MARCH</b></p><ul><li><p><b>Sat 28
  - F 6  </b>NTS Step 8<b> </b><b> TRANSFER to HOLD </b>+ Building Your Ment
 al Program</p></li><li><p><b>Sat 7 - F 13  </b>NTS Step 9<b> </b><b>EXPAND 
 / AIM + </b>Building Your Mental Program</p></li><li><p><b>Sat 14 - F 20 </
 b> NTS Step 10 <b>RELEASE / FOLLOW-THROUGH</b> + NTS Step 11 <b>FEEDBACK +<
 /b> Building Your Mental Program</p></li><li><p><b>Sat 21 + F 22  </b><b>SC
 ORING WEEKEND - </b><b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b></p><
 /li></ul><p><b>INTRO</b></p><p><i>Each week the focus of your lessons will 
 be on one or two particular </i><b><i>Steps of Shooting of the NTS (Nationa
 l Training System) </i></b><i>shot cycle\, to help you focus and improve yo
 ur form\, which\, as we all know\, leads to greater and more consistent pre
 cision (tight groups of arrows) and ultimately greater accuracy (tight grou
 ps of arrows dead center)</i>. <i>Concurrently you will be learning how to 
 build a </i><b><i>strong mental program</i></b><i>\, which will improve you
 r focus\, awareness and confidence for competitions later.</i></p><p><i>The
  NTS is the </i><b><i>most biomechanically efficient and least injurious me
 thod of shooting</i></b><i>\, and is highly and continuously researched out
  at the Elite Athletes Center in Chula Vista\, CA. It is what the Olympians
  do!</i></p><p><i>The 11 NTS Steps are cumulative with each step most succe
 ssfully completed if the previous steps have been completed well. As you re
 ach higher levels\, you will learn the NTS Steps in progressively greater d
 etail.</i></p><p><b>Goals by the end of the winter semester (March 22)</b><
 /p><p>Make a list of what you want to accomplish by the end of the semester
 . Email it to Coach Racae\, so you can discuss it together. </p><p>Confiden
 ce and consistency in form and mind are your two main goals. Replicate the 
 NTS step(s) mindfully and consistently on every shot\, and build a strong m
 ental program that is consistent on every shot. </p><p>Your conscious mind 
 commands your subconscious mind to put your body into position\, after you 
 train your body to be in those positions. When you stay in the present\, ju
 st doing what you need to do as you need to do it\, your conscious mind wil
 l be occupied\, instead of random thoughts entering your head or you being 
 distracted by emotional or environmental elements. </p><p>You´ll need to bu
 ild up your mental program alongside your form knowledge\, so when your bod
 y is trained to shoot excellent shots\, your self image and subconscious su
 pport you\, instead of undermining you. </p><p><i>Improving your training\,
  practicing\, and competition components\, process\, and skills is a perpet
 ual lifetime quest\, which you´ll slowly learn to love. You´ll  realize wha
 t is under your control\, and you'll become your own best coach! Those who 
 find all this fun and enjoy the journey are the ones who win - the champion
 s!</i></p><p><i>I know you can do it -  I'm your biggest fan!</i></p><p><i>
 ​I'm also really looking forward to seeing you improve\, succeed\, and thri
 ve !​</i></p><p><b><i>                                                   Co
 ach Racae<br></i></b></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260517T071556Z
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:FORM FOCUS for INDOOR 2-6
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
