 br></b><br><b>2024 Fall Fees </b><b><br></b><br><b>SINGLE Class Fees per ar
 cher for one Indoor 2-6 class:</b><br>$30 for 1 hr<br>$42 for 1.5 hrs<br><b
 r><b>MULTI-Class Discount Packets</b><br><b>  9 hours :  $243 </b>(six 1.5-
 hr classes)<br> <b>12 hours : $312 </b>(eight 1.5-hr classes)<br> <b>18 hou
 rs : $450 </b>(twelve 1.5-hr classes) <br><br><i>There are 8 places on the 
