 d pay in advance.<br>For multi-class discount packs\, pay in advance and bo
 ok when you are sure of the dates.<br>Coaching and whistle commands at all 
 times.<br>Instruction in the National Training System.<br>Unfair games depe
 nding on attendance.<br><br><b>Registered archers:</b><br><br>1. <b>Miles G
 .</b>\, 12\, on 40-cm target face\, USAA\, OB\, pd <b>257 pts </b> 1.5 hrs<
