 8.\n9.\n10.\n11.\n12.\n\nSINGLE Class Fees per archer for one Indoor 2-6 cl
 ass:\n$31 for 1 hr (arrive 30 min after class starts or leave 30 min before
  class ends)\n$43 for 1.5 hrs\n\nMULTI-Class Discount Packets\n  9 hours : 
 $250 (six 1.5-hr classes)\n 12 hours : $320 (eight 1.5-hr classes)\n 18 hou
 rs : $460 (twelve 1.5-hr classes) \n\nThere are 8 places on the shooting li
 ne\, and we sometimes have double lines depending on attendance.\n\nSign in
 /out upon arrival/departure\nFor single classes\, book and pay in advance.\
