 adult\, pd (Indoor 2)<span>- 1.5 hrs</span><br>9. <br>10.<br>11.<br>12.<br>
 <br>SINGLE Class Fees per archer for one Indoor 2-6 class<br>Book and pay i
 n advance.<br>$30 for 1 hr (book a 1-hr class\, or arrive 30 min after a 1.
 5-hr class starts or leave 30 min before class ends)<br>$45 for 1.5-hr clas
 s<br><br><br>MONTHLY Discount Fee Packs<br>Pay before the 1st of each month
 \; book dates within the month<br>1 class/wk:      $218 (7.5 hrs\; 5 classe
 s/mo)<br>2 classes/wk: $372 (13.5 hrs\; 9 classes/mo)<br>3 classes/wk: $557
