 2 classes) <br> 23 hours: $587 (15 classes)<br> 27 hours: $675 (18 classes)
 <br><br>There are 8 places on the shooting line\, and we sometimes have dou
 ble lines depending on attendance.<br><br>Sign in/out upon arrival/departur
