DESCRIPTION:<b>What we worked on:</b><br>Time management - Prioritize what´
 s urgent and important<br>Use practice as enjoyable downtime \; play some m
 ental games<br>Shoot for as long as you enjoy it<br>Training sessions will 
 be enough focus<br>Enjoy shooting again for a few weeks!<br>Just shoot\; no
  periodization for now\; inform me of what going on<br>Ice on bow arm bicep
  if it hurts\, followed by heat\, and then ice again if it helps<br><b>Home
 work:</b><br>Set time periods for archery\; change Training sessions times 
 if needed<br>Read the Focus Trainng document emailed to you<br>10 sec / 20 
 rest - all or nothing - go by time\, not quantity\n\nJoin with Google Meet:
  https://meet.google.com/hqs-fxrx-uas\n\nLearn more about Meet at: https://
 support.google.com/a/users/answer/9282720
