 ></b><br><br>Review of previous NTS steps.<br><br><br><b>Homework:</b><br><
 ul><li>Read + Watch</li><li>Practice in front of mirror to see positions  <
 /li><li>Video yourself from different positions</li><li>Do "Squeeze Test" <
 /li><li>Use Shot Trainer</li></ul><span><br><b>Transfer:</b><br><ul><li>Sma
 ll movement</li><li>95% back tension</li><li>Makes Holding possible</li></u
 l><br><b>Holding:</b><br><ul><li>Possible because of Transfer</li><li>Perfe
 ct bone alignment to brace the weight of the bow</li><li>Movement of LAN2</
 li><li>Maintain</li><li>Focus</li><li>Tension and direction of LAN2</li><li
 >Increased strength</li><li>Braced inside the bow</li><li>Both physical and
  mental </li><li>Test by doing Squeeze Drill</li><li>Arrow within 2 mm (1/1
 6th") of clicker going off</li></ul><br><b>Still no aiming !</b> </span>\n\
 nJoin with Google Meet: https://meet.google.com/upx-pvsz-ton\n\nLearn more 
 about Meet at: https://support.google.com/a/users/answer/9282720
