DESCRIPTION:<p><b>WINTER TRAINING PROGRAM - 11 weeks (Jan 3 - Mar 22)</b> <
 /p><p>We will go through the <b>National Training System (NTS) 11 Steps of 
 Shooting</b> and <b>Building Your Mental Program</b> step-by-step during th
 e regular training classes\, covering each one in sequence during the follo
 wing weeks.. </p><p>Learning\, understanding and doing the NTS and building
  a strong mental program are ongoing quests that all archers are continuous
 ly trying to achieve - even at the highest levels !</p><p><b><i>What if you
  miss some of the weeks?</i></b><i>  </i>We'll do our best to catch you up 
 during your next sessions. </p><p><b><i>Also see more important notes below
 \, under the schedule.</i></b></p><p><b>JANUARY</b></p><ul><li><p><b>  Sat 
 Jan 3 - F 9</b>       <b>WELCOME </b>!  Understanding  <b>NTS CONCEPTS</b> 
 especially TRANSFER + <span>NTS Step 1</span><b> STANCE</b></p></li><li><p>
 <b>  Sat 10- F 16  </b><span>NTS Step 2</span><span> </span><b> NOCK +  </b
 ><span>NTS Step 3</span><span> </span><b>HOOK &amp\; GRIP </b><span>+ Build
 ing Your Mental Program</span></p></li><li><p>  <b>Sat 17 - F 23</b>  NTS S
 tep 4<b> SET + </b>Building Your Mental Program</p></li><li><p><b>  Sat 24 
 - F 30 SCORING WEEK (Optional) - </b><b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR P
 IN SHOOT </b><b>   </b></p></li></ul><p><b>FEBRUARY</b></p><ul><li><p><b>  
 Sat 31 - F 6    </b>NTS Step 5 <b>SET-UP +</b> Building Your Mental Program
 </p></li><li><p>  <b>Sat 7 - F 13  </b>  NTS Step 6 <b>DRAW</b> to <b>LOAD 
 </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</p></li><li><p><b>  Sat 4 - F 20</b>  NT
 S Step 7 <b>ANCHOR </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</p></li><li><p>  <b>S
 at 21 - F 27  </b><b>SCORING WEEK - </b><b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STA
 R      PIN SHOOT </b><b>     </b></p></li></ul><p><b>MARCH</b></p><ul><li><
 p><b>Sat 28 - F 6  </b>NTS Step 8<b> </b><b> TRANSFER to HOLD </b>+ Buildin
 g Your Mental Program</p></li><li><p><b>Sat 7 - F 13  </b>NTS Step 9<b> </b
 ><b>EXPAND / AIM + </b>Building Your Mental Program</p></li><li><p><b>Sat 1
 4 - F 20 </b> NTS Step 10 <b>RELEASE / FOLLOW-THROUGH</b> + NTS Step 11 <b>
 FEEDBACK +</b> Building Your Mental Program</p></li><li><p><b>Sat 21 + F 22
   </b><b>SCORING WEEKEND - </b><b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHO
 OT</b></p></li></ul><p><b>INTRO</b></p><p><i>Each week the focus of your le
 ssons will be on one or two particular </i><b><i>Steps of Shooting of the N
 TS (National Training System) </i></b><i>shot cycle\, to help you focus and
  improve your form\, which\, as we all know\, leads to greater and more con
 sistent precision (tight groups of arrows) and ultimately greater accuracy 
 (tight groups of arrows dead center)</i>. <i>Concurrently you will be learn
 ing how to build a </i><b><i>strong mental program</i></b><i>\, which will 
 improve your focus\, awareness and confidence for competitions later.</i></
 p><p><i>The NTS is the </i><b><i>most biomechanically efficient and least i
 njurious method of shooting</i></b><i>\, and is highly and continuously res
 earched out at the Elite Athletes Center in Chula Vista\, CA. It is what th
 e Olympians do!</i></p><p><i>The 11 NTS Steps are cumulative with each step
  most successfully completed if the previous steps have been completed well
 . As you reach higher levels\, you will learn the NTS Steps in progressivel
 y greater detail.</i></p><p><b>Goals by the end of the winter semester (Mar
 ch 22)</b></p><p>Make a list of what you want to accomplish by the end of t
 he semester. Email it to Coach Racae\, so you can discuss it together. </p>
 <p>Confidence and consistency in form and mind are your two main goals. Rep
 licate the NTS step(s) mindfully and consistently on every shot\, and build
  a strong mental program that is consistent on every shot. </p><p>Your cons
 cious mind commands your subconscious mind to put your body into position\,
  after you train your body to be in those positions. When you stay in the p
 resent\, just doing what you need to do as you need to do it\, your conscio
 us mind will be occupied\, instead of random thoughts entering your head or
  you being distracted by emotional or environmental elements. </p><p>You´ll
  need to build up your mental program alongside your form knowledge\, so wh
 en your body is trained to shoot excellent shots\, your self image and subc
 onscious support you\, instead of undermining you. </p><p><i>Improving your
  training\, practicing\, and competition components\, process\, and skills 
 is a perpetual lifetime quest\, which you´ll slowly learn to love. You´ll  
 realize what is under your control\, and you'll become your own best coach!
  Those who find all this fun and enjoy the journey are the ones who win - t
 he champions!</i></p><p><i>I know you can do it -  I'm your biggest fan!</i
 ></p><p><i>​I'm also really looking forward to seeing you improve\, succeed
 \, and thrive !​</i></p><p><b><i>                                          
          Coach Racae<br></i></b></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260517T071556Z
