 iors usually come to the 5:00 pm class\, and adults to the 6:30 class\, but
  all classes are open to both adults and juniors.\n\nAlways check this cale
 ndar just before driving to class in case there are last-minutes changes or
  cancellations!\n\nUSA Archery Level 4 NTS Coach Racae Meyer unless otherwi
 se noted above.\n\nThe level of each attending archer is noted next to thei
