UID:3jjncrkkvnkd6b0hned1bv4cdk_R20230415@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;VALUE=DATE:20230416
CREATED:20221103T190047Z
DESCRIPTION:Registrations are on <br><a href="https://www.usarchery.org/eve
 nts/find-an-event">https://www.usarchery.org/events/find-an-event</a><br><a
  href="https://www.usarchery.org/events/event-information/41379">https://ww
 w.usarchery.org/events/event-information/41379</a><br>and<br><a href="http:
 //www.arizonacup.net">www.arizonacup.net</a><br><br><h1>USAT #1 2023 USA AR
 CHERY AAE ARIZONA CUP AND WORLD/PAN AM TEAM TRIALS</h1><p></p><p>World Team
  Trials for Sr. Recurve and Compound as well as Pan Am Trials for Sr. Recur
 ve\, Compound and Para archers will be held in conjunction with the 2023 AA
 E Arizona Cup.  Senior and Para archers must be registered for both AZ Cup 
 and Trials.<br></p><p>The Arizona Cup is an annual outdoor target archery t
 ournament in April\, complying with USA Archery rules. It began in 1989 in 
 Tempe at Arizona State University\, moved to Tucson\, and returned to Phoen
 ix\, Arizona\, in 2001. The Arizona Cup is celebrating its 34th year in 202
 3.</p><p>The 2023 USA Archery AAE Arizona Cup is a USAT Series Qualifier an
 d Stage 1 of the trials for the World Archery Championships\, World Archery
  Para Championships\, Pan Am Games\, and Parapan Am Games for Recurve and C
 ompound. A stand-alone event for the World Archery Youth Championships will
  occur before the 2023 Arizona Cup.<br></p><p><strong><b><u>USA Archery Mem
 bership:</u></b></strong> All USA participants must be a current member of 
 USA Archery. NFAA members may be allowed per USA Archery temporary membersh
 ip policy. See USA Archery website for additional membership information an
 d additional steps to qualify. Please check to see if your membership expir
 es prior to the tournament and renew prior to the tournament. At tournament
  check-in\, please have your current membership card available if needed. <
 /p><p><strong><b><u>Non-USA Membership:</u></b></strong> Must be a current 
 member of another World Archery member association. Your World Archery memb
 er association must be in good financial standing with World Archery before
  you will be allowed to compete.</p><p>EARLY REGISTRATION FEE: $190.00<br><
 br>REGISTRATION FEE AFTER March 24\, 2023: $225.00<br><br></p><p><strong><b
 ><u>Schedule:</u></b></strong> The schedule and format is subject to change
  due to weather delays\, unforeseen conditions\, final registration\, etc. 
 The competition may extend up to sunset on Sunday\, April 16\, 2023. If the
  tournament is stopped before completion\, then the current archer standing
 s at that time may be considered final. Please make sure to plan all travel
  arrangements accordingly.</p><p><strong><b>Wednesday\, April 12</b></stron
 g></p><ul><li>World Archery Youth Championship Trials<br>7:30AM-5:30PM  (mo
 re details to come)</li></ul><p><strong><b>Thursday\, April 13</b></strong>
 </p><ul><li>Unofficial Practice 10:00AM-4:00PM  $15 per archer</li></ul><p>
 <strong><b>Friday\, April 14</b></strong></p><ul><li>8:00-10:15AM – Officia
 l Practice<br>Senior and 50+ Divisions and Equipment Inspection</li><li>10:
 30AM – Qualification<br>Senior and 50+ Divisions with 3 ends of practice</l
 i><li>3:15-5:30PM – Official Practice<br>U21 and U18 Divisions and Equipmen
 t Inspection</li></ul><p><strong><b>Saturday\, April 15</b></strong></p><ul
 ><li>8:00AM – Eliminations<br>Senior &amp\; 50+ Divisions with 2 ends of pr
 actice</li><li>1:00PM – Qualifications<br>U21 and U18 Divisions with 3 ends
  of practice</li></ul><p><strong><b>Sunday\, April 16</b></strong></p><ul><
 li>8:00AM – Eliminations<br>U21 and U18 Divisions with 2 ends of practice*.
 <br>*Through gold medal matches except for U21 Compound and Recurve</li><li
 >2:00-3:00PM- LIVE Gold Medal Matches<br>U21 Recurve Men &amp\; Women\, U21
  Compound Men &amp\; Women – Final order TBA</li></ul><p></p><br><table><tb
 ody><tr><td><h1>LEVEL:</h1></td><td><p>National</p></td></tr><tr><td><h1>AD
 DRESS:</h1></td><td><p>Ben Avery Shooting Facility\, 37016 N. Archery Drive
 \, Phoenix\, Arizona\, United States of America\, 85086</p></td></tr><tr><t
 d><h1>EMAIL:</h1></td><td><p><a href="mailto:azcupinformation@gmail.com">az
 cupinformation@gmail.com</a></p></td></tr><tr><td><h1>CONTACT:</h1></td><td
 ><p>+1 480-331-1517</p></td></tr><tr><td><h1>START DATE:</h1></td><td><p>04
 /14/2023</p></td></tr><tr><td><h1>END DATE:</h1></td><td><p>04/16/2023</p><
 /td></tr><tr><td><h1>DISCIPLINES:</h1></td><td><p>Barebow (Recurve)\, Compo
 und\, Para Compound\, Para Recurve\, Para V.I.\, Para W1 and Recurve</p></t
 d></tr></tbody></table>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260517T065836Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:USAT #1: Arizona Cup + World Youth Championship Trials in Phoenix
