DESCRIPTION:Training classes at this location are reserved for competitive 
 and advanced archers.\n\nIf you participated in the 2024 or 2025 Aggie Invi
 tationals\, you are in! You should receive an email with info and instructi
 ons before your first session at this location.\n\nIf you haven't yet made 
 the 2026 Indoor Competition Team\, but have your own equipment\, and have s
 cored 240 on the 60-cm target face or 230 on the 40-cm target face in a 30-
 arrow indoor round at 9m\, contact Coach Racae.\n\nSpace is limited to 12 a
 rchers\, so sign up early and pay the Training Class and Facility Fees in a
 dvance to secure your place! \n\nCoach Racae will coach this Training Class
  whenever there are at least 5 archers registered by Fri 10:00 am (for Sat)
  and Sat 10:00am (for Sun).   \n\nTraining Class fee: $52/archer/class\n(1x
 /wk required to attend Open Practice)\nFacility fee (required each month): 
 $205/month/archer due Nov 15\, Dec 15\, and Jan 15  (Move out : Feb 15)\nOp
 en Practice Included in facility fee (1-2x/wk recommended)\nPrivate Lesson 
 fee: $125/hr/archer (2x/mo recommended)\nPlease add your name below to regi
 ster:\n\n1. Sara T\, 15 \n2. Chi C (9/12)\, adult\, USAA\n3. Logan C (10/12
 )\, 9\, USAA\n4. Emma A.\, 14\n5. Finn E\n6. Rhys E\n7. Nick E\n8. Adrianne
  M.\n9.\n10\n11.\n12.
