 ail which tournaments you have participated in and your placements.\n\nPare
 nts: We are part of the US Olympic Committee's Safe Sport program\, so we m
 inimally require 2 adults to be present at all times. Please plan to stay w
 ith your child whenever necessary to fulfill this requirement.
