 Waiting List:  \n11.  Michelle R.\, mom\n12.   \nIf your name is on the wai
 ting list\, you have a choice of  coming to see if a place opens up at the 
 last minute\, or  rescheduling your class for another date/time.  We can on
 ly take 10 archers on the shooting line at one time.  If you prefer not to 
 be on the waiting list\, please reschedule your class for another date.
