DESCRIPTION:PREREQUISITE: INDOOR 1: First-time Class<br>(To register for In
 door 1\, click the Sign Up button at the top of <a href="http://www.archery
 trainingcenter.com">www.archerytrainingcenter.com</a>.)<br><br>OPEN to Juni
 ors/Parents in<br>INDOOR 2 (9m) and<br>INDOOR 3A (13.5m) <br><br>Enrollment
  links at: <a href="http://www.archerytrainingcenter.com/Classes">http://ww
 w.archerytrainingcenter.com/Classes</a><br><br>Fees: <br>RECREATIONAL: <br>
 $20/cl for 1 hr\; $30/cl for 2 hrs\; $40/cl for 3 hrs ON THE SAME DAY.<br>T
 here are also reduced Monthly fees when you regularly come to more than 3 h
 rs/week and Progressive fees when you are at 18m and regularly come to more
  than 5 hrs/week. Ask Coach Racae for more information.<br><br>Your name wi
 ll be on the list below when we receive your registration form and fee in a
 dvance of the class. When you attend\, and the class is near full\, you sho
 uld pay at least one class in advance to guarantee you have a place on the 
 shooting line next time. <br><br>When classes are not full\, it's okay to j
 ust drop in occasionally for the class and pay at that time. However it is 
 difficult to tell how many people will be dropping in\, so to secure your p
 lace\, it is better to register and pay in advance to prevent overcrowding.
  We can only take 10 people on the shooting line at one time. <br><br>When 
 we have more than 10 archers\, we will form a second line\, as in a tournam
 ent\, which will reduce the number of arrows shot per person within the tim
 e. (You can see the actual attendance and class composition by looking at p
 ast classes at <a href="http://www.archerytrainingcenter.com/calendar">www.
 archerytrainingcenter.com/calendar</a>.)<br><br>Scores are also listed belo
 w\, if you kept score\, which is not required\, except on Master Challenge 
 weeks.  You need 230 pts on 40cm target or 240 pts on 60cm target to gradua
 te out of your distance into Indoor 3A 13.5m\, and again at 13.5m to get in
 to Indoor 3B at 18m (full distance).<br>PB = Personal Best. <br><br>Registe
 red archers:<br>1. Zoë C.\, JOAD 13.5m\, paid - DNA<br>2. Sarah X.\, JOAD 1
 8m paid&nbsp\;<br>3. Emma W.\, JOAD 18m - paid<br>4. <br>5. <br>6. <br>7. <
 br>8. <br>9.<br>10.
