CREATED:20220603T213305Z
DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><br><b>2022 Summer Schedule and Goals for Outdoor 2-
 9 (9m to 70m)</b><br><b><br></b><br><b>Goals by the end of the summer semes
 ter (Aug 14):&nbsp\;</b><br>Make a list of what you want to accomplish<b><b
 r></b>&nbsp\;<br><b>JUNE</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>2-5</b>&nb
 sp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; Welcome Back: Understanding&nbsp\; NTS Concepts \; Men
 tal Program<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>9-12</b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; NTS
  Steps 1+2: STANCE + NOCK&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\;&nbsp\;<b>16-19&nbsp\; &
 nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 3: HOOK &amp\; GRIP&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; 25/</b>
 <b>26&nbsp\; JUNE ATCI MASTER CHALLENGE TOURNAMENT (Pin Shoot)</b><br><b>JU
 LY</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;6/30-7/3&nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 4: SET\; NT
 S Step 5: SET-UP&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;7-10</b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\
 ; &nbsp\;NTS Step 6 DRAW to LOAD&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;<b>14-17&
 nbsp\;&nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 7 ANCHOR&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b>
 <b>21-24&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 8 TRANSFER to HOLD<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\;
  &nbsp\;30/31&nbsp\; JULY ATCI MASTER CHALLENGE TOURNAMENT (Pin Shoot)</b><
 br><b>AUGUST</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;4-7</b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\
 ; &nbsp\;NTS Step 9 EXPAND / AIM&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;11-14<
 /b>&nbsp\; NTS Step 10 RELEASE + FOLLOW-THROUGH<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;<
 b>18-21</b>&nbsp\;<b>&nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 11: FEEDBACK + Putting it all toge
 ther!<b><br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>27/28&nbsp\; AUGUST ATCI MASTER C
 HALLENGE TOURNAMENT (Pin Shoot)</b><br><br>Each week the focus of your less
 ons will be on particular Steps of Shooting of the NTS (National Training S
 ystem) shot cycle\, to help you focus and improve your form\, which\, as we
  all know\, leads to greater and consistent precision (tight groups of arro
 ws) and ultimately greater accuracy (tight groups of arrows dead center).<b
 r><br>Your goal is always to replicate the NTS step(s) mindfully and consis
 tently on every shot. If you stay in the present just doing what you need t
 o do as you need to it\, your conscious mind will be occupied\, instead of 
 random thoughts entering your head or you being distracted by emotional or 
 environmental elements. You´ll need to build up your mental program alongsi
 de your form knowledge\, so when your body is trained to shoot excellent sh
 ots\, your self image and subsonscious support you\, instead of undermining
  you. Confidence and consistency in form and mind are major goals.<br><br>Y
 ou do not need to score in every class. In fact\, it would be more benefici
 al to you if you scored only during Master Challenge Tournament Weeks\, whi
 ch happen the last week of each month. This is because working on the NTS S
 teps of Shooting (your form) is more easily done without the distraction of
  the target face or scoring\, and you will improve faster.<br><br>As you re
 ach higher levels\, you will learn the NTS Steps in progressively greater d
 etail.<br>The NTS Steps are cumulative with each step most successfully com
 pleted if the previous steps have been completed well.&nbsp\;<br><br>Your a
 bility to learn and understand the NTS Steps\, and use deep focus on these 
 Steps while shooting outdoors and while using your stretchband/string loop 
 at home to reinforce form poisitions will propel you to higher levels fast!
 </html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260517T071146Z
