DESCRIPTION:<p>The <b>SUMMER TRAINING PROGRAM (May 31-Aug 30)</b> is a cond
 ensed program\, meaning that we will go through the <b>National Training Sy
 stem 11 Steps of Shooting</b> and <b>Building Your Mental Program</b> much 
 faster than during the Fall and Winter/Spring semesters. </p><p>Learning\, 
 understanding and doing the NTS and building a strong mental program are on
 going quests that all archers are continuously trying to achieve - even at 
 the highest levels !<br></p><p><i><b>What if you miss some of the weeks </b
 >because you're on vacation or at camp?  </i>We'll do our best to catch you
  up during your next sessions. </p><p><b>JUNE</b><br></p><ul><li><b> Sat Ma
 y 31 - Th June 5</b>       <b>WELCOME </b>!  Understanding  <b>NTS CONCEPTS
 </b> especially TRANSFER + NTS Step 1:<b> STANCE</b><b> + </b>NTS Step 2: <
 b> NOCK</b><b> </b></li><li><b> Sat June 7 - Th 12   </b>NTS Step 3: <b>HOO
 K &amp\; GRIP </b><b>+ </b>Building Your Mental Program </li><li> <b>Sat 14
  - Th 19</b>   NTS Step 4:<b> SET</b><b> + </b>+ Building Your Mental Progr
 am</li><li><b> Sat 21 - Th 26  </b>NTS Step 5:<b> SET-UP </b><b>+</b> Build
 ing Your Mental Program</li><li><b> Sat 28 - Th July 3  </b><b>ATCI MONTHLY
  COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b><b> </b><b>   </b></li></ul><p></p><p><b
 >JULY</b><br></p><ul><li><b>  Sat July 5 - Th 10</b><b>  </b>NTS Step 6 <b>
 DRAW</b> to <b>LOAD </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li><li>  <b>Sat 12 
 - Th 17  </b>NTS Step 7  <b>ANCHOR </b>+ Building Your Mental Program  </li
 ><li><b>  Sat 19 - Th 24</b> NTS Step 8  <b>TRANSFER</b><b> to HOLD </b>+ B
 uilding Your Mental Program</li><li>  <b>Sat 26 - Th 31 </b><b>ATCI MONTHLY
  COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b><b>  </b></li></ul><p></p><p><b>AUGUST</
 b><br></p><ul><li><b>Sat Aug  2 - Th 7   </b>NTS Step 9<b style="font-weigh
 t: bold\;"> EXPAND / AIM </b><b style="font-weight: bold\;">+ </b><b>Buildi
 ng Your Mental Program   </b><br></li><li><b>Sat 9 - Th 14 </b> NTS Step 10
  <b>RELEASE / FOLLOW-THROUGH</b> + Building Your Mental Program</li><li><b>
 Sat 16 - Th 21</b>  NTS Step 11 <b>FEEDBACK</b>+ Building Your Mental Progr
 am</li><li><b>Sat 23 - Th 28  </b><b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN 
 SHOOT</b></li></ul><p></p><p><b>Sat\, August 30 - FALL TRAINING PROGRAM sta
 rts. </b></p><p><b>INTRO</b></p><p><i>Each week the focus of your lessons w
 ill be on one or two particular <b>Steps of Shooting of the NTS (National T
 raining System) </b>shot cycle\, to help you focus and improve your form\, 
 which\, as we all know\, leads to greater and more consistent precision (ti
 ght groups of arrows) and ultimately greater accuracy (tight groups of arro
 ws dead center)</i>. <i>Concurrently you will be learning how to build a <b
 >strong mental program</b>\, which will improve your focus\, awareness and 
 confidence for competitions later.</i></p><p><i>The NTS is the <b>most biom
 echanically efficient and least injurious method of shooting</b>\, and is h
 ighly and continuously researched out at the Elite Athletes Center in Chula
  Vista\, CA. It is what the Olympians do!</i></p><p><i>The 11 NTS Steps are
  cumulative with each step most successfully completed if the previous step
 s have been completed well. </i><i>As you reach higher levels\, you will le
 arn the NTS Steps in progressively greater detail.</i></p><p><b>Goals by th
 e end of the summer semester (Aug 29)</b></p><p>Make a list of what you wan
 t to accomplish by the end of the semester. Email it to Coach Racae\, so yo
 u can discuss it together. </p><p>Confidence and consistency in form and mi
 nd are your two main goals. Replicate the NTS step(s) mindfully and consist
 ently on every shot\, and build a strong mental program that is consistent 
 on every shot. </p><p>Your conscious mind commands your subconscious mind t
 o put your body into position\, after you train your body to be in those po
 sitions. When you stay in the present\, just doing what you need to do as y
 ou need to do it\, your conscious mind will be occupied\, instead of random
  thoughts entering your head or you being distracted by emotional or enviro
 nmental elements. </p><p>You´ll need to build up your mental program alongs
 ide your form knowledge\, so when your body is trained to shoot excellent s
 hots\, your self image and subconscious support you\, instead of underminin
 g you. </p><p><i>Improving your training\, practicing\, and competition com
 ponents\, process\, and skills is a perpetual lifetime quest\, which you´ll
  slowly learn to love. You´ll  realize what is under your control\, and bec
 ome your own best coach! Those who find all this fun and enjoy the journey 
 are the ones who win - the champions!</i></p><p><i>I know you can do it -  
 I'm your biggest fan!</i></p><p><i>​I'm also really looking forward to seei
 ng you improve\, succeed\, and thrive !​</i></p><p><b><i>                  
                                  Coach Racae<br></i></b></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260517T070736Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:FORM FOCUS
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
