DESCRIPTION:PREREQUISITE:&nbsp\;<br>This enrollment form is for ADULTS\, JU
 NIOR archers and their PARENTS who have taken and qualified in the Indoor 1
 : First-time Class.<br><br>PARENTS&nbsp\;<br>can enroll and shoot with thei
 r child(ren) in the following classes\, provided they have also taken an In
 door 1: First-time Class.<br><br><br>HOW DOES IT WORK? HOW DO I ADVANCE?<br
 >Please look under Programs at&nbsp\;<a href="http://www.archerytrainingcen
 ter.com">www.archerytrainingcenter.com</a>\, and read the information to un
 derstand how it all works.<br><br>PLEASE COMPLETE ONE REGISTRATION FORM FOR
  EACH ARCHER. You can register anytime all semester\, as long as there are 
 places left in the class. If there are no spaces left\, it will indicate "F
 ULL" for that class on the website calendar.<br><br>CAPACITY: 10 archers pe
 r class<br>AGES: 8 - 80? years old&nbsp\;<br>DISTANCES: 9m\, 13.5m\, and 18
 m<br>BOWS: Recurves<br><br>EQUIPMENT:&nbsp\;<br>We provide all equipment ne
 cessary indefinitely at no extra charge. (Recurve bow\, 3 arrows\, armguard
 \, finger tab\, target)<br>When you are ready to order your own equipment\,
  we pace and specify what you need and help you order it\, so you buy the c
 orrect equipment for your strength and experience. Generally\, we do not re
 commend anyone buys equipment before they have been with us for at least 8 
 hours.<br><br>CLASS TIMES and COACHES/INSTRUCTORS:<br>These are the days/ti
 mes that are available to you. All classes are coached by Coach Racae.<br>M
 IXED Indoor 2/3/4/5+ classes of JOADs\, Parents\, and Adults at 9m/13.5m/18
 m.<br>SAT: 3:45-4:45pm<br>SUN: 3:45-4:45pm<br>TUES: 6:00-7:00pm&nbsp\;<br>W
 ED: 6:00-7:00pm&nbsp\;<br><br>FEES:&nbsp\;<br>$20/hr for any hour above\, a
 nd to secure your place in any class before or after that hour ON THE SAME 
 DAY<br>+ Enrollment fee: $20 (always due once per semester)&nbsp\;<br>Addit
 ional hour(s) ON THE SAME DAY are open to you at the following reduced fees
 \, provided there are spaces remaining in the class: $20/hr\; $30 for 2 hrs
 \; $40 for 3 hrs.&nbsp\;<br><br>ENROLLMENT IS ON A FIRST-RECEIVED AND PAID 
 BASIS.<br>This enrollment form must be completed and your payment received 
 in order for you to be enrolled and a place reserved for you. You can enrol
 l any time during the semester for as many or as few classes as you like as
  long as there are places open.<br>So\, for example\, you can enroll for th
 e entire semester\, each month\, or sprinkle the days throughout the semest
 er depending on your schedule. (Please bear in mind\, however\, you'll prog
 ress faster with regular attendance.)<br><br>DROP INS:<br>Your name will be
  on the website calendar under the date and time you registered after we re
 ceive your fee in advance of the class. When classes are not full\, it's ok
 ay to just drop in for the class and pay at that time. When you attend\, an
 d the class is near full\, you should pay at least one class in advance to 
 guarantee you have a place next time. You can see the actual attendance (in
 cluding drop-ins) by looking at past classes on the website calendar. If th
 e class is "FULL"\, it will be so indicated on the calendar.<br><br>ATTENDA
 NCE RECOMMENDATIONS (in order to improve over time). Recreational archers h
 ave no attendance requirements.&nbsp\;<br>INDOOR 2 at 9m : 2 hrs/wk<br>INDO
 OR 3A at 13.5m : 3-4 hrs/wk<br>INDOOR 3B at 18m : 4-5 hrs/wk<br>INDOOR 4 at
  18m : 6 hrs/wk<br>INDOOR 5 at 18m: 8 hrs/wk<br>INDOOR 6 at 18m: 12 hrs/wk<
 br><br>Scores are also listed below\, if you kept score\, which is not requ
 ired\, except on Master Challenge weeks. You need 230 pts on 40cm target or
  240 pts on 60cm target to graduate out of your distance into Indoor 3A 13.
 5m\, and again at 13.5m to get into Indoor 3B at 18m (full distance).<br>PB
  = Personal Best.&nbsp\;<br><br>Registered archers:<br>1. Valur G.\, adult 
 9m - paid<br>2. Lily R.\, JOAD 13.5m - to pay<br>3.&nbsp\;<br>4.&nbsp\;<br>
 5.&nbsp\;<br>6.&nbsp\;<br>7.&nbsp\;<br>8.&nbsp\;<br>9.<br>10.
