 m target face. Then you will graduate to our outdoor classes !<br><br>After
  you graduate to Outdoor 3-9\, you will be granted access to the ATCI Calen
 dar via an email from Coach Racae\, and can just add your name under Regist
 ered Archers below.<br><br>SCHEDULE :<br>​Register for ​​as many as your sc
 hedule and budget allows to progress faster:<br>Sat/Sun 4:00-5:30 pm  <br>T
 /Th       5:00-6:30 pm  and  6:30-8\;:00 pm<br>​Weekdays: Juniors usually c
 ome to the 5:00 pm class\, and adults to the 6:30 class\, but all classes a
 re open to both adults and juniors.<br><br>Always check this calendar just 
 before driving to class in case there are last-minutes changes or cancellat
 ions!<br><br>USA Archery Level 4 NTS Coach Racae Meyer<br><br>2025 INDOOR 2
 -6 at 9m<br><br>Registered archers:<br>1\, <b>Lexi E</b>.  16\, pd (O4@ 20m
 ) -1.5 hrs - <b>204 pts</b><br>2. <b>Berkley I.</b>\, adult\, (Indoor 2) - 
 1.5 hrs - <b>107 pts</b><br>3. <b>Lichao C.\, </b>adult\, (O4@20m) -1.5 hrs
  -  <b>277 pts !!! CONGRATULATIONS -&gt\; Outdoor 5 at 30m !!</b><br>  <br>
 <br>SINGLE Class Fees per archer for one Indoor 2-6 class:<br>$31 for 1 hr 
 (arrive 30 min after class starts or leave 30 min before class ends)<br>$43
  for 1.5 hrs<br><br>MULTI-Class Discount Packets<br>  9 hours : $250 (six 1
 .5-hr classes)<br> 12 hours : $320 (eight 1.5-hr classes)<br> 18 hours : $4
 60 (twelve 1.5-hr classes) <br><br>There are 8 places on the shooting line\
 , and we sometimes have double lines depending on attendance.<br><br>Sign i
 n/out upon arrival/departure<br>For single classes\, book and pay in advanc
 e.<br>For multi-class discount packs\, pay in advance and book when you are
  sure of the dates.<br>Coaching and whistle commands at all times.<br>Instr
 uction in the National Training System.<br>Unfair games depending on attend
 ance.<br><br>Please note: Youths &lt\;12 y.o. should not shoot more than 10
 0 arrows/day!<br><br>Prerequisites for Indoor 2: <br>Adults: No min. score 
