DESCRIPTION:<b>2024 USA Archery Texas (TSAA) State Indoor Championship</b><
 br><br>Whether you´re aiming for the world stage\, or you´re new to archery
  competition\, state championships are a great opportunity to test your ski
 lls\, make new friends\, and prepare for USA Archery national events.<br><b
 r><b>Register today</b> for your chance to shoot for the title of State Ind
 oor Champion!<br><br>Visit <b> <a href="https://www.usarchery.org/events/fi
 nd-an-event">https://www.usarchery.org/events/find-an-event</a> </b>for all
  upcoming events!<br><br>Date: <b>February 10-11</b><br>Format: 60-arrow in
 door round<br>Contact: <a href="mailto:thejoadclub@gmail.com">thejoadclub@g
 mail.com</a> 832 846 0402<br><br>If this will be your first event\, the<b> 
 USA Archery Event Reference Guidebook </b>(see above events link) is a grea
 t resource to help answer questions you may have as you prepare for competi
 tion. If you have any questions about the State Championships\, <b>ask Coac
 h Racae</b>\, visit <a href="https://www.usarchery.org/events/rules">https:
 //www.usarchery.org/events/rules</a> or reach out to <a href="mailto:clubs@
 usarchery.org">clubs@usarchery.org</a> <br><br><b>Who´s going from Archery 
 Training Center? When are they shooting?</b><br>(If you´re going\, please l
 et Coach Racae know asap)<br><br><b>1. Yugan C.\, Sat. 9am</b><br><b>2. Jam
 es H.\, Sat.9 am</b><br><b>3. Daisy D.\, Sat 1 pm</b><br><b>4. Joseph F.\, 
 Sat 6 pm<br>5. Gianna L.\, Sun 10 am</b><br><b><br></b><b>Abby Y.\, Sat\, 9
  am - canceled - shoulder injury</b>
