 atically introduce\, explain\, demonstrate and practice one or two steps in
  the 13-step Shot Cycle of the National Training System (NTS). All JOAD arc
 hers must earn their "Learned" and "Mastered" tags relevant to their level 
 before progressing to the next level. (It's not enough to simply shoot the 
 relevant scores - you've got to know and be able to do the form!)\nIt's the
 refore important that all registered archers come at least once a week in o
 rder to benefit from this instruction!
