 gcenter.com/calendar">www.archerytrainingcenter.com/calendar</a>.)<br><br>S
 cores are also listed below\, if you kept score\, which is not required\, e
 xcept on Master Challenge weeks. You need 230 pts on 40cm target or 240 pts
