DESCRIPTION:<h1>2025 TSAA State Indoors</h1><p><b>ATCI Registered Archers:<
 /b></p><p></p><ol><li><b>Ted H</b>. MMR60+</li><li><b>Sophia D.\, </b>SFR</
 li><li><b>Colby K </b>SMR</li><li>.</li><li>.</li></ol><p></p><p>The 2025 T
 exas State Indoor Championships are set for January 11 and 12\, 2025 with a
  new location now available!</p><p>Fort Grard Guns &amp\; Archery 3800 Mine
 ral Wells Hwy\, Weatherford\, Texas 76088 for our North Location\;</p><p><b
 >Kealing Middle School 1607 Pennsylvania Ave\, Austin\, TX 78702 for our ce
 ntral location\;</b></p><p><span>Texas Archery Learning Center - 5833 Treas
 chwig Rd. Spring\, TX 77373 for our southeast location.</span></p><p>Partic
 ipants must be a member of USA Archery or the NFAA with a temporary members
 hip. International Guests (non U.S. citizens) - Please go to <a href="http:
 //www.usarchery.org" target="_blank">www.usarchery.org</a> to purchase a Te
 mporary Membership for Foreign Nationals.</p><p>Archers will register to sh
 oot a single 60 arrow World Archery indoor round on a 3-spot or single spot
  target on either Saturday or Sunday. Awards will be mailed out for the div
 isions.</p><p>Divisions in the State Championship are available for U13\, U
 15\, U18\, U21\, Senior\, 50+\, 60+ and 70+\, in Recurve\, Compound\, Bareb
 ow\, Fixed Pins\, Longbow\, and Para. </p><p>U13 and U15 have the option to
  shoot a 60 cm face.</p><p>Line times are:</p><p><b>Saturday 10:00 am and 2
 :00 pm</b></p><p><b>Sunday 10:00 am</b>. We will open another line if we ge
 t all lines full before the shoot.</p><p>Registration is $60 for U21\, Seni
 ors\, 50+\, 60+\, and 70+ and $45 for Youth (U13\, U15\, and U18)\, plus a 
 $1.99 service fee and any PayPal fees.</p><p>Registration is set to check f
 or age of participants based on the 2025 calendar year.</p><p>All divisions
  follow World Archery Rules except for Fixed Pins\, which follows the rules
  set by USA Archery.</p><p><b>Deadline for registration January 9th</b>.</p
 ><p>For inquiries about registration please contact the event organizer at:
  <a href="mailto:president@texasarchery.org" target="_blank">president@texa
 sarchery.org</a></p><p>Please Note: As a registered participant in a USA Ar
 chery sanctioned event\, you are required to adhere to the Minor Athlete Ab
 use Prevention Policies for the duration of the event.</p><p>Here is the re
 gistration Link.</p><p><a href="https://eyesonscore.com/archer-registration
 -form/NG4zaE0yU29JbFBPOVcraUZqU1Zndz09" target="_blank">https://eyesonscore
 .com/archer-registration-form/NG4zaE0yU29JbFBPOVcraUZqU1Zndz09</a></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260517T072236Z
LOCATION:Kealing Middle School\, 1607 Pennsylvania Ave\, Austin\, TX 78702
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:2025 TSAA State Indoor Championships
