DESCRIPTION:<br><b>After you graduate out of Indoor 1\,</b> sign up for <a 
 href="https://forms.gle/phoKGk3QkYAXQ2yu8" target="_blank"><u><u><u><b>INDO
 OR 2-6 at 9m</b></u></u></u></a> until you score  240 pts on the 60-cm targ
 et face or 230 pts on the 40-cm target face. Then you will graduate to our 
 outdoor classes !<br><br><b>After you graduate to Outdoor 3-9</b>\, you wil
 l be granted access to the ATCI Calendar via an email from Coach Racae\, an
 d can just add your name under Registered Archers below.<br><b><br>SCHEDULE
  :</b><br>​Register for ​​as many as your schedule and budget allows to pro
 gress faster:<br><b>Sat/Sun 4:00-5:30 pm  <br>T/Th       5:00-6:30 pm</b>  
 and  <b>6:30-8:00 pm</b><br>​Weekdays: Juniors usually come to the 5:00 pm 
 class\, and adults to the 6:30 class\, but all classes are open to both adu
 lts and juniors.<br><br>Always check this calendar just before driving to c
 lass in case there are last-minutes changes or cancellations!<br><br>USA Ar
 chery Level 4 NTS Coach Racae Meyer<br><br>2025 INDOOR 2-6 at 9m<br><br><b>
 Registered archers:</b><br>1.<br>2\, <br>3. <br>4.<br>5.<br>6.<br>7.<br>8.<
 br>9.<br>10.<br>11.<br>12.<br><br><b>SINGLE Class Fees per archer for one I
 ndoor 2-6 class:</b><br>$31 for 1 hr (arrive 30 min after class starts or l
 eave 30 min before class ends)<br>$43 for 1.5 hrs<br><br><b>MULTI-Class Dis
 count Packets</b><br>  9 hours : $250 (six 1.5-hr classes)<br> 12 hours : $
 320 (eight 1.5-hr classes)<br> 18 hours : $460 (twelve 1.5-hr classes) <br>
 <br>There are 8 places on the shooting line\, and we sometimes have double 
 lines depending on attendance.<br><br>Sign in/out upon arrival/departure<br
 >For single classes\, book and pay in advance.<br>For multi-class discount 
 packs\, pay in advance and book when you are sure of the dates.<br>Coaching
  and whistle commands at all times.<br>Instruction in the National Training
  System.<br>Unfair games depending on attendance.<br><br>Please note: Youth
 s &lt\;12 y.o. should not shoot more than 100 arrows/day!<br><br>Prerequisi
 tes for Indoor 2: <br>Adults: No min. score in Indoor 1 <br>Juniors: 50 pts
  in Indoor 1<br>Scores needed at 9m to advance to Indoor 3-6 and Outdoor 3-
 6:<br><br>                 On 40-cm                  On 60-cm<br>          
      target face                 target face<br>Indoor 3:          230 pts 
                240 pts           -&gt\; Outdoor 3 at 13.5m<br>Indoor 4:    
       250 pts                260 pts           -&gt\; Outdoor 4 at 18m/20m<
 br>Indoor 5:          270 pts                280 pts           -&gt\; Outdo
 or 5 at 30m<br>Indoor 6:          290 pts                300 pts          -
 &gt\;  Outdoor 6 at 40m
