DESCRIPTION:<b>When you are in Outdoor 3-9 </b>and would like a private les
 son with Coach Racae\, you can now book:<br><br><b>Outdoors</b>: You will <
 b>attend the full Outdoor 3-9 class</b>. Book <b>30 min only</b> during cla
 ss times on Saturdays and Sundays either at 10:30-11:00 or 11:00-11:30. The
  first and last 30 min of the class Coach Racae will coach the other archer
 s in attendance.  <b>Add your name next to just one of following times for 
 an outdoor private lesson today:</b><ul><li>10:00-10:30 Pranav</li><li>10:3
 0-11:00 Yugan (rescheduled 09/29) </li><li>11:00-11:30 Ananya</li><li>11:30
 -12:00</li></ul><b>Indoors at 9m</b>: <b>30 min or 1 hr</b> during the Mond
 ay indoor session (6:30-8:00). Fill in the times on the calendar under the 
 Monday(s) of your choice.<br><br><b>Additional fees: </b><br><ul><li><b>Out
 doors</b> : $12/30 min  (in addition to the regular Outdoor 3 class fee)</l
 i><li><b>Indoors</b>: $40/30min or $75/hr. You can shoot before or after yo
 ur private lesson time at no extra charge from 6:30-8:00\, if other archers
  are booked for private lessons otherwise the range will be closed.</li></u
 l><i>Priority will be given to archers who will participate/compete in TX S
 tate and National competitions.</i>
