DESCRIPTION:Coach Racae\n\n\nPREREQUISITES: \nINDOOR 1: First-time Class\n(
 To register for Indoor 1\, click the Sign Up button at the top of www.arche
 rytrainingcenter.com.)\nINDOOR 2: Beginners at 9m\nINDOOR 3A: Intermediates
  at 13.5m\n\nOPEN to Advanced Juniors/Parents/Adults at 18m who shoot the f
 ollowing scores:\nINDOOR 3B (up to 200 pts twice at 18m)\nINDOOR 4 (201-250
  pts at 18m)\nINDOOR 5 (251-270 pts at 18m)\nINDOOR 6 (271-280 pts at 18m)\
 nINDOOR 7 (281-290 pts at 18m)\nINDOOR 8 (291-300 pts at 18m)\n\nEnrollment
  links at: http://www.archerytrainingcenter.com/Classes\n\nFees: \nRECREATI
 ONAL: \n$20/cl for 1 hr.\nThere are also reduced Monthly fees and Progressi
 ve fees - \nLook under "Classes" on our website.\n\nPREREQUISITE: INDOOR 1:
  First-time Class\n(To register for Indoor 1\, click the Sign Up button at 
 the top of www.archerytrainingcenter.com.)\n\nOPEN to Juniors/Parents in\nI
 NDOOR 2 (9m) and\nINDOOR 3A (13.5m) \n\nEnrollment links at: http://www.arc
 herytrainingcenter.com/Classes\n\nFees: \nRECREATIONAL: \n$20/cl for 1 hr.\
 nThere are also reduced Monthly fees and Progressive fees - \nLook under "C
 lasses" on our website.\n\nYour name will be on the list below when we rece
 ive your fee in advance of the class. When classes are not full\, it's okay
  to just drop in for the class and pay at that time. When you attend\, and 
 the class is near full\, you should pay at least one class in advance to gu
 arantee you have a place next time. You can see the actual attendance by lo
 oking at past classes.\n\nRegistered archers:\n1. Lauren M. (18m) \n2. Luca
  L. (18m)\n3. \n4. \n5. \n6. \n7. \n8. \n9.\n10.
