DESCRIPTION:PREREQUISITE: INDOOR 1: First-time Class<br>(To register for In
 door 1\, click the Sign Up button at the top of <a href="http://www.archery
 trainingcenter.com">www.archerytrainingcenter.com</a>.)<br><br>OPEN to Adul
 ts in<br>INDOOR 2 (9m) and<br>INDOOR 3A (13.5m) and <br>INDOOR 3B/4/5+ (18m
 )<br><br>Enrollment links at: <a href="http://www.archerytrainingcenter.com
 /Classes">http://www.archerytrainingcenter.com/Classes</a><br><br>Fees: <br
 >RECREATIONAL: <br>$20/cl for 1 hr\; $30/cl for 2 hrs\; $40/cl for 3 hrs ON
  THE SAME DAY.<br>There are also reduced Monthly fees when you regularly co
 me to more than 3 hrs/week and Progressive fees when you are at 18m and reg
 ularly come to more than 5 hrs/week. Ask Coach Racae for more information.<
 br>&nbsp\;<br>Your name will be on the list below when we receive your regi
 stration form and fee in advance of the class. When you attend\, and the cl
 ass is near full\, you should pay at least one class in advance to guarante
 e you have a place on the shooting line next time. <br><br>When classes are
  not full\, it's okay to just drop in occasionally for the class and pay at
  that time. However it is difficult to tell how many people will be droppin
 g in\, so to secure your place\, it is better to register and pay in advanc
 e to prevent overcrowding. We can only take 10 people on the shooting line 
 at one time. <br><br>When we have more than 10 archers\, we will form a sec
 ond line\, as in a tournament\, which will reduce the number of arrows shot
  per person within the time. (You can see the actual attendance and class c
 omposition by looking at past classes at <a href="http://www.archerytrainin
 gcenter.com/calendar">www.archerytrainingcenter.com/calendar</a>.)<br><br>S
 cores are also listed below\, if you kept score\, which is not required\, e
 xcept on Master Challenge weeks. You need 230 pts on 40cm target or 240 pts
  on 60cm target to graduate out of your distance into Indoor 3A 13.5m\, and
  again at 13.5m to get into Indoor 3B at 18m (full distance).<br>PB = Perso
 nal Best. <br><br>Registered archers:<br>1. José M.\, Adult 18m - paid<br>2
 . Kevin B.\, adult 9m - paid<br>3. Liz J.\, adult 9m - paid - DNA<br>5. Bre
 ndan\, adult 9m - paid<br>4.<br>6. <br>7. <br>8. <br>9.<br>10.
