DESCRIPTION:Prerequisite: INDOOR 1\n\nThis class is open to:\nINDOOR 2 at 9
 m\nINDOOR 3A at 13.5m \nINDOOR 3B at 18m\nINDOOR 4+ at 18m\nOPT\nOPT Traine
 es\n\nCoach Racae\nUSA Archery Level 3 NTS Coach\n\nFee: $15 for 1 hr\n(Fre
 e to OPT and OPT Trainees)\n\nParents: We are part of the US Olympic Commit
 tee's Safe Sport program\, so we minimally require 2 adults (one of whom ca
 n be the coach) to be present at all times. Please plan to stay with your c
 hild whenever necessary to fulfill this requirement.\n\nThese classes were 
 created so juniors have the opportunity to keep up their practice during th
 eir busy summer in between vacations and other activities. Each class will 
 be coached specific to each individual\, and starts on the half-hour. Just 
 drop in when you can\, or sign up in advance to secure your place. It's abo
 ut as flexible as we can make it for you! See you all summer long! 
