DESCRIPTION:<h1>2025 TSAA State Indoors</h1><br><p>The 2025 Texas State Ind
 oor Championships are set for January 11 and 12\, 2025 with a new location 
 now available!</p><p>Fort Grard Guns &amp\; Archery 3800 Mineral Wells Hwy\
 , Weatherford\, Texas 76088 for our North Location\;</p><p><b>Kealing Middl
 e School 1607 Pennsylvania Ave\, Austin\, TX 78702 for our central location
 \;</b></p><p> <span>And Texas Archery Learning Center - 5833 Treaschwig Rd.
  Spring\, TX 77373 for our southeast location.</span></p><p>Participants mu
 st be a member of USA Archery or the NFAA with a temporary membership. Inte
 rnational Guests (non U.S. citizens) - Please go to <a href="www.usarchery.
 org">www.usarchery.org</a> to purchase a Temporary Membership for Foreign N
 ationals.</p><p>Archers will register to shoot a single 60 arrow World Arch
 ery indoor round on a 3-spot or single spot target on either Saturday or Su
 nday. Awards will be mailed out for the divisions.</p><p>Divisions in the S
 tate Championship are available for U13\, U15\, U18\, U21\, Senior\, 50+\, 
 60+ and 70+\, in Recurve\, Compound\, Barebow\, Fixed Pins\, Longbow\, and 
 Para. </p><p>U13 and U15 have the option to shoot a 60 cm face.</p><p>Line 
 times are:</p><p>Saturday 10:00 am and 2:00 pm</p><p>Sunday 10:00 am. We wi
 ll open another line if we get all lines full before the shoot.</p><p>Regis
 tration is $60 for U21\, Seniors\, 50+\, 60+\, and 70+ and $45 for Youth (U
 13\, U15\, and U18)\, plus a $1.99 service fee and any PayPal fees.</p><p>R
 egistration is set to check for age of participants based on the 2025 calen
 dar year.</p><p>All divisions follow World Archery Rules except for Fixed P
 ins\, which follows the rules set by USA Archery.</p><p><b>Deadline for reg
 istration January 9th</b>.</p><p>For inquiries about registration please co
 ntact the event organizer at: <a href="mailto:president@texasarchery.org">p
 resident@texasarchery.org</a></p><p>Please Note: As a registered participan
 t in a USA Archery sanctioned event\, you are required to adhere to the Min
 or Athlete Abuse Prevention Policies for the duration of the event.</p><p>H
 ere is the registration Link.</p><p><a href="https://eyesonscore.com/archer
 -registration-form/NG4zaE0yU29JbFBPOVcraUZqU1Zndz09">https://eyesonscore.co
 m/archer-registration-form/NG4zaE0yU29JbFBPOVcraUZqU1Zndz09</a></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260517T072236Z
LOCATION:Kealing Middle School\, 1607 Pennsylvania Ave\, Austin\, TX 78702
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:2025 TSAA State Indoor Championships
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
