 tp://www.archerytrainingcenter.com">www.archerytrainingcenter.com</a>.)<br>
 INDOOR 2: at 9m<br>INDOOR 3A: at 13.5m<br><br>OPEN to Juniors/Parents/Adult
 s in<br>INDOOR 3B/4/5/6+ (18m) or those in INDOOR 3A at 13.5m who are on pe
 riodization.<br><br>Enrollment links at:&nbsp\;<a href="http://www.archeryt
 rainingcenter.com/Classes">http://www.archerytrainingcenter.com/Classes</a>
 <br><br>Fees:&nbsp\;<br>RECREATIONAL:&nbsp\;<br>$15 for up to 3 hours\, whe
 n not covered in the monthly or progressive fees.<br>There are also reduced
  Monthly fees when you regularly come to more than 3 hrs/week and Progressi
 ve fees when you are at 18m and regularly come to more than 5 hrs/week. Ask
  Coach Racae for more information.<br>&nbsp\;<br>Your name will be on the l
 ist below when we receive your registration form and fee in advance of the 
 class. When you attend\, and the class is near full\, you should pay at lea
 st one class in advance to guarantee you have a place on the shooting line 
 next time.&nbsp\;<br><br>When classes are not full\, it's okay to just drop
  in occasionally for the class and pay at that time. However it is difficul
 t to tell how many people will be dropping in\, so to secure your place\, i
 t is better to register and pay in advance to prevent overcrowding. We can 
 only take 10 people on the shooting line at one time.&nbsp\;<br><br>When we
  have more than 10 archers\, we will form a second line\, as in a tournamen
 t\, which will reduce the number of arrows shot per person within the time.
  (You can see the actual attendance and class composition by looking at pas
 t classes at&nbsp\;<a href="http://www.archerytrainingcenter.com/calendar">
 www.archerytrainingcenter.com/calendar</a>.)<br><br>Scores are also listed 
 below\, if you kept score\, which is not required\, except on Master Challe
 nge weeks. You need 230 pts on 40cm target or 240 pts on 60cm target to gra
 duate out of your distance into Indoor 3A 13.5m\, and again at 13.5m to get
  into Indoor 3B at 18m (full distance).<br>PB = Personal Best.&nbsp\;<br><b
 r>Registered archers:<br>1.&nbsp\;<br>2.<br>3.&nbsp\;<br>4.&nbsp\;<br>5.&nb
 sp\;<br>6.&nbsp\;<br>7.&nbsp\;<br>8.&nbsp\;<br>9.<br>10.
