  9/18<u></u><br><u></u><b>Abraham F.\,&nbsp\;</b>adult - pd - No show\, no 
 notice fee forfeited<br><u></u><br>Space will be limited to 10-15 archers p
 er session depending on the number of family groups in attendance or in acc
 ordance with CDC Guidelines.&nbsp\;<br>Each person will have a target stand
 \, except after 10 people have registered\, two members from the same famil
 y will share one target stand.<br>The archer and a maximum of one spectator
  will be allowed on the field until further notice or approved by Coach Rac
