 ace will be limited to 10-15 archers per session depending on the number of
  family groups in attendance or in accordance with CDC Guidelines.&nbsp\;<b
 r>Each person will have a target stand\, except after 10 people have regist
 ered\, two members from the same family will share one target stand.<br>The
  archer and a maximum of one spectator will be allowed on the field until f
