 son with Coach Racae\, you can now book:<br><br><b>Outdoors</b>: You will <
 b>attend the full Outdoor 3-9 class</b>. Book <b>30 min only</b> during cla
 ss times on Saturdays and Sundays either at 9:30-10:00 or 10:00-10:30. The 
 first and last 30 min of the class Coach Racae will coach the other archers
  in attendance.  <b>Add your name next to just one of following times for O
 utdoor private lesson today:</b><br><ul><li>9:30-10:00</li></ul><ul><li>10:
 00-10:30</li></ul><b>Indoors at 9m</b>: <b>30 min or 1 hr</b> during the Mo
 nday indoor session (6:30-8:00). Fill in the times on the calendar under th
 e Monday(s) of your choice.<br><br><b>Additional fees: </b><br><ul><li><b>O
 utdoors</b> : $12/30 min  (in addition to the regular Outdoor 3 class fee)<
 /li><li><b>Indoors</b>: $40/30min or $75/hr. You can shoot before or after 
 your private lesson time at no extra charge from 6:30-8:00\, if other arche
 rs are booked for private lessons otherwise the range will be closed.</li><
 /ul><i>Priority will be given to archers who will participate/compete in TX
  State and National competitions.</i>
