DTSTAMP:20261004T164459Z
UID:3s54q3qkqfn7hs4cquftc675h3_R20240727@google.com
CREATED:20240528T161732Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>The <b>SUMMER TRAINING PROGRAM (June 1-Aug 29)</b> is a cond
 ensed program\, meaning that we will go through the <b>National Training Sy
 stem 11 Steps of Shooting</b> and <b>Building Your Mental Program</b> much 
 faster than during the Fall and Winter/Spring semesters. </p><p>Learning\, 
 understanding and doing the NTS and building a strong mental program are on
 going quests that all archers are continuously trying to achieve - even at 
 the highest levels !<br></p><p><i><b>What if you miss some of the weeks </b
 >because you're on vacation or at camp?  </i>We'll do our best to catch you
  up during your next sessions. </p><p><b><i>Also see more important notes b
 elow under the schedule.</i></b></p><p><b>JUNE</b><br></p><ul><li><b>  Sat 
 1 - Th 6</b>       <b>WELCOME </b>!  Understanding  <b>NTS CONCEPTS</b> esp
 ecially TRANSFER</li><li><b>  Sat 8 - Th 13     </b>NTS Step 1:<b> STANCE</
 b><b> + </b>NTS Step 2: <b> NOCK</b><b> + </b>Building Your Mental Program<
 /li><li>  <b>Sat 15 - Th 20</b>   NTS Step 3: <b>HOOK &amp\; GRIP </b>+ Bui
 lding Your Mental Program</li><li><b>  Sat 22 - Th 27  </b><b>ATCI MONTHLY 
 COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b><b> </b><b>   </b></li></ul><p></p><p><b>
 JULY</b><br></p><ul><li><b>  Sat 29 - Th 4</b><b>    </b>NTS Step 4:<b> SET
 </b><b> + </b>NTS Step 5:<b> SET-UP </b><b>+</b> Building Your Mental Progr
 am</li><li>  <b>Sat 6 - Th 11  </b>  NTS Step 6 <b>DRAW</b> to <b>LOAD </b>
 + Building Your Mental Program</li><li><b>  Sat 13 - Th 18</b>  NTS Step 7 
  <b>ANCHOR </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li><li>  <b>Sat 20 - Th 25  
 NTS Step 8  TRANSFER</b><b> to HOLD </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li>
 <li><b>  Sat 27 - Th 1    ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b><b
 >  </b></li></ul><p></p><p><b>AUGUST</b><br></p><ul><li><b>Sat 3 - Th 8    
    </b>NTS Step 9<b> EXPAND / AIM </b><b>+ </b>Building Your Mental Program
 <br></li><li><b>Sat 10 - Th 15 </b> NTS Step 10 <b>RELEASE / FOLLOW-THROUGH
 </b> + Building Your Mental Program</li><li><b>Sat 17 - Th 22</b>  NTS Step
  11 <b>FEEDBACK</b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li><li><b>Sat 24 - Th 29
   </b><b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b></li></ul><p></p><p
 ><b>Sat\, August 31 - FALL TRAINING PROGRAM starts. </b></p><p><b>INTRO</b>
 </p><p><i>Each week the focus of your lessons will be on one or two particu
 lar <b>Steps of Shooting of the NTS (National Training System) </b>shot cyc
 le\, to help you focus and improve your form\, which\, as we all know\, lea
 ds to greater and more consistent precision (tight groups of arrows) and ul
 timately greater accuracy (tight groups of arrows dead center)</i>. <i>Conc
 urrently you will be learning how to build a <b>strong mental program</b>\,
  which will improve your focus\, awareness and confidence for competitions 
 later.</i></p><p><i>The NTS is the <b>most biomechanically efficient and le
 ast injurious method of shooting</b>\, and is highly and continuously resea
 rched out at the Elite Athletes Center in Chula Vista\, CA. It is what the 
 Olympians do!</i></p><p><i>The 11 NTS Steps are cumulative with each step m
 ost successfully completed if the previous steps have been completed well. 
 </i><i>As you reach higher levels\, you will learn the NTS Steps in progres
 sively greater detail.</i></p><p><b>Goals by the end of the summer semester
  (Aug 29)</b></p><p>Make a list of what you want to accomplish by the end o
 f the semester. Email it to Coach Racae\, so you can discuss it together. <
 /p><p>Confidence and consistency in form and mind are your two main goals. 
 Replicate the NTS step(s) mindfully and consistently on every shot\, and bu
 ild a strong mental program that is consistent on every shot. </p><p>Your c
 onscious mind commands your subconscious mind to put your body into positio
 n\, after you train your body to be in those positions. When you stay in th
 e present\, just doing what you need to do as you need to do it\, your cons
 cious mind will be occupied\, instead of random thoughts entering your head
  or you being distracted by emotional or environmental elements. </p><p>You
 ´ll need to build up your mental program alongside your form knowledge\, so
  when your body is trained to shoot excellent shots\, your self image and s
 ubconscious support you\, instead of undermining you. </p><p><i>Improving y
 our training\, practicing\, and competition components\, process\, and skil
 ls is a perpetual lifetime quest\, which you´ll slowly learn to love. You´l
 l  realize what is under your control\, and become your own best coach! Tho
 se who find all this fun and enjoy the journey are the ones who win - the c
 hampions!</i></p><p><i>I know you can do it -  I'm your biggest fan!</i></p
 ><p><i>​I'm also really looking forward to seeing you improve\, succeed\, a
 nd thrive !​</i></p><p><b><i>                                              
      Coach Racae<br></i></b></p>
