 would like to try archery for the first time and join in future Junior Olym
 pic Archery Development (JOAD) and Adult Training classes. \n\nThis class i
 s a prerequisite for all classes. \n\nEnrollment link: Click the Sign Up bu
 tton at the top of the ATCI homepage.\n\nIf you have more than one year's e
 xperience\, contact us for a placement evaluation ($45) instead of attendin
 g the Indoor 1 Class.\n\n(You will be on the waiting list after 10 people r
 egister - see below.)\n\nRegistered archers:\n1.  Kiele D.\, 12\n2.  Jimmy 
