DESCRIPTION:After you graduate out of Indoor 1\, sign up for INDOOR 2-6 at 
 9m (https://forms.gle/phoKGk3QkYAXQ2yu8) until you score  240 pts on the 60
 -cm target face or 230 pts on the 40-cm target face. Then you will graduate
  to our outdoor classes !\n\nAfter you graduate to Outdoor 3-9\, you will b
 e granted access to the ATCI Calendar via an email from Coach Racae\, and c
 an just add your name under Registered Archers below.\n\nSCHEDULE :\n​Regis
 ter for ​​as many as your schedule and budget allows to progress faster:\nS
 at/Sun 4:00-5:30 pm  \nT/Th       5:00-6:30 pm  and  6:30-8\;:00 pm\n​Weekd
 ays: Juniors usually come to the 5:00 pm class\, and adults to the 6:30 cla
 ss\, but all classes are open to both adults and juniors.\n\nAlways check t
 his calendar just before driving to class in case there are last-minutes ch
 anges or cancellations!\n\nUSA Archery Level 4 NTS Coach Racae Meyer\n\n\nS
 cores needed at 9m to advance to Indoor 3-6 and Outdoor 3-6:\n\n           
       On 40-cm                  On 60-cm\n               target face       
           target face\nIndoor 3:          230 pts                240 pts   
         -> Outdoor 3 at 13.5m\nIndoor 4:          250 pts                26
 0 pts           -> Outdoor 4 at 18m/20m\nIndoor 5:          270 pts        
         280 pts           -> Outdoor 5 at 30m\nIndoor 6:          290 pts  
               300 pts          ->  Outdoor 6 at 40m\n\nIf you are already o
 utdoors\, please add your level (eg.\, O6@40m for Outdoor 6) after your nam
 e\, so newer archers can see the level of the archers in the class and deci
 de which class they would prefer to join. (Outdoor archers come into the in
 door range mainly to work on their form more intensely with Coach Racae.)\n
 2025 INDOOR 2-6 at 9m\n\nRegistered archers:\n1. Xinrui L.\, adult\, pd (In
 door 2)\n2\, Raj D.\, adult\, pd (Indoor 2)\n3\, Anjali M.\, adult\, pd (In
 door 2)\n4. Colby K!  USAA!  Paid!  Moved from 5 pm session.\n5. Eben\n6. L
 ove\n7.\n8.\n9.\n10.\n11.\n12.\n\nSINGLE Class Fees per archer for one Indo
 or 2-6 class:\n$31 for 1 hr (arrive 30 min after class starts or leave 30 m
 in before class ends)\n$43 for 1.5 hrs\n\nMULTI-Class Discount Packets\n  9
  hours : $250 (six 1.5-hr classes)\n 12 hours : $320 (eight 1.5-hr classes)
 \n 18 hours : $460 (twelve 1.5-hr classes) \n\nThere are 8 places on the sh
 ooting line\, and we sometimes have double lines depending on attendance.\n
 \nSign in/out upon arrival/departure\nFor single classes\, book and pay in 
 advance.\nFor multi-class discount packs\, pay in advance and book when you
  are sure of the dates.\nCoaching and whistle commands at all times.\nInstr
 uction in the National Training System.\nUnfair games depending on attendan
 ce.\n\nPlease note: Youths <12 y.o. should not shoot more than 100 arrows/d
 ay!\n\nPrerequisites for Indoor 2: \nAdults: No min. score in Indoor 1 \nJu
 niors: 50 pts in Indoor 1
