DESCRIPTION:Coach Racae\n2-hr Class\n$25/archer\n\nINDOOR 1: First-time cla
 ss is for juniors age 8+\, optionally their parents\, and other adults who 
 would like to try archery for the first time and join in future Junior Olym
 pic Archery Development (JOAD) and Adult Training classes. \n\nThis class i
 s a prerequisite for all classes. \n\nEnrollment link: Click the Sign Up bu
 tton at the top of the ATCI homepage.\n\nIf you have more than one year's e
 xperience\, contact us for a placement evaluation ($45) instead of attendin
 g the Indoor 1 Class.\n\n(You will be on the waiting list after 10 people r
 egister - see below.)\n\nRegistered archers:\n1. Steven H.\, adult\n2. \n3.
  \n4. Juliana J.\, 9\n5. Ben J.\, 10\n6. Shana J.\, mom\n7. Bob J.\, dad\n8
 . Grant G.\, 8\n9. Steven G.\, dad\n10. Nichele N.\, adult\n\nWaiting List:
  \n11. \n12. \n\nIf your name is on the waiting list\, you have a choice of
  \ncoming to see if a place opens up at the last minute\, or \nrescheduling
  your class for another date/time. \nWe can only take 10 archers on the sho
 oting line at one time. \nIf you prefer not to be on the waiting list\, ple
 ase reschedule your class for another date.
