 or 2 hrs\; $40/cl for 3 hrs ON THE SAME DAY.<br>There are also reduced Mont
 hly fees when you regularly come to more than 3 hrs/week and Progressive fe
 es when you are at 18m and regularly come to more than 5 hrs/week. Ask Coac
 h Racae for more information.<br>&nbsp\;<br>Your name will be on the list b
 elow when we receive your registration form and fee in advance of the class
 . When you attend\, and the class is near full\, you should pay at least on
 e class in advance to guarantee you have a place on the shooting line next 
