DESCRIPTION:<b>When you are in Outdoor 3-9 </b>and would like a private les
 son with Coach Racae\, you can now book:<br><br><b>Outdoors</b>: You will <
 b>attend the full Outdoor 3-9 class</b>. Book <b>30 min only</b> during cla
 ss times on Saturdays and Sundays either at 10:30-11:00 or 11:00-11:30. The
  first and last 30 min of the class Coach Racae will coach the other archer
 s in attendance.  <b>Add your name next to just one of following times for 
 an outdoor private lesson today:</b><br><ul><li>10:30-11:00</li></ul><ul><l
 i>11:00-11:30</li></ul><b>Indoors at 9m</b>: <b>30 min or 1 hr</b> during t
 he Monday indoor session (6:30-8:00). Fill in the times on the calendar und
 er the Monday(s) of your choice.<br><br><b>Additional fees: </b><br><ul><li
 ><b>Outdoors</b> : $12/30 min  (in addition to the regular Outdoor 3 class 
 fee)</li><li><b>Indoors</b>: $40/30min or $75/hr. You can shoot before or a
 fter your private lesson time at no extra charge from 6:30-8:00\, if other 
 archers are booked for private lessons otherwise the range will be closed.<
 /li></ul><i>Priority will be given to archers who will participate/compete 
 in TX State and National competitions.</i>
