 \, and shoot for 1-3+ hours\, in accordance with your strength and experien
 ce.<br>There is continuous training with Coach Racae\, but since it´s summe
 r\, we will challenge ourselves with some archery games!<br><br>It´s going 
 to be a great summer - and cool in the indoor archery range!<br><br>Sign up
  and pay at <a href="http://www.paypal.me/atciaustin">www.paypal.me/atciaus
 tin</a> in advance to secure your space on the shooting line! (Please write
  the dates and times on your PayPal payment and add an extra 4%.)<br><br>PR
