DESCRIPTION:After you graduate out of Indoor 1\, sign up for INDOOR 2-6 at 
 9m until you score  240 pts on the 60-cm target face or 230 pts on the 40-c
 m target face. Then you will graduate to our outdoor classes !<br><br>After
  you graduate to Outdoor 3-9\, you will be granted access to the ATCI Calen
 dar via an email from Coach Racae\, and can just add your name under Regist
 ered Archers below.<br><br>SCHEDULE :<br>​Register for ​​as many as your sc
 hedule and budget allows to progress faster:<br>Sat/Sun 4:30-6:00 pm  <br>T
 /Th       5:00-6:30 pm  and  6:30-8:00 pm<br>​Weekdays: Juniors usually com
 e to the 5:00 pm class\, and adults to the 6:30 class\, but all classes are
  open to both adults and juniors.<br><br>Always check this calendar just be
 fore driving to class in case there are last-minutes changes or cancellatio
 ns! If fewer than 4 people register in advance and pay\, the class may be c
 ancelled at the coach's discretion\, and you may need to reschedule.<br><br
 >USA Archery Level 4 NTS Coach Racae Meyer<br><br>2025 INDOOR 2-6 at 9m<br>
 <br>Registered archers:<br><ol><li><b>Basil A</b>.\, adult\, pd? (Indoor 2)
  - 1.5 hrs - <b>139 pts</b></li><li><b>Arjun B</b>.\, pd? (Indoor 2) - 1.5 
