 s - <b>227 pts</b></li><li><b>Lana F</b>. 15\, pd (Indoor 2) <b>DNA</b></li
 ><li><b>Marlon B.</b>\, adult\, pd? (Indoor 2) <b>DNA</b></li><li><b>Rachae
 l B.</b>\, adult\, pd? (Indoor 2) <b>DNA</b></li></ol><br>SINGLE Class Fees
  per archer for one Indoor 2-6 class:<br>$31 for 1 hr (arrive 30 min after 
 class starts or leave 30 min before class ends)<br>$43 for 1.5 hrs<br><br>M
 ULTI-Class Discount Packets<br>  9 hours : $250 (six 1.5-hr classes)<br> 12
  hours : $320 (eight 1.5-hr classes)<br> 18 hours : $460 (twelve 1.5-hr cla
 sses) <br><br>There are 8 places on the shooting line\, and we sometimes ha
 ve double lines depending on attendance.<br><br>Sign in/out upon arrival/de
 parture<br>For single classes\, book and pay in advance.<br>For multi-class
  discount packs\, pay in advance and book when you are sure of the dates.<b
 r>Coaching and whistle commands at all times.<br>Instruction in the Nationa
 l Training System.<br>Unfair games depending on attendance.<br><br>Please n
 ote: Youths &lt\;12 y.o. should not shoot more than 100 arrows/day!<br><br>
