 \n12. \n\nIf your name is on the waiting list\, you have a choice of \ncomi
 ng to see if a place opens up at the last minute\, or \nrescheduling your c
 lass for another date/time. \nWe can only take 10 archers on the shooting l
 ine at one time. \nIf you prefer not to be on the waiting list\, please res
 chedule your class for another date.
