DESCRIPTION:After you graduate out of Indoor 1\, sign up for 2026 INDOOR 2-
 6 at 9m Registration Form (<a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIp
 QLSfz1Ww1xFc_x-hCgXixX36YxyfAHlfAUMi-Hir24Fy7hLOzbw/viewform?usp=sharing&ou
 id=104080193312046349991" target="_blank">https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e
 /1FAIpQLSfz1Ww1xFc_x-hCgXixX36YxyfAHlfAUMi-Hir24Fy7hLOzbw/viewform?usp=shar
 ing&amp\;ouid=104080193312046349991</a>) until you score  240 pts on the 60
 -cm target face or 230 pts on the 40-cm target face. Then you will graduate
  to our outdoor classes !<br><br>After you graduate to Outdoor 3-9\, you wi
 ll be granted access to the ATCI Calendar via an email from Coach Racae\, a
 nd can just add your name under Registered Archers below.<br><br>SCHEDULE :
 <br>​Register for ​​as many as your schedule and budget allows to progress 
 faster:<br>Sat/Sun   4:30-6:00 pm  <br>Wed         6:30-8:00 pm<br>Thurs   
     6:30-8:00 pm<br><br>Always check this calendar just before driving to c
 lass in case there are last-minutes changes or cancellations!<br><br>USA Ar
 chery Level 4 NTS Coach Racae Meyer unless otherwise noted above.<br><br>Th
 e level of each attending archer is noted next to their name below\, to hel
 p you decide which classes to join. (Example: Indoor 2 or more advanced are
  Outdoor 3+ (O4 @20m\, etc.)<br><br>Registered archers:<br>1. <b>Harrison C
 .\,  </b>8?\, on 60-cm target face\, pd (Indoor 2) 1.5 hrs<br>2. <b>Phi A.\
 , </b>adult\, pd (O4@ 20m) 1.5 hrs<br>3. <b>Maxine V.H.\, </b>14\, pd + sem
  fee + Star Pin fee (Indoor 2) 1.5 hrs<br>4.<b> Ryan R</b>.\, adult\, pd (I
 ndoor 2) 1.5 hrs<br>5. <b>Coraline R.\, </b>10\, on 60-cm target face\, pd 
 (Indoor 2) 1.5 hrs<br>6. <b>Atharva D.\, </b>adult\, pd (Indoor 2) 1.5 hrs<
 br>7. <b>Matthew A.\, </b>adult\, pd (Indoor 2) 1.5 hrs<br>8. <b>Carolyn M.
 \, </b>adult\, pd (Indoor 2) + sem fee - 1.5 hrs<br>9.<br>10.<br>11.<br>12.
 <br><br><br>SINGLE Class Fees per archer for one Indoor 2-6 class<br>Book a
 nd pay in advance.<br>$30 for 1 hr (book a 1-hr class\, or arrive 30 min af
 ter a 1.5-hr class starts or leave 30 min before class ends)<br>$45 for 1.5
 -hr class<br><br><br>MONTHLY Discount Fee Packs<br>Pay before the 1st of ea
 ch month\; book dates within the month<br>1 class/wk:      $218 (7.5 hrs\; 
 5 classes/mo)<br>2 classes/wk: $372 (13.5 hrs\; 9 classes/mo)<br>3 classes/
 wk: $557 (21 hrs\; 14 classes/mo)<br>4 classes/wk: $675 (27 hrs\; 18 classe
 s/mo)<br>5 classes/wk: $792 (33 hrs\; 22 classes/mo)<br><br>MULTI-CLASS Dis
 count Packets<br>Pay in advance and book when you're sure of the dates.<br>
   9 hours : $257 (6 classes)<br> 12 hours : $330 (8 classes)<br> 18 hours :
  $477 (12 classes) <br> 23 hours: $587 (15 classes)<br> 27 hours: $675 (18 
 classes)<br><br>There are 8 places on the shooting line\, and we sometimes 
 have double lines depending on attendance.<br><br>Sign in/out upon arrival/
 departure<br>Coaching and whistle commands at all times.<br>Instruction in 
 the National Training System.<br>Unfair games depending on attendance.<br>P
 lease note: Youths &lt\;12 y.o. should not shoot more than 100 arrows/day!<
 br><br>Prerequisites for Indoor 2: <br>Adults: No min. score in Indoor 1 <b
 r>Juniors: 50 pts in Indoor 1<br>Scores needed at 9m to advance to Indoor 3
 -6 and Outdoor 3-6:<br><br>                 On 40-cm                  On 60
 -cm<br>               target face                 target face<br>Indoor 3: 
          230 pts                240 pts           -&gt\; Outdoor 3 at 13.5m
 <br>Indoor 4:          250 pts                260 pts           -&gt\; Outd
 oor 4 at 18m/20m<br>Indoor 5:          270 pts                280 pts      
      -&gt\; Outdoor 5 at 30m<br>Indoor 6:          290 pts                3
 00 pts          -&gt\;  Outdoor 6 at 40m
