DESCRIPTION:Coach Racae\n\nPREREQUISITES: \nINDOOR 1: First-time Class\,  (
 To register for Indoor 1\, click the Sign Up button at the top of www.arche
 rytrainingcenter.com.) \nINDOOR 2 at 9m\, \nINDOOR 3A at 13.5m\n \nOPEN to 
 all archers (JOAD and Adults) at 18m.\nHigher levels can also choose to reg
 ister for lower-level classes until lower level classes are full with Indoo
 r 2 and Indoor 3A archers. \n\nEnrollment links at:\nhttp://www.archerytrai
 ningcenter.com/news\n\nTime / Attendance Requirements: \nRECREATIONAL: None
  \nPROGRESSIVE: Must continuously meet the time/attendance requirements to 
 remain in the Progressive Program. Those who fall short of the weekly time/
 attendance requirements will automatically be considered Recreational\, and
  Recreational class fees will apply.  These classes are designed to prepare
 d archers for CAP (Competitive Archery Program).\n\nFees:  \nRECREATIONAL F
 EES: \nAll fees are payable in advance of the Indoor at 18m class to secure
  your place in the class: \nTues 6:30-7:30pm: 1-hr class - $20\nWed  6:30-8
 :00pm: 1.5-hr class - $30\nSat   3:30-5:30pm:  2-hr class - $40\nSun  3:30-
 5:30pm:  2-hr class - $40\n+ Enrollment fee: $20 (always due once per semes
 ter) \n\nPROGRESSIVE (min. attendance required):  \nIndoor 3B:       $60/wk
  (min. 5 hrs)  \nIndoor 4:         $66/wk (min. 6 hrs) \nIndoor 5:         
 $80/wk (min. 8 hrs)  \n\nMONTHLY FEES for ADULTS at 18m:\n\nAdult classes o
 nly (Tues 7:30-8:30 + Sun 6:00-7:00):\nAUG   $   40     \nSEPT $ 120 \nOCT 
   $ 120     \nNOV   $ 120      \nDEC   $   80     \n\nAdult classes + Wed. 
 6:30-8:00:\nAUG   $  90  \nSEPT $ 207  \nOCT  $ 243  \nNOV  $ 243   \nDEC  
 $ 126   \n\nMONTHLY FEES for JUNIORS at 18m:\nRecreational hourly fees appl
 y. At this level archers should be in the range at least 5 hrs/wk to improv
 e over time. If your schedule allows for this\, you are a Progressive arche
 r\; if not\, you are a Recreational archer.
