UID:3s54q3qkqfn7hs4cquftc675h3@google.com
CREATED:20240528T161732Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>The <b>SUMMER TRAINING PROGRAM (June 1-Aug 29)</b> is a cond
 ensed program\, meaning that we will go through the <b>National Training Sy
 stem 11 Steps of Shooting</b> and <b>Building Your Mental Program</b> much 
 faster than during the Fall and Winter/Spring semesters. </p><p>Learning\, 
 understanding and doing the NTS and building a strong mental program are on
 going quests that all archers are continuously trying to achieve - even at 
 the highest levels !<br></p><p><i><b>What if you miss some of the weeks </b
 >because you're on vacation or at camp?  </i>We'll do our best to catch you
  up during your next sessions. </p><p><b>JUNE</b><br></p><ul><li><b>  Sat 1
  - Th 6</b>       <b>WELCOME </b>!  Understanding  <b>NTS CONCEPTS</b> espe
 cially TRANSFER</li><li><b>  Sat 8 - Th 13     </b>NTS Step 1:<b> STANCE</b
 ><b> + </b>NTS Step 2: <b> NOCK</b><b> + </b>Building Your Mental Program</
 li><li>  <b>Sat 15 - Th 20</b>   NTS Step 3: <b>HOOK &amp\; GRIP </b>+ Buil
 ding Your Mental Program</li><li><b>  Sat 22 - Th 27  </b><b>ATCI MONTHLY C
 OMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b><b> </b><b>   </b></li></ul><p></p><p><b>J
 ULY</b><br></p><ul><li><b>  Sat 29 - Th 4</b><b>    </b>NTS Step 4:<b> SET<
 /b><b> + </b>NTS Step 5:<b> SET-UP </b><b>+</b> Building Your Mental Progra
 m</li><li>  <b>Sat 6 - Th 11  </b>  NTS Step 6 <b>DRAW</b> to <b>LOAD </b>+
  Building Your Mental Program</li><li><b>  Sat 13 - Th 18</b>  NTS Step 7  
 <b>ANCHOR </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li><li>  <b style="font-weigh
 t: bold\;">Sat 20 - Th 25  NTS Step 8  TRANSFER</b><b style="font-weight: b
 old\;"> to HOLD </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li><li><b>  Sat 27 - Th
  1    ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b><b>  </b></li></ul><p>
 </p><p><b>AUGUST</b><br></p><ul><li><b>Sat 3 - Th 8       </b>NTS Step 9<b>
  EXPAND / AIM </b><b>+ </b>Building Your Mental Program<br></li><li><b>Sat 
 10 - Th 15 </b> NTS Step 10 <b>RELEASE / FOLLOW-THROUGH</b> + Building Your
  Mental Program</li><li><b>Sat 17 - Th 22</b>  NTS Step 11 <b>FEEDBACK</b>+
  Building Your Mental Program</li><li><b>Sat 24 - Th 29  </b><b>ATCI MONTHL
 Y COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b></li></ul><p></p><p><b>Sat\, August 31 
 - FALL TRAINING PROGRAM starts. </b></p><p><b>INTRO</b></p><p><i>Each week 
 the focus of your lessons will be on one or two particular <b>Steps of Shoo
 ting of the NTS (National Training System) </b>shot cycle\, to help you foc
 us and improve your form\, which\, as we all know\, leads to greater and mo
 re consistent precision (tight groups of arrows) and ultimately greater acc
 uracy (tight groups of arrows dead center)</i>. <i>Concurrently you will be
  learning how to build a <b>strong mental program</b>\, which will improve 
 your focus\, awareness and confidence for competitions later.</i></p><p><i>
 The NTS is the <b>most biomechanically efficient and least injurious method
  of shooting</b>\, and is highly and continuously researched out at the Eli
 te Athletes Center in Chula Vista\, CA. It is what the Olympians do!</i></p
 ><p><i>The 11 NTS Steps are cumulative with each step most successfully com
 pleted if the previous steps have been completed well. </i><i>As you reach 
 higher levels\, you will learn the NTS Steps in progressively greater detai
 l.</i></p><p><b>Goals by the end of the summer semester (Aug 29)</b></p><p>
 Make a list of what you want to accomplish by the end of the semester. Emai
 l it to Coach Racae\, so you can discuss it together. </p><p>Confidence and
  consistency in form and mind are your two main goals. Replicate the NTS st
 ep(s) mindfully and consistently on every shot\, and build a strong mental 
 program that is consistent on every shot. </p><p>Your conscious mind comman
 ds your subconscious mind to put your body into position\, after you train 
 your body to be in those positions. When you stay in the present\, just doi
 ng what you need to do as you need to do it\, your conscious mind will be o
 ccupied\, instead of random thoughts entering your head or you being distra
 cted by emotional or environmental elements. </p><p>You´ll need to build up
  your mental program alongside your form knowledge\, so when your body is t
 rained to shoot excellent shots\, your self image and subconscious support 
 you\, instead of undermining you. </p><p><i>Improving your training\, pract
 icing\, and competition components\, process\, and skills is a perpetual li
 fetime quest\, which you´ll slowly learn to love. You´ll  realize what is u
 nder your control\, and become your own best coach! Those who find all this
  fun and enjoy the journey are the ones who win - the champions!</i></p><p>
 <i>I know you can do it -  I'm your biggest fan!</i></p><p><i>​I'm also rea
 lly looking forward to seeing you improve\, succeed\, and thrive !​</i></p>
 <p><b><i>                                                   Coach Racae<br>
 </i></b></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260517T072718Z
