  a place opens up at the last minute\, or \nrescheduling your class for ano
 ther date/time. \nWe can only take 10 archers on the shooting line at one t
 ime. \nThe instructor may also create two shooting lines\, which may increa
 se the length of the class for everyone and decrease the number of arrows e
 veryone has time to shoot.\nIf you prefer not to be on the waiting list\, p
 lease reschedule your class for another date.
