CREATED:20220603T214054Z
DESCRIPTION:<b>2022 Summer Schedule and Goals for Outdoor 2-9 (9m to 70m)</
 b><b><br></b><br><b>Goals by the end of the summer semester (Aug 14):&nbsp\
 ;</b><br>Make a list of what you want to accomplish<b><br></b>&nbsp\;<br><b
 >JUNE</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>2-5</b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\
 ; Welcome Back: Understanding&nbsp\; NTS Concepts \; Mental Program<br><b>&
 nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>9-12</b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; NTS Steps 1+2: STANCE 
 + NOCK&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\;&nbsp\;<b>16-19&nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 
 3: HOOK &amp\; GRIP&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; 25/</b><b>26&nbsp\; JUNE A
 TCI MASTER CHALLENGE TOURNAMENT (Pin Shoot)&nbsp\;</b><b>10:30am-12:30pm&nb
 sp\;</b><br><b>JULY</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;6/30-7/3&nbsp\;</b>NTS
  Step 4: SET\; NTS Step 5: SET-UP&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;7-10<
 /b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;NTS Step 6 DRAW to LOAD&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\;
  &nbsp\;<b>14-17&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 7 ANCHOR&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &n
 bsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>21-24&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 8 TRANSFER to HOLD<br><
 b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;30/31&nbsp\; JULY ATCI MASTER CHALLENGE TOURNAMENT
  (Pin Shoot)</b><br><b>AUGUST</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;4-7</b>&nbsp
 \; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;NTS Step 9 EXPAND / AIM&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbs
 p\; &nbsp\;11-14</b>&nbsp\; NTS Step 10 RELEASE + FOLLOW-THROUGH<br>&nbsp\;
  &nbsp\; &nbsp\;<b>18-21</b>&nbsp\;<b>&nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 11: FEEDBACK + Pu
 tting it all together!<b><br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>27/28&nbsp\; AUG
 UST ATCI MASTER CHALLENGE TOURNAMENT (Pin Shoot)</b><br><br>Each week the f
 ocus of your lessons will be on particular Steps of Shooting of the NTS (Na
 tional Training System) shot cycle\, to help you focus and improve your for
 m\, which\, as we all know\, leads to greater and consistent precision (tig
 ht groups of arrows) and ultimately greater accuracy (tight groups of arrow
 s dead center).<br><br>Your goal is always to replicate the NTS step(s) min
 dfully and consistently on every shot. If you stay in the present just doin
 g what you need to do as you need to it\, your conscious mind will be occup
 ied\, instead of random thoughts entering your head or you being distracted
  by emotional or environmental elements. You´ll need to build up your menta
 l program alongside your form knowledge\, so when your body is trained to s
 hoot excellent shots\, your self image and subsonscious support you\, inste
 ad of undermining you. Confidence and consistency in form and mind are majo
 r goals.<br><br>You do not need to score in every class. In fact\, it would
  be more beneficial to you if you scored only during Master Challenge Tourn
 ament Weeks\, which happen the last week of each month. This is because wor
 king on the NTS Steps of Shooting (your form) is more easily done without t
 he distraction of the target face or scoring\, and you will improve faster.
 <br><br>As you reach higher levels\, you will learn the NTS Steps in progre
 ssively greater detail.<br>The NTS Steps are cumulative with each step most
  successfully completed if the previous steps have been completed well.&nbs
 p\;<br><br>Your ability to learn and understand the NTS Steps\, and use dee
 p focus on these Steps while shooting outdoors and while using your stretch
 band/string loop at home to reinforce form poisitions will propel you to hi
 gher levels fast!
LAST-MODIFIED:20260517T073716Z
