UID:6t71dctqea0dcgk599auocfo9n@google.com
CREATED:20220603T214722Z
DESCRIPTION:<html-blob><b>2022 Summer Schedule and Goals for Outdoor 2-9 (9
 m to 70m)</b><b><br></b><br><b>Goals by the end of the summer semester (Aug
  14):&nbsp\;</b><br>Make a list of what you want to accomplish<b><br></b>&n
 bsp\;<br><b>JUNE</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>2-5</b>&nbsp\; &nb
 sp\; &nbsp\; Welcome Back: Understanding&nbsp\; NTS Concepts \; Mental Prog
 ram<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>9-12</b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; NTS Steps 1
 +2: STANCE + NOCK&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\;&nbsp\;<b>16-19&nbsp\; &nbsp\;</
 b>NTS Step 3: HOOK &amp\; GRIP&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; 25/</b><b>26&nb
 sp\; JUNE ATCI MASTER CHALLENGE TOURNAMENT (Pin Shoot)&nbsp\;</b><b>10:30am
 -12:30pm&nbsp\;</b><br><b>JULY</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;6/30-7/3&nb
 sp\;</b>NTS Step 4: SET\; NTS Step 5: SET-UP&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &
 nbsp\;7-10</b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;NTS Step 6 DRAW to LOAD&nbsp\;<br>&nbs
 p\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;<b>14-17&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 7 ANCHOR&nbsp\;<br><b
 >&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>21-24&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 8 TRANSFER t
 o HOLD<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;30/31&nbsp\; JULY ATCI MASTER CHALLENGE
  TOURNAMENT (Pin Shoot)</b><br><b>AUGUST</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;4
 -7</b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;NTS Step 9 EXPAND / AIM&nbsp\;<br><b>&
 nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;11-14</b>&nbsp\; NTS Step 10 RELEASE + FOLLOW-THROUGH
 <br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;<b>18-21</b>&nbsp\;<b>&nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 11: FE
 EDBACK + Putting it all together!<b><br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>27/28
 &nbsp\; AUGUST ATCI MASTER CHALLENGE TOURNAMENT (Pin Shoot)</b><br><br>Each
  week the focus of your lessons will be on particular Steps of Shooting of 
 the NTS (National Training System) shot cycle\, to help you focus and impro
 ve your form\, which\, as we all know\, leads to greater and consistent pre
 cision (tight groups of arrows) and ultimately greater accuracy (tight grou
 ps of arrows dead center).<br><br>Your goal is always to replicate the NTS 
 step(s) mindfully and consistently on every shot. If you stay in the presen
 t just doing what you need to do as you need to it\, your conscious mind wi
 ll be occupied\, instead of random thoughts entering your head or you being
  distracted by emotional or environmental elements. You´ll need to build up
  your mental program alongside your form knowledge\, so when your body is t
 rained to shoot excellent shots\, your self image and subsonscious support 
 you\, instead of undermining you. Confidence and consistency in form and mi
 nd are major goals.<br><br>You do not need to score in every class. In fact
 \, it would be more beneficial to you if you scored only during Master Chal
 lenge Tournament Weeks\, which happen the last week of each month. This is 
 because working on the NTS Steps of Shooting (your form) is more easily don
 e without the distraction of the target face or scoring\, and you will impr
 ove faster.<br><br>As you reach higher levels\, you will learn the NTS Step
 s in progressively greater detail.<br>The NTS Steps are cumulative with eac
 h step most successfully completed if the previous steps have been complete
 d well.&nbsp\;<br><br>Your ability to learn and understand the NTS Steps\, 
 and use deep focus on these Steps while shooting outdoors and while using y
 our stretchband/string loop at home to reinforce form poisitions will prope
 l you to higher levels fast!</html-blob>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260517T073206Z
