DESCRIPTION:Coach Racae \n2.5-hr Class $25/archer \nEnrollment link: Click 
 the Sign Up button at the top of www.archerytrainingcenter.com\n\nINDOOR 1:
  First-time class is for those who would like to try archery for the first 
 time and join in future Adult Training and Junior Olympic Archery Developme
 nt (JOAD) classes. \nThis class is a prerequisite for all classes. \n \nIf 
 you have more than one year's experience\, contact archerytrainingcenteraus
 tin@gmail.com for a placement evaluation ($45) instead of attending the Ind
 oor 1 Class. \n\n(You will be on the waiting list after 10 people register 
 - see below.) \n\nRegistered archers: \n1.\n2.\n3.\n4.\n5.\n6.\n7.\n8.\n9.\
 n10.\nWaiting List: \n11. \n12. \nIf your name is on the waiting list\, you
  have a choice of coming to see if a place opens up at the last minute\, or
  rescheduling your class for another date/time. We can only take 10 archers
  on the shooting line at one time. If you prefer not to be on the waiting l
 ist\, please reschedule your class for another time.
