UID:not48ipuah7j7e0vqi9fim05ug@google.com
CREATED:20141223T170341Z
DESCRIPTION:Please look at the website calendar before coming to class\, in
  case there are changes or cancellations.  PREREQUISITE: INDOOR 1: First-ti
 me Class These classes are for JUNIOR archers and their parents who have ta
 ken and qualified in the Indoor 1: First-time Class by scoring at least 50 
 pts at 9m. (Click the Sign Up button on the website to register for Indoor 
 1: First-time Class.)  PARENTS  can enroll and shoot with their child(ren) 
 in the above classes\, provided they have also taken an Indoor 1: First-tim
 e Class.  PLEASE COMPLETE ONE ENROLLMENT FORM FOR EACH ARCHER. Enrollment f
 orms will be emailed to you after your Indoor 1: First-time Lesson.  DATES:
           January 6 - May 31\, 2015  CAPACITY:    10 archers per class AGES
 :            8 - 18 years old  DISTANCES:  9m\, 13.5m\, 18m  CLASS SCHEDULE
  and COACHES / INSTRUCTORS: (Read enrollment info below) Saturdays: 12:00-1
 :30 and 2:00-3:30 USA Archery Level 1 Instructor TBD Sundays: 12:00-1:30 an
 d 2:00-3:30 USA Archery Level 1 Instructor Chloe / Tori Tues: 5:30-7:00: US
 A Archery Level 2 Instructor Dan Wed: 5:30-7:00: USA Archery Level 2 Instru
 ctor Dale Thurs: 5:30-7:00: USA Archery Level 3 NTS Coach Racae  DAYS CLOSE
 D:   MONDAYS and FRIDAYS APRIL 4 and 5\, Easter Weekend MAY 6\, Range close
 d MAY 10\, Mother's Day  ENROLLMENT IS ON A FIRST-RECEIVED AND PAID BASIS. 
 An enrollment form must be completed and your payment received in order for
  you to be enrolled and a place reserved for you. You can enroll any time d
 uring the semester for as many or as few classes as you like as long as the
 re are places open. So\, for example\, you can enroll for the entire semest
 er\, each month\, or sprinkle the days throughout the semester depending on
  your schedule. (Please bear in mind\, however\, you'll progress faster wit
 h regular attendance.)  REFUNDS\, CREDITS\, and SUBSTITUTIONS: There are no
  refunds or credits for paid days missed Jan. 6 - May 31\, except in the ca
 se of injury\, long-term illness\, unforeseen move out of the Austin area\,
  or if we cancel a class. If\, however\, you let us know before a class tha
 t you will miss that class\, you can substitute another class as long as th
 ere are places left in that class during the Spring 2015 semester. If you f
 ail to let us know before a class that you will miss that class and want to
  substitute another class\, there is no substitution or refund. Substitutio
 ns do not carry forward to the next semester.  In the case of physical inju
 ry or long-term illness\, we require a doctor's note saying the archer is u
 nable to practice archery\, and then a doctor's note saying the archer is f
 it to return to archery\, before the archer will be allowed back in class. 
  ATTENDANCE RECOMMENDATIONS in order to improve:  INDOOR 2 at 9m :        O
 ne or two 1.5-hr classes per week. INDOOR 3A at 13.5m : Two 1.5-hr classes 
 per week. INDOOR 3B at 18m :    Two or three 1.5-hr classes per week.  MINI
 MUM ENROLLMENT: Classes will be held only if there are 5 or more archers en
 rolled in the class.  If the class does not make this minimum enrollment re
 quirement\, you will be notified at least one week in advance\, so you can 
 reschedule.  HOW DO I ADVANCE? You'll be trained in Indoor 2 at 9m until yo
 u score 240 pts and master certain NTS* Shot Cycle positions\, then you'll 
 move back to 13.5m in Indoor 3A until you score 240 pts and master more NTS
  Shot Cycle positions\, and then to 18m in Indoor 3B until you score 200 pt
 s. twice and master more NTS Shot Cycle positions. After that you'll be in 
 Indoor 4: Advanced Recreational with Coach Racae!  FEES: All fees are payab
 le in advance of the class to secure your place in the class. $21 / class\,
  if paid on or before Nov. 30\, 2014  $22 / class\, if paid on or before De
 c. 14\, 2014  $23 / class\, if paid after Dec. 14\, 2014.  + Enrollment fee
 : $20 (always due once per semester)  HOW MUCH DO I OWE?  Multiply the numb
 er of classes x the appropriate fee above. Add the $20 semester enrollment 
 fee  HOW DO I PAY IN ADVANCE (after I submit the enrollment form)? Pay the 
 total by Paypal using e-mail address: racae@aajoad.com. We also accept chec
 ks and credit cards in person at the indoor range. Please make your check p
