 ffre Al...\, adult\n8. Hansi Keydel\, 12\n9. Pat Bennett\, adult\n10. \n\nW
 aiting List: \n\nIf your name is on the waiting list\, you have a choice of
  \ncoming to see if a place opens up at the last minute\, or \nrescheduling
  your class for another date/time. \nWe can only take 10 archers on the sho
 oting line at one time. \nThe instructor may also create two shooting lines
 \, which may increase the length of the class for everyone and decrease the
  number of arrows everyone has time to shoot.\nIf you prefer not to be on t
 he waiting list\, please reschedule your class for another date.
