DESCRIPTION:INDOOR 1: First-time class is for juniors age 8+\, optionally t
 heir parents\, and other adults who would like to try archery for the first
  time and join in future Junior Olympic Archery Development (JOAD) and Adul
 t Training classes. \nThis class is a prerequisite for the FALL PROGRAM cla
 sses. Fee: $25/archer. \nIf you have more than one year's experience\, cont
 act us for a placement evaluation ($45) instead of attending the Indoor 1 C
 lass.\n(You will be on the waiting list after 10 people register - see belo
 w.)\n\nRegistered archers:\n1.  Alisa I.\, 11\n2.  Nora I.\, mom\n3.  Keith
  I.\, dad\n4.  Ally Z.\, adult\n5. Geno G.\, adult\n6. Arnold N.\, adult\n7
 . \n8. \n9. \n10. \n\nWaiting List: \n11. \n12. \n\nIf your name is on the 
 waiting list\, you have a choice of \ncoming to see if a place opens up at 
 the last minute\, or \nrescheduling your class for another date/time. \nWe 
 can only take 10 archers on the shooting line at one time. \nIf you prefer 
 not to be on the waiting list\, please reschedule your class for another da
 te.
