DESCRIPTION:PLEASE READ and THEN FILL OUT THE FIELDS AT THE BOTTOM OF THIS 
 REGISTRATION FORM.<br><br>PREREQUISITE: <br>This enrollment form is for JUN
 IOR archers and their PARENTS who have taken and qualified in the Indoor 1:
  First-time Class.<br><br>PARENTS <br>can enroll and shoot with their child
 (ren) in the following classes\, provided they have also taken an Indoor 1:
  First-time Class.<br><br>CAPACITY:    10 archers per class<br>AGES:       
       8 - 18 years old <br>DISTANCES:  9m\, 13.5m<br>BOWS:           Recurv
 es<br><br>EQUIPMENT: <br>We provide all equipment necessary indefinitely at
  no extra charge. (Recurve bow\, 3 arrows\, armguard\, finger tab\, target)
 <br>When you are ready to order your own equipment\, we pace and specify wh
 at you need and help you order it\, so you buy the correct equipment for yo
 ur strength and experience. Generally\, we do not recommend anyone buys equ
 ipment before they have been with us for at least 8 hours.<br><br>CLASS TIM
 ES and COACHES/INSTRUCTORS:<br>These are the days/times that are available 
 to you. All classes are coached by Coach Racae.<br>MIXED Indoor 2/3/4/5+ cl
 asses of JOADs\, Parents\, and Adults at 9m/13.5m/18m.<br><br>SAT:    2:30-
 3:30pm (JOAD + Parents only at 9m/13.5m) <br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&n
 bsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;3:45-4:45pm (MIXED) <
 br><br>SUN:   2:30-3:30pm (JOAD + Parents only at 9m/13.5m) <br>&nbsp\;&nbs
 p\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;3:
 45-4:45pm (MIXED) <br><br>TUES:  5:00-6:00pm JOAD + Parents only at 9m/13.5
 m) <br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp
 \;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;6:00-7:00pm (MIXED) <br><br>WED:  5:00-6:00pm JOAD + Parent
 s only at 9m/13.5m) <br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&n
 bsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;6:00-7:00pm (MIXED) <br><br>FEES: <br>$20/
 hr for any hour above\, and to secure your place in any class before or aft
 er that hour ON THE SAME DAY<br>+  Enrollment fee: $20 (always due once per
  semester) <br>Additional hour(s) ON THE SAME DAY are open to you at the fo
 llowing reduced fees\, provided there are spaces remaining in the class:  $
 20/hr\; $30 for 2 hrs\; $40 for 3 hrs. <br><br>ENROLLMENT IS ON A FIRST-REC
 EIVED AND PAID BASIS.<br>This enrollment form must be completed and your pa
 yment received in order for you to be enrolled and a place reserved for you
 . You can enroll any time during the semester for as many or as few classes
  as you like as long as there are places open.<br>So\, for example\, you ca
 n enroll for the entire semester\, each month\, or sprinkle the days throug
 hout the semester depending on your schedule. (Please bear in mind\, howeve
 r\, you'll progress faster with regular attendance.)<br><br>DROP INS:<br>Yo
 ur name will be on the website calendar under the date and time you registe
 red after we receive your fee in advance of the class. When classes are not
  full\, it's okay to just drop in for the class and pay at that time. When 
 you attend\, and the class is near full\, you should pay at least one class
  in advance to guarantee you have a place next time. You can see the actual
  attendance (including drop-ins) by looking at past classes on the website 
 calendar. If the class is "FULL"\, it will be so indicated on the calendar.
 <br><br>ATTENDANCE RECOMMENDATIONS (in order to improve over time). Recreat
 ional archers have no attendance requirements. <br>INDOOR 2 at 9m :        
  2 hrs/wk<br>INDOOR 3A at 13.5m : 3-4 hrs/wk<br><br>HOW DOES IT WORK? HOW D
 O I ADVANCE?<br>Please look under Programs at <a href="http://www.archerytr
 ainingcenter.com">www.archerytrainingcenter.com</a>\, and read the informat
 ion to understand how it all works.<br><br>Scores are also listed below\, i
 f you kept score\, which is not required\, except on Master Challenge weeks
 . You need 230 pts on 40cm target or 240 pts on 60cm target to graduate out
  of your distance into Indoor 3A at 13.5m\, and again at 13.5m to get into 
 Indoor 3B at 18m (full distance).<br>PB = Personal Best.&nbsp\;<br><br>Regi
 stered archers:<br>1. Zoë C.\, JOAD 13.5m - to pay<br>2. Lily R.\, JOAD 13.
 5m - to pay<br>3.&nbsp\;<br>4.&nbsp\;<br>5.&nbsp\;<br>6.&nbsp\;<br>7.&nbsp\
 ;<br>8.&nbsp\;<br>9.<br>10.
