DESCRIPTION:<u></u><br><b>ATCI monthly competitions are held at the end of 
 each calendar month on Saturdays and Sundays</b>\, weather permitting.&nbsp
 \;<u></u>If you are new to our program\, come and try it\, so you will be m
 ore comfortable and better prepared next month!<br><br><u></u>The only diff
 erences between the regular training sessions and the tournaments are that 
 we are more closely reproducing official competition conditions\, which inc
 lude:<u></u><br><ul><li><u></u>No coaching while you are on the shooting li
 ne (but\, as in a real tournament\, y<u></u>ou can always ask the coach for
  help in between the ends.)&nbsp\;</li><li>This is your chance to find out 
 how well you can do the form on your own\, and learn how to go into ¨trusti
 ng¨ compared with ¨training¨ mode.</li><li><u></u>You will shoot more arrow
 s :&nbsp\; 2 practice ends + two rounds (<u></u>60 arrows at 9m and 13.5m o
 r 72 arrows at 20m-70m)</li><li><u></u>You will score every arrow for two r
 ounds.&nbsp\;<u></u></li><li><u></u>The ends will be timed. You´ll have 4 m
 in to shoot 6 arrows.<u></u></li><li>Everyone will be shooting at close-to-
 official competition spacing\, so there will be two archers on each target 
 about 3 ft apart\, depending on the number of registrations</li><li>There w
 ill be a maximum of 20 archers on the shooting line at the same time. Aweso
 me! (Lots of arrow flying towards the targets!)</li></ul><br>Your goal is a
 lways to replicate the NTS step(s) mindfully and consistently on every shot
 .<br><u></u><b>Outside of the competition weekends</b>\, the focus of your 
 regular lessons will be on one or two of the Steps of Shooting of the NTS (
 National Training System) shot cycle\, to help you focus and improve your f
 orm\, which\, as we all know\, leads to greater precision (tighter groups o
 f arrows) and ultimately greater accuracy (tight groups of arrows dead cent
 er).<br><u></u><br><b>JANUARY</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>7-13<
 /b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\;Welcome to 2023 !&nbsp\; Understanding&nbsp\; NTS CONCEPT
 S especially TRANSFER<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; 14-20</b><b>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</b>N
 TS Step 1: STANCE&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\;&nbsp\;<b>21-27&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</b
 >NTS Step 2:&nbsp\; NOCK&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; 28+29</b><b>&nbsp\;</
 b><b>&nbsp\;</b><b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT&nbsp\;</b><b
 r><b>FEBRUARY</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;30-5</b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\;&nbsp
 \;NTS Step 3: HOOK &amp\; GRIP&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br><u></u>&nbsp\; &nbsp
 \; &nbsp\;<b>6-12&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</b>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;NTS Step 4: SET&nbsp\;&nbs
 p\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;13-19</b>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;REVIE
 W Steps 1-4&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;<b>25+26&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</b><b>A
 TCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT&nbsp\;</b><b>(INDOOR NATIONALS!!
 !!</b>)<br><b>MARCH</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>27-5:&nbsp\; &n
 bsp\;</b>NTS Step 5: SET-UP&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;6-12</b>&nb
 sp\; &nbsp\;&nbsp\;NTS Step 6 DRAW to LOAD&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br><
 u></u><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;13-19&nbsp\;</b>&nbsp\;REVIEW Steps 1-6<b>&
 nbsp\;(Spring Break 13-17)</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>25+26</b
 ><b>&nbsp\;</b>&nbsp\;<b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b><b>
 &nbsp\; &nbsp\;&nbsp\;</b><br><b>APRIL</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;27-
 2&nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 7&nbsp\; ANCHOR&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\
 ; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;<b>3-9&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</b>&nbsp\;NTS Step 8&nbsp\;&n
 bsp\;TRANSFER to HOLD&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;<b>10-16&nbsp
 \;</b>NTS Step 9 EXPAND / AIM<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;17-23&nbsp\;</b>
 NTS Step 10 RELEASE and FOLLOW-THROUGH&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;
 24-30&nbsp\;</b>REVIEW Steps 1-10<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;29+30 ATCI M
 ONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b><br><b>MAY</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp
 \; &nbsp\;1-7&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 11 FEEDBACK<br>&nbsp\; &nb
 sp\; &nbsp\;<b>8-14&nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b>MENTAL PROGRAM<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nb
 sp\;<b>15-21&nbsp\;</b>MENTAL PROGRAM<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;22-31&nb
 sp\;</b>PUTTING IT ALL TOGETHER !!<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;27+28 ATCI 
 MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><br
 ><b><br></b>You do not need to score every class. In fact\, it would be mor
 e beneficial to you if you scored only during the ATCI Monthly Competition 
 and Star Pin Shoot\, which happen the last week of each month. This is beca
 use working on the NTS Steps of Shooting (your form) is more easily done wi
 thout the distraction of the target face or scoring\, and you will improve 
 faster.<br><br>As you reach higher levels\, you will learn the NTS Steps in
  progressively greater detail.<br>The NTS Steps are cumulative with each st
 ep most successfully completed if the previous steps have been completed mi
 ndfully.&nbsp\;<br><br>Your ability to learn and understand the NTS Steps\,
  and use deep focus on these Steps while shooting outdoors and while using 
 your stretchband/string loop at home will propel you to higher levels fast!
 <br><br><b>Goals by the end of the semester:&nbsp\;</b><br>See Coach Racae´
 s email ¨2023 New Year´s Goals¨<u></u>
