DESCRIPTION:This class has been cancelled because of low registration. Come
  to the 6:30 class instead.\n\nAfter you graduate out of Indoor 1\, sign up
  for INDOOR 2-6 at 9m until you score  240 pts on the 60-cm target face or 
 230 pts on the 40-cm target face. Then you will graduate to our outdoor cla
 sses !\n\nAfter you graduate to Outdoor 3-9\, you will be granted access to
  the ATCI Calendar via an email from Coach Racae\, and can just add your na
 me under Registered Archers below.\n\nSCHEDULE :\n​Register for ​​as many a
 s your schedule and budget allows to progress faster:\nSat/Sun   4:30-6:00 
 pm  \nTues         5:00-6:30 pm and 6:30-8:00 pm\n\nWed         5:00-6:30 p
 m and 6:30-8:00 pm (starts Aug 23)\nThurs       5:00-6:30 pm  and 6:30-8:00
  pm\n​Weekdays: Juniors usually come to the 5:00 pm class\, and adults to t
 he 6:30 class\, but all classes are open to both adults and juniors.\n\nAlw
 ays check this calendar just before driving to class in case there are last
