CREATED:20250808T210448Z
DESCRIPTION:After you graduate out of Indoor 1\, sign up for INDOOR 2-6 at 
 9m until you score  240 pts on the 60-cm target face or 230 pts on the 40-c
 m target face. Then you will graduate to our outdoor classes !\n\nAfter you
  graduate to Outdoor 3-9\, you will be granted access to the ATCI Calendar 
 via an email from Coach Racae\, and can just add your name under Registered
  Archers below.\n\nSCHEDULE :\n​Register for ​​as many as your schedule and
  budget allows to progress faster:\nSat/Sun   4:30-6:00 pm  \nTues         
 5:00-6:30 pm and 6:30-8:00 pm\nWed         5:00-6:30 pm and 6:30-8:00 pm (s
 tarts Aug 23)\nThurs       5:00-6:30 pm  and 6:30-8:00 pm\n​Weekdays: Junio
 rs usually come to the 5:00 pm class\, and adults to the 6:30 class\, but a
 ll classes are open to both adults and juniors.\n\nAlways check this calend
 ar just before driving to class in case there are last-minutes changes or c
 ancellations!  Look for your name under Registered Archers or Waiting List 
 below. If there are fewer than 4 people registered\, the class may be cance
 lled at the coach's discretion. In which case you'll need to book another d
 ate or we will refund your fee..\n\nUSA Archery Level 4 NTS Coach Racae Mey
 er unless otherwise noted above.\n\nThe level of each attending archer is n
 oted next to their name below\, to help you decide which classes to join. (
 Example: Indoor 2 or more advanced are Outdoor 3+ (O4 @20m\, etc.)\n\n2025 
 INDOOR 2-6 at 9m\n\nRegistered archers:\n1. Chi C.\, adult\, USAA\, OB\, pd
  (O4@20m)\, pd. 1.5 hrs \n2. Logan C.\, 8\, on 60-cm target face\, USAA\, O
 B\, pd (O3@13.5m) 1.5 hrs \n3. Finn E 13\, O6 40m 1.5hrs\n4. Rhys E 11\, O4
  20m did not shoot\n5. Everett Z.\, 13\, (Indoor 2)\, 1.5 hrs\n6.\n7.\n8.\n
 9.\n10.\n11.\n12.\n\nSINGLE Class Fees per archer for one Indoor 2-6 class:
 \n$31 for 1 hr (arrive 30 min after class starts or leave 30 min before cla
 ss ends)\n$43 for 1.5 hrs\n\nMULTI-Class Discount Packets\n  9 hours : $250
  (six 1.5-hr classes)\n 12 hours : $320 (eight 1.5-hr classes)\n 18 hours :
  $460 (twelve 1.5-hr classes) \n\nThere are 8 places on the shooting line\,
  and we sometimes have double lines depending on attendance.\n\nSign in/out
  upon arrival/departure\nFor single classes\, book and pay in advance.\nFor
  multi-class discount packs\, pay in advance and book when you are sure of 
 the dates.\nCoaching and whistle commands at all times.\nInstruction in the
  National Training System.\nUnfair games depending on attendance.\n\nPlease
  note: Youths <12 y.o. should not shoot more than 100 arrows/day!\n\nPrereq
 uisites for Indoor 2: \nAdults: No min. score in Indoor 1 \nJuniors: 50 pts
  in Indoor 1\nScores needed at 9m to advance to Indoor 3-6 and Outdoor 3-6:
 \n\n                 On 40-cm                  On 60-cm\n               tar
 get face                 target face\nIndoor 3:          230 pts           
      240 pts           -> Outdoor 3 at 13.5m\nIndoor 4:          250 pts   
              260 pts           -> Outdoor 4 at 18m/20m\nIndoor 5:          
 270 pts                280 pts           -> Outdoor 5 at 30m\nIndoor 6:    
       290 pts                300 pts          ->  Outdoor 6 at 40m
LAST-MODIFIED:20260517T075126Z
LOCATION:5446 W US Hwy 290 Service Rd\, Unit 102\, Austin\, TX 78735\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:INDOOR 2-6 at 9m with Coach Nick
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
