 cted) = <b>2.13 arrow avg </b>(Top 1.7\; Bottom 2.5)</li></ol><br>Those who
  have already qualified for Indoor Nationals at TAMU in February:<br>Coach 
 Joel\, Coach Nick\, Instructor Lily\, Ted\, Christine\, Javier\, Erika<br><
 br>All archers going to the Indoor Nationals wll be shooting at 18m unless 
