 far. In that case\, you will be shooting at 13.5m on 60-cm target face if J
 OAD until your form and groups tighten up\, and you shoot  an arrow average
  of 6.0 pts.<br>U15 and U13 JOAD archers shoot on 60-cm target face to get 
 ready for JOAD Indoor Nationals\; use 40-cm target face if you are going to
  Indoor Nationals (any age)<br><br>Field work this weekend: Finish cleaning
  up and painting fenced enclosure.<br><br>Target Assignments:<br><br>Target
 s 1 should always stay at 70m so Jake can shoot.<br>Target 2 at 60m<br>Targ
 et 3 at 40m<br>Targets 4-9 at 18m <br>Targets 10 at 13.5m<br>See notes belo
