 r>7B. Ellie Y\, 10\, USAA\, OB\, pd<br>---------------------------------- <
 br>8A. Joel Y\, adult\, USAA\, ob\, pd<br>8B. <br><br>9A. <br>-------------
 ---------------------<br>9B<br><br>13.5m 40-cm:<br>10A.<br>10B<br><br>Ideal
 ly\, we want to practice with at least two archers/target to replicate comp
 etition conditions as much as possible.<br>You can decide each week if you 
 want to shoot at your long distance or at 18m and add or move your name on 
