 ></u></u></u></u></a><br><br>This class has been moved to indoors due to th
 e low temperatures outdoors.<br><br><b><i>Those who have already qualified 
 for Indoor Nationals at TAMU in February:</i></b><br><b><i>Coach Joel\, Coa
 ch Nick\, Instructor Lily\, Ted\, Christine\, Javier\, Erika<br></i></b><br
 ><i><b>All archers going to the Indoor Nationals wll be shooting at 18m</b>
  unless you need to build up your strength and tighten your form to group o
 ut that far. In that case\, you will be shooting at <b>13.5m on 60-cm targe
 t face if JOAD</b> until your form and groups tighten up\, and you shoot  a
 n arrow average of 6.0 pts.</i><br><i><b>U15 and U13 JOAD archers shoot on 
