  face if you are going to Indoor Nationals (any age)</b><br></i><br>1. <b>M
 iles G</b>.\, 12\, USAA\, ob - 2.0 hrs <br><br>Ideally\, we want to practic
 e with at least two archers/target to replicate competition conditions as m
