DESCRIPTION:<h1>2025 TSAA State Indoors</h1><p>Here is the registration Lin
 k.</p><p><a href="https://eyesonscore.com/archer-registration-form/NG4zaE0y
 U29JbFBPOVcraUZqU1Zndz09" target="_blank"><u><u>https://eyesonscore.com/arc
 her-registration-form/NG4zaE0yU29JbFBPOVcraUZqU1Zndz09</u></u></a></p><p><b
 >ATCI Registered Archers </b>(also look under shooting times on the ATCI Ca
 lendar<b> and </b><a href="https://eyesonscore.com/archer-list/NG4zaE0yU29J
 bFBPOVcraUZqU1Zndz09" target="_blank">https://eyesonscore.com/archer-list/N
 G4zaE0yU29JbFBPOVcraUZqU1Zndz09</a> <b>:</b></p><p></p><ol><li>Ted H MMR60+
 </li><li>Coach Joel SMR</li><li>Coach Nick SMR</li><li>Sophia D.\, SFR</li>
 <li>Joseph U18</li><li>Kishore U18</li><li>Lily U18</li><li>Finn U15</li><l
 i>Abby U15</li><li>Rhys U13</li><li>Daisy U13</li><li>.</li><li>.</li><li>.
 </li><li>.</li><li>.</li></ol><p></p><p>The 2025 Texas State Indoor Champio
 nships are set for January 11 and 12\, 2025 with a new location now availab
 le!</p><p>Fort Grard Guns &amp\; Archery 3800 Mineral Wells Hwy\, Weatherfo
 rd\, Texas 76088 for our North Location\;</p><p><b>Kealing Middle School 16
 07 Pennsylvania Ave\, Austin\, TX 78702 for our central location\;</b></p><
 p>Texas Archery Learning Center - 5833 Treaschwig Rd. Spring\, TX 77373 for
  our southeast location.</p><p>Participants must be a member of USA Archery
  or the NFAA with a temporary membership. International Guests (non U.S. ci
 tizens) - Please go to <a href="http://www.usarchery.org" target="_blank"><
 u>www.usarchery.org</u></a> to purchase a Temporary Membership for Foreign 
 Nationals.</p><p>Archers will register to shoot a single 60 arrow World Arc
 hery indoor round on a 3-spot or single spot target on either Saturday or S
 unday. Awards will be mailed out for the divisions.</p><p>Divisions in the 
 State Championship are available for U13\, U15\, U18\, U21\, Senior\, 50+\,
  60+ and 70+\, in Recurve\, Compound\, Barebow\, Fixed Pins\, Longbow\, and
  Para. </p><p>U13 and U15 have the option to shoot a 60 cm face.</p><p>Line
  times are:</p><p><b>Saturday 10:00 am and 2:00 pm</b></p><p><b>Sunday 10:0
 0 am</b>. We will open another line if we get all lines full before the sho
 ot.</p><p>Registration is $60 for U21\, Seniors\, 50+\, 60+\, and 70+ and $
 45 for Youth (U13\, U15\, and U18)\, plus a $1.99 service fee and any PayPa
 l fees.</p><p>Registration is set to check for age of participants based on
  the 2025 calendar year.</p><p>All divisions follow World Archery Rules exc
 ept for Fixed Pins\, which follows the rules set by USA Archery.</p><p><b>D
 eadline for registration January 9th</b>.</p><p>For inquiries about registr
 ation please contact the event organizer at: <a href="mailto:president@texa
 sarchery.org" target="_blank"><u>president@texasarchery.org</u></a></p><p>P
 lease Note: As a registered participant in a USA Archery sanctioned event\,
  you are required to adhere to the Minor Athlete Abuse Prevention Policies 
 for the duration of the event.</p><p><br></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260517T074556Z
LOCATION:Kealing Middle School 1607 Pennsylvania Ave\, Austin\, TX 78702 
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:TSAA State Indoor Championships
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
