 door 2: <br>Adults: No min. score in Indoor 1 <br>Juniors: 50 pts in Indoor
  1<br>Scores needed at 9m to advance to Indoor 3-6 and Outdoor 3-6:<br><br>
                  On 40-cm                  On 60-cm<br>               targe
 t face                 target face<br>Indoor 3:          230 pts           
