 nSimon dV\, adult\n\nWaiting list:\n\nWhat if my name is on the Waiting Lis
 t?\nIf your name is on the waiting list\, you have a choice of coming to se
 e if a place opens up at the last minute\, or rescheduling your class for a
 nother date/time. We can only take 10 archers on the shooting line at one t
 ime. The instructor may also create two shooting lines\, which will increas
 e the length of the class for everyone and decrease the number of arrows ev
 eryone has time to shoot.\nIf you prefer not to be on the waiting list\, pl
 ease reschedule your class for another date.\n\nParents: We are part of the
  US Olympic Committee's Safe Sport program\, so we minimally require 2 adul
 ts to be present at all times. Please plan to stay with your child whenever
  necessary to fulfill this requirement.
