 hoot with their child(ren) in the following classes\, provided they have al
 so taken an Indoor 1: First-time Class.<br><br>PLEASE COMPLETE ONE REGISTRA
 TION FORM FOR EACH ARCHER. You can register anytime all semester\, as long 
 as there are places left in the class. If there are no spaces left\, it wil
 l indicate "FULL" for that class on the website calendar.<br><br>CAPACITY: 
    10 archers per class<br>AGES:             8 - 80? years old <br>DISTANCE
 S:  9m\, 13.5m\, and 18m<br>BOWS:           Recurves<br><br>EQUIPMENT: <br>
