 asses. This class is a prerequisite for all other training classes. If you 
 have more than one year experience\, contact us for a placement evaluation 
 ($45) instead of attending the Indoor 1 Class.\n\nRegistered archers:\n1. D
 orsey W.\, 8\n2. Sherina W.\, mom\n3. Daniel H.\, 11\n4. Phil H.\, dad\n5. 
 Adriana S.\, adult\n6. Jennifer N.\, adult\n7. Mark S.\, adult\n8. Ronan C.
 \, age?\n9. Raj\, 8\n10. Mark W.\, adult\n\nWaiting List: \n11. Patty W.\, 
 adult\n12. \n13. \n\nIf your name is on the waiting list\, you have a choic
 e of \ncoming to see if a place opens up at the last minute\, or \nreschedu
 ling your class for another date/time. \nWe can only take 10 archers on the
  shooting line at one time. \nThe instructor may also create two shooting l
 ines\, which may increase the length of the class for everyone and decrease
  the number of arrows everyone has time to shoot.\nIf you prefer not to be 
 on the waiting list\, please reschedule your class for another date.
