 door 1\, click the Sign Up button at the top of&nbsp\;<a href="http://www.a
 rcherytrainingcenter.com">www.archerytrainingcenter.com</a>.)<br><br>OPEN t
 o Adults in<br>INDOOR 2 (9m) and<br>INDOOR 3A (13.5m) and&nbsp\;<br>INDOOR 
 3B/4/5/6+ (18m)<br><br>Enrollment links at:&nbsp\;<a href="http://www.arche
 rytrainingcenter.com/Classes">http://www.archerytrainingcenter.com/Classes<
 /a><br><br>Fees:&nbsp\;<br>RECREATIONAL:&nbsp\;<br>$20/cl for 1 hr\; $30/cl
  for 2 hrs\; $40/cl for 3 hrs ON THE SAME DAY.<br>There are also reduced Mo
 nthly fees when you regularly come to more than 3 hrs/week and Progressive 
 fees when you are at 18m and regularly come to more than 5 hrs/week. Ask Co
 ach Racae for more information.<br>&nbsp\;<br>Your name will be on the list
  below when we receive your registration form and fee in advance of the cla
 ss. When you attend\, and the class is near full\, you should pay at least 
 one class in advance to guarantee you have a place on the shooting line nex
 t time.&nbsp\;<br><br>When classes are not full\, it's okay to just drop in
  occasionally for the class and pay at that time. However it is difficult t
 o tell how many people will be dropping in\, so to secure your place\, it i
 s better to register and pay in advance to prevent overcrowding. We can onl
 y take 10 people on the shooting line at one time.&nbsp\;<br><br>When we ha
 ve more than 10 archers\, we will form a second line\, as in a tournament\,
  which will reduce the number of arrows shot per person within the time. (Y
 ou can see the actual attendance and class composition by looking at past c
 lasses at&nbsp\;<a href="http://www.archerytrainingcenter.com/calendar">www
 .archerytrainingcenter.com/calendar</a>.)<br><br>Scores are also listed bel
 ow\, if you kept score\, which is not required\, except on Master Challenge
  weeks. You need 230 pts on 40cm target or 240 pts on 60cm target to gradua
 te out of your distance into Indoor 3A 13.5m\, and again at 13.5m to get in
 to Indoor 3B at 18m (full distance).<br>PB = Personal Best.&nbsp\;<br><br>R
 egistered archers:<br>1. Valur G.\, adult 9m - paid - 258 going to 13.5m<br
 >2. Jesse\, adult 9m - paid<br>3.&nbsp\;<br>4.&nbsp\;<br>5.&nbsp\;<br>6.&nb
 sp\;<br>7.&nbsp\;<br>8.&nbsp\;<br>9.<br>10.
