CREATED:20191221T163946Z
DESCRIPTION:PLEASE READ and THEN FILL OUT THE FIELDS AT THE BOTTOM OF THE R
 EGISTRATION FORM at <a href="http://www.archerytrainingcenter.com">www.arch
 erytrainingcenter.com</a>&nbsp\;<br><br>PREREQUISITE: <br>This enrollment f
 orm is for ADULTS\,  JUNIOR archers and their PARENTS who have taken and qu
 alified in the Indoor 1: First-time Class.<br><br>PARENTS <br>can enroll an
 d shoot with their child(ren) in the following classes\, provided they have
  also taken an Indoor 1: First-time Class.<br><br>PLEASE COMPLETE ONE REGIS
 TRATION FORM FOR EACH ARCHER. You can register anytime all semester\, as lo
 ng as there are places left in the class. If there are no spaces left\, it 
 will indicate "FULL" for that class on the website calendar.<br><br>CAPACIT
 Y:    10 archers per class<br>AGES:             8 - 80? years old <br>DISTA
 NCES:  9m\, 13.5m\, and 18m<br>BOWS:           Recurves<br><br>EQUIPMENT: <
 br>We provide all equipment necessary indefinitely at no extra charge. (Rec
 urve bow\, 3 arrows\, armguard\, finger tab\, target)<br>When you are ready
  to order your own equipment\, we pace and specify what you need and help y
 ou order it\, so you buy the correct equipment for your strength and experi
 ence. Generally\, we do not recommend anyone buys equipment before they hav
 e been with us for at least 8 hours.<br><br>CLASS TIMES and COACHES/INSTRUC
 TORS:<br>These are the days/times that are available to you. All classes ar
 e coached by Coach Racae.<br>MIXED Indoor 2/3/4/5+ classes of JOADs\, Paren
 ts\, and Adults at 9m/13.5m/18m.<br>SAT:      3:45-4:45pm<br>SUN:     3:45-
 4:45pm<br>TUES:   6:00-7:00pm  <br>WED:    6:00-7:00pm <br><br>FEES: <br>$2
 0/hr for any hour above\, and to secure your place in any class before or a
 fter that hour ON THE SAME DAY<br>+  Enrollment fee: $20 (always due once p
 er semester) <br>Additional hour(s) ON THE SAME DAY are open to you at the 
 following reduced fees\, provided there are spaces remaining in the class: 
  $20/hr\; $30 for 2 hrs\; $40 for 3 hrs. <br><br>ENROLLMENT IS ON A FIRST-R
 ECEIVED AND PAID BASIS.<br>This enrollment form must be completed and your 
 payment received in order for you to be enrolled and a place reserved for y
 ou. You can enroll any time during the semester for as many or as few class
 es as you like as long as there are places open.<br>So\, for example\, you 
 can enroll for the entire semester\, each month\, or sprinkle the days thro
 ughout the semester depending on your schedule. (Please bear in mind\, howe
 ver\, you'll progress faster with regular attendance.)<br><br>DROP INS:<br>
 Your name will be on the website calendar under the date and time you regis
 tered after we receive your fee in advance of the class. When classes are n
 ot full\, it's okay to just drop in for the class and pay at that time. Whe
 n you attend\, and the class is near full\, you should pay at least one cla
 ss in advance to guarantee you have a place next time. You can see the actu
 al attendance (including drop-ins) by looking at past classes on the websit
 e calendar. If the class is "FULL"\, it will be so indicated on the calenda
 r.<br><br>ATTENDANCE RECOMMENDATIONS (in order to improve over time). Recre
 ational archers have no attendance requirements. <br>INDOOR 2 at 9m :      
