DESCRIPTION:<b>What we worked on:</b><br>Use shoestring fingersling<br>Sync
 hronized Release:<br>Scoop and push continuously toward target\; lead with 
 bow arm<br>Keep Grip ¨V¨ pointing toward 10-ring upon Release/Follow-throug
 h: No turning inward<br>Keep bow arm up until you hear arrow hit the paper<
 br>Posture:<br>Core tight\, chest down\, shoulders relaxed and down\; (too 
 straight results in bow almost hitting you)<br><b>Homework:</b><br>Work on 
 above<br>Holding SPTs: 10 sec / 20 rest - start clock at Holding\; do 10 se
 c or stop for session (all or nothing)\; count how many you can do up to ab
 out 70-80% of max.\; one day on\, two days rest
