DESCRIPTION:After you graduate out of Indoor 1\, sign up for INDOOR 2-6 at 
 9m until you score  240 pts on the 60-cm target face or 230 pts on the 40-c
 m target face. Then you will graduate to our outdoor classes !<br><br>After
  you graduate to Outdoor 3-9\, you will be granted access to the ATCI Calen
 dar via an email from Coach Racae\, and can just add your name under Regist
 ered Archers below.<br><br>SCHEDULE :<br>​Register for ​​as many as your sc
 hedule and budget allows to progress faster:<br>Sat/Sun   4:30-6:00 pm  <br
 >Tues         5:00-6:30 pm and 6:30-8:00 pm<br>Wed         5:00-6:30 pm and
  6:30-8:00 pm (starts Aug 23)<br>Thurs       5:00-6:30 pm  and 6:30-8:00 pm
 <br>​Weekdays: Juniors usually come to the 5:00 pm class\, and adults to th
 e 6:30 class\, but all classes are open to both adults and juniors.<br><br>
 Always check this calendar just before driving to class in case there are l
 ast-minutes changes or cancellations!<br>Look for your name under Registere
 d Archers or Waiting List below. If there are fewer than 4 people registere
 d\, the class may be cancelled at the coach's discretion. In which case you
 'll need to book another date or we will refund your fee..<br><br>USA Arche
 ry Level 4 NTS Coach Racae Meyer unless otherwise noted above.<br><br>The l
 evel of each attending archer is noted next to their name below\, to help y
 ou decide which classes to join. (Example: Indoor 2 or more advanced are Ou
 tdoor 3+ (O4 @20m\, etc.)<br><br>2025 INDOOR 2-6 at 9m<br><br>Registered ar
 chers:<br><ol><li><b>Chi C.</b>\, adult\, USAA\, OB\, pd (O4@20m)\, pd - <b
 >256 pts </b>40cm</li><li><b>Miles G</b>.\, 13\, (O6@40m)  USAA\, ob\, pd -
  <b>262 pts </b>60cm</li><li><b>Rhys E</b>.\, 11 (O4@20m) USAA\, ob\, pd - 
 <b>240 pts </b>60cm</li><li><b>Logan C</b>.\, 8\, on 60-cm target face\, US
 AA\, OB\, pd (O3@13.5m) <b>206 pts </b>60cm</li><li><b>Finn E</b><span>.\, 
 13\, (O6@40m) USAA\, ob\, pd </span><b>219 pts? </b>no name?<br></li><li><b
 >Everett Z.\, </b><span>13\, (Indoor 2)\, pd - </span><b>151  </b><span>no 
 name?</span><br></li></ol><br><b>Phi A</b><span>.\, adult\, (Indoor 2?)\, p
 d? DNA</span><br><br>SINGLE Class Fees per archer for one Indoor 2-6 class:
 <br>$31 for 1 hr (arrive 30 min after class starts or leave 30 min before c
 lass ends)<br>$43 for 1.5 hrs<br><br>MULTI-Class Discount Packets<br>  9 ho
 urs : $250 (six 1.5-hr classes)<br> 12 hours : $320 (eight 1.5-hr classes)<
 br> 18 hours : $460 (twelve 1.5-hr classes) <br><br>There are 8 places on t
 he shooting line\, and we sometimes have double lines depending on attendan
 ce.<br><br>Sign in/out upon arrival/departure<br>For single classes\, book 
 and pay in advance.<br>For multi-class discount packs\, pay in advance and 
 book when you are sure of the dates.<br>Coaching and whistle commands at al
 l times.<br>Instruction in the National Training System.<br>Unfair games de
 pending on attendance.<br><br>Please note: Youths &lt\;12 y.o. should not s
 hoot more than 100 arrows/day!<br><br>Prerequisites for Indoor 2: <br>Adult
 s: No min. score in Indoor 1 <br>Juniors: 50 pts in Indoor 1<br>Scores need
 ed at 9m to advance to Indoor 3-6 and Outdoor 3-6:<br><br>                 
 On 40-cm                  On 60-cm<br>               target face           
       target face<br>Indoor 3:          230 pts                240 pts     
       -&gt\; Outdoor 3 at 13.5m<br>Indoor 4:          250 pts              
