 5 hrs<br>4.<br>5.<br>6.<br>7.<br>8.<br>9.<br>10.<br>11.<br>12.<br><br>SINGL
 E Class Fees per archer for one Indoor 2-6 class:<br>$31 for 1 hr (arrive 3
 0 min after class starts or leave 30 min before class ends)<br>$43 for 1.5 
 hrs<br><br>MULTI-Class Discount Packets<br>  9 hours : $250 (six 1.5-hr cla
 sses)<br> 12 hours : $320 (eight 1.5-hr classes)<br> 18 hours : $460 (twelv
 e 1.5-hr classes) <br><br>There are 8 places on the shooting line\, and we 
 sometimes have double lines depending on attendance.<br><br>Sign in/out upo
