DESCRIPTION:PLEASE READ and THEN FILL OUT THE FIELDS AT THE BOTTOM OF THE R
 EGISTRATION FORM.<br><br>PREREQUISITE: <br>This enrollment form is for JUNI
 OR archers and their PARENTS who have taken and qualified in the Indoor 1: 
 First-time Class.<br><br>PARENTS <br>can enroll and shoot with their child(
 ren) in the following classes\, provided they have also taken an Indoor 1: 
 First-time Class.<br><br>CAPACITY:    10 archers per class<br>AGES:        
      8 - 18 years old <br>DISTANCES:  9m\, 13.5m<br>BOWS:           Recurve
 s<br><br>EQUIPMENT: <br>We provide all equipment necessary indefinitely at 
 no extra charge. (Recurve bow\, 3 arrows\, armguard\, finger tab\, target)<
 br>When you are ready to order your own equipment\, we pace and specify wha
 t you need and help you order it\, so you buy the correct equipment for you
 r strength and experience. Generally\, we do not recommend anyone buys equi
 pment before they have been with us for at least 8 hours.<br><br>CLASS TIME
 S and COACHES/INSTRUCTORS:<br>These are the days/times that are available t
 o you. All classes are coached by Coach Racae.<br>MIXED Indoor 2/3/4/5+ cla
 sses of JOADs\, Parents\, and Adults at 9m/13.5m/18m.<br><br>SAT:    2:30-3
 :30pm (JOAD + Parents only at 9m/13.5m) <br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nb
 sp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;3:45-4:45pm (MIXED) <b
 r><br>SUN:   2:30-3:30pm (JOAD + Parents only at 9m/13.5m) <br>&nbsp\;&nbsp
 \;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;3:4
 5-4:45pm (MIXED) <br><br>TUES:  5:00-6:00pm JOAD + Parents only at 9m/13.5m
 ) <br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\
 ;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;6:00-7:00pm (MIXED) <br><br>WED:  5:00-6:00pm JOAD + Parents
  only at 9m/13.5m) <br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nb
 sp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;6:00-7:00pm (MIXED) <br><br>FEES: <br>$20/h
 r for any hour above\, and to secure your place in any class before or afte
 r that hour ON THE SAME DAY<br>+  Enrollment fee: $20 (always due once per 
 semester) <br>Additional hour(s) ON THE SAME DAY are open to you at the fol
 lowing reduced fees\, provided there are spaces remaining in the class:  $2
 0/hr\; $30 for 2 hrs\; $40 for 3 hrs. <br><br>ENROLLMENT IS ON A FIRST-RECE
 IVED AND PAID BASIS.<br>This enrollment form must be completed and your pay
 ment received in order for you to be enrolled and a place reserved for you.
  You can enroll any time during the semester for as many or as few classes 
 as you like as long as there are places open.<br>So\, for example\, you can
  enroll for the entire semester\, each month\, or sprinkle the days through
 out the semester depending on your schedule. (Please bear in mind\, however
 \, you'll progress faster with regular attendance.)<br><br>DROP INS:<br>You
 r name will be on the website calendar under the date and time you register
 ed after we receive your fee in advance of the class. When classes are not 
 full\, it's okay to just drop in for the class and pay at that time. When y
 ou attend\, and the class is near full\, you should pay at least one class 
 in advance to guarantee you have a place next time. You can see the actual 
 attendance (including drop-ins) by looking at past classes on the website c
 alendar. If the class is "FULL"\, it will be so indicated on the calendar.<
 br><br>ATTENDANCE RECOMMENDATIONS (in order to improve over time). Recreati
 onal archers have no attendance requirements. <br>INDOOR 2 at 9m :         
 2 hrs/wk<br>INDOOR 3A at 13.5m : 3-4 hrs/wk<br><br>HOW DOES IT WORK? HOW DO
  I ADVANCE?<br>Please look under Programs at <a href="http://www.archerytra
 iningcenter.com">www.archerytrainingcenter.com</a>\, and read the informati
 on to understand how it all works.<br><br>Scores are also listed below\, if
  you kept score\, which is not required\, except on Master Challenge weeks.
  You need 230 pts on 40cm target or 240 pts on 60cm target to graduate out 
 of your distance into Indoor 3A at 13.5m\, and again at 13.5m to get into I
 ndoor 3B at 18m (full distance).<br>PB = Personal Best.&nbsp\;<br><br>Regis
 tered archers:<br>1. Zoë C.\, JOAD 13.5m - paid<br>2. Will A.\, JOAD 13.5m 
 - paid<br>3. Emily A.\, JOAD 9m - paid - DNA<br>4. Jeff A.\, Parent 13.5m -
  paid&nbsp\;<br>5. Lily R.\, JOAD 13.5m - paid - came for personal trainer<
 br>6. Gunnar\, JOAD 9m - to pay<br>7. Katalina\, JOAD 9m - paid but owes 4%
  on 4 classes = $3.20<br>8. Shaun S.\, adult 9m - paid + e.f.<br>9.<br>10.
