 tdoor classes !<br><br><b>After you graduate to Outdoor 3-9</b>\, you will 
 be granted access to the ATCI Calendar via an email from Coach Racae\, and 
 can just add your name under Registered Archers below.<br><b><br>SCHEDULE :
