 ess faster:<br><b>Sat/Sun   4:30-6:00 pm  </b><br><b>Tues         </b><b>5:
 00-6:30 pm </b>and <b>6:30-8:00 pm</b><b><br></b><br><b>Wed         5:00-6:
 30 pm </b>and <b>6:30-8:00 pm </b>(starts Aug 23)<br><b>Thurs       5:00-6:
 30 pm</b>  and <b>6:30-8:00 pm</b><br>​Weekdays: Juniors usually come to th
 e 5:00 pm class\, and adults to the 6:30 class\, but all classes are open t
 o both adults and juniors.<br><br><b>Always check this calendar just before
