DESCRIPTION:<h1>2025 TSAA State Indoors</h1><p>Here is the registration Lin
 k.</p><p><a href="https://eyesonscore.com/archer-registration-form/NG4zaE0y
 U29JbFBPOVcraUZqU1Zndz09" target="_blank"><u><u>https://eyesonscore.com/arc
 her-registration-form/NG4zaE0yU29JbFBPOVcraUZqU1Zndz09</u></u></a></p><p>Al
 so look under shooting times on the ATCI Calendar<b> and </b><a href="https
 ://eyesonscore.com/archer-list/NG4zaE0yU29JbFBPOVcraUZqU1Zndz09" target="_b
 lank"><u>https://eyesonscore.com/archer-list/NG4zaE0yU29JbFBPOVcraUZqU1Zndz
 09</u></a> <b>:</b><br></p><p><b>2025 Competitive Team at Texas State Indoo
 rs:</b></p><p></p><ol><li>Ted H MMR60+</li><li>Coach Joel SMR</li><li>Coach
  Nick SMR</li><li>Colby K. SMR</li><li>Javier G. SMR</li><li>Erika O-G SFR<
 /li><li>Hannah T.\, SFR</li><li>Sophia D.\, SFR</li><li>Joseph U18</li><li>
 Kishore U18</li><li>Pranav C U18</li><li>Lily U18</li><li>Finn U15</li><li>
 Abby U15</li><li>Sofia W. U15</li><li>Ananya C U15</li><li>Miles G U15</li>
 <li>Riley M. U15</li><li>Rhys U13</li><li>Daisy U13</li><li>Jacqui C. U13</
 li></ol><p></p><p>The 2025 Texas State Indoor Championships are set for Jan
 uary 11 and 12\, 2025 with a new location now available!</p><p>Fort Grard G
 uns &amp\; Archery 3800 Mineral Wells Hwy\, Weatherford\, Texas 76088 for o
 ur North Location\;</p><p><b>Kealing Middle School 1607 Pennsylvania Ave\, 
 Austin\, TX 78702 for our central location\;</b></p><p>Texas Archery Learni
 ng Center - 5833 Treaschwig Rd. Spring\, TX 77373 for our southeast locatio
 n.</p><p>Participants must be a member of USA Archery or the NFAA with a te
 mporary membership. International Guests (non U.S. citizens) - Please go to
  <a href="http://www.usarchery.org" target="_blank"><u>www.usarchery.org</u
 ></a> to purchase a Temporary Membership for Foreign Nationals.</p><p>Arche
 rs will register to shoot a single 60 arrow World Archery indoor round on a
  3-spot or single spot target on either Saturday or Sunday. Awards will be 
 mailed out for the divisions.</p><p>Divisions in the State Championship are
  available for U13\, U15\, U18\, U21\, Senior\, 50+\, 60+ and 70+\, in Recu
 rve\, Compound\, Barebow\, Fixed Pins\, Longbow\, and Para. </p><p>U13 and 
 U15 have the option to shoot a 60 cm face.</p><p>Line times are:</p><p><b>S
 aturday 10:00 am and 2:00 pm</b></p><p><b>Sunday 10:00 am</b>. We will open
  another line if we get all lines full before the shoot.</p><p>Registration
  is $60 for U21\, Seniors\, 50+\, 60+\, and 70+ and $45 for Youth (U13\, U1
 5\, and U18)\, plus a $1.99 service fee and any PayPal fees.</p><p>Registra
 tion is set to check for age of participants based on the 2025 calendar yea
 r.</p><p>All divisions follow World Archery Rules except for Fixed Pins\, w
 hich follows the rules set by USA Archery.</p><p><b>Deadline for registrati
 on January 9th</b>.</p><p>For inquiries about registration please contact t
 he event organizer at: <a href="mailto:president@texasarchery.org" target="
