DESCRIPTION:Coach Racae \n2.5-hr Class $25/archer  \nINDOOR 1: First-time c
 lass is for juniors age 8+\, optionally their parents\, and other adults wh
 o would like to try archery for the first time and join in future Junior Ol
 ympic Archery Development (JOAD) and Adult Training classes.   \nThis class
  is a prerequisite for all classes.   \nEnrollment link: Click the Sign Up 
 button at the top of the ATCI homepage.  \nIf you have more than one year's
  experience\, contact us for a placement evaluation ($45) instead of attend
 ing the Indoor 1 Class. \n\n(You will be on the waiting list after 10 peopl
 e register - see below.)  \nRegistered archers: \n1.  Ellie P.\, 9  (reg. 4
 /24)\n2.  Greg P.\, dad\n3.  Skyelar H.\, age? (reg 4/25 9:42am)\n4.  Simru
