 \, adult\n12.  Hannah McI.\, adult\n13.  Sarah M.\, 10 (reg 4/26 7:26pm)\n1
 4.  Susan M.\, mom\n15. \n16. \n17. \n18. \nIf your name is on the waiting 
 list\, you have a choice of  coming to see if a place opens up at the last 
