 b> -&gt\; Outdoor 2&nbsp\;</b><u></u><br><u></u>8. <b>Gaius McC</b>.\, 13 -
  pd - <b>116 pts -&gt\; Outdoor 2</b><br>9. <b>Beth D.\, </b>18 - pd - <b>3
