DESCRIPTION:This is a first-time class for adults who have never shot with 
 us before\, and generally have little to no experience.\n\nIf you have more
  than 1 year's experience in archer\, please contact us for an evaluation s
 ession\, which will prepare you to enter the regular Tuesday evening adult 
 sessions. (Fee: $40)\n\nRegistered Archers:\nAlysah S\nRoger P\nJulius A\nR
 aymund M\nAshley R\nMel A\nErin K\nChris K\nBrandon A\nRachael B\n\nWaiting
  List (see note below):\nEvan D\nCourtney M\nJudy J\nWill J\nJennifer J\n\n
 If your name is on the waiting list\, you have a choice of coming to see if
  a place opens up at the last minute\, or rescheduling your class for anoth
 er date/time. \nWe can only take 10 archers on the shooting line at one tim
 e\, so if a space does not open\, you will not be in the class. \nAlternati
 vely\, if there is no class immediately following this class\, the instruct
 or may opt to create two shooting lines\, which will increase the length of
  the class for everyone and decrease the number of arrows a person will hav
 e a chance to shoot.\n\nIf you prefer not to be on the waiting list\, pleas
 e reschedule your class for another date.
