DESCRIPTION:<b>ATCI monthly competitions are held at the end of each calend
 ar month on Saturdays and Sundays</b>\, weather permitting.&nbsp\;<u></u>If
  you are new to our program\, come and try it\, so you will be more comfort
 able and better prepared next month!<br><br><u></u>The only differences bet
 ween the regular training sessions and the tournaments are that we are more
  closely reproducing official competition conditions\, which include:<u></u
 ><br><ul><li><u></u>No coaching while you are on the shooting line (but\, a
 s in a real tournament\, y<u></u>ou can always ask the coach for help in be
 tween the ends.)&nbsp\;</li><li>This is your chance to find out how well yo
 u can do the form on your own\, and learn how to go into ¨trusting¨ compare
 d with ¨training¨ mode.</li><li><u></u>You will shoot more arrows :&nbsp\; 
 2 practice ends + two rounds (<u></u>60 arrows at 9m and 13.5m or 72 arrows
  at 20m-70m)</li><li><u></u>You will score every arrow for two rounds.&nbsp
 \;<u></u></li><li><u></u>The ends will be timed. You´ll have 4 min to shoot
  6 arrows.<u></u></li><li>Everyone will be shooting at close-to-official co
 mpetition spacing\, so there will be two archers on each target about 3 ft 
 apart\, depending on the number of registrations</li><li>There will be a ma
 ximum of 20 archers on the shooting line at the same time. Awesome! (Lots o
 f arrow flying towards the targets!)</li></ul><br>Your goal is always to re
 plicate the NTS step(s) mindfully and consistently on every shot.<br><u></u
 ><b>Outside of the competition weekends</b>\, the focus of your regular les
 sons will be on one or two of the Steps of Shooting of the NTS (National Tr
 aining System) shot cycle\, to help you focus and improve your form\, which
 \, as we all know\, leads to greater precision (tighter groups of arrows) a
 nd ultimately greater accuracy (tight groups of arrows dead center).<br><u>
 </u><br><b>JANUARY</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>7-13</b>&nbsp\; 
 &nbsp\;Welcome to 2023 !&nbsp\; Understanding&nbsp\; NTS CONCEPTS especiall
 y TRANSFER<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; 14-20</b><b>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 1: 
 STANCE&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\;&nbsp\;<b>21-27&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 2
 :&nbsp\; NOCK&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; 28+29</b><b>&nbsp\;</b><b>&nbsp\
 ;</b><b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT&nbsp\;</b><br><b>FEBRUA
 RY</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;30-5</b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\;&nbsp\;NTS Step 
 3: HOOK &amp\; GRIP&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br><u></u>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;<
 b>6-12&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</b>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;NTS Step 4: SET&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&
 nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;13-19</b>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;REVIEW Steps 1-4
 &nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;<b>25+26&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</b><b>ATCI MONTHLY
  COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT&nbsp\;</b><b>(INDOOR NATIONALS!!!!</b>)<br>
 <b>MARCH</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>27-5:&nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b>NT
 S Step 5: SET-UP&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;6-12</b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\
 ;&nbsp\;NTS Step 6 DRAW to LOAD&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br><u></u><b>&n
 bsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;13-19&nbsp\;</b>&nbsp\;REVIEW Steps 1-6<b>&nbsp\;(Spri
 ng Break 13-17)</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><b>25+26</b><b>&nbsp\;
 </b>&nbsp\;<b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b><b>&nbsp\; &nb
 sp\;&nbsp\;</b><br><b>APRIL</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;27-2&nbsp\; &n
 bsp\;</b>NTS Step 7&nbsp\; ANCHOR&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &
 nbsp\; &nbsp\;<b>3-9&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</b>&nbsp\;NTS Step 8&nbsp\;&nbsp\;TRANSF
 ER to HOLD&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;<b>10-16&nbsp\;</b>NTS S
 tep 9 EXPAND / AIM<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;17-23&nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 10
  RELEASE and FOLLOW-THROUGH&nbsp\;<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;24-30&nbsp\
 ;</b>REVIEW Steps 1-10<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;29+30 ATCI MONTHLY COMP
 ETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b><br><b>MAY</b><br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;1
 -7&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b>NTS Step 11 FEEDBACK<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\
 ;<b>8-14&nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b>MENTAL PROGRAM<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;<b>15-2
 1&nbsp\;</b>MENTAL PROGRAM<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;22-31&nbsp\;</b>PUT
 TING IT ALL TOGETHER !!<br><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;27+28 ATCI MONTHLY COM
 PETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b><b>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;</b><br><b><br></b
 >You do not need to score every class. In fact\, it would be more beneficia
 l to you if you scored only during the ATCI Monthly Competition and Star Pi
 n Shoot\, which happen the last week of each month. This is because working
  on the NTS Steps of Shooting (your form) is more easily done without the d
 istraction of the target face or scoring\, and you will improve faster.<br>
 <br>As you reach higher levels\, you will learn the NTS Steps in progressiv
 ely greater detail.<br>The NTS Steps are cumulative with each step most suc
 cessfully completed if the previous steps have been completed mindfully.&nb
 sp\;<br><br>Your ability to learn and understand the NTS Steps\, and use de
 ep focus on these Steps while shooting outdoors and while using your stretc
 hband/string loop at home will propel you to higher levels fast!<br><br><b>
 Goals by the end of the semester:&nbsp\;</b><br>See Coach Racae´s email ¨20
 23 New Year´s Goals¨
