DESCRIPTION:<i>Sorry to disappoint you\, but the heat index is already 105F
  at 12:50pm today\, Mon 6/26\, and it´s only going up today and all week! J
 ust too dangerous out there.. </i><i>I´m canceling the open range\, and all
  the evening weekday classes this week.</i><br><i>Shooting really great sho
 ts with great form is reduced under these conditions\, so it is a much bett
 er use of your time\, if you spend the time working in front of your mirror
 s with your stretchbands/string loops\, and trying to understand / feel / d
 o the NTS shot cycle. </i><br><i>See you on the weekend. We´ve got two out 
 of three archer tents up\, and four really nice new dark blue pop-up tents 
 for spectators\, so it should be fine in the mornings on Saturday and Sunda
 y. I´m looking forward to seeing you then!</i><br>                         
                                                <i><b>Coach Racae </b></i><i
 ><b><br></b></i>This is a NEW session for those ATCI members shooting recur
 ve bows at 20m-70m in Outdoor 4-9.  <br><b>Register here</b>: <a href="http
 s://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfJfEM3tMQkTg9p7HLnorDwepLGgDzqHYq9jcg
 QN6XTHwKEQg/viewform"><u>2023 Outdoor 4-9 at 20m-70m</u></a> <br><b>Fee: $3
 0/session</b> for open range session with <b>no coaching</b>. Your name wil
 l be added and your place reserved under Target Assignments below once we r
 eceive your registration and fee in advance. <b>Multi-class discount pack l
 essons do not apply. You need to pay for open range separately.</b><br><b>E
 quipment: </b>You should also have your own equipment by now. If you need t
 o order equipment\, ask Coach Jake to measure your draw length\, and then c
 ontact Coach Racae who will give you a specification list of recommended eq
 uipment\, which you order directly from <a href="http://lancasterarchery.co
 m">lancasterarchery.com</a>.<br><b>Private 30-min Lessons: </b>If you would
  like to book a private 30-min lesson with Coach Jake Lanoux during an open
  range time at no additional cost\, select the date and time within the abo
 ve registration link. Your name will be added next to the time you requeste
 d under Private Lessons below. You can practice on the open range before or
  after your private lesson.<br><br>All archers are on 122-cm target face. U
 SA Archery Safety Rules\, including whistle system\, will apply.<br><br><b>
 TARGET ASSIGNMENTS:</b><br><br>1. (70m target)<br><br>2. (60/50m target)<br
 ><br>3. (40m target) <b>Justin W.</b>\, adult\, O6 40m\, <b>USAA\, OB</b><b
 r><br>4. (30m target)<br><br>5. (20m target)<br><br><b>PRIVATE LESSON BOOKI
 NGS:</b><br><br><b>6:30-7:00:</b>
