 ose positions. When you stay in the present\, just doing what you need to d
 o as you need to do it\, your conscious mind will be occupied\, instead of 
 random thoughts entering your head or you being distracted by emotional or 
 environmental elements. </p><p>You´ll need to build up your mental program 
 alongside your form knowledge\, so when your body is trained to shoot excel
 lent shots\, your self image and subconscious support you\, instead of unde
 rmining you. </p><p><i>Improving your training\, practicing\, and competiti
 on components\, process\, and skills is a perpetual lifetime quest\, which 
 you´ll slowly learn to love. You´ll  realize what is under your control\, a
 nd you'll become your own best coach! Those who find all this fun and enjoy
  the journey are the ones who win - the champions!</i></p><p><i>I know you 
 can do it -  I'm your biggest fan!</i></p><p><i>​I'm also really looking fo
 rward to seeing you improve\, succeed\, and thrive !​</i></p><p><b><i>     
                                               Coach Racae<br></i></b></p>
