 m) 121\n5. Will A. (9m) 110\n6. Jeff A. (parent 9m) 156 avg\n7. Andrew L. (
 9m) PB 257!! to 13.5m!\n8. Lily R. (13.5m)\n9. Josephine L. (13.5m) 160\n10
 . Cathy S. (13.5m) 164
