DESCRIPTION:<b>COME JOIN US AND REGISTER NOW !</b><br><b><br></b>This class
  is open to <b>adults\, juniors\, and parents</b> <b>who have taken and gra
 duated out of Outdoor 1 (</b>prior to Sept 2) or <b>Indoor 1: First-time Cl
 ass and are shooting at 9m </b> <br>Classes are based on skill level\, not 
