DESCRIPTION:Coach Racae \n2.5-hr Class $25/archer  \nINDOOR 1: First-time c
 lass is for juniors age 8+\, optionally their parents\, and other adults wh
 o would like to try archery for the first time and join in future Junior Ol
 ympic Archery Development (JOAD) and Adult Training classes.   \nThis class
  is a prerequisite for all classes.   \nEnrollment link: Click the Sign Up 
 button at the top of the ATCI homepage. \nIf you have more than one year's 
 experience\, contact us for a placement evaluation ($45) instead of attendi
 ng the Indoor 1 Class.  \n(You will be on the waiting list after 10 people 
 register - see below.)  \n\nRegistered archers: \n1.  Anna M.\, 8\n2.  Sara
 h M.\, 10\n3.  Chris M.\, dad\n4.  Linus W.\, 8\n5.  Alex W.\, dad\n6.  \n7
 .  \n8.  \n9.  \n10.   \nWaiting List:  \n11.  \n12.   \nIf your name is on
  the waiting list\, you have a choice of  coming to see if a place opens up
  at the last minute\, or  rescheduling your class for another date/time.  W
 e can only take 10 archers on the shooting line at one time.  If you prefer
  not to be on the waiting list\, please reschedule your class for another d
 ate.
