UID:3c7so0uip65hm66at4q4gv6k40@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;VALUE=DATE:20230218
CREATED:20230111T060429Z
DESCRIPTION:JANUARY\n     8-13   Welcome to 2023 !  Understanding  NTS CONC
 EPTS especially TRANSFER\n    14-20  NTS Step 1: STANCE \n    21-27  NTS St
 ep 2:  NOCK \n    28+29  ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT \nFEBR
 UARY\n     30-5    NTS Step 3: HOOK & GRIP   \n     6-12    NTS Step 4: SET
     \n     13-19  REVIEW Steps 1-4 \n     25+26  ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION a
 nd STAR PIN SHOOT (INDOOR NATIONALS!!!!)\nMARCH\n     27-5:   NTS Step 5: S
 ET-UP \n     6-12    NTS Step 6 DRAW to LOAD    \n     13-19  REVIEW Steps 
 1-6 (Spring Break 13-17)\n     25+26  ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN
  SHOOT    \nAPRIL\n     27-2   NTS Step 7  ANCHOR   \n       3-9   NTS Step
  8  TRANSFER to HOLD  \n     10-16 NTS Step 9 EXPAND / AIM\n     17-23 NTS 
 Step 10 RELEASE and FOLLOW-THROUGH \n     24-30 REVIEW Steps 1-10\n     29+
 30 ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT\nMAY\n     1-7     NTS Step 
 11 FEEDBACK\n     8-14   MENTAL PROGRAM\n     15-21 MENTAL PROGRAM\n     22
 -30 PUTTING IT ALL TOGETHER !!\n     27+28 ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STA
 R PIN SHOOT     \n Intro\nEach week the focus of your lessons will be on pa
 rticular Steps of Shooting of the NTS (National Training System) shot cycle
 \, to help you focus and improve your form\, which\, as we all know\, leads
  to greater and consistent precision (tight groups of arrows) and ultimatel
 y greater accuracy (tight groups of arrows dead center). Concurrently you w
 ill be learning how to build a strong mental program\, which will improve y
 our focus\, awareness and confidence for competitions later.\nAs you reach 
 higher levels\, you will learn the NTS Steps in progressively greater detai
 l.\nThe NTS Steps are cumulative with each step most successfully completed
  if the previous steps have been completed well. \nGoals by the end of the 
 winter/spring semester (May 30)\nMake a list of what you want to accomplish
  by the end of the semester. Email it to Coach Racae\, so you can discuss i
 t together. \nYour two main goals are to replicate the NTS step(s) mindfull
 y and consistently on every shot\, and build a mental program that is consi
 stent on every shot. \nIf you stay in the present just doing what you need 
 to do as you need to do it\, your conscious mind will be occupied\, instead
  of random thoughts entering your head or you being distracted by emotional
  or environmental elements. You´ll need to build up your mental program alo
 ngside your form knowledge\, so when your body is trained to shoot excellen
 t shots\, your self image and subconscious support you\, instead of undermi
 ning you. Confidence and consistency in form and mind are major goals. \nIm
 proving your training\, practicing\, and competition components\, process\,
  and skills is a perpetual lifetime quest\, which you´ll slowly learn to lo
 ve. You´ll  realize what is under your control\, and become your own best c
 oach! Those who find all this fun and enjoy the journey are the ones who wi
 n - the champions!\nI know you can do it -  I'm your biggest fan!\n​I'm als
 o really looking forward to seeing you improve\, succeed\, and thrive !​\n 
                                                   Coach Racae
LAST-MODIFIED:20260517T081016Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Form Focus - Weekly NTS Steps of Shooting
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
