UID:1ajbtljoe5sh13nko089ce7ccd@google.com
CREATED:20241001T155100Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><b>FALL TRAINING PROGRAM (Aug 31-Dec 19)</b> We will go thro
 ugh the <b>National Training System (NTS) 11 Steps of Shooting</b> and <b>B
 uilding Your Mental Program</b> step-by-step during the regular training cl
 asses\, covering each one in sequence during the following weeks.. </p><p>L
 earning\, understanding and doing the NTS and building a strong mental prog
 ram are ongoing quests that all archers are continuously trying to achieve 
 - even at the highest levels !<br></p><p><i><b>What if you miss some of the
  weeks?</b>  </i>We'll do our best to catch you up during your next session
 s. </p><p><b><i>Also see more important notes below\, under the schedule.</
 i></b></p><p><b>SEPTEMBER</b><br></p><ul><li><b>  Sat Aug 31 - Th Sept 5</b
 >       <b>WELCOME </b>!  Understanding  <b>NTS CONCEPTS</b> especially TRA
 NSFER + NTS Step 1:<b> STANCE</b></li><li><b>  Sat 7 - Th 12    </b>NTS Ste
 p 2: <b> NOCK + </b><b> </b>NTS Step 3: <b>HOOK &amp\; GRIP </b>+ Building 
 Your Mental Program</li><li>  <b>Sat 14 - Th 19</b>   NTS Step 4:<b> SET</b
 ><b> + </b>Building Your Mental Program</li><li><b>  Tues 24- Su 29  </b><b
 >ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b><b> </b><b>   </b></li></ul
 ><p></p><p><b>OCTOBER</b><br></p><ul><li><b>  Tues 1 - Su 6</b><b>    </b>N
 TS Step 5:<b> SET-UP </b><b>+</b> Building Your Mental Program</li><li>  <b
 >Tues 8 - Su 13  </b>  NTS Step 6 <b>DRAW</b> to <b>LOAD </b>+ Building You
 r Mental Program</li><li><b>  Tues 15 - Th 24</b>  NTS Step 7  <b>ANCHOR </
 b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li><li>  <b>Sat 26 - Th 31  </b><b>ATCI M
 ONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b><b> </b><b>    </b><b> </b></li></
 ul><p></p><p><b>NOVEMBER</b><br></p><ul><li><b>Sat 2 - Th 7  </b>NTS Step 8
 <b>  TRANSFER</b><b> to HOLD </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li><li><b>
 Sat 9 - Th 14  </b>NTS Step 9<b> EXPAND / AIM </b><b>+ </b>Building Your Me
 ntal Program<br></li><li><b>Sat 16 - Th 21 </b> NTS Step 10 <b>RELEASE / FO
 LLOW-THROUGH</b> + Building Your Mental Program</li><li><b>Fri 22 - Su 24 A
 GGIE INVITATIONAL </b>at TAMU\, College Station</li><li><b>Sat 23 - Wed 27 
  </b><b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b></li><li><b>Th 28 - 
 Sun Dec 1 THANKSGIVING</b></li></ul><br><b>DECEMBER</b><br><ul><li><b>Tues 
 3 - Th 12</b>  NTS Step 11 <b>FEEDBACK</b>+ Building Your Mental Program</l
 i><li><b>Tues 10 - Th 19  </b><b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOO
 T</b></li><li><b>Sat 21- Th Jan 2 : CHRISTMAS / NEW YEAR BREAK</b></li></ul
 ><p></p><p><b>Sat\, January 4\, 2025 - SPRING TRAINING PROGRAM starts. </b>
 </p><p><b>INTRO</b></p><p><i>Each week the focus of your lessons will be on
  one or two particular <b>Steps of Shooting of the NTS (National Training S
 ystem) </b>shot cycle\, to help you focus and improve your form\, which\, a
 s we all know\, leads to greater and more consistent precision (tight group
 s of arrows) and ultimately greater accuracy (tight groups of arrows dead c
 enter)</i>. <i>Concurrently you will be learning how to build a <b>strong m
 ental program</b>\, which will improve your focus\, awareness and confidenc
 e for competitions later.</i></p><p><i>The NTS is the <b>most biomechanical
 ly efficient and least injurious method of shooting</b>\, and is highly and
  continuously researched out at the Elite Athletes Center in Chula Vista\, 
 CA. It is what the Olympians do!</i></p><p><i>The 11 NTS Steps are cumulati
 ve with each step most successfully completed if the previous steps have be
 en completed well. </i><i>As you reach higher levels\, you will learn the N
 TS Steps in progressively greater detail.</i></p><p><b>Goals by the end of 
 the fall semester (Dec 19)</b></p><p>Make a list of what you want to accomp
 lish by the end of the semester. Email it to Coach Racae\, so you can discu
 ss it together. </p><p>Confidence and consistency in form and mind are your
  two main goals. Replicate the NTS step(s) mindfully and consistently on ev
 ery shot\, and build a strong mental program that is consistent on every sh
 ot. </p><p>Your conscious mind commands your subconscious mind to put your 
 body into position\, after you train your body to be in those positions. Wh
 en you stay in the present\, just doing what you need to do as you need to 
 do it\, your conscious mind will be occupied\, instead of random thoughts e
 ntering your head or you being distracted by emotional or environmental ele
 ments. </p><p>You´ll need to build up your mental program alongside your fo
 rm knowledge\, so when your body is trained to shoot excellent shots\, your
  self image and subconscious support you\, instead of undermining you. </p>
 <p><i>Improving your training\, practicing\, and competition components\, p
 rocess\, and skills is a perpetual lifetime quest\, which you´ll slowly lea
 rn to love. You´ll  realize what is under your control\, and you'll become 
 your own best coach! Those who find all this fun and enjoy the journey are 
 the ones who win - the champions!</i></p><p><i>I know you can do it -  I'm 
 your biggest fan!</i></p><p><i>​I'm also really looking forward to seeing y
 ou improve\, succeed\, and thrive !​</i></p><p><b><i>                      
                              Coach Racae<br></i></b></p>
