DESCRIPTION:<h2><strong>Texas Archery Indoor League (TAIL)</strong></h2><p>
 presented by</p><p>Texas Archery Academy</p><p><strong>World Archery compet
 ition format*</strong></p><p><strong>Open to ALL shooters!</strong></p><p>&
 nbsp\;$15 Youth &amp\; Adult Division</p><p>2pm start\, registration 1pm</p
 ><p><strong>Last Sunday of the month (Jan – Oct)</strong></p><ul><li>Equipm
 ent is limited to 60lbs draw weight and arrow shaft no greater than 9.3mm\,
  point size no greater than 9.4mm&nbsp\;</li></ul><p></p><p><strong>Dates f
 or 2020: &nbsp\;1/26 2/23 3/29 4/26 5/31 6/28 7/26 8/30 9/27 10/25&nbsp\;</
 strong></p><p>Each TAIL shoot has awards for individual performance and SOY
  award for season!</p><p>DIVISIONS: Age\, Gender\, and Equipment</p><p><str
 ong>Texas Archery Academy&nbsp\;</strong>600 Accent Dr.\, #B Plano\, TX 750
 75</p><p><strong>FORMAT</strong><br></p><p>30 arrows&nbsp\;<em>(10 ends of 
 3 arrows)</em>&nbsp\;at 18 meters or 9 meters<em>&nbsp\;(for ages 9 and und
 er).</em>. You are striving for your top 2 scores at 18 meters during the s
 eason to qualify you for SOY award. &nbsp\;<em>This also serves as the “Pin
 s Shoot” to earn individual performance awards from USA Archery (described 
 at end of page) under tournament conditions.&nbsp\;</em></p><p><a href="htt
 p://texasarchery.info/wp-content/uploads/2011/09/TargetFaceFITA.jpg"></a></
 p><p><a href="http://texasarchery.info/wp-content/uploads/2014/04/IMG_0071.
 jpg">Award for top score per equipment style at each league shoot at 18 met
 ers &nbsp\;(all genders and ages combined).</a></p><hr><p><strong>DIVISIONS
 :</strong></p><p>&nbsp\;Your age as of first TAIL event of the season. This
  is the age group you shoot in all season.</p><p><strong>Youth: &nbsp\;</st
 rong>Yeoman (9 or under)\, Bowman (10-12)\, Cub (13-14)\, Cadet (15-17)</p>
 <p><strong>Adults:</strong>&nbsp\; Junior (18-20)\, Senior (21-49)\, Master
  (50+)</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260517T080136Z
LOCATION:Texas Archery Academy 600 Accent Dr.\, #B Plano\, TX 75075
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Texas Archery Indoor League (TAIL) - Plano
