DESCRIPTION:PREREQUISITE: INDOOR 1: First-time Class\n(To register for Indo
 or 1\, click the Sign Up button at the top of www.archerytrainingcenter.com
 .)\n\nOPEN to Juniors/Parents in\nINDOOR 2 (9m) and\nINDOOR 3A (13.5m) \n\n
 Enrollment links at: http://www.archerytrainingcenter.com/Classes\n\nFees: 
 \nRECREATIONAL: \n$20/cl for 1 hr.\nThere are also reduced Monthly fees and
  Progressive fees - \nLook under "Classes" on our website.\n\nYour name wil
 l be on the list below when we receive your fee in advance of the class. Wh
 en classes are not full\, it's okay to just drop in for the class and pay a
 t that time. When you attend\, and the class is near full\, you should pay 
 at least one class in advance to guarantee you have a place next time. You 
 can see the actual attendance by looking at past classes. Scores are also l
 isted\, if you kept score\, which is not required\, except on Master Challe
 nge weeks. PB = Personal Best. You need 230 pts on 40cm target or 240 pts o
 n 60cm target to graduate out of your distance to 13.5m\, and again at 13.5
 m to get back to 18m (full distance). (* = attended\; DNA = Did not attend\
 ; number after name = score\; PB = Personal Best))\n\nRegistered archers:\n
 1. NIcholas T. (13.5m) *\n2. Erwin (parent 9m) 230 PB to 13.5m\n3. Lea (9m)
  204\n4. Ajith R. (9m) PB 227\n5. Will A. (9m) DNA\n6. Jeff A. (parent 9m) 
 DNA\n7. Darian K. (13.5m) *\n8. Lily R. (13.5m) *\n9. Cathy (13.5m) 179\n10
 .Andrew (13.5m) *\n11. Justin (13.5m) DNA\n12. Ezra B. (9m) *
