DESCRIPTION:First-time class for juniors age 8+and optionally their parents
  who would like to try archery for the first time and join in future Junior
  Olympic Archery Development (JOAD) and Adult Training classes.\n\nRegister
 ed archers:\n\nWaiting List: None\n\nIf your name is on the waiting list\, 
 you have a choice of \ncoming to see if a place opens up at the last minute
 \, or \nrescheduling your class for another date/time. \nWe can only take 1
 0 archers on the shooting line at one time. \nThe instructor may also creat
 e two shooting lines\, which will increase the length of the class for ever
 yone and decrease the number of arrows everyone has time to shoot.\nIf you 
 prefer not to be on the waiting list\, please reschedule your class for ano
 ther date.
