DESCRIPTION:Coach Dan \n2.5-hr Class $25/archer  \nEnrollment link: Click t
 he Sign Up button at the top of www.archerytrainingcenter.com\n\nINDOOR 1: 
 First-time class is for juniors age 8+\, optionally their parents\, and oth
 er adults who would like to try archery for the first time and join in futu
 re Junior Olympic Archery Development (JOAD) and Adult Training classes.   
