 ment evaluation ($45) instead of attending the Indoor 1 Class.  \n\n(You wi
 ll be on the waiting list after 10 people register - see below.)  \n\nRegis
 tered archers: \n1.  Meagan P.\, adult\n2.  Aaron P.\, adult\n3.  Ben K.\, 
 adult\n4.  Shana K.\, adult\n5.  Luke S.\, adult\n6.  Nicholas C.\, 11\n7. 
