DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20241022
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20241023
DTSTAMP:20261004T164459Z
UID:1ajbtljoe5sh13nko089ce7ccd@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;VALUE=DATE:20241022
CREATED:20241001T155100Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><b>FALL TRAINING PROGRAM (Aug 31-Dec 19)</b> We will go thro
 ugh the <b>National Training System (NTS) 11 Steps of Shooting</b> and <b>B
 uilding Your Mental Program</b> step-by-step during the regular training cl
 asses\, covering each one in sequence during the following weeks.. </p><p>L
 earning\, understanding and doing the NTS and building a strong mental prog
 ram are ongoing quests that all archers are continuously trying to achieve 
 - even at the highest levels !<br></p><p><i><b>What if you miss some of the
  weeks?</b>  </i>We'll do our best to catch you up during your next session
 s. </p><p><b><i>Also see more important notes below\, under the schedule.</
 i></b></p><p><b>SEPTEMBER</b><br></p><ul><li><b>  Sat Aug 31 - Th Sept 5</b
 >       <b>WELCOME </b>!  Understanding  <b>NTS CONCEPTS</b> especially TRA
 NSFER + NTS Step 1:<b> STANCE</b></li><li><b>  Sat 7 - Th 12    </b>NTS Ste
 p 2: <b> NOCK + </b><b> </b>NTS Step 3: <b>HOOK &amp\; GRIP </b>+ Building 
 Your Mental Program</li><li>  <b>Sat 14 - Th 19</b>   NTS Step 4:<b> SET</b
 ><b> + </b>Building Your Mental Program + <b>REVIEW</b></li><li><b>  Tues 2
 4- Su 29  </b><b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b><b> </b><b>
    </b></li></ul><p></p><p><b>OCTOBER</b><br></p><ul><li><b>  Tues 1 - Su 6
 </b><b>    </b>NTS Step 5:<b> SET-UP </b><b>+</b> Building Your Mental Prog
 ram</li><li>  <b>Tues 8 - Su 13  </b>  NTS Step 6 <b>DRAW</b> to <b>LOAD </
 b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li><li><b>  Tues 15 - Th 24</b>  NTS Step
  7  <b>ANCHOR </b>+ Building Your Mental Program + <b>REVIEW</b></li><li>  
 <b>Sat 26 - Th 31  </b><b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b><b
 > </b><b>    </b><b> </b></li></ul><p></p><p><b>NOVEMBER</b><br></p><ul><li
 ><b>Sat 2 - Th 7  </b>NTS Step 8<b>  TRANSFER</b><b> to HOLD </b>+ Building
  Your Mental Program</li><li><b>Sat 9 - Th 14  </b>NTS Step 9<b> EXPAND / A
 IM </b><b>+ </b>Building Your Mental Program<br></li><li><b>Sat 16 - Th 21 
 </b> NTS Step 10 <b>RELEASE / FOLLOW-THROUGH</b> + Building Your Mental Pro
 gram + <b>REVIEW</b></li><li><b>Fri 22 - Su 24 AGGIE INVITATIONAL </b>at TA
 MU\, College Station</li><li><b>Sat 23 - Wed 27  </b><b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPET
 ITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b></li><li><b>Th 28 - Sun Dec 1 THANKSGIVING</b><
 /li></ul><br><b>DECEMBER</b><br><ul><li><b>Tues 3 - Th 12</b>  NTS Step 11 
 <b>FEEDBACK</b>+ Building Your Mental Program + <b>REVIEW</b></li><li><b>Tu
 es 10 - Th 19  </b><b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b></li><
 li><b>Sat 21- Th Jan 2 : CHRISTMAS / NEW YEAR BREAK</b></li></ul><p></p><p>
 <b>Sat\, January 4\, 2025 - SPRING TRAINING PROGRAM starts. </b></p><p><b>I
 NTRO</b></p><p><i>Each week the focus of your lessons will be on one or two
  particular <b>Steps of Shooting of the NTS (National Training System) </b>
 shot cycle\, to help you focus and improve your form\, which\, as we all kn
 ow\, leads to greater and more consistent precision (tight groups of arrows
 ) and ultimately greater accuracy (tight groups of arrows dead center)</i>.
  <i>Concurrently you will be learning how to build a <b>strong mental progr
 am</b>\, which will improve your focus\, awareness and confidence for compe
 titions later.</i></p><p><i>The NTS is the <b>most biomechanically efficien
 t and least injurious method of shooting</b>\, and is highly and continuous
 ly researched out at the Elite Athletes Center in Chula Vista\, CA. It is w
 hat the Olympians do!</i></p><p><i>The 11 NTS Steps are cumulative with eac
 h step most successfully completed if the previous steps have been complete
 d well. </i><i>As you reach higher levels\, you will learn the NTS Steps in
  progressively greater detail.</i></p><p><b>Goals by the end of the fall se
 mester (Dec 19)</b></p><p>Make a list of what you want to accomplish by the
  end of the semester. Email it to Coach Racae\, so you can discuss it toget
 her. </p><p>Confidence and consistency in form and mind are your two main g
 oals. Replicate the NTS step(s) mindfully and consistently on every shot\, 
 and build a strong mental program that is consistent on every shot. </p><p>
 Your conscious mind commands your subconscious mind to put your body into p
 osition\, after you train your body to be in those positions. When you stay
  in the present\, just doing what you need to do as you need to do it\, you
 r conscious mind will be occupied\, instead of random thoughts entering you
 r head or you being distracted by emotional or environmental elements. </p>
 <p>You´ll need to build up your mental program alongside your form knowledg
 e\, so when your body is trained to shoot excellent shots\, your self image
  and subconscious support you\, instead of undermining you. </p><p><i>Impro
 ving your training\, practicing\, and competition components\, process\, an
 d skills is a perpetual lifetime quest\, which you´ll slowly learn to love.
  You´ll  realize what is under your control\, and you'll become your own be
 st coach! Those who find all this fun and enjoy the journey are the ones wh
 o win - the champions!</i></p><p><i>I know you can do it -  I'm your bigges
 t fan!</i></p><p><i>​I'm also really looking forward to seeing you improve\
 , succeed\, and thrive !​</i></p><p><b><i>                                 
                   Coach Racae<br></i></b></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260517T080526Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:FORM FOCUS
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
