BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20230603
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20230604
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;WKST=SU;UNTIL=20230813;BYDAY=SA,SU,MO,TU,TH
DTSTAMP:20261004T164459Z
UID:0f57undkuutbafht5tqif3b95i@google.com
CREATED:20230525T192243Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>The <b>Summer Training Program (June 3-Aug 13)</b> is a cond
 ensed program\, meaning that we will go through the <b>NTS 11 Steps of Shoo
 ting</b> and <b>Building Your Mental Program</b> much faster than during th
 e Fall and Winter/Spring semesters. </p><p><b>JUNE</b><br></p><ul><li><b>  
 S 3 - F 9</b>   <b>Welcome </b>!  Understanding  <b>NTS CONCEPTS</b> especi
 ally TRANSFER</li><li><b>  S 10 - F 16 </b>NTS Step 1:<b> STANCE</b><b> + <
 /b>NTS Step 2: <b> NOCK</b><b> + </b>Building Your Mental Program</li><li><
 span>  <b>S 17 - F 23  </b> NTS Step 3: <b>HOOK &amp\; GRIP </b>+ </span>Bu
 ilding Your Mental Program</li><li><b>  S 24 + Su 25  ATCI MONTHLY COMPETIT
 ION and STAR PIN SHOOT </b></li><li><b>  M 26 - F 30  </b>Review</li></ul><
 p></p><p><b>JULY</b><br></p><ul><li><b>  S 1 - F 7</b><b>      </b>NTS Step
  4:<b> SET</b><b> + </b>NTS Step 5:<b> SET-UP </b><b>+</b> Building Your Me
 ntal Program</li><li><span>  <b>S 8 - F 14  </b>  NTS Step 6 <b>DRAW</b> to
  <b>LOAD </b>+ </span>Building Your Mental Program </li><li><span><b>  S 15
  - F 21</b>  NTS Step 7  <b>ANCHOR </b>+ </span>Building Your Mental Progra
 m</li><li><span>  </span><b>S 22 - F 28  </b><span>NTS Step 8  </span><b>TR
 ANSFER</b><span> to </span><b>HOLD </b><span><b>+ </b>Building Your Mental 
 Program</span></li><li>  <b>S 29 + Su 30  ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR
  PIN SHOOT </b></li></ul><p></p><p><b>AUGUST</b><br></p><ul><li><b>  M 31 -
  Su 6: </b> NTS Step 9<b> EXPAND / AIM </b><b>+ </b>Building Your Mental Pr
 ogram</li><li><span><b>  M 7 - Su 13</b>  NTS Step 10 <b>RELEASE / FOLLOW-T
 HROUGH</b> + NTS Step 11 <b>FEEDBACK </b></span></li></ul><p></p><p><b> Mon
 \, August 14 - FALL SEMESTER STARTS and NTS Steps of Shooting start over ag
 ain!  </b></p><p><b>INTRO</b></p><p><i>Each week the focus of your lessons 
 will be on particular <b>Steps of Shooting of the NTS (National Training Sy
 stem) </b>shot cycle\, to help you focus and improve your form\, which\, as
  we all know\, leads to greater and consistent precision (tight groups of a
 rrows) and ultimately greater accuracy (tight groups of arrows dead center)
 </i>. <i>Concurrently you will be learning how to build a <b>strong mental 
 program</b>\, which will improve your focus\, awareness and confidence for 
 competitions later.</i></p><p><i>As you reach higher levels\, you will lear
 n the NTS Steps in progressively greater detail.</i></p><p><i>The NTS Steps
  are cumulative with each step most successfully completed if the previous 
 steps have been completed well. </i></p><p><b>Goals by the end of the summe
 r semester (Aug 13)</b></p><p>Make a list of what you want to accomplish by
  the end of the semester. Email it to Coach Racae\, so you can discuss it t
 ogether. </p><p>Your two main goals are to replicate the NTS step(s) mindfu
 lly and consistently on every shot\, and build a mental program that is con
 sistent on every shot. </p><p>If you stay in the present\, just doing what 
 you need to do as you need to do it\, your conscious mind will be occupied\
 , instead of random thoughts entering your head or you being distracted by 
 emotional or environmental elements. You´ll need to build up your mental pr
 ogram alongside your form knowledge\, so when your body is trained to shoot
  excellent shots\, your self image and subconscious support you\, instead o
 f undermining you. Confidence and consistency in form and mind are major go
 als. </p><p><i>Improving your training\, practicing\, and competition compo
 nents\, process\, and skills is a perpetual lifetime quest\, which you´ll s
 lowly learn to love. You´ll  realize what is under your control\, and becom
 e your own best coach! Those who find all this fun and enjoy the journey ar
 e the ones who win - the champions!</i></p><p><i>I know you can do it -  I'
 m your biggest fan!</i></p><p><i>​I'm also really looking forward to seeing
  you improve\, succeed\, and thrive !​</i></p><p><b><i>                    
                                Coach Racae</i></b></p>
