DESCRIPTION:<p><b>JANUARY</b><br><b>     8</b><b>-13</b>   <b>Welcome</b> t
 o 2023 !  Understanding  NTS CONCEPTS especially TRANSFER<br><b>    14-20</
 b><b>  </b>NTS Step 1: STANCE <br>    <b>21-27  </b>NTS Step 2:  NOCK <br><
 b>    28+29</b><b> </b><b> </b><b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHO
 OT </b><br><b>FEBRUARY</b><br><b>     30-5</b>    NTS Step 3: HOOK &amp\; G
 RIP   <br><u></u>     <b>6-12  </b>  NTS Step 4: SET    <br><b>     13-19</
 b>  REVIEW Steps 1-4 <br>     <b>25+26  </b><b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and
  STAR PIN SHOOT </b><b>(INDOOR NATIONALS!!!!</b>)<br><b>MARCH</b><br><b>   
   </b><b>27-5:   </b>NTS Step 5: SET-UP <br><b>     6-12</b>    NTS Step 6 
 DRAW to LOAD    <br><u></u><b>     13-19 </b> REVIEW Steps 1-6<b> (Spring B
 reak 13-17)</b><br><b>     </b><b>25+26</b><b> </b> <b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPETI
 TION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b><b>    </b><br><b>APRIL</b><br><b>     27-2   </
 b>NTS Step 7  ANCHOR   <br>       <b>3-9  </b> NTS Step 8  TRANSFER to HOLD
   <br>     <b>10-16 </b>NTS Step 9 EXPAND / AIM<br><b>     17-23 </b>NTS St
 ep 10 RELEASE and FOLLOW-THROUGH <br><b>     24-30 </b>REVIEW Steps 1-10<br
 ><b>     29+30 ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b><br><b>MAY</b
 ><br><b>     1-7     </b>NTS Step 11 FEEDBACK<br>     <b>8-14   </b>MENTAL 
 PROGRAM<br>     <b>15-21 </b>MENTAL PROGRAM<br><b>     22-30 </b>PUTTING IT
  ALL TOGETHER !!<br><b>     27+28 ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHO
 OT</b><b>     </b><br></p><p> <b>Intro</b></p><p><i>Each week the focus of 
 your lessons will be on particular Steps of Shooting of the NTS (National T
 raining System) shot cycle\, to help you focus and improve your form\, whic
 h\, as we all know\, leads to greater and consistent precision (tight group
 s of arrows) and ultimately greater accuracy (tight groups of arrows dead c
 enter)</i><span>. <i>C</i></span><i>oncurrently y</i><span><i>ou will be le
 arning how to build a strong mental program\, which will improve your focus
 \, awareness and confidence for competitions later.</i></span></p><p><i>As 
 you reach higher levels\, you will learn the NTS Steps in progressively gre
 ater detail.</i></p><p><i>The NTS Steps are cumulative with each step most 
 successfully completed if the previous steps have been completed well. </i>
 </p><p><b>Goals by the end of the winter/spring semester (May 30)</b></p><p
 >Make a list of what you want to accomplish by the end of the semester. Ema
 il it to Coach Racae\, so you can discuss it together. </p><p>Your two main
  goals are to replicate the NTS step(s) mindfully and consistently on every
  shot\, and build a mental program that is consistent on every shot. </p><p
 ><span>If you stay in the present just doing what you need to do as you nee
 d to do it\, your conscious mind will be occupied\, instead of random thoug
 hts entering your head or you being distracted by emotional or environmenta
 l elements. You´ll need to build up your mental program alongside your form
  knowledge\, so when your body is trained to shoot excellent shots\, your s
 elf image and subconscious support you\, instead of undermining you. Confid
 ence and consistency in form and mind are major goals. </span></p><p><i>Imp
 roving your training\, practicing\, and competition components\, process\, 
 and skills is a perpetual lifetime quest\, which you´ll slowly learn to lov
 e. You´ll  realize what is under your control\, and become your own best co
 ach! Those who find all this fun and enjoy the journey are the ones who win
  - the champions!</i><br></p><p><i>I know you can do it -  I'm your biggest
  fan!</i></p><p><i>​I'm also really looking forward to seeing you improve\,
  succeed\, and thrive !​</i></p><p><i><b>                                  
                  Coach Racae</b></i><br></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260517T081016Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Form Focus - Weekly NTS Steps of Shooting
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
