 , and other adults who would like to try archery for the first time and joi
 n in future Junior Olympic Archery Development (JOAD) and Adult Training cl
 asses. This class is a prerequisite for the FALL PROGRAM classes. If you ha
 ve more than one year's experience\, contact us for a placement evaluation 
 ($45) instead of attending the Indoor 1 Class. (You will be on the waiting 
 list after 10 people register - see below.)  Registered archers: 1. Cody Ul
 ...\, adult Confirmed 2. Daniela Riv..\, age? Cancelled 3. Luis Riv..\, dad
  Cancelled 4. Shannon Lew..\, adult Cancelled 5. James Lew..\, adult Cancel
 led 6. Hope Arab..\, adult 7. Brandon Corn....\, adult 8. Raul Basua...\, 1
