 nfirmed  Waiting List:  11. Pauline Kom....\, 10 confirmed 12. Frank Kom...
 .\, 13 confirmed    If your name is on the waiting list\, you have a choice
  of  coming to see if a place opens up at the last minute\, or  reschedulin
 g your class for another date/time.  We can only take 10 archers on the sho
 oting line at one time.  The instructor may also create two shooting lines\
 , which may increase the length of the class for everyone and decrease the 
