DESCRIPTION:INDOOR 1: First-time Class for Adults\, Juniors\, and Parents <
 br><br>Start archery with us any time and continue for as long as you like 
 - all the way to the Olympic Training Center!<br><br>Read the info below an
 d FILL IN THE REGISTRATION FORM at <a href="http://www.archerytrainingcente
 r.com/register">www.archerytrainingcenter.com/register</a><br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\
 ;<br>INDOOR 1: First-time Class is the minimum requirement to join the othe
 r Junior Olympic programs\, so please register early!<br>This class is to p
 repare you for the Indoor 2 Group Classes by teaching you the basics of the
  latest way to shoot a bow and arrow! The safety rules will be enforced. At
  the end\, the top three in each division (men\, women\, boys\, girls) will
  experience what it feels like to stand on the 1st\, 2nd\, and 3rd place po
 diums - just like in the Olympics!<br><br>You´ll learn <br>- what fun it is
  to shoot some arrows at a target and try to hit the bullseye (or dead cent
 er 10)!<br>- what it feels like to shoot a bow like an Olympian! <br>- how 
 to select your equipment\,<br>- how to set up the range\, <br>- how to stan
 d using the correct posture and weight distribution\,<br>- how to  achieve 
 some of the basic positions of the National Training System (so you hit the
  target more consistently)\, <br>- how to load the bow\, aim\, and release\
 , <br>- how to score and pull arrows\,<br>- how to handle distractions and 
 fully focus\,<br>- how to use positive self-talk to build confidence and su
 ccess.<br><br>DO YOU PROVIDE EQUIPMENT?<br>Yes\, we provide all equipment n
 ecessary indefinitely at no extra charge. (Recurve bow\, 3 arrows\, armguar
 d\, finger tab\, target)<br>When you are ready to order your own equipment\
 , we pace and specify what you need and help you order it\, so you buy the 
 correct equipment for your strength and experience. Generally\, we do not r
 ecommend anyone buys equipment before they have been with us for at least 8
  hours.<br><br>FEE FOR INDOOR 1: FIRST-TIME CLASS?<br>Individuals: $26 per 
 archer\, payable in advance at <a href="http://www.PayPal.me/atciaustin">ww
 w.PayPal.me/atciaustin</a><br>Groups of friends or family with 4-10 people:
  $26 per archer\, payable in advance at <a href="http://www.PayPal.me/atcia
 ustin">www.PayPal.me/atciaustin</a><br>If you would like to rent a time jus
