 ing&amp\;ouid=104080193312046349991</a>) until you score  240 pts on the 60
 -cm target face or 230 pts on the 40-cm target face. Then you will graduate
  to our outdoor classes !<br><br>After you graduate to Outdoor 3-9\, you wi
 ll be granted access to the ATCI Calendar via an email from Coach Racae\, a
 nd can just add your name under Registered Archers below..<br><br>SCHEDULE 
 :<br>​Register for ​​as many as your schedule and budget allows to progress
  faster:<br>Sat/Sun   4:30-6:00 pm  <br>Wed         6:30-8:00 pm <br>Thurs 
       5:30-6:30 pm  and 6:30-8:00 pm<br>​Weekdays: Juniors usually come to 
 the 5:00 pm class\, and adults to the 6:30 class\, but all classes are open
  to both adults and juniors.<br><br>Always check this calendar just before 
 driving to class in case there are last-minutes changes or cancellations!<b
 r><br>We require at least 3 archers to be registered for the class 24 hours
  in advance and an Instructor/Coach to coach it\, in order for it to make\,
  otherwise it will be cancelled a few hours before the class. <br>If you se
 e that there are fewer than 3 people registered below\, please consider com
 ing to the later class at 6:30-8:00pm. If you have already paid for the ear
 lier class\, your fee will apply to another class of your choosing. Please 
 contact us with a new date.<br><br>USA Archery Level 4 NTS Coach Racae Meye
 r unless otherwise noted above.<br><br>The level of each attending archer i
 s noted next to their name below\, to help you decide which classes to join
 . (Example: Indoor 2 or more advanced are Outdoor 3+ (O4 @20m\, etc.)<br><b
 r>Registered archers:<br>1. Anjali 1 hr until 7:00\, but stayed until 8:00\
 , pd for 1.5 hrs<br>2\, <br>3. <br>4.<br>5.<br>6.<br>7.<br>8.<br>9.<br>10.<
 br>11.<br>12.<br><br>SINGLE Class Fees per archer for one Indoor 2-6 class<
 br>Book and pay in advance.<br>$30 for 1 hr (arrive 30 min after class star
 ts or leave 30 min before class ends)<br>$45 for 1.5-hr class<br><br>MONTHL
 Y Discount Fee Packs<br>Pay before the 1st of each month\; book dates withi
 n the month<br>1 class/wk:      $218 (7.5 hrs\; 5 classes/mo)<br>2 classes/
 wk: $372 (13.5 hrs\; 9 classes/mo)<br>3 classes/wk: $557 (21 hrs\; 14 class
 es/mo)<br>4 classes/wk: $675 (27 hrs\; 18 classes/mo)<br>5 classes/wk: $792
  (33 hrs\; 22 classes/mo)<br><br>MULTI-CLASS Discount Packets<br>Pay in adv
 ance and book when you're sure of the dates.<br>  9 hours : $257 (6 classes
 )<br> 12 hours : $330 (8 classes)<br> 18 hours : $477 (12 classes) <br> 23 
 hours: $587 (15 classes)<br> 27 hours: $675 (18 classes)<br><br>There are 8
  places on the shooting line\, and we sometimes have double lines depending
  on attendance.<br><br>Sign in/out upon arrival/departure<br>Coaching and w
 histle commands at all times.<br>Instruction in the National Training Syste
 m.<br>Unfair games depending on attendance.<br>Please note: Youths &lt\;12 
 y.o. should not shoot more than 100 arrows/day!<br><br>Prerequisites for In
 door 2: <br>Adults: No min. score in Indoor 1 <br>Juniors: 50 pts in Indoor
  1<br>Scores needed at 9m to advance to Indoor 3-6 and Outdoor 3-6:<br><br>
                  On 40-cm                  On 60-cm<br>               targe
 t face                 target face<br>Indoor 3:          230 pts           
