DESCRIPTION:Coach Racae\n\nPREREQUISITES: \nINDOOR 1: First-time Class\,  (
 To register for Indoor 1\, click the Sign Up button at the top of www.arche
 rytrainingcenter.com.) \nINDOOR 2 at 9m\, \nINDOOR 3A at 13.5m\n \nOPEN to 
 all archers (JOAD and Adults) at 18m.\n\nEnrollment links at:\nhttp://www.a
 rcherytrainingcenter.com/news\n\n1. Daniel H.\n2. Michael G.\n3. Judson M.\
 n4. Paige M.\n5. Francisca L.\n6. Kelly K.\n7. Cassandra G.\n8. Ty H.\n9.\n
 10.\n\n\nTime / Attendance Requirements: \nRECREATIONAL: None \nPROGRESSIVE
 : Must continuously meet the time/attendance requirements to remain in the 
 Progressive Program. Those who fall short of the weekly time/attendance req
 uirements will automatically be considered Recreational\, and Recreational 
 class fees will apply.  These classes are designed to prepared archers for 
 CAP (Competitive Archery Program).\n\nFees:  \nRECREATIONAL FEES: \nAll fee
 s are payable in advance of the Indoor at 18m class to secure your place in
  the class: \nTues 6:30-7:30pm: 1-hr class - $20\nWed  6:30-8:00pm: 1.5-hr 
 class - $30\nSat   3:30-5:30pm:  2-hr class - $40\nSun  3:30-5:30pm:  2-hr 
 class - $40\n+ Enrollment fee: $20 (always due once per semester) \n\nPROGR
 ESSIVE (min. attendance required):  \nIndoor 3B:       $TBD/wk (min. 5 hrs)
   \nIndoor 4:         $TBD/wk (min. 6 hrs) \nIndoor 5:         $TBD/wk (min
 . 8 hrs)  \n\nMONTHLY FEES for ADULTS at 18m:\n\nAdult classes only (Tues 7
 :30-8:30 + Sun 6:00-7:00):\nJAN   $ 120    \nFEB   $ 120 \nMAR   $ 120     
 \nAPR   $ 120      \nMAY   $ 120    \n\nAdult classes + Wed. 6:30-8:00:\nJA
 N   $ 188    \nFEB   $ 210 \nMAR   $ 233    \nAPR   $ 210      \nMAY   $ 21
 0   \n\nMONTHLY FEES for JUNIORS at 18m:\nRecreational hourly fees apply. A
 t this level archers should be in the range at least 5 hrs/wk to improve ov
 er time. If your schedule allows for this\, you are a Progressive archer\; 
 if not\, you are a Recreational archer.
