DESCRIPTION:What we worked on:\nIncreasing strength\nSet Up\, Draw to Load\
 , Anchor\n\nHomework:\nHolding SPT - 10 sec + 20 sec rest - all or nothing 
 (stop for the day when you can´t do 10 sec\, don´t lower time - start clock
  at Holding - keep track of how many sets - be careful and conservative - b
 reak down instead of shooting\nWork on Set Up coiling (aligning draw should
 er with bow shoulder - Barrel of the Gun) and then\nmoving LAN2 towards the
  trees for Draw to Load.\nTighten up Anchor - deep in and up - knuckle in v
 alley - thumb along neck + little finger on neck - no gap between jaw and h
 and\nKeep height of bow elbow low - not up but around\nRead ItA (Inside the
  Archer) and watch Kaminski videos on above positions
LAST-MODIFIED:20260517T084744Z
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:VIRTUAL NTS Form - Lindsay
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
