DESCRIPTION:Coach Racae (Recurves only)\n\nIndoor 1: First-time Classes for
  Adults is a requirement to join regular adult training classes. Click the 
 Sign Up button at the top of ATCI website to register if you are at least 1
 8 years old or the following link.\nSaturdays: 11:30am-1:30pm (Fee: $25/cl)
 \nSundays: 11:30am-1:30pm (Fee: $25/cl)\nEnrollment link for Indoor 1: Firs
 t-time Class for Adult:\nhttps://docs.google.com/forms/d/1sPp_1NRpCtLb-SHXJ
 R1dgEn7LVMV6BFgnCKW6-67GYM/viewform\n\nWe welcome adult recurve and compoun
 d Olympic target archers at all levels of experience after they have taken 
 Indoor 1: First-time Class for Adults. \nRECURVE ARCHERS can attend any of 
 the group classes or book private lessons with Coach Racae or Instructor Da
 le.\nCOMPOUND ARCHERS Only private lessons are available with Coach Dan or 
 Instructor Bailey \nEXPERIENCED ARCHERS (recurve and compounds) need to be 
 evaluated by Coach Racae for advanced placement in the Progressive Program 
 or recommendation to the Competitive Archery Program with Coach Alex.  You 
 can book an evaluation by sending an email stating your years of experience
 \, preferred coaching times\, previous coaches\, tournament experience and 
 results to racae@archerytrainingcenter.com.\n\nUSA Archery's Adult Training
  Program (ATP) follows a similar path to the Junior Olympic Archery Develop
 ment (JOAD) program. \n\nYour first step is to take an Indoor 1: First-time
  Class for Adults. Just click the link or the Sign Up button at the top of 
 this website.\n\nEveryone starts out in our Recreational program at 9 meter
 s. As you improve you progress to 13.5 meters then on to 18 meters indoors.
  \n\nWhen you decide that you are interested in competing you'll apply to j
 oin USA Archery Level 4 NTS and JDT Coach Alex Meyer's Competitive Archery 
 Program (CAP).\n\nRECREATIONAL ADULT CLASSES at Indoor 2-5 and distances (9
 m\, 13.5m\, 18m) \nSundays: 5:30-6:30 and/or 7:00-8:00pm (Fee: $20/cl) (Rec
 urves)\nTuesdays: 7:30-8:30pm (Fee: $20/cl) (Recurves)\n\nPROGRESSIVE PROGR
 AM Indoor 2-5\nJOAD and ADULT TRAINING for those who want to progress faste
 r toward competitive archery by meeting minimum attendance requirements.\nS
 aturdays 3:30-5:30pm (Recurves)\nSundays:  3:30-5:30pm (Recurves)\nSundays:
   6:00-7:00pm (Adults and Indoor 5 only) (Recurves)\nTuesdays: 6:30-7:30pm 
 (Recurves)\nTuesdays: 7:30-8:30pm (Adults and Indoor 5 only) (Recurves)\nWe
 dnesdays: 6:30-8:00pm (Recurves)\n\nProgressive weekly fees (after meeting 
 previous week's attendance requirement):\nIndoor 3A at 13.5m: $48/wk (min. 
 4 hrs)\nIndoor 3B at 18m:    $55/wk (min. 5 hrs)\nIndoor 4 at 18m:      $60
 /wk (min. 6 hrs)\nIndoor 5 at 18m:      $72/wk (min. 8 hrs)\n\n\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260517T082935Z
LOCATION:10203 OLD Manchaca Road\, Austin\, TX 78748
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:ADULT TRAINING
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
