DESCRIPTION:Coach Racae\n\nPREREQUISITES: \nINDOOR 1: First-time Class\,  (
 To register for Indoor 1\, click the Sign Up button at the top of www.arche
 rytrainingcenter.com.) \nINDOOR 2 at 9m\, \nINDOOR 3A at 13.5m\n \nOPEN to 
 all archers (JOAD and Adults) at 18m.\n\nEnrollment links at:\nhttp://www.a
 rcherytrainingcenter.com/news\n\n1. Daniel H.\n2. Francisca L.\n3. Michael 
 G.\n4. Judson M.\n5. Kelly K.\n6. Paige M.\n7.\n8.\n9.\n10.\n\n\nTime / Att
 endance Requirements: \nRECREATIONAL: None \nPROGRESSIVE: Must continuously
  meet the time/attendance requirements to remain in the Progressive Program
 . Those who fall short of the weekly time/attendance requirements will auto
 matically be considered Recreational\, and Recreational class fees will app
 ly.  These classes are designed to prepared archers for CAP (Competitive Ar
 chery Program).\n\nFees:  \nRECREATIONAL FEES: \nAll fees are payable in ad
 vance of the Indoor at 18m class to secure your place in the class: \nTues 
 6:30-7:30pm: 1-hr class - $20\nWed  6:30-8:00pm: 1.5-hr class - $30\nSat   
 3:30-5:30pm:  2-hr class - $40\nSun  3:30-5:30pm:  2-hr class - $40\n+ Enro
 llment fee: $20 (always due once per semester) \n\nPROGRESSIVE (min. attend
 ance required):  \nIndoor 3B:       $TBD/wk (min. 5 hrs)  \nIndoor 4:      
    $TBD/wk (min. 6 hrs) \nIndoor 5:         $TBD/wk (min. 8 hrs)  \n\nMONTH
 LY FEES for ADULTS at 18m:\n\nAdult classes only (Tues 7:30-8:30 + Sun 6:00
 -7:00):\nJAN   $ 120    \nFEB   $ 120 \nMAR   $ 120     \nAPR   $ 120      
 \nMAY   $ 120    \n\nAdult classes + Wed. 6:30-8:00:\nJAN   $ 188    \nFEB 
   $ 210 \nMAR   $ 233    \nAPR   $ 210      \nMAY   $ 210   \n\nMONTHLY FEE
 S for JUNIORS at 18m:\nRecreational hourly fees apply. At this level archer
 s should be in the range at least 5 hrs/wk to improve over time. If your sc
 hedule allows for this\, you are a Progressive archer\; if not\, you are a 
 Recreational archer.
