DESCRIPTION:Coach Racae\n\nPREREQUISITES: \nINDOOR 1: First-time Class\,  (
 To register for Indoor 1\, click the Sign Up button at the top of www.arche
 rytrainingcenter.com.) \nINDOOR 2 at 9m\, \nINDOOR 3A at 13.5m\n \nOPEN to 
 all archers (JOAD and Adults) at 18m.\n\nEnrollment links at:\nhttp://www.a
 rcherytrainingcenter.com/news\n\n1. Daniel H.\n2. Michael G.\n3. Judson M.\
 n4. Paige M. (dna)\n5. Francisca L.\n6. Kelly \n7. Evan L.\n8.\n9.\n10.\n\n
 Time / Attendance Requirements: \nRECREATIONAL: None \nPROGRESSIVE: Must co
 ntinuously meet the time/attendance requirements to remain in the Progressi
 ve Program. Those who fall short of the weekly time/attendance requirements
  will automatically be considered Recreational\, and Recreational class fee
 s will apply.  These classes are designed to prepared archers for CAP (Comp
 etitive Archery Program).\n\nFees:  \nRECREATIONAL FEES: \nAll fees are pay
 able in advance of the Indoor at 18m class to secure your place in the clas
 s: \nTues 6:30-7:30pm: 1-hr class - $20\nWed  6:30-8:00pm: 1.5-hr class - $
 30\nSat   3:30-5:30pm:  2-hr class - $40\nSun  3:30-5:30pm:  2-hr class - $
 40\n+ Enrollment fee: $20 (always due once per semester) \n\nPROGRESSIVE (m
 in. attendance required):  \nIndoor 3B:       $TBD/wk (min. 5 hrs)  \nIndoo
 r 4:         $TBD/wk (min. 6 hrs) \nIndoor 5:         $TBD/wk (min. 8 hrs) 
  \n\nMONTHLY FEES for ADULTS at 18m:\n\nAdult classes only (Tues 7:30-8:30 
 + Sun 6:00-7:00):\nJAN   $ 120    \nFEB   $ 120 \nMAR   $ 120     \nAPR   $
  120      \nMAY   $ 120    \n\nAdult classes + Wed. 6:30-8:00:\nJAN   $ 188
     \nFEB   $ 210 \nMAR   $ 233    \nAPR   $ 210      \nMAY   $ 210   \n\nM
 ONTHLY FEES for JUNIORS at 18m:\nRecreational hourly fees apply. At this le
 vel archers should be in the range at least 5 hrs/wk to improve over time. 
 If your schedule allows for this\, you are a Progressive archer\; if not\, 
 you are a Recreational archer.\n\nJoin with Google Hangouts: https://plus.g
 oogle.com/hangouts/_/calendar/M2NkdGhhdDVxNGhmcmcwMGtyYWZ1NGJ0NmtAZ3JvdXAuY
 2FsZW5kYXIuZ29vZ2xlLmNvbQ.m1eo47qh8rkho5t8g9gj5o6qfo?hs=121
