 j1RaXdLhPoew/viewform">2022 Winter/Spring Outdoor 1: First-time Class for A
 dults</a><br><br>Sign up for just one Outdoor 1 class\, because most people
  graduate out of this class into Outdoor 2 after the first lesson.<br><br><
 b>Your name will be added below and your place reserved on a</b> <b>first r
 egistered and paid basis and after we receive 3 things</b>:&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<b
 r>2022 OUTDOOR 1 REGISTRATION FORM + WAIVERS + FEE<br><br><b>Registered arc
 hers&nbsp\;</b>at 9m on 40-cm target face unless otherwise noted:<br><br><b
 >Target nos:</b><br>1. Liz G.\, adult - pd - substituted 2/12<br>2A. Jim W.
