 r>9.<br>10.<br><br>Space will be limited to 10-15 archers per session depen
 ding on the number of family groups in attendance or in accordance with CDC
  Guidelines.&nbsp\;<br>Each person will have a target stand\, except after 
 10 people have registered\, two members from the same family will share one
  target stand.<br>The archer and a maximum of one spectator will be allowed
