 y is now in Stage 5 of COVID-19 risk-based guidelines\, I have made the dec
 ision to postpone the start of our archery training classes this semester p
 ossibly until Austin drops back down to Stage 4.&nbsp\;<br>I will review th
 e situation weekly on Fridays and postpone classes on the weekend if Austin
  is still in Stage 5.&nbsp\;<br><br>I know this is disappointing to most of
  you - and no one wants to attend the training classes more than I do. I lo
 ve to coach you! My main concern\, however\, as always\, is to keep everyon
 e who attends our classes as safe as possible.&nbsp\;<br><br>Not to worry\,
  we will start classes soon again!<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp
