 o remain in the Progressive Program. Those who fall short of the weekly tim
 e/attendance requirements will automatically be considered Recreational\, a
 nd Recreational class fees will apply.  These classes are designed to prepa
 red archers for CAP (Competitive Archery Program).\n\nFees:  \nRECREATIONAL
