DESCRIPTION:This weekly practice time is intended to give everyone more pra
 ctice time in the range\, but not as a substitute for the regularly schedul
 ed and coached training classes. This type of practice prepares you for tou
 rnaments\, when you are on the shooting line\, making decisions\, often wit
 hout feedback from your coach. Self-analysis of your form and shots through
  deep\, perfect practice!<br><br><br>This same time can also be booked in a
 dvance with Coach Racae for&nbsp\;<br>- one-hour private lessons ($50/hr - 
 see Private Lesson sheet)\,&nbsp\;<br>- goal-setting sessions for those on 
 periodization ($0)\,&nbsp\;<br>- new equipment specifying (4% of list price
 )&nbsp\;<br>- new bow setup ($20)\,&nbsp\;<br>- arrow fletching lesson ($15
 )&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br><br><br>Details:<br>No coaching - just focused practice!
 <br>Olympic recurve bows only&nbsp\;<br>Max. draw weight: 45 lbs.<br><br>Op
 en to:<br>- recurve archers who have taken the Indoor 1: First-time Class A
 ND regularly attend at least two (2) hours/month in scheduled group coached
  training classes&nbsp\;<br>- experienced recurve archers\, who have previo
 usly met with Coach Racae.<br><br>$15/hr payable in advance at<a href="http
 ://paypal.me/atciaustin"> paypal.me/atciaustin</a> or upon arrival.&nbsp\;<
 br>This time and fee can be included for those on monthly periodization.<br
 >Sign up at the range in advance to reserve your place on the shooting line
 \, or just show up\, if it´s not nearing full.<br><br>If junior archers are
  present\, there must be at least two adults in the range at all times (par
 ents\, adult archers).<br><br>All safety rules will be enforced and obeyed.
 <br><br>Always look at the website calendar before coming\, in case there i
 s last minute change due to weather\, illness\, etc.<br>Any questions: Cont
 act Coach Racae 512 975 1850<br><br>See you soon!<br><br>1. Lily R.\, JOAD 
 13.5m<br>2. Katie G.\, JOAD 18m
