 d waivers are available at&nbsp\;<a href="http://www.archerytrainingcenter.
 com">www.archerytrainingcenter.com</a>.<br><br>Register here using ONE of t
 hese forms:<br><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfcwG419ZK
 9XmA4-JlXM-zhjhvSPCF8NCwWJlzFP2w-gRliUw/viewform">2022 Winter/Spring Outdoo
