 lts</a><br><br>Sign up for just one Outdoor 1 class\, because most people g
 raduate out of this class into Outdoor 2 after the first lesson.<br><br><b>
 Your name will be added below and your place reserved on a</b> <b>first reg
 istered and paid basis and after we receive 3 things</b>:&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br>
 2022 OUTDOOR 1 REGISTRATION FORM + WAIVERS + FEE<br><br><b>Registered arche
 rs&nbsp\;</b>at 9m on 40-cm target face unless noted otherwise<u></u><br><u
 ></u><br><b>Target assignments:</b><br>1. <b>Alan M</b>.\, adult - pd - <b>
 substituted for 1/15 - 78 pts</b><br>2. <b>Eduardo C</b>.\, adult - pd - <b
