CREATED:20151230T002230Z
DESCRIPTION:Coach Racae (Recurves only)\n\nClick the Sign Up button at the 
 top of ATCI website to Register for Spring 2016 Indoor 1: First-time Classe
 s for Adults\nif you are at least 18 years old. This is a requirement to jo
 in regular adult training classes.\nSaturdays: 11:30am-1:30pm (Fee: $25/cl)
 \nSundays: 11:30am-1:30pm (Fee: $25/cl)\n\nEnrollment link:\nhttps://docs.g
 oogle.com/forms/d/1sPp_1NRpCtLb-SHXJR1dgEn7LVMV6BFgnCKW6-67GYM/viewform\n\n
 RECREATIONAL ADULT CLASSES at Indoor 2-5 and distances (9m\, 13.5m\, 18m) \
 nSundays: 6:00-7:00pm (Fee: $20/cl) (Recurves)\nTuesdays: 7:30-8:30pm (Fee:
  $20/cl) (Compounds and Recurves)\n\nPROGRESSIVE PROGRAM Indoor 2-5\nJOAD a
 nd ADULT TRAINING for those who want to progress faster toward competitive 
 archery by meeting minimum attendance requirements.\nSaturdays 3:30-5:30pm 
 (Recurves)\nSundays:  3:30-5:30pm (Recurves)\nSundays:  6:00-7:00pm (Adults
  and Indoor 5 only) (Recurves)\nTuesdays: 6:30-7:30pm (Compounds and Recurv
 es)\nTuesdays: 7:30-8:30pm (Adults and Indoor 5 only) (Compounds and Recurv
 es)\nWednesdays: 6:30-8:00pm (Recurves)\n\nProgressive weekly fees (after m
 eeting previous week's attendance requirement):\nIndoor 3A at 13.5m: $48/wk
  (min. 4 hrs)\nIndoor 3B at 18m:    $55/wk (min. 5 hrs)\nIndoor 4 at 18m:  
     $60/wk (min. 6 hrs)\nIndoor 5 at 18m:      $72/wk (min. 8 hrs)\n\nUSA A
 rchery's Adult Training Program (ATP) follows a similar path to the Junior 
 Olympic Archery Development (JOAD) program. \n\nYour first step is to take 
 an Indoor 1: First-time Class for Adults. Just click the link or the Sign U
 p button at the top of this website.\n\nEveryone starts out in our Recreati
 onal program at 9 meters. As you improve you progress to 13.5 meters then o
 n to 18 meters indoors. \n\nWe welcome adult recurve and compound Olympic t
 arget archers at all levels of experience. \nRecurve archers can attend any
  of the group classes above or book private lessons with Coach Racae or Ins
 tructor Dale.\nCompound archers can attend the group class on Tues. evening
 s or book private lessons with Coach Dan or Instructor Bailey.\n\nExperienc
 ed competitive archers need to be evaluated by Coach Racae for advanced pla
 cement in either the Progressive Program or recommendation to the Competiti
 ve Archery Program with Coach Alex.\n\nWhen you decide that you are interes
 ted in competing you'll apply to join USA Archery Level 4 NTS and JDT Coach
  Alex Meyer's Competitive Archery Program (CAP).
LAST-MODIFIED:20260517T082935Z
LOCATION:10203 OLD Manchaca Road\, Austin\, TX 78748
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:ADULT TRAINING
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
