DESCRIPTION:Coach Racae\n\nPREREQUISITES: \nINDOOR 1: First-time Class\,  (
 To register for Indoor 1\, click the Sign Up button at the top of www.arche
 rytrainingcenter.com.) \nINDOOR 2 at 9m\, \nINDOOR 3A at 13.5m\n \nOPEN to 
 all archers (JOAD and Adults) at 18m.\n\nEnrollment links at:\nhttp://www.a
 rcherytrainingcenter.com/news\n\nRegistered and paid archers:\n1. Daniel H.
 \, JOAD\n2. Kelly K.\, adult\n3. Evan L. JOAD\n4. Cassandra G.\n5. \n6.\n7.
 \n8.\n9.\n10.\n\n\nTime / Attendance Requirements: \nRECREATIONAL: None \nP
 ROGRESSIVE: Must continuously meet the time/attendance requirements to rema
 in in the Progressive Program. Those who fall short of the weekly time/atte
 ndance requirements will automatically be considered Recreational\, and Rec
 reational class fees will apply.  These classes are designed to prepared ar
 chers for CAP (Competitive Archery Program).\n\nFees:  \nRECREATIONAL FEES:
  \nAll fees are payable in advance of the Indoor at 18m class to secure you
 r place in the class: \nTues 6:30-7:30pm: 1-hr class - $20\nWed  6:30-8:00p
 m: 1.5-hr class - $30\nSat   3:30-5:30pm:  2-hr class - $40\nSun  3:30-5:30
 pm:  2-hr class - $40\n+ Enrollment fee: $20 (always due once per semester)
  \n\nPROGRESSIVE (min. attendance required):  \nIndoor 3B:       $TBD/wk (m
 in. 5 hrs)  \nIndoor 4:         $TBD/wk (min. 6 hrs) \nIndoor 5:         $T
 BD/wk (min. 8 hrs)  \n\nMONTHLY FEES for ADULTS at 18m:\n\nAdult classes on
 ly (Tues 7:30-8:30 + Sun 6:00-7:00):\nJAN   $ 120    \nFEB   $ 120 \nMAR   
 $ 120     \nAPR   $ 120      \nMAY   $ 120    \n\nAdult classes + Wed. 6:30
 -8:00:\nJAN   $ 188    \nFEB   $ 210 \nMAR   $ 233    \nAPR   $ 210      \n
 MAY   $ 210   \n\nMONTHLY FEES for JUNIORS at 18m:\nRecreational hourly fee
 s apply. At this level archers should be in the range at least 5 hrs/wk to 
 improve over time. If your schedule allows for this\, you are a Progressive
  archer\; if not\, you are a Recreational archer.
