 utdoor private lesson today:</b><br><ul><li>9:30-10:00 - Yugan</li></ul><ul
 ><li>10:00-10:30</li></ul><b>Indoors at 9m</b>: <b>30 min or 1 hr</b> durin
 g the Monday indoor session (6:30-8:00). Fill in the times on the calendar 
 under the Monday(s) of your choice.<br><br><b>Additional fees: </b><br><ul>
 <li><b>Outdoors</b> : $12/30 min  (in addition to the regular Outdoor 3 cla
 ss fee)</li><li><b>Indoors</b>: $40/30min or $75/hr. You can shoot before o
 r after your private lesson time at no extra charge from 6:30-8:00\, if oth
 er archers are booked for private lessons otherwise the range will be close
 d.</li></ul><i>Priority will be given to archers who will participate/compe
 te in TX State and National competitions.</i>
