 ubrey R.\,&nbsp\;</b>18\, pd <b>-&gt\; 66 pts -&gt\; Outdoor 2</b><br>7.&nb
 sp\;<b>Cassidy R.\,&nbsp\;</b>mom\, pd <b>-&gt\; Outdoor 2</b><br>8.&nbsp\;
