 rget face - pd<b>&nbsp\;. 48 pts -&gt\; Outdoor 2&nbsp\;</b><br><br>Space w
 ill be limited to 10-15 archers per session depending on the number of fami
 ly groups in attendance or in accordance with CDC Guidelines.&nbsp\;<br>Eac
 h person will have a target stand\, except after 10 people have registered\
 , two members from the same family will share one target stand.<br>The arch
 er and a maximum of one spectator will be allowed on the field until furthe
