 ign up as an archer or watch as a spectator. Parents of juniors 8-9 years o
 ld need to register\, pay\, and shoot with their child for greater safety.<
 br><br>A maximum of one 8-year-old (+ parent) is accepted into each Outdoor
  1: First-time Class.&nbsp\;<br><br>We will accept a limited&nbsp\;number o
 f kids under 12 into the program each semester\, depending on the total&nbs
 p\; number of archers in all the classes. If you join before the limit is r
