 as soon as you score on average about 5 pts/end of 3 arrows.&nbsp\;<br>Adul
 ts don´t need a minimum score to graduate into Outdoor 2. If you improved s
 ignificantly in the last two ends and scored at least 35 pts\, at Coach Rac
 ae may graduate to Outdoor 2.<br><br>ap = accessories packet (armguard\, fi
 ngertab\, fingersling)\, which will be needed for Outdoor 2. ($15)<br>fp = 
 form pack (stretchband and string loop)\, optional but really needed to pra
 ctice form\, warm up before classes ($4)<br><br>At the end of each Outdoor 
