  (30 arrows)\, you may not recognize your final score\, because it will hav
 e been averaged by taking your recorded score from your scorecard\, dividin
 g by the number of arrows you shot to get an arrow average\, and then multi
 plying that by 30 to get a full round score. After the last class on the we
 ekend\, final scores will also be sent to all Outdoor 1 participants in an 
