DESCRIPTION:New 2025 Fees (See below)\n\nIf you have been with us for a whi
 le\, and have been given access to the ATCI Calendar via an email from Coac
 h Racae\, just add the archer´s name under Registered Archers below.\nFor n
 ewer archers\, register using the 2025 INDOOR 2-6 at 9m Registration form.\
 n\nSCHEDULE :\n​Register for ​​as many as your schedule and budget allows t
 o progress faster:\nSat/Sun 4:00-5:30 pm - \nT/W/Th  5:00-6:30 pm  and  \nT
 /W/Th   6:30-8\;:00 pm\n​Weekdays: Juniors usually come to the 5:00 pm clas
 s\, and adults to the 6:30 class\, but all classes are open to both adults 
 and juniors.\n\nAlways check this calendar just before driving to class in 
 case there are last-minutes changes or cancellations!\n\nUSA Archery Level 
 4 NTS Coach Racae Meyer\n\nAfter you graduate out of Indoor 1\, sign up for
  2025 INDOOR 2-6 at 9m\n\nRegistered archers:\n1.Felix S.\, 10\, on 60-cm t
 arget face\, pd\n2.Jack Paulsen.\, 10\, on 60-cm target face\n3. Anna LeFlo
 re-Paulsen.\, on 40-cm target face\n4.. Rhys E\, 10\, pd\n5..\n6..\n7..\n8.
 .\n9..\nNEW 2025 Winter/Spring Fees \n\nSINGLE Class Fees per archer for on
 e Indoor 2-6 class:\n$31 for 1 hr (arrive 30 min after class starts or leav
 e 30 min before class ends)\n$43 for 1.5 hrs\n\nMULTI-Class Discount Packet
 s\n  9 hours : $250 (six 1.5-hr classes)\n 12 hours : $320 (eight 1.5-hr cl
 asses)\n 18 hours : $460 (twelve 1.5-hr classes) \n\nThere are 8 places on 
 the shooting line\, and we sometimes have double lines depending on attenda
 nce.\n\nSign in/out upon arrival/departure\nFor single classes\, book and p
 ay in advance.\nFor multi-class discount packs\, pay in advance and book wh
 en you are sure of the dates.\nCoaching and whistle commands at all times.\
 nInstruction in the National Training System.\nUnfair games depending on at
 tendance.\n\nPlease note: Youths <12 y.o. should not shoot more than 100 ar
 rows/day!\n\nPrerequisites for Indoor 2: \nAdults: No min. score in Indoor 
 1 \nJuniors: 50 pts in Indoor 1\nScores needed at 9m to advance to Indoor 3
 -6 and Outdoor 3-6:\n\n                 On 40-cm                  On 60-cm\
 n               target face                 target face\nIndoor 3:         
  230 pts                240 pts           -> Outdoor 3 at 13.5m\nIndoor 4: 
          250 pts                260 pts           -> Outdoor 4 at 18m/20m\n
 Indoor 5:          270 pts                280 pts           -> Outdoor 5 at
  30m\nIndoor 6:          290 pts                300 pts          ->  Outdoo
 r 6 at 40m
