 fying to get into Outdoor 2 by scoring 50 pts. You´ll make it as soon as yo
 u score on average about 5 pts/end of 3 arrows. <br>Adults don´t need a min
 imum score to graduate into Outdoor 2.<br><br>ap = accessories packet (armg
 uard\, fingertab\, fingersling)\, which will be needed for Outdoor 2. ($18)
  Please pay for this at the field\, as our stock fluctuates because of deal
 er supply fluctuations<br>fp = form pack (stretchband and string loop)\, op
 tional but really needed to practice form\, warm up before classes ($4)<br>
 <br>At the end of each Outdoor 1 class\, your scores will be posted. If we 
 did not finish a complete round (30 arrows)\, you may not recognize your fi
 nal score\, because it will have been averaged by taking your recorded scor
 e from your scorecard\, dividing by the number of arrows you shot to get an
  arrow average\, and then multiplying that by 30 to get a full round score.
  After the last first-time class each weekend\, final scores may also be se
 nt to all Outdoor 1 participants in an email with more information before y
 our next class.
