DESCRIPTION:For your convenience\, all summer long\, the schedule has opene
 d up!<br><br>Come whenever you want within the time allocated (5:00-8:00pm)
 \, and shoot for 1-3+ hours\, in accordance with your strength and experien
 ce.<br>There is continuous training with Coach Racae\, but since it´s summe
 r\, we will challenge ourselves with some archery games!<br><br>It´s going 
 to be a great summer - and cool in the indoor archery range!<br><br>Sign up
  and pay at <a href="http://www.paypal.me/atciaustin">www.paypal.me/atciaus
 tin</a> in advance to secure your space on the shooting line! (Please write
  the dates and times on your PayPal payment and add an extra 4%.)<br><br>PR
 EREQUISITE: INDOOR 1: First-time Class<br>(To register for Indoor 1\, click
  the Sign Up button at the top of <a href="http://www.archerytrainingcenter
 .com">www.archerytrainingcenter.com</a>.)<br><br>OPEN to all archers (adult
 s\, juniors\, parents) in<br>INDOOR 2 (9m) and<br>INDOOR 3A (13.5m) and<br>
 INDOOR 4+ (18m)<br><br>Enrollment links at: <a href="http://www.archerytrai
 ningcenter.com/Classes">http://www.archerytrainingcenter.com/Classes</a> <b
 r><br>Fees: <br>RECREATIONAL: <br>$20/cl for 1 hr.\, $30 for two hours\, or
