DESCRIPTION:First-time class for juniors age 8+\, optionally their parents\
 , and adults who would like to try archery for the first time and join in f
 uture Junior Olympic Archery Development (JOAD) and Adult Training classes.
 \n\nRegistered archers:\n\nWaiting List: None\n\nIf your name is on the wai
 ting list\, you have a choice of \ncoming to see if a place opens up at the
  last minute\, or \nrescheduling your class for another date/time. \nWe can
  only take 10 archers on the shooting line at one time. \nThe instructor ma
 y also create two shooting lines\, which will increase the length of the cl
 ass for everyone and decrease the number of arrows everyone has time to sho
 ot.\nIf you prefer not to be on the waiting list\, please reschedule your c
 lass for another date.
