 Spring Outdoor 1: First-time Class for Adults</a><br><br>Sign up for just o
 ne Outdoor 1 class\, because most people graduate out of this class into Ou
 tdoor 2 after the first lesson.<br><br><b>Your name will be added below and
  your place reserved on a</b> <b>first registered and paid basis and after 
 we receive 3 things</b>:&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br>2022 OUTDOOR 1 REGISTRATION FORM 
 + WAIVERS + FEE<br><br><b>Registered archers&nbsp\;</b>at 9m on 40-cm targe
 t face unless otherwise noted :<u></u><br><br><b>Target asignments:</b><br>
 1.&nbsp\;<b>Gentry A</b>.\, adult\, pd - <b>substituted for 1/8 - 227 pts !
 !!&nbsp\;</b>(so close\, you need 230 to go to Outdoor 3 at 13.5m - Next ti
 me!)<br><u></u>2.&nbsp\;<b>Tyler H.\,</b> adult\, pd - <b>111 pts.</b><u></
