 r.com/calendar</a>.)<br><br>Scores are also listed below\, if you kept scor
 e\, which is not required\, except on Master Challenge weeks. You need 230 
 pts on 40cm target or 240 pts on 60cm target to graduate out of your distan
 ce into Indoor 3A 13.5m\, and again at 13.5m to get into Indoor 3B at 18m (
 full distance).<br>PB = Personal Best. <br><br>Registered archers:<br>1. Ka
 tie G.\, JOAD OPT\, paid<br>2.<br>3. <br>4. <br>5. <br>6. <br>7. <br>8. <br
 >9.<br>10.
