DESCRIPTION:PREREQUISITE: Indoor 1: First-time Class\n(Register for Indoor 
 1 by clicking the Sign-Up button on the top of our website's homepage.)\nOP
 EN TO: Indoor 2\, 3\, and 4\, and parents who have taken Indoor 1\nRegister
