 1iNEV0zG13PZGbmtoNuFmNUkqiCDht2nvptlaVtSkWgA/viewform\nFEE: $225/wk\; $45/d
 ay\nLevel 1 Instructor: Tori. \nAfter an hour of regular shooting you'll co
 mplete quests\, defeat monsters and protect Mount Olympus! You'll gain skil
 l points by strategic monster hits and by winning competitions. You'll earn
  higher titles by earning more skill points. Besides daily awards\, when yo
 u achieve the most skill points of all the archers at the end of the traini
 ng you'll be appointed Guardian of the Gods at the Annual Awards Banquet on
  August 16!
