 he list below when we receive your fee in advance of the class through <a h
 ref="http://www.paypal.me/atciaustin">www.paypal.me/atciaustin</a>  (Please
  add an extra 4%). When classes are not full\, it's okay to just drop in fo
 r the class and pay at that time. When you attend\, and the class is near f
 ull\, you should pay at least one class in advance to guarantee you have a 
 place next time. You can see the actual attendance by looking at past class
 es. Scores are also listed\, if you kept score\, which is not required\, ex
 cept on Master Challenge weeks. PB = Personal Best. You need 230 pts on 40c
