 ttendance Requirements: \nRECREATIONAL: None \nPROGRESSIVE: Must continuous
 ly meet the time/attendance requirements to remain in the Progressive Progr
 am. Those who fall short of the weekly time/attendance requirements will au
 tomatically be considered Recreational\, and Recreational class fees will a
 pply.  These classes are designed to prepared archers for CAP (Competitive 
