 advance of the Indoor at 18m class to secure your place in the class: \nTue
 s 6:30-7:30pm: 1-hr class - $20\nWed  6:30-8:00pm: 1.5-hr class - $30\nSat 
   3:30-5:30pm:  2-hr class - $40\nSun  3:30-5:30pm:  2-hr class - $40\n+ En
 rollment fee: $20 (always due once per semester) \n\nPROGRESSIVE (min. atte
 ndance required):  \nIndoor 3B:       $TBD/wk (min. 5 hrs)  \nIndoor 4:    
