 d up!\n\nCome whenever you want within the time allocated (5:00-8:00pm)\, a
 nd shoot for 1-3+ hours\, in accordance with your strength and experience.\
 nThere is continuous training with Coach Racae\, but since it´s summer\, we
  will challenge ourselves with some archery games!\n\nIt´s going to be a gr
 eat summer - and cool in the indoor archery range!\n\nSign up and pay at ww
 w.paypal.me/atciaustin in advance to secure your space on the shooting line
 ! (Please write the dates and times on your PayPal payment and add an extra
  4%.)\n\nPREREQUISITE: INDOOR 1: First-time Class\n(To register for Indoor 
 1\, click the Sign Up button at the top of www.archerytrainingcenter.com.)\
 n\nOPEN to all archers (adults\, juniors\, parents) in\nINDOOR 2 (9m) and\n
 INDOOR 3A (13.5m) and\nINDOOR 4+ (18m)\n\nEnrollment links at: http://www.a
 rcherytrainingcenter.com/Classes \n\nFees: \nRECREATIONAL: \n$20/cl for 1 h
 r.\, $30 for two hours\, or $40 for 3+ hours!\nThere are also reduced Month
 ly fees and Progressive fees - \nLook under "Classes" on our website.\n\nYo
 ur name will be on the list below when we receive your fee in advance of th
 e class through www.paypal.me/atciaustin (Please add an extra 4%). When cla
 sses are not full\, it's okay to just drop in for the class and pay at that
  time. When you attend\, and the class is near full\, you should pay at lea
 st one class in advance to guarantee you have a place next time. You can se
 e the actual attendance by looking at past classes. Scores are also listed\
 , if you kept score\, which is not required\, except on Master Challenge we
 eks. PB = Personal Best. You need 230 pts on 40cm target or 240 pts on 60cm
  target to graduate out of your distance to 13.5m\, and again at 13.5m to g
 et back to 18m (full distance).\n \nRegistered archers:\n         6:00-7:00
 \n1. Lauren M.\, Adult 18m\n2. \n3.\n4. \n5. \n6. \n7. \n8. \n9.\n10.
