 ents\, and other adults who would like to try archery for the first time an
 d join in future Junior Olympic Archery Development (JOAD) and Adult Traini
 ng classes.   \n\nThis class is a prerequisite for all classes.   \n\nEnrol
 lment link: Click the Sign Up button at the top of the ATCI homepage. \nIf 
 you have more than one year's experience\, contact us for a placement evalu
 ation ($45) instead of attending the Indoor 1 Class.  \n\n(You will be on t
