DESCRIPTION:This weekly practice time is intended to give everyone more pra
 ctice time in the range\, but not as a substitute for the regularly schedul
 ed and coached training classes. This type of practice prepares you for tou
 rnaments\, when you are on the shooting line\, making decisions\, often wit
 hout feedback from your coach. Self-analysis of your form and shots through
  deep\, perfect practice!<br><br>This same time can also be booked in advan
 ce with Coach Racae for&nbsp\;<br>- one-hour private lessons ($50/hr - see 
 Private Lesson sheet)\,&nbsp\;<br>- goal-setting sessions for those on peri
 odization ($0)\,&nbsp\;<br>- new equipment specifying (4% of list price)&nb
 sp\;<br>- new bow setup ($20)\,&nbsp\;<br>- arrow fletching lesson ($15)&nb
 sp\;&nbsp\;<br><br>Details:<br>No coaching - just focused practice!<br>Olym
 pic recurve bows only&nbsp\;<br>Max. draw weight: 45 lbs.<br><br>Open to:<b
 r>- recurve archers who have taken the Indoor 1: First-time Class AND regul
 arly attend at least two (2) hours/month in scheduled group coached trainin
 g classes&nbsp\;<br>- experienced recurve archers\, who have previously met
  with Coach Racae.<br><br>$15/hr payable in advance at<a href="http://paypa
 l.me/atciaustin" target="_blank"> paypal.me/atciaustin</a> or upon arrival.
 &nbsp\;<br>This time and fee can be included for those on monthly periodiza
 tion.<br>Sign up at the range in advance to reserve your place on the shoot
 ing line\, or just show up\, if it´s not nearing full.<br><br>If junior arc
 hers are present\, there must be at least two adults in the range at all ti
 mes (parents\, adult archers).<br><br>All safety rules will be enforced and
  obeyed.<br><br>Always look at the website calendar before coming\, in case
  there is last minute change due to weather\, illness\, etc.<br>Any questio
 ns: Contact Coach Racae 512 975 1850<br><br>See you soon!<br><br>1.&nbsp\; 
