DESCRIPTION:Coach Racae\n\nPREREQUISITES: \nINDOOR 1: First-time Class\,  (
 To register for Indoor 1\, click the Sign Up button at the top of www.arche
 rytrainingcenter.com.) \nINDOOR 2 at 9m\, \nINDOOR 3A at 13.5m\n \nOPEN to 
 all archers (JOAD and Adults) at 18m.\n\nEnrollment links at:\nhttp://www.a
 rcherytrainingcenter.com/news\n\nTime / Attendance Requirements: \nRECREATI
 ONAL: None \nPROGRESSIVE: Must continuously meet the time/attendance requir
 ements to remain in the Progressive Program. Those who fall short of the we
 ekly time/attendance requirements will automatically be considered Recreati
 onal\, and Recreational class fees will apply.  These classes are designed 
 to prepared archers for CAP (Competitive Archery Program).\n\nFees:  \nRECR
 EATIONAL FEES: \nAll fees are payable in advance of the Indoor at 18m class
  to secure your place in the class: \nTues 6:30-7:30pm: 1-hr class - $20\nW
 ed  6:30-8:00pm: 1.5-hr class - $30\nSat   3:30-5:30pm:  2-hr class - $40\n
 Sun  3:30-5:30pm:  2-hr class - $40\n+ Enrollment fee: $20 (always due once
  per semester) \n\nPROGRESSIVE (min. attendance required):  \nIndoor 3B:   
     $TBD/wk (min. 5 hrs)  \nIndoor 4:         $TBD/wk (min. 6 hrs) \nIndoor
  5:         $TBD/wk (min. 8 hrs)  \n\nMONTHLY FEES for ADULTS at 18m:\n\nAd
 ult classes only (Tues 7:30-8:30 + Sun 6:00-7:00):\nJAN   $ 120    \nFEB   
 $ 120 \nMAR   $ 120     \nAPR   $ 120      \nMAY   $ 120    \n\nAdult class
 es + Wed. 6:30-8:00:\nJAN   $ 188    \nFEB   $ 210 \nMAR   $ 233    \nAPR  
  $ 210      \nMAY   $ 210   \n\nMONTHLY FEES for JUNIORS at 18m:\nRecreatio
 nal hourly fees apply. At this level archers should be in the range at leas
 t 5 hrs/wk to improve over time. If your schedule allows for this\, you are
  a Progressive archer\; if not\, you are a Recreational archer.
