DESCRIPTION:PREREQUISITE: INDOOR 1: First-time Class<br>(To register for In
 door 1\, click the Sign Up button at the top of <a href="http://www.archery
 trainingcenter.com">www.archerytrainingcenter.com</a>.)<br><br>OPEN to Juni
 ors/Parents/Adults in<br>INDOOR 2 (9m) and<br>INDOOR 3A (13.5m)&nbsp\;<br>I
 NDOOR 3B/4/5+ (18m)<br><br>Enrollment links at: <a href="http://www.archery
 trainingcenter.com/Classes">http://www.archerytrainingcenter.com/Classes</a
 ><br><br>Fees: <br>RECREATIONAL: <br>$20/cl for 1 hr\; $30/cl for 2 hrs\; $
 40/cl for 3 hrs ON THE SAME DAY.<br>There are also reduced Monthly fees whe
 n you regularly come to more than 3 hrs/week and Progressive fees when you 
 are at 18m and regularly come to more than 5 hrs/week. Ask Coach Racae for 
 more information.<br>&nbsp\;<br>Your name will be on the list below when we
  receive your registration form and fee in advance of the class. When you a
 ttend\, and the class is near full\, you should pay at least one class in a
 dvance to guarantee you have a place on the shooting line next time. <br><b
 r>When classes are not full\, it's okay to just drop in occasionally for th
 e class and pay at that time. However it is difficult to tell how many peop
 le will be dropping in\, so to secure your place\, it is better to register
  and pay in advance to prevent overcrowding. We can only take 10 people on 
 the shooting line at one time. <br><br>When we have more than 10 archers\, 
 we will form a second line\, as in a tournament\, which will reduce the num
 ber of arrows shot per person within the time. (You can see the actual atte
 ndance and class composition by looking at past classes at <a href="http://
 www.archerytrainingcenter.com/calendar">www.archerytrainingcenter.com/calen
 dar</a>.)<br><br>Scores are also listed below\, if you kept score\, which i
 s not required\, except on Master Challenge weeks. You need 230 pts on 40cm
  target or 240 pts on 60cm target to graduate out of your distance into Ind
 oor 3A 13.5m\, and again at 13.5m to get into Indoor 3B at 18m (full distan
 ce).<br>PB = Personal Best. <br><br>Registered archers:<br>1. Cade C.\, JOA
 D 9m\, paid<br>2. Zoë C.\, JOAD 13.5m\, paid<br>3. Sarah X.\, JOAD 18m\, to
  pay 5:30-7:30<br>4. Emma W.\, JOAD 18m\, to pay 5:30-7:30<br>5. Katie G.\,
  JOAD OPT\, paid<br>6. <br>7. <br>8. <br>9.<br>10.
