DESCRIPTION:Coach Racae\n\nPREREQUISITES: \nINDOOR 1: First-time Class\,  (
 To register for Indoor 1\, click the Sign Up button at the top of www.arche
 rytrainingcenter.com.) \nINDOOR 2 at 9m\, \nINDOOR 3A at 13.5m\n \nOPEN to 
 all archers (JOAD and Adults) at 18m.\n\nEnrollment links at:\nhttp://www.a
 rcherytrainingcenter.com/news\n\n1. Daniel H.\n2. Francisca L.\n3. Michael 
 G.\n4. Cassandra G.\n5. Judson M.\n6. Paige M.\n7. Kelly K.\n8.\n9.\n10.\n\
 n\nTime / Attendance Requirements: \nRECREATIONAL: None \nPROGRESSIVE: Must
  continuously meet the time/attendance requirements to remain in the Progre
 ssive Program. Those who fall short of the weekly time/attendance requireme
 nts will automatically be considered Recreational\, and Recreational class 
 fees will apply.  These classes are designed to prepared archers for CAP (C
 ompetitive Archery Program).\n\nFees:  \nRECREATIONAL FEES: \nAll fees are 
 payable in advance of the Indoor at 18m class to secure your place in the c
 lass: \nTues 6:30-7:30pm: 1-hr class - $20\nWed  6:30-8:00pm: 1.5-hr class 
 - $30\nSat   3:30-5:30pm:  2-hr class - $40\nSun  3:30-5:30pm:  2-hr class 
 - $40\n+ Enrollment fee: $20 (always due once per semester) \n\nPROGRESSIVE
  (min. attendance required):  \nIndoor 3B:       $TBD/wk (min. 5 hrs)  \nIn
 door 4:         $TBD/wk (min. 6 hrs) \nIndoor 5:         $TBD/wk (min. 8 hr
 s)  \n\nMONTHLY FEES for ADULTS at 18m:\n\nAdult classes only (Tues 7:30-8:
 30 + Sun 6:00-7:00):\nJAN   $ 120    \nFEB   $ 120 \nMAR   $ 120     \nAPR 
   $ 120      \nMAY   $ 120    \n\nAdult classes + Wed. 6:30-8:00:\nJAN   $ 
 188    \nFEB   $ 210 \nMAR   $ 233    \nAPR   $ 210      \nMAY   $ 210   \n
 \nMONTHLY FEES for JUNIORS at 18m:\nRecreational hourly fees apply. At this
  level archers should be in the range at least 5 hrs/wk to improve over tim
 e. If your schedule allows for this\, you are a Progressive archer\; if not
 \, you are a Recreational archer.
