 >For newer archers\, register using the 2025 INDOOR 2-6 at 9m Registration 
 form<br><br>SCHEDULE :<br>​Register for ​​as many as your schedule and budg
 et allows to progress faster:<br>Sat/Sun 4:00-5:30 pm - <br>T/W/Th  5:00-6:
 30 pm  and  <br>T/W/Th   6:30-8\;:00 pm<br>​Weekdays: Juniors usually come 
 to the 5:00 pm class\, and adults to the 6:30 class\, but all classes are o
 pen to both adults and juniors.<br><br>Always check this calendar just befo
 re driving to class in case there are last-minutes changes or cancellations
 !<br><br>USA Archery Level 4 NTS Coach Racae Meyer<br><br>After you graduat
 e out of Indoor 1\, sign up for 2025 INDOOR 2-6 at 9m<br><br>Registered arc
 hers:<br>1. <b>Abby Y\,</b> 13\, USAA\, pd - 1.5 hrs<br>2. <b>Ellie Y</b>\,
  10\, USAA\, pd - 1.5 hrs<br>3. <b>Jacqui C.\, </b>11\, USAA\, pd - 1.5 hrs
 <br>4. <b>Heather Y.\, </b>adult\, pd - 1.5 hrs<br>5.<br>6.<br>7.<br>8.<br>
 9.<br>10.<br>11.<br>12.<br>NEW 2025 Winter/Spring Fees <br><br>SINGLE Class
  Fees per archer for one Indoor 2-6 class:<br>$31 for 1 hr (arrive 30 min a
 fter class starts or leave 30 min before class ends)<br>$43 for 1.5 hrs<br>
 <br>MULTI-Class Discount Packets<br>  9 hours : $250 (six 1.5-hr classes)<b
 r> 12 hours : $320 (eight 1.5-hr classes)<br> 18 hours : $460 (twelve 1.5-h
 r classes) <br><br>There are 8 places on the shooting line\, and we sometim
 es have double lines depending on attendance.<br><br>Sign in/out upon arriv
 al/departure<br>For single classes\, book and pay in advance.<br>For multi-
 class discount packs\, pay in advance and book when you are sure of the dat
 es.<br>Coaching and whistle commands at all times.<br>Instruction in the Na
 tional Training System.<br>Unfair games depending on attendance.<br><br>Ple
 ase note: Youths &lt\;12 y.o. should not shoot more than 100 arrows/day!<br
 ><br>Prerequisites for Indoor 2: <br>Adults: No min. score in Indoor 1 <br>
 Juniors: 50 pts in Indoor 1<br>Scores needed at 9m to advance to Indoor 3-6
  and Outdoor 3-6:<br><br>                 On 40-cm                  On 60-c
 m<br>               target face                 target face<br>Indoor 3:   
        230 pts                240 pts           -&gt\; Outdoor 3 at 13.5m<b
 r>Indoor 4:          250 pts                260 pts           -&gt\; Outdoo
