DESCRIPTION:<b>When you are in Outdoor 3-9 </b>and would like a private les
 son with Coach Racae\, you can now book:<br><br><b>Outdoors</b>: You will <
 b>attend the full Outdoor 3-9 class</b>. Book <b>30 min only</b> during cla
 ss times on Saturdays and Sundays either at 9:30-10:00 or 10:00-10:30. The 
 first and last 30 min of the class Coach Racae will coach the other archers
  in attendance.  <b>Add your name next to just one of following times for O
 utdoor private lesson today:</b><br><ul><li>9:30-10:00 - Yugan - no lesson 
 due to deltoid</li></ul><ul><li>10:00-10:30</li></ul><b>Indoors at 9m</b>: 
 <b>30 min or 1 hr</b> during the Monday indoor session (6:30-8:00). Fill in
  the times on the calendar under the Monday(s) of your choice.<br><br><b>Ad
 ditional fees: </b><br><ul><li><b>Outdoors</b> : $12/30 min  (in addition t
 o the regular Outdoor 3 class fee)</li><li><b>Indoors</b>: $40/30min or $75
 /hr. You can shoot before or after your private lesson time at no extra cha
 rge from 6:30-8:00\, if other archers are booked for private lessons otherw
 ise the range will be closed.</li></ul><i>Priority will be given to archers
  who will participate/compete in TX State and National competitions.</i>
