DESCRIPTION:PREREQUISITE:&nbsp\;<br>INDOOR 1: First-time Class<br>(To regis
 ter for Indoor 1\, click the Sign Up button at the top of <a href="http://w
 ww.archerytrainingcenter.com">www.archerytrainingcenter.com</a>.)<br>INDOOR
  2: at 9m<br>INDOOR 3A: at 13.5m<br><br>OPEN to Juniors/Parents/Adults in<b
 r>INDOOR 3B/4/5/6+ (18m)<br><br>Enrollment links at: <a href="http://www.ar
 cherytrainingcenter.com/Classes">http://www.archerytrainingcenter.com/Class
 es</a><br><br>Fees: <br>RECREATIONAL: <br>$15 for up to 3 hours\, when not 
 covered in the monthly or progressive fees.<br>There are also reduced Month
 ly fees when you regularly come to more than 3 hrs/week and Progressive fee
 s when you are at 18m and regularly come to more than 5 hrs/week. Ask Coach
  Racae for more information.<br>&nbsp\;<br>Your name will be on the list be
 low when we receive your registration form and fee in advance of the class.
  When you attend\, and the class is near full\, you should pay at least one
  class in advance to guarantee you have a place on the shooting line next t
 ime. <br><br>When classes are not full\, it's okay to just drop in occasion
 ally for the class and pay at that time. However it is difficult to tell ho
 w many people will be dropping in\, so to secure your place\, it is better 
 to register and pay in advance to prevent overcrowding. We can only take 10
  people on the shooting line at one time. <br><br>When we have more than 10
  archers\, we will form a second line\, as in a tournament\, which will red
 uce the number of arrows shot per person within the time. (You can see the 
 actual attendance and class composition by looking at past classes at <a hr
 ef="http://www.archerytrainingcenter.com/calendar">www.archerytrainingcente
 r.com/calendar</a>.)<br><br>Scores are also listed below\, if you kept scor
 e\, which is not required\, except on Master Challenge weeks. You need 230 
 pts on 40cm target or 240 pts on 60cm target to graduate out of your distan
 ce into Indoor 3A 13.5m\, and again at 13.5m to get into Indoor 3B at 18m (
 full distance).<br>PB = Personal Best. <br><br>Registered archers:<br>1. <b
 r>2.<br>3. <br>4. <br>5. <br>6. <br>7. <br>8. <br>9.<br>10.
