 ee: $12/30 min  (in addition to the regular class fee)\nEmail Coach Racae i
 f you would like a private lesson during these times.\nThe Outdoor 3-9 clas
 s will be extended in Fall 2024 as the temperatures go down\, so there shou
 ld be an extra hour available for private lessons.
