 d postpone classes on the weekend if Austin is still in Stage 5<b><br></b><
 br>I know this is disappointing to most of you - and no one wants to attend
  the training classes more than I do. I love to coach you! My main concern\
 , however\, as always\, is to keep everyone who attends our classes as safe
  as possible.&nbsp\;<br><br>Not to worry\, we will start classes soon again
 !<br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\
