 <br><br>Sign up for just one Outdoor 1 class\, because most people graduate
  out of this class into Outdoor 2 after the first lesson.<br><br><b>Your na
 me will be added below and your place reserved on a</b> <b>first registered
  and paid basis and after we receive 3 things</b>:&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br>2022 OU
 TDOOR 1 REGISTRATION FORM + WAIVERS + FEE<br><br><b>Registered archers&nbsp
 \;</b>at 9m on 40-cm target face:<br><b>Target nos:</b><br>1. Courtney K.\,
  adult - pd - <b>substituted 2/20</b><br>2. Kelsey N.\, adult - pd + ap - <
 b>refunded</b><br>3. NIkki C.\, adult - pd - <b>substituted 2/20</b><br>4.&
 nbsp\;Gentry A.\, adult - pd - <b>substituted 2/19</b><br>5. Micah G.\, adu
