 uted 2/12</b><br>10A. Adam H.\, dad - pd - no refund\, wants to reschedule 
 - <b>substituted 3/19</b><br>10B. Lexi H.\, 10 - pd - no refund\, wants to 
 reschedule - <b>substituted 3/19</b><br><br>Space will be limited to 10-15 
 archers per session depending on the number of family groups in attendance 
 or in accordance with CDC Guidelines.&nbsp\;<br>Each person will have a tar
 get stand\, except after 10 people have registered\, two members from the s
 ame family will share one target stand.<br>The archer and a maximum of one 
