 atch as a spectator. Parents of juniors 8-9 years old need to register\, pa
 y\, and shoot with their child for greater safety.<br><br>A maximum of one 
 8-year-old (+ parent) is accepted into each Outdoor 1: First-time Class.&nb
 sp\;<br><br>We will accept a limited&nbsp\;number of kids under 12 into the
  program each semester\, depending on the total&nbsp\; number of archers in
  all the classes. If you join before the limit is reached\, and are younger
  than 12\, you´ll stay in the program and take other Outdoor 1 classes as n
 eeded and later join Outdoor 2.&nbsp\;If you are under 12\, registered and 
