 niors may need to take Outdoor 1 two or three times before qualifying to ge
 t into Outdoor 2 by scoring 50 pts. You´ll make it as soon as you score on 
 average about 5 pts/end of 3 arrows.&nbsp\;<br>Adults don´t need a minimum 
