 .\, adult 62\n6. Logan B.\, 8 46\n7. Latasha B.\, parent 32\n8.\n9.\n10.\nW
 aiting List: \n11. \n12. \nIf your name is on the waiting list\, you have a
  choice of coming to see if a place opens up at the last minute\, or resche
 duling your class for another date/time. We can only take 10 archers on the
  shooting line at one time. If you prefer not to be on the waiting list\, p
 lease reschedule your class for another time.
