  href="http://www.paypal.me/atciaustin" id="ow11461" __is_owner="true">www.
 paypal.me/atciaustin</a> in advance to secure your space on the shooting li
 ne! (Please write the dates and times on your PayPal payment.)<br><br>PRERE
