 nJAN   $ 188    \nFEB   $ 210 \nMAR   $ 233    \nAPR   $ 210      \nMAY   $
  210   \n\nMONTHLY FEES for JUNIORS at 18m:\nRecreational hourly fees apply
 . At this level archers should be in the range at least 5 hrs/wk to improve
