 u><br><b>Target Assignments:</b><br><u></u><b><br></b>1. <b>Erin S.\, </b>a
 dult\, to pay - <b>44 pts</b>  -&gt\; <b>Indoor 2</b><br><br>2. <b>Scott M.
 \, </b>adult\, pd - substituted for 5/14/23 - <b>74 pts </b>-&gt\; <b>Indoo
 r 2</b><br><br>3. <b>Dean D.\, </b>adult\, pd - <b>40 pts </b>-&gt\; <b>Ind
