DESCRIPTION:Master Challenge Weeks are when the real (40-cm FITA and 60-cm 
 JOAD) targets go back up\, so we can all see the improvements made in build
 ing muscle memory and neural pathways from perfectly practicing the Nationa
 l Training System positions\, training the brain to create the right pictur
 e and building up our Self Image through the use of the Big Yellows!\n\nHel
 pful Hint:\nIt would be a good idea to register for more than one Indoor 2/
 3/4 classes during the Master Challenge weeks\, if you'd like to have more 
 opportunities to earn your USA Archery Star Pins and get out of your distan
 ce!
