 "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1tNkBcZq9GWzNyZhOz50G02KwQX6J6fN6Fm
 QZRmynx2c/edit?usp=sharing" target="_blank">2026 Summer Weekly Individual T
 raining  (Responses)</a><br><b><br></b><br><b>Summer training (</b>As discu
 ssed together with great input from you! <b>):</b><br><b><br>Independent</b
 > <b>practice</b> <b>outdoors</b> as much as possible\; min. 90 arrows/sess
 ion\; max 150\, min of 2 hrs<br><b>Group practice outdoors</b> - Set matche
 s\, eliminations\; round robins\, etc. (use the group for doing things you 
 cannot do when practicing on the field alone)<br>When<b> indoors</b>\, deep
  focus on consistency of form and mind\; equipment<br><b>SPTs:</b> Preferab
 ly 5 days/wk on alternating days\; max 30min @ 25-30 secs/rep\; rest 60 sec
 s inbetween\; do them at the end of the practice sessions<br><b>When form s
 tarts going off</b> with more frequent "breakdowns"\, take a 5-10 min break
 \, reset\, do it\; if after two or three breaks\, form is still off\, stop.
  You are programming your subconscious to only accept "perfect" form\; stop
 ping is better than continuing  with "less-than-perfect". Go rest up and re
 focus for another day.<br><b>Score once a week </b>- consistently on the sa
 me day\, no matter what\; competitions happen\, ready or not. Score more of
 ten closer to the competition.<br><b>Min: 10 hrs/wk</b><ul><li><b>Sun</b> O
 </li><li><b>Mon</b> 2 hrs - Independent practice / SPTs</li><li><b>Tues </b
 >30 min virtual - Mental competition prep\; training adjustments\; progress
  reviews / SPTs afterwards\; (watch competition YouTubes for inspriation)</
 li><li><b>Wed </b>3 hrs? - independent practice / SPTs</li><li><b>Thurs</b>
  - garage shooting\; self-videos / SPTs</li><li><b>Fri</b> 1.5-2.0 hrs - in
 dependent practice - Weekly scoring day - 2 rounds min. - focusing on reduc
 ing the spread between PB and average at 40m / SPTs</li><li><b>Sat </b>3 hr
 s on field in group training class - set matches\, equipment</li></ul><br><
 b>Tournament happiness: </b>Lasting longer in the eliminations than last ti
 me. <br><br><b>Scores</b> at the moment at 40m: average 280\; PB 290+\; tou
 rnament goal: 300+<br><b><br></b><br><b>Homework: </b><br><ol><li>Buy an <b
 >a/c unit</b> for the garage so you can self-video and self-critique in the
 re whenever you can't do it out on the field due to the weather</li><li>Loo
 k up the <b>middle of pack scores </b>in U15 at last year's JTN.</li><li>Le
 t me know when I need to move the class to 8:30-11:30 because of the heat.<
 /li></ol>\n\nJoin with Google Meet: https://meet.google.com/yrr-ssft-zqi\n\
 nLearn more about Meet at: https://support.google.com/a/users/answer/928272
 0
