DESCRIPTION:Please look at the website calendar before coming to class\, in
  case there are changes or cancellations.\n\nPREREQUISITE: INDOOR 1: First-
 time Class\nThese classes are for JUNIOR archers and their parents who have
  taken and qualified in the Indoor 1: First-time Class by scoring at least 
 50 pts at 9m. (Click the Sign Up button on the website to register for Indo
 or 1: First-time Class.)\n\nPARENTS \ncan enroll and shoot with their child
 (ren) in the above classes\, provided they have also taken an Indoor 1: Fir
 st-time Class.\n\nPLEASE COMPLETE ONE ENROLLMENT FORM FOR EACH ARCHER.\nEnr
 ollment forms will be emailed to you after your Indoor 1: First-time Lesson
 .\n\nDATES:          August 23 - December 14\, 2014\n\nCAPACITY:    10 arch
 ers per class\nAGES:            8 - 18 years old \nDISTANCES:  9m\, 13.5m\,
  18m\n\nCLASS SCHEDULE and COACHES / INSTRUCTORS:\n(Read enrollment info be
 low)\nSaturdays: 12:00-1:30 and 2:00-3:30 USA Archery Level 2 Instructor Lu
 ke\nSundays: 12:00-1:30 and 2:00-3:30 USA Archery Level 1 Instructor Chloe\
 nTues / Wed / Thurs: 2:00-3:30 (Home School) : USA Archery Level 3 NTS Coac
 h Racae\nTues / Thurs: 5:30-7:00: USA Archery Level 3 NTS Coach Racae\nWed:
  5:30-7:00: USA Archery Level 2 Instructor Dale\n\nDAYS CLOSED:\nSEPT. 1\, 
 Labor Day\nSEPT. 30\, Range closed\nOCT. 31\, Halloween\nNOV. 26-30\, Thank
 sgiving\nDEC. 15 - Jan. 3\, Christmas / New Year's\n\nENROLLMENT IS ON A FI
 RST-RECEIVED AND PAID BASIS.\nAn enrollment form must be completed and your
  payment received in order for you to be enrolled and a place reserved for 
 you.\nYou can enroll any time during the semester for as many or as few cla
 sses as you like as long as there are places open.\nSo\, for example\, you 
 can enroll for the entire semester\, each month\, or sprinkle the days thro
 ughout the semester depending on your schedule. (Please bear in mind\, howe
 ver\, you'll progress faster with regular attendance.)\n\nREFUNDS\, CREDITS
 \, and SUBSTITUTIONS:\nThere are no refunds or credits for paid days missed
  Aug. 23 - Dec. 14\, 2014\, except in the case of injury\, long-term illnes
 s\, unforeseen move out of the Austin area\, or if we cancel a class. If\, 
 however\, you let us know that you will miss a class\, you can substitute a
 nother class as long as there are places left in that class during the Fall
  2014 semester.\n\nIn the case of physical injury or long-term illness\, we
  require a doctor's note saying the archer is unable to practice archery\, 
 and then a doctor's note saying the archer is fit to return to archery\, be
 fore the archer will be allowed back in class.\n\nATTENDANCE RECOMMENDATION
 S in order to improve: \nINDOOR 2 at 9m :        One or two 1.5-hr classes 
 per week.\nINDOOR 3A at 13.5m : Two 1.5-hr classes per week.\nINDOOR 3B at 
 18m :    Two or three 1.5-hr classes per week.\n\nMINIMUM ENROLLMENT:\nClas
 ses will be held only if there are 5 or more archers enrolled in the class.
  \nIf the class does not make this minimum enrollment requirement\, you wil
 l be notified at least one week in advance\, so you can reschedule.\n\nHOW 
 DO I ADVANCE?\nYou'll be trained in Indoor 2 at 9m until you score 240 pts 
 and master certain NTS* Shot Cycle positions\, then you'll move back to 13.
 5m in Indoor 3A until you score 240 pts and master more NTS Shot Cycle posi
 tions\, and then to 18m in Indoor 3B until you score 200 pts. twice and mas
 ter more NTS Shot Cycle positions. After that you'll be in Indoor 4: Advanc
 ed Recreational with Coach Racae!\n\nFEES:\nAll fees are payable in advance
  of the class to secure your place in the class.\n$21 / class\, if paid on 
 or before August 3\, 2014 \n$22 / class\, if paid on or before August 24\, 
 2014 \n$23 / class\, if paid after August 24\, 2014.\n\n+ Enrollment fee: $
 20 (always due once per semester)\n\nHOW MUCH DO I OWE? \nMultiply the numb
 er of classes x the appropriate fee above.\nAdd the $20 semester enrollment
  fee\n\nHOW DO I PAY IN ADVANCE (after I submit the enrollment form)?\nPay 
 the total by Paypal using e-mail address: racae@aajoad.com.\nWe also accept
  checks and credit cards in person at the indoor range.\nPlease make your c
 heck payable to "Archery Training Center\, Inc." and give it to us at JOAD*
  or mail it to us at:\nArchery Training Center\, Inc.\, PO Box 93216\, Aust
 in\, TX 78709-3216\n\nSAFE SPORTS:\nParents please note we are part of the 
 US Olympic Committee's Safe Sport program\, so we minimally require one oth
 er adult besides the instructor to be present at all times. Please plan to 
 stay with your child or take turns with other parents staying whenever nece
 ssary to fulfill this requirement. THANKS!\n\nINDOOR 2/3 WAIVERS:\nPlease f
 ill out\, sign\, and return the Photo\, Medical\, and Supervision Releases 
 attached to the e-mail you received with the enrollment form link..\n\nQUES
 TIONS?\nE-mail us at racae@archerytrainingcenter.com or\nCall us at 512 436
  8813\n\n*NTS = National Training System\n*JOAD = Junior Olympic Archery De
 velopment
