 urther notice or approved by Coach Racae. <br><br>Parents of juniors 10+ ca
 n sign up as an archer or watch as a spectator. <br>Parents of juniors 8-9 
 years old need to register\, pay\, and shoot with their child for greater s
 afety.<br><br>A maximum of one 8-year-old (+ parent) is accepted into each 
