  registered and paid after the cut off\, your fee will be returned to you. 
 <br><br>Juniors may need to take Indoor 1 two or three times before qualify
 ing for Indoor 2 by scoring 50 pts over 30 arrows.<br>Adults don´t need a m
 inimum score to graduate into Indoor 2.<br><br>At the end of each Indoor 1 
 class\, your scores will be posted. If we did not finish a complete round (
 30 arrows)\, you may not recognize your final score\, because it will have 
 been averaged by taking your recorded score from your scorecard\, dividing 
 it by the number of arrows you shot to get an arrow average\, and then mult
 iplying that by 30 to get a full round score.
