DESCRIPTION:Training classes at this location are reserved for competitive 
 and advanced archers.\n\n\nYou will receive an email with info and instruct
 ions before your first session at this location.\n\nIf you participated in 
 the 2024 or 2025 Aggie Invitationals\, you are definitely in! \n\nYou are a
 lso in\, even if you haven't yet made the 2026 Indoor Competition Team\, bu
 t have your own equipment\, and have scored 240 on the 60-cm target face or
  230 on the 40-cm target face in a 30-arrow indoor round at 9m\, contact Co
 ach Racae.\n\nSpace is limited to 12 archers per session\, so sign up early
  and pay the Training Class and Facility Fees in advance to secure your pla
 ce! \n\nCoach Racae will coach this Training Class whenever possible and wh
 en there are at least 5 archers registered by Fri 10:00 am (for Sat) and Sa
 t 10:00am (for Sun).   \n\nTraining Class fee: $57/archer/class\n(1x/wk req
 uired to attend Open Practice)\nFacility fee (required each month): $210/mo
 nth/archer due on or before Oct 1\, Nov 1\, Dec 1\, Jan 1 and $105 due befo
 re Feb 1 (Move out : Feb 15)\nOpen Practice Included in facility fee (1-2x/
 wk recommended)\nPrivate Lesson fee: $125/hr/archer (2x/mo recommended)\nPl
 ease add your name below to register:\n\n1. Ethan N\n2. Emma A.\n3. Anna P\
 n4. Chi C.\, adult\, USAA\, pd (11/18)\n5. Logan C.\, 9\, USAA\, pd (12/18)
 \n6. Everett Z.\, 13 \n7. Finn E\n8. Rhys E\n9. Love (tryout)\n10\n11.\n12.
