DESCRIPTION:First-time class for juniors age 8+\, optionally their parents\
 , and other adults who would like to try archery for the first time and joi
 n in future Junior Olympic Archery Development (JOAD) and Adult Training cl
 asses.     This class is a prerequisite for all other training classes.    
  If you have more than one year experience\, contact us for a placement eva
 luation ($45) instead of attending the Indoor 1 Class.     If you would lik
 e to schedule a birthday party during one of the Indoor 1: First-time Class
  times\, the minimum charge for booking the range is $200 for a max. of 10 
 archers + $5/archer to cover additional supplies (balloons\, etc.). Send yo
 ur request to racae@archerytrainingcenter.com.    Registered archers:  1.  
 Nina Cor..\, 9 2.  David Cor..\, dad 3.   4.   5.   6.   7.   8.   9.   10.
     Waiting List:     If your name is on the waiting list\, you have a choi
 ce of  coming to see if a place opens up at the last minute\, or  reschedul
 ing your class for another date/time.  We can only take 10 archers on the s
 hooting line at one time.  The instructor may also create two shooting line
 s\, which may increase the length of the class for everyone and decrease th
 e number of arrows everyone has time to shoot.  If you prefer not to be on 
 the waiting list\, please reschedule your class for another date.
