CREATED:20260326T213634Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><b>SPRING TRAINING PROGRAM - 9 weeks (Mar 23 - May 31)</b> <
 /p><p>We will go through the <b>National Training System (NTS) 11 Steps of 
 Shooting</b> and <b>Building Your Mental Program</b> step-by-step during th
 e regular training classes\, covering each one in sequence during the follo
 wing weeks.. </p><p>Learning\, understanding and doing the NTS and building
  a strong mental program are ongoing quests that all archers are continuous
 ly trying to achieve - even at the highest levels !</p><p><b><i>What if you
  miss some of the weeks?</i></b><i>  </i>We'll do our best to catch you up 
 during your next sessions. </p><p><b><i>Also see more important notes below
 \, under the schedule.</i></b></p><p><b>MARCH / APRIL</b></p><br><b>Sat 3/2
 8 - Fri 4/3</b><span>  </span><br><ul><li><b>WELCOME </b><span>!  </span><s
 pan>Understanding  </span></li><li><b>NTS CONCEPTS</b><span> especially TRA
 NSFER </span></li><li><span>Step 1</span><b> STANCE </b>+ Building Your Men
 tal Program</li></ul><p><b>Sat 4/4- Fri 4/10</b><br></p><ul><li>Step 2  <b>
 NOCK</b> + Building Your Mental Program</li><li>Step 3 <b>HOOK &amp\; GRIP<
 /b> + Building Your Mental Program</li></ul><p></p><p><b>Sat</b><b> 4/11 - 
 Fri 4/17</b><span> </span><span>  </span></p><p></p><ul><li><span>Step 4</s
 pan><b> SET </b><span>+ Building Your Mental Program</span></li><li><span>S
 tep 5 </span><b>SET-UP +</b><span> Building Your Mental Program</span></li>
 </ul><p></p><br><b>Sat 4/18 - Fri 4/24 </b><br><ul><li><span>Step 6 </span>
 <b>DRAW</b><span> to </span><b>LOAD </b><span>+ Building Your Mental Progra
 m</span></li><li><span>Step 7 </span><b>ANCHOR </b><span>+ Building Your Me
 ntal Program</span></li></ul><br><b>Sat 4/25 - Fri 5/1 </b><br><ul><li><b>S
 CORING WEEK - ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b><br></li></ul>
 <br><b>MAY</b><br><b><br></b><br><b>Sat 5/2 - Fri 5/8 </b> <br><ul><li>Step
  8<b> </b><b><b>TRANSFER to HOLD</b> + </b>Building Your Mental Program</li
 ><li>Step 9<b> </b><b>EXPAND / AIM + </b>Building Your Mental Program</li><
 /ul><br><b>Sat 5/9 - Fri 5/15</b><span> </span><br><ul><li>Step 10 <b>RELEA
 SE / FOLLOW-THROUGH </b><b>+</b> Building Your Mental Program</li><li>Step 
 11 <b>FEEDBACK +</b> Building Your Mental Program</li></ul><br><b>Sat 5/16 
 - Fri 5/22  </b><br><ul><li><b>PUTTING IT ALL TOGETHER !</b><br></li></ul><
 br><b>Sat 5/23 - Sun 5/31  </b><br><ul><li><b>SCORING WEEK - ATCI MONTHLY C
 OMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b></li></ul><p><b>INTRO</b></p><p><i>Each we
 ek the focus of your lessons will be on one or two particular </i><b><i>Ste
 ps of Shooting of the NTS (National Training System) </i></b><i>shot cycle\
 , to help you focus and improve your form\, which\, as we all know\, leads 
 to greater and more consistent precision (tight groups of arrows) and ultim
 ately greater accuracy (tight groups of arrows dead center)</i>. <i>Concurr
 ently you will be learning how to build a </i><b><i>strong mental program</
 i></b><i>\, which will improve your focus\, awareness and confidence for co
 mpetitions later.</i></p><p><i>The NTS is the </i><b><i>most biomechanicall
 y efficient and least injurious method of shooting</i></b><i>\, and is high
 ly and continuously researched out at the Elite Athletes Center in Chula Vi
 sta\, CA. It is what the Olympians do!</i></p><p><i>The 11 NTS Steps are cu
 mulative with each step most successfully completed if the previous steps h
 ave been completed well. As you reach higher levels\, you will learn the NT
 S Steps in progressively greater detail.</i></p><p><b>Goals by the end of t
 he spring semester (May 31)</b></p><p>Make a list of what you want to accom
 plish by the end of the semester. <span>Email it to Coach Racae\, so you ca
 n discuss it together. </span></p><p>Confidence and consistency in form and
  mind are your two main goals. Replicate the NTS step(s) mindfully and cons
 istently on every shot\, and build a strong mental program that is consiste
 nt on every shot. </p><p>Your conscious mind commands your subconscious min
 d to put your body into position\, after you train your body to be in those
  positions. When you stay in the present\, just doing what you need to do a
 s you need to do it\, your conscious mind will be occupied\, instead of ran
 dom thoughts entering your head or your being distracted by emotional or en
 vironmental elements. </p><p>You´ll need to build up your mental program al
 ongside your form knowledge\, so when your body is trained to shoot excelle
 nt shots\, your self image and subconscious support you\, instead of underm
 ining you. </p><p><i>Improving your training\, practicing\, and competition
  components\, process\, and skills is a perpetual lifetime quest\, which yo
 u´ll slowly learn to love. You´ll  realize what is under your control\, and
  you'll become your own best coach! Those who find all this fun and enjoy t
 he journey are the ones who win - the champions!</i></p><p><i>I know you ca
 n do it -  I'm your biggest fan!</i></p><p><i>​I'm also really looking forw
 ard to seeing you improve\, succeed\, and thrive !​</i></p><p><b><i>       
                                             Coach Racae</i></b></p>
