 nk">www.archerytrainingcenter.com/<u></u>calendar</a> under Aggie Invitatio
 nal on  Nov 22-24.<br><br><b>All that is allowed this year is to sign up fo
 r </b><b>one shooting time of 60 arrows (2 rounds of 30 arrows) on </b><b>a
  40-cm target face (choose single NOT triangular 3-spot). </b><br><br>Pract
 ice outdoors from now on at 18m on <b>40-cm target face only.</b> There are
  no 60-cm target faces at the Aggie Invitational this year. Alternate some 
 days with shooting at your outdoor distance\, so you practice for both indo
 or and outdoor competitions. <br><br><b>Deadline: Sunday\, Nov. 10</b><br>M
 eet one of the <b>MQS</b> (Minimum Qualifying Scores) below to participate 
