 .5 hrs<br>6. <b>Ahmet O.\, </b>11\, pd - 1.5 hrs<br>7.<br>8.<br>9.<br>10.<b
 r>11.<br>12.<br><br>SINGLE Class Fees per archer for one Indoor 2-6 class<b
 r>Book and pay in advance. (All Indoor 2-6 Classes are 1.5 hrs long.)<br>$3
 0 for 1 hr (arrive 30 min after class starts or leave 30 min before class e
 nds)<br>$45 for 1.5-hr class<br><br>Discount Fee Packs:<br>Starting August 
