DESCRIPTION:After you graduate out of INDOOR 1\, sign up for 2026 INDOOR 2-
 6 at 9m Registration Form (<a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIp
 QLSfz1Ww1xFc_x-hCgXixX36YxyfAHlfAUMi-Hir24Fy7hLOzbw/viewform?usp=sharing&ou
 id=104080193312046349991" target="_blank">https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e
 /1FAIpQLSfz1Ww1xFc_x-hCgXixX36YxyfAHlfAUMi-Hir24Fy7hLOzbw/viewform?usp=shar
 ing&amp\;ouid=104080193312046349991</a>) until you score  240 pts on the 60
 -cm target face or 230 pts on the 40-cm target face. Then you will graduate
  to our outdoor classes !<br><br>After you graduate to Outdoor 3-9\, you wi
 ll be granted access to the ATCI Calendar via an email from Coach Racae\, a
 nd can just add your name under Registered Archers below..<br><br>SCHEDULE 
 :<br>Register for ​​as many as your schedule and budget allows to progress 
 faster:<br>Sat/Sun   4:30-6:00 pm  <br>Wed         5:00-6:30 pm - Juniors &
 lt\;15 and Parents after July 1<br>                 6:30-8:00 pm<br>Thurs  
      6:30-8:00 pm <br><br>Always check this calendar just before driving to
  class in case there are last-minutes changes or cancellations!<br><br>USA 
 Archery Level 4 NTS Coach Racae Meyer unless otherwise noted above.<br><br>
 The level of each attending archer is noted next to their name below\, to h
 elp you decide which classes to join. (Example: Indoor 2 are beginners\; Ou
 tdoor 5+ (O5 @30m\, etc.) are competitive outdoor archers)<br><br>There is 
 a minimum attendance of 3 registered archers for the class to be held.<br><
 br>Registered archers:<br>1. <b>Anjali M</b><span>.\, adult\, pd (Indoor 2)
  - moved from 6/4 - 1.5 hrs</span><br>2. <b>Josh C</b>.\, adult\, pd - 1.5 
 hrs<br>3. <b>Adit D.\, </b>adult\, pd - 1.5 hrs<br>4.<br>5.<br>6.<br>7.<br>
 8.<br>9.<br>10.<br>11.<br>12.<br><br>SINGLE Class Fees per archer for one I
 ndoor 2-6 class<br>Book and pay in advance.<br>$30 for 1 hr (book a 1-hr cl
 ass\, or arrive 30 min after a 1.5-hr  starts or leave 30 min before class 
 ends)<br>$45 for 1.5-hr class<br><br>MONTHLY Discount Fee Packs<br>Pay befo
 re the 1st of each month\; book dates within the month<br>1 class/wk:      
 $218 (7.5 hrs\; 5 classes/mo)<br>2 classes/wk: $372 (13.5 hrs\; 9 classes/m
 o)<br>3 classes/wk: $557 (21 hrs\; 14 classes/mo)<br>4 classes/wk: $675 (27
  hrs\; 18 classes/mo)<br>5 classes/wk: $792 (33 hrs\; 22 classes/mo)<br><br
 >MULTI-CLASS Discount Packets<br>Pay in advance and book when you're sure o
 f the dates.<br>  9 hours : $257 (6 classes)<br> 12 hours : $330 (8 classes
 )<br> 18 hours : $477 (12 classes) <br> 23 hours: $587 (15 classes)<br> 27 
 hours: $675 (18 classes)<br><br>There are 8 places on the shooting line\, b
 ut we often have double lines as in competitions\, depending on attendance.
 <br><br>Sign in/out upon arrival/departure<br>Coaching and whistle commands
  at all times.<br>Instruction in the National Training System.<br>Unfair ga
 mes depending on attendance.<br><br>Please note: Youths &lt\;12 y.o. should
  not shoot more than 100 arrows/day!<br><br>Prerequisites for Indoor 2: <br
 >Adults: No min. score in Indoor 1 <br>Juniors: 50 pts in Indoor 1<br>Score
 s needed at 9m to advance to Indoor 3-6 and Outdoor 3-6:<br><br>           
       On 40-cm                  On 60-cm<br>               target face     
             target face<br>Indoor 3:          230 pts                240 pt
 s           -&gt\; Outdoor 3 at 13.5m<br>Indoor 4:          250 pts        
         260 pts           -&gt\; Outdoor 4 at 18m/20m<br>Indoor 5:         
  270 pts                280 pts           -&gt\; Outdoor 5 at 30m<br>Indoor
  6:          290 pts                300 pts          -&gt\;  Outdoor 6 at 4
