DESCRIPTION:REGISTER NOW !<br>This class is open to adults\, juniors\, and 
 parents who have taken and graduated out of Outdoor 1: First-time Class and
  are shooting at distances of 9m to 70m. It is a mixed class of different d
 istances.&nbsp\;<br>Sign up any time for as many or as few Outdoor 2-7 Clas
 ses as you like.<br>Register at one of these links depending on your level:
 <br><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdzkDP5mwDrW_qgrx2Ynl
 LDYipCtg5LRbHBqkYVHMJkBolOig/viewform">2021 Outdoor 2 at 9m and Outdoor 3 a
 t 13.5m</a><br><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfF-EGKsMP
 SlfPLuLe3aLkqThTFZs0qqb8zleJ_0W3B6Xn7mA/viewform">2021 Outdoor 4 - 9 at 20m
  - 70m</a><br><br>Registered archers:<br>1.&nbsp\;<br>2.&nbsp\;<br>3. <b>Li
 ly R.\, </b>12<b> @ 30m </b>on 122cm target face - pd<br>4.&nbsp\;<b>Christ
 opher N</b>.\, adult @ 9m on 40-cm target face - pd<br>5.<br>6. <b>Marissa 
 I.\, </b>adult @ 9m on 40-cm target face - pd<br>7.<br>8.<br>9.<br>10.<br><
 br>Space will be limited to a maximum of 10-15 archers per session dependin
 g on the number of family groups in attendance or in accordance with CDC Gu
 idelines.&nbsp\;<br>Each person will have a target stand\, except after 10 
 people have registered\, two members from the same family will share one ta
 rget stand.<br><br>The archer and a maximum of one spectator will be allowe
 d on the field until further notice or approved by Coach Racae. Parents can
  sign up as an archer or watch as a spectator.<br><br>As of Sept 15\, we ha
 ve reached the maximum number of kids under 12 that we accept into the prog
 ram this semester. The minimum age to register is now 12 years old.&nbsp\;<
 br><br>If you registered by Sept 15\, and are younger than 12\, you´ll stay
  in the program and take other Outdoor 1 classes as needed and later join O
 utdoor 2.&nbsp\;<br><br>More information and other registration forms are a
 vailable on&nbsp\;<a href="http://www.archerytrainingcenter.com">www.archer
 ytrainingcenter.com</a>.
