UID:5v7gdp33evaqe51ufic124eum3_R20260829@google.com
CREATED:20260824T233625Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>The <b>FALL TRAINING PROGRAM (Aug 22 -Dec 20)</b> is the lon
 gest program\, meaning that we will go through the <b>National Training Sys
 tem (NTS) 11 Steps of Shooting</b> and <b>Building Your Mental Program</b> 
 with plenty of time for revisions and catching up during the semester with 
 scoring weeks at the end of each month starting at the end of September. </
 p><p>You can join any week by taking the Indoor 1: First-time Class. </p><p
 >Learning\, understanding and doing the NTS and building a strong mental pr
 ogram are ongoing quests that all archers are continuously trying to achiev
 e - even at the highest levels !<br></p><p><i><b>What if you miss some of t
 he weeks?</b>  </i>We'll do our best to catch you up during your next sessi
 ons. </p><p><b>AUG/SEPT</b><br></p><ul><li><b>Sat Aug 22 - Fri  Aug 28</b> 
   <b>WELCOME </b>!  Understanding  <b>NTS CONCEPTS</b> especially TRANSFER 
 + NTS Step 1:<b> STANCE</b><b> + </b>NTS Step 2: <b> NOCK</b><b> </b></li><
 li><b> Sat Aug 29 - Fri Sept 4   </b>NTS Step 3: <b>HOOK &amp\; GRIP </b><b
 >+ </b>Building Your Mental Program </li><li> <b>Sat 5 - Fri 11</b>   NTS S
 tep 4:<b> SET</b><b> + </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li><li><b> Sat 1
 2 - Fri 18  </b>NTS Step 5:<b> SET-UP </b><b>+</b> Building Your Mental Pro
 gram</li><li><b> Sat 19 - Fri  25 Putting it all together</b></li><li><b> S
 at 26 - Fri Oct 2  </b><b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b><b
 > </b><b>   </b></li></ul><p></p><p><b>OCTOBER</b></p><ul><li><b>  Sat Oct 
 3 - Fri 9 </b>NTS Step 6 <b>DRAW</b> to <b>LOAD </b>+ Building Your Mental 
 Program</li><li>  <b>Sat 10 - Fri 16 </b>NTS Step 7  <b>ANCHOR </b>+ Buildi
 ng Your Mental Program  </li><li><b>  Sat 17 - Fri 23 </b>NTS Step 8  <b>TR
 ANSFER</b><b> to HOLD </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li><li>  <b>Sat 2
 4 - Fri 30 </b><b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b><b>  </b><
 /li></ul><p></p><p><b>NOVEMBER</b><br></p><ul><li><b>Sat Oct 31 - Fri Nov 6
    </b>NTS Step 9<b> EXPAND / AIM </b><b>+ </b><b>Building Your Mental Prog
 ram   </b><br></li><li><b>Sat 7 - Fri 13 </b> NTS Step 10 <b>RELEASE / FOLL
 OW-THROUGH</b> + Building Your Mental Program</li><li><b>Sat 14 - Fri 20</b
 >  NTS Step 11 <b>FEEDBACK</b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li><li><b>Sat
  21- Wed 25  </b><b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b></li></u
 l><p><b>DECEMBER</b><br></p><ul><li><b>Sat Nov 28 - Fri Dec 4   PUTTING IT 
 ALL TOGETHER</b> and <b>Building Your Mental Program   </b><br></li><li><b>
 Sat 5 - Fri 11</b>  <b>PUTTING IT ALL TOGETHER</b> and <b>Building Your Men
 tal Program  </b></li><li><b>Sat 12 - Sun 20</b>  <b>ATCI END OF YEAR ! COM
 PETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b></li></ul><p></p><p><b>Sat\, Jan 2 - WINTER 
 TRAINING PROGRAM starts. </b></p><p><b>INTRO</b></p><p><i>Each week the foc
 us of your lessons will be on one or two particular <b>Steps of Shooting of
  the NTS (National Training System) </b>shot cycle\, to help you focus and 
 improve your form\, which\, as we all know\, leads to greater and more cons
 istent precision (tight groups of arrows) and ultimately greater accuracy (
 tight groups of arrows dead center)</i>. <i>Concurrently you will be learni
 ng how to build a <b>strong mental program</b>\, which will improve your fo
 cus\, awareness and confidence for competitions later.</i></p><p><i>The NTS
  is the <b>most biomechanically efficient and least injurious method of sho
 oting</b>\, and is highly and continuously researched out at the Elite Athl
 etes Center in Chula Vista\, CA. It is what the Olympians do!</i></p><p><i>
 The 11 NTS Steps are cumulative with each step most successfully completed 
 if the previous steps have been completed well. </i><i>As you reach higher 
 levels\, you will learn the NTS Steps in progressively greater detail.</i><
 /p><p><b>Goals by the end of the fall semester (Dec 20)</b></p><p>Make a li
 st of what you want to accomplish by the end of the semester. Email it to C
 oach Racae\, so you can discuss it together. </p><p>Confidence and consiste
 ncy in form and mind are your two main goals. Replicate the NTS step(s) min
 dfully and consistently on every shot\, and build a strong mental program t
 hat is consistent on every shot. </p><p>Your conscious mind commands your s
 ubconscious mind to put your body into position\, after you train your body
  to be in those positions. When you stay in the present\, just doing what y
 ou need to do as you need to do it\, your conscious mind will be occupied\,
  instead of random thoughts entering your head or you being distracted by e
 motional or environmental elements. </p><p>You´ll need to build up your men
 tal program alongside your form knowledge and skill\, so when your body is 
 trained to shoot excellent shots\, your self image and subconscious support
  you\, instead of undermining you. </p><p><i>Improving your training\, prac
 ticing\, and competition components\, process\, and skills is a perpetual l
 ifetime quest\, which you´ll slowly learn to love. You´ll  realize what is 
 under your control\, and become your own best coach! Those who find all thi
 s fun and enjoy the journey are the ones who win - the champions!</i></p><p
 ><i>I know you can do it -  I'm your biggest fan!</i></p><p><i>​I'm also re
 ally looking forward to seeing you improve\, succeed\, and thrive !​</i></p
 ><p><b><i>                                                   Coach Racae</i
 ></b></p>
