DESCRIPTION:As confirmation that you are registered for the class\, look fo
 r your name under "Registered Archers" below. (Scroll way down!)\n\nSign up
  for Indoor 2 at 2026 INDOOR 2-6 at 9m Registration Form (https://docs.goog
 le.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfz1Ww1xFc_x-hCgXixX36YxyfAHlfAUMi-Hir24Fy7hLOzbw/v
 iewform?usp=sharing&ouid=104080193312046349991) \n\nPrerequisites for Indoo
 r 2:\nCompletion of Indoor 1. \nAdults do not need a minimum score in Indoo
 r 1 to advance to Indoor 2.\nJuniors <18 need a minimum score of 50 pts in 
 Indoor 1  to advance to Indoor 2.\n\nScores needed at 9m to advance beyond 
 Indoor 2:\nOn 40-cm         On 60-cm\ntarget face        target face\n   23
 0 pts              240 pts           -> Indoor 3 and Outdoor 3 at 13.5m \n 
   250 pts              260 pts           -> Indoor 4 and Outdoor 4 at 18m/2
 0m\n   270 pts              280 pts           -> Indoor 5 and Outdoor 5 at 
 30m\n   290 pts              300 pts          -> Indoor  6 and Outdoor 6 at
  40m\n\nYou can shoot indoors indefinitely and use the range's equipment.  
 When you'd like your own bow\, ask Coach Racae for recommendations.\n\nWhen
  you are ready to shoot outdoors in Outdoor 3-9:\n    * You'll definitely n
 eed your own bow\, based on Coach Racae's recommendations\n    * You'll be 
 granted access to the ATCI Calendar via an email from Coach Racae\,so you c
 an just add your name directly below under "Registered Archers". \n    * Yo
 u will also be invited to join the WhatsApp ATCI Community. \n\nINDOOR CLAS
 S SCHEDULE : (Fees are below) \nRegister for ​​as many as your schedule and
  budget allows to progress faster:\nSat         4:00-5:30 pm - INDOOR 2-6\n
 Sun        4:00-5:30 pm - INDOOR 2-6\nTues       6:30-8:00 pm - INDOOR 2-6\
 nWed       5:00-6:30 pm - INDOOR 2-6 Juniors <15 and Parents\n             
   6:30-8:00 pm - INDOOR 2-6\nThurs     6:30-8:00 pm - INDOOR 3+ with own co
 mpetition recurve bow\n\nAlways check this calendar just before driving to 
 class in case there are last-minutes changes or cancellations!\n\nUSA Arche
 ry Level 4 NTS Coach Racae Meyer will coach unless otherwise noted above.\n
 \nThe level of each attending archer is noted next to their name below\, to
  help you decide which classes to join. (Example: Indoor 2 are beginners\; 
 Outdoor 5+ (O5 @30m\, etc.) are competitive outdoor archers)\n\nThere is a 
 minimum attendance of 3 registered archers for the class to be held.\n\nReg
 istered archers:\n1.  Harshad S.\, 11\, on 60-cm target face\, pd (Indoor 2
 )\n2. Anjali M.\, adult\, pd (Indoor 2)\n3. Raj D.\, adult\, pd (Indoor 2)\
 n4. maxine\n5. aiyla\n6. Sameer\n7. Leon\n8. Girish\n9.\n10.\n11.\n12.\n\nS
 INGLE Class Fees per archer for one Indoor 2-6 class\nBook and pay in advan
 ce. (All Indoor 2-6 Classes are 1.5 hrs long.)\n$30 for 1 hr (arrive 30 min
  after class starts or leave 30 min before class ends)\n$45 for 1.5-hr clas
 s\n\nDiscount Fee Packs:\nStarting August 18\, there are no substitutions o
 r credits for days missed\, if you have given us dates and paid for a month
 ly or multi-class discount pack.\n\nMONTHLY Discount Fee Packs\nPay before 
 the 1st of each month\; book dates within the month\n1 class/wk:      $218 
 (7.5 hrs\; 5 classes/mo)\n2 classes/wk: $372 (13.5 hrs\; 9 classes/mo)\n3 c
 lasses/wk: $557 (21 hrs\; 14 classes/mo)\n4 classes/wk: $675 (27 hrs\; 18 c
 lasses/mo)\n5 classes/wk: $792 (33 hrs\; 22 classes/mo)\n\nMULTI-CLASS Disc
 ount Packets\nPay in advance and book dates when you're sure of the dates.\
 n  9 hours : $257 (6 classes)\n 12 hours : $330 (8 classes)\n 18 hours : $4
 77 (12 classes) \n 23 hours: $587 (15 classes)\n 27 hours: $675 (18 classes
 )\n\nThere are 8 places on the shooting line\, but we often have double lin
 es as in competitions\, depending on attendance.\n\nSign in/out upon arriva
 l/departure\nCoaching and whistle commands at all times.\nInstruction in th
 e National Training System.\nUnfair games depending on attendance.\n\nPleas
 e note: Youths <12 y.o. should not shoot more than 100 arrows/day!
