UID:5v7gdp33evaqe51ufic124eum3@google.com
CREATED:20260824T233625Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>The <b>FALL TRAINING PROGRAM (Aug 22 -Dec 20)</b> is the lon
 gest program\, meaning that we will go through the <b>National Training Sys
 tem (NTS) 11 Steps of Shooting</b> and <b>Building Your Mental Program</b> 
 with plenty of time for revisions and catching up during the semester with 
 scoring weeks at the end of each month starting at the end of September. </
 p><p>You can join any week by taking the Indoor 1: First-time Class. </p><p
 >Learning\, understanding and doing the NTS and building a strong mental pr
 ogram are ongoing quests that all archers are continuously trying to achiev
 e - even at the highest levels !<br></p><p><i><b>What if you miss some of t
 he weeks?</b>  </i>We'll do our best to catch you up during your next sessi
 ons. </p><p><b>AUG/SEPT</b><br></p><ul><li><b>Sat Aug 22 - F  Aug 28</b>   
 <b>WELCOME </b>!  Understanding  <b>NTS CONCEPTS</b> especially TRANSFER + 
 NTS Step 1:<b> STANCE</b><b> + </b>NTS Step 2: <b> NOCK</b><b> </b></li><li
 ><b> Sat Aug 29 - F Sept 4   </b>NTS Step 3: <b>HOOK &amp\; GRIP </b><b>+ <
 /b>Building Your Mental Program </li><li> <b>Sat 5 - F 11</b>   NTS Step 4:
 <b> SET</b><b> + </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li><li><b> Sat 12 - F 
 18  </b>NTS Step 5:<b> SET-UP </b><b>+</b> Building Your Mental Program</li
 ><li><b> Sat 19 - F 25 Putting it all together</b></li><li><b> Sat 26 - F O
 ct 2  </b><b>ATCI MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b><b> </b><b>   <
 /b></li></ul><p></p><p><b>OCTOBER</b></p><ul><li><b>  Sat Oct 3 - F 9 </b>N
 TS Step 6 <b>DRAW</b> to <b>LOAD </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li><li
 >  <b>Sat 10 - F 16 </b>NTS Step 7  <b>ANCHOR </b>+ Building Your Mental Pr
 ogram  </li><li><b>  Sat 17 - F 23 </b>NTS Step 8  <b>TRANSFER</b><b> to HO
 LD </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li><li>  <b>Sat 24 - F 30 </b><b>ATC
 I MONTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b><b>  </b></li></ul><p></p><p><b
 >NOVEMBER</b><br></p><ul><li><b>Sat Oct 31 - Fri Nov 6   </b>NTS Step 9<b> 
 EXPAND / AIM </b><b>+ </b><b>Building Your Mental Program   </b><br></li><l
 i><b>Sat 7 - F 13 </b> NTS Step 10 <b>RELEASE / FOLLOW-THROUGH</b> + Buildi
 ng Your Mental Program</li><li><b>Sat 14 - F 20</b>  NTS Step 11 <b>FEEDBAC
 K</b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li><li><b>Sat 21- W 25  </b><b>ATCI MO
 NTHLY COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b></li></ul><p><b>DECEMBER</b><br></p
 ><ul><li><b>Sat Nov 28 - F Dec 4   PUTTING IT ALL TOGETHER</b> and <b>Build
 ing Your Mental Program   </b><br></li><li><b>Sat 5 - F 11</b>  <b>PUTTING 
 IT ALL TOGETHER</b> and <b>Building Your Mental Program  </b></li><li><b>Sa
 t 12 - Sun 20</b>  <b>ATCI END OF YEAR ! COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b>
 </li></ul><p></p><p><b>Sat\, Jan 2 - WINTER TRAINING PROGRAM starts. </b></
 p><p><b>INTRO</b></p><p><i>Each week the focus of your lessons will be on o
 ne or two particular <b>Steps of Shooting of the NTS (National Training Sys
 tem) </b>shot cycle\, to help you focus and improve your form\, which\, as 
 we all know\, leads to greater and more consistent precision (tight groups 
 of arrows) and ultimately greater accuracy (tight groups of arrows dead cen
 ter)</i>. <i>Concurrently you will be learning how to build a <b>strong men
 tal program</b>\, which will improve your focus\, awareness and confidence 
 for competitions later.</i></p><p><i>The NTS is the <b>most biomechanically
  efficient and least injurious method of shooting</b>\, and is highly and c
 ontinuously researched out at the Elite Athletes Center in Chula Vista\, CA
 . It is what the Olympians do!</i></p><p><i>The 11 NTS Steps are cumulative
  with each step most successfully completed if the previous steps have been
  completed well. </i><i>As you reach higher levels\, you will learn the NTS
  Steps in progressively greater detail.</i></p><p><b>Goals by the end of th
 e fall semester (Dec 20)</b></p><p>Make a list of what you want to accompli
 sh by the end of the semester. Email it to Coach Racae\, so you can discuss
  it together. </p><p>Confidence and consistency in form and mind are your t
 wo main goals. Replicate the NTS step(s) mindfully and consistently on ever
 y shot\, and build a strong mental program that is consistent on every shot
 . </p><p>Your conscious mind commands your subconscious mind to put your bo
 dy into position\, after you train your body to be in those positions. When
  you stay in the present\, just doing what you need to do as you need to do
  it\, your conscious mind will be occupied\, instead of random thoughts ent
 ering your head or you being distracted by emotional or environmental eleme
 nts. </p><p>You´ll need to build up your mental program alongside your form
  knowledge and skill\, so when your body is trained to shoot excellent shot
 s\, your self image and subconscious support you\, instead of undermining y
 ou. </p><p><i>Improving your training\, practicing\, and competition compon
 ents\, process\, and skills is a perpetual lifetime quest\, which you´ll sl
 owly learn to love. You´ll  realize what is under your control\, and become
  your own best coach! Those who find all this fun and enjoy the journey are
  the ones who win - the champions!</i></p><p><i>I know you can do it -  I'm
  your biggest fan!</i></p><p><i>​I'm also really looking forward to seeing 
 you improve\, succeed\, and thrive !​</i></p><p><b><i>                     
                               Coach Racae</i></b></p>
