 participants exceeds 8 archers.<br>Not more than 8 archers will be on the s
 hooting line at the same time.<br>A = Line A<br>B = Line B<br><br>The arche
 r and a maximum of one spectator will be allowed on the field until further
  notice or approved by Coach Racae. <br><br>Parents of juniors 10+ can sign
  up as an archer or watch as a spectator. <br>Parents of juniors 8-9 years 
 old need to register\, pay\, and shoot with their child for greater safety.
 <br><br>A maximum of one 8-year-old (+ parent) is accepted into each Indoor
  1: First-time Class. <br><br>We will accept a limited number of juniors un
 der 12 into the program each semester\, depending on the total  number of a
