 r Indoor 2 by scoring 50 pts over 30 arrows.<br>Adults don´t need a minimum
  score to graduate into Indoor 2.<br><br>At the end of each Indoor 1 class\
 , your scores will be posted. If we did not finish a complete round (30 arr
 ows)\, you may not recognize your final score\, because it will have been a
 veraged by taking your recorded score from your scorecard\, dividing it by 
 the number of arrows you shot to get an arrow average\, and then multiplyin
 g that by 30 to get a full round score.
