DESCRIPTION:<p><b>SUMMER TRAINING PROGRAM - 11 weeks (June 1 - Aug 16)</b> 
 </p><p>We will go through the <b>National Training System (NTS) 11 Steps of
  Shooting</b> and <b>Building Your Mental Program</b> step-by-step during t
 he regular training classes\, covering each one in sequence during the foll
 owing weeks.</p><p>Learning\, understanding and doing the NTS and building 
 a strong mental program are ongoing quests that all archers are continuousl
 y trying to achieve - even at the highest levels !</p><p><b><i>What if you 
 miss some of the weeks?</i></b><i>  </i>We'll do our best to catch you up d
 uring your next sessions. </p><p><i><b>When do I score? </b>Scoring is only
  meaningful after you can group your arrows\, within the blue rings. You wi
 ll qualify to shoot outdoors at longer distances when you shoot inside the 
 inner red ring consistently. (See scores needed below.) When you are shooti
 ng groups like these\, you can always let the coach know that you'd like to
  score. Otherwise\, the main scoring week will be at the end of summer trai
 ning.</i></p><p><b><i>Also see important notes below\, under the schedule.<
 /i></b></p><p><b>JUNE</b></p><b>Wed 6/3 - Sun 6/7</b><br><ul><li><b>WELCOME
  </b>!    </li><li><b>NTS CONCEPTS</b> especially TRANSFER </li><li>Step 1<
 b> STANCE </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li></ul><p><b>Sun 6/7 -  Thur
 s 6/11</b></p><ul><li>Step 2 <b>NOCK</b> + Building Your Mental Program</li
 ><li>Step 3 <b>HOOK &amp\; GRIP</b> + Building Your Mental Program</li></ul
 ><p></p><p><b>Sun</b><b> 6/14 - Thurs 6/18 </b></p><p></p><ul><li>Step 4<b>
  SET </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li></ul><b>Sun 6/21 - Thurs 6/25</
 b><ul><li>Step 5 <b>SET-UP +</b> Building Your Mental Program</li></ul><b>J
 ULY</b><b><br></b><br><b>Sun 6/28 - Thurs 7/2 </b><ul><li>Step 6 <b>DRAW</b
 > to <b>LOAD </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li></ul><b>Sun 7/5 - Thurs
  7/9 </b><br><ul><li>Step 7 <b>ANCHOR </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</l
 i></ul><b>Sun 7/12 - Thurs 7/16 </b> <br><ul><li>Step 8<b> </b><b><b>TRANSF
 ER to HOLD</b> + </b>Building Your Mental Program<b>Sun 7/19 - Thurs 7/23</
 b></li></ul><ul><li>Step 9<b> </b><b>EXPAND / AIM + </b>Building Your Menta
 l Program</li></ul><b>Sun 7/26 - Thurs 7/30 </b><ul><li>Step 10 <b>RELEASE 
 / FO</b><b>LLOW-THROUGH </b><b>+</b> Building Your Mental Program</li><li>S
 tep 11 <b>FEEDBACK +</b> Building Your Mental Program</li></ul><b>AUGUST</b
 ><br><b><br></b><b>Sun 8/2 - Thurs 8/6  </b><ul><li><b>PUTTING IT ALL TOGET
 HER FUN !</b></li></ul><b>Sun 8/9 - Sun 8/16</b><br><ul><li><b>SCORING WEEK
  - ATCI SUMMER COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b></li></ul><b>INTRO</b><p><
 i>Each week the focus of your lessons will be on one or two particular </i>
 <b><i>Steps of Shooting of the NTS (National Training System) </i></b><i>sh
 ot cycle\, to help you focus and improve your form\, which\, as we all know
 \, leads to greater and more consistent precision (tight groups of arrows) 
 and ultimately greater accuracy (tight groups of arrows dead center)</i>. <
 i>Concurrently you will be learning how to build a </i><b><i>strong mental 
 program</i></b><i>\, which will improve your focus\, awareness and confiden
 ce for competitions later.</i></p><p><i>The NTS is the </i><b><i>most biome
 chanically efficient and least injurious method of shooting</i></b><i>\, an
 d is highly and continuously researched out at the Elite Athletes Center in
  Chula Vista\, CA. It is what the Olympians do!</i></p><p><i>The 11 NTS Ste
 ps are cumulative with each step most successfully completed if the previou
 s steps have been completed well. As you reach higher levels\, you will lea
 rn the NTS Steps in progressively greater detail.</i></p><p><b>Goals by the
  end of the summer semester (Aug 16)</b></p><p>Make a list of what you want
  to accomplish by the end of the semester. Email it to Coach Racae\, so you
  can discuss it together. </p><p>Confidence and consistency in form and min
 d are your two main goals. Replicate the NTS step(s) mindfully and consiste
 ntly on every shot\, and build a strong mental program that is consistent o
 n every shot. </p><p>Your conscious mind commands your subconscious mind to
  put your body into position\, after you train your body to be in those pos
 itions. When you stay in the present\, just doing what you need to do as yo
 u need to do it\, your conscious mind will be occupied\, instead of random 
 thoughts entering your head or your being distracted by emotional or enviro
 nmental elements. </p><p>You´ll need to build up your mental program alongs
 ide your form knowledge\, so when your body is trained to shoot excellent s
 hots\, your self image and subconscious support you\, instead of underminin
 g you. </p><p><i>Improving your training\, practicing\, and competition com
 ponents\, process\, and skills is a perpetual lifetime quest\, which you´ll
  slowly learn to love. You´ll  realize what is under your control\, and you
 'll become your own best coach! Those who find all this fun and enjoy the j
 ourney are the ones who win - the champions!</i></p><p><i>I know you can do
  it -  I'm your biggest fan!</i></p><p><i>​I'm also really looking forward 
 to seeing you improve\, succeed\, and thrive !​</i></p><p><b><i>           
                                         Coach Racae</i></b></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260802T181452Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:FORM FOCUS - SUMMER
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
