DESCRIPTION:<b>WAIVERS:</b> Everyone needs to <b>sign the waivers in advanc
 e </b>of arriving at the range\, so we are not delayed in starting. Here's 
 the link: <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfsWlvFJhlvEMDP
 Iw2f8-x-Lwpwd06cVxvA7PGw-lgmRnD00w/viewform?usp=dialog" target="_blank"><u>
 2026 Waives/Membership Packet for Corporate Team Events</u></a><br><br>As e
 ach participant signs the waivers\, it will be indicated below\, so you wil
 l be aware of what we have received. <br><br><b>DIRECTIONS:</b> <b>Google M
 ap "Donut Taco Palace"</b> to find us quickly - We are right next door in U
 nit 102. (Some people are still being misdirected.) There is a target on th
 e glass door and the unit is facing 290W service road going west on the cor
 ner of Industrial Oaks Blvd and 290W. <br><br><b>ARRIVAL</b>: For a 3:00 pm
  start\, please <b>arrive by 2:45 pm</b>\, because we need to start togethe
 r at 3:00 pm. <br><br><b>CARPOOLING / PARKING:</b> Please meet and carpool 
 earlier from another location or from a big box store parking lot across th
 e highway (like Target or At Home on the corner of Mopac and 290W). It's ea
 sy and convenient to do. (Parking in front of the range and along Industria
 l Oaks Blvd may be limited\, depending on the number of participants.)<br><
 br><b>DRESS RECOMMENDATIONS: </b><br>Flat athletic shoes are best\, as we w
 ill be throwing our weight forward a little\, so balance and weight distrib
 ution is important. The bowstring can get slowed or entangled in your cloth
 ing or hair\, so wearing tightly fitting clothes\, no wide skirts\, shirts 
 without buttons on the front pockets and tying your hair back is preferable
 . Longer brim baseball caps often prevent the string from reaching your fac
 e\, so shorter brims or bucket hats are better.<br><br><b>All participants 
 need to complete waivers online before the event.</b><br><b>Here is the dir
 ect link to complete: </b><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQ
 LSfsWlvFJhlvEMDPIw2f8-x-Lwpwd06cVxvA7PGw-lgmRnD00w/viewform?usp=dialog" tar
 get="_blank"><u>2026 Waives/Membership Packet for Corporate Team Events</u>
 </a>  <br><br>Waivers have been received from those shown below in <b>bold 
 with (W) - </b><br><b>Last update: July 13 at 1:55 pm</b><br><ol><li><b>Joe
 l Y. (W)</b></li><li><b>Scott L. (W)</b></li><li><b>James H. (W)</b></li><l
 i>Monica B-S</li><li><b>Allyse V. (W)</b></li><li><b>Caitlyn A. (W)</b></li
 ><li>.</li><li>.</li></ol>
