CREATED:20260517T191158Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><b>SUMMER TRAINING PROGRAM - 11 weeks (June 1 - Aug 16)</b> 
 </p><p>We will go through the <b>National Training System (NTS) 11 Steps of
  Shooting</b> and <b>Building Your Mental Program</b> step-by-step during t
 he regular training classes\, covering each one in sequence during the foll
 owing weeks.</p><p>Learning\, understanding and doing the NTS and building 
 a strong mental program are ongoing quests that all archers are continuousl
 y trying to achieve - even at the highest levels !</p><p><b><i>What if you 
 miss some of the weeks?</i></b><i>  </i>We'll do our best to catch you up d
 uring your next sessions. </p><p><i><b>When do I score? </b>Scoring is only
  meaningful after you can group your arrows\, within the blue rings. You wi
 ll qualify to shoot outdoors at longer distances when you shoot inside the 
 inner red ring consistently. (See scores needed below.) When you are shooti
 ng groups like these\, you can always let the coach know that you'd like to
  score. Otherwise\, the main scoring week will be at the end of summer trai
 ning.</i></p><p><b><i>Also see important notes below\, under the schedule.<
 /i></b></p><p><b>JUNE</b></p><b>Wed 6/3 - Sun 6/7</b><br><ul><li><b>WELCOME
  </b>!    </li><li><b>NTS CONCEPTS</b> especially TRANSFER </li><li>Step 1<
 b> STANCE </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li></ul><p><b>Sun 6/7 -  Thur
 s 6/11</b></p><ul><li>Step 2 <b>NOCK</b> + Building Your Mental Program</li
 ><li>Step 3 <b>HOOK &amp\; GRIP</b> + Building Your Mental Program</li></ul
 ><p></p><p><b>Sun</b><b> 6/14 - Thurs 6/18 </b></p><p></p><ul><li>Step 4<b>
  SET </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li></ul><b>Sun 6/21 - Thurs 6/25</
 b><ul><li>Step 5 <b>SET-UP +</b> Building Your Mental Program</li></ul><b>J
 ULY</b><b><br></b><br><b>Sun 6/28 - Thurs 7/2 </b><ul><li>Step 6 <b>DRAW</b
 > to <b>LOAD </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li></ul><b>Sun 7/5 - Thurs
  7/9 </b><br><ul><li>Step 7 <b>ANCHOR </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</l
 i></ul><b>Sun 7/12 - Thurs 7/16 </b> <br><ul><li>Step 8<b> </b><b><b>TRANSF
 ER to HOLD</b> + </b>Building Your Mental Program</li></ul><b>Sun 7/19 - Th
 urs 7/23</b><br><ul><li>Step 9<b> </b><b>EXPAND / AIM + </b>Building Your M
 ental Program</li></ul><b>Sun 7/26 - Thurs 7/30 </b><ul><li>Step 10 <b>RELE
 ASE / FO</b><b>LLOW-THROUGH </b><b>+</b> Building Your Mental Program</li><
 li>Step 11 <b>FEEDBACK +</b> Building Your Mental Program</li></ul><b>AUGUS
 T</b><br><b><br></b><b>Sun 8/2 - Thurs 8/6  </b><ul><li><b>PUTTING IT ALL T
 OGETHER FUN !</b></li></ul><b>Sun 8/9 - Sun 8/16</b><br><ul><li><b>SCORING 
 WEEK - ATCI SUMMER COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b></li></ul><b>INTRO</b>
 <p><i>Each week the focus of your lessons will be on one or two particular 
 </i><b><i>Steps of Shooting of the NTS (National Training System) </i></b><
 i>shot cycle\, to help you focus and improve your form\, which\, as we all 
 know\, leads to greater and more consistent precision (tight groups of arro
 ws) and ultimately greater accuracy (tight groups of arrows dead center)</i
 >. <i>Concurrently you will be learning how to build a </i><b><i>strong men
 tal program</i></b><i>\, which will improve your focus\, awareness and conf
 idence for competitions later.</i></p><p><i>The NTS is the </i><b><i>most b
 iomechanically efficient and least injurious method of shooting</i></b><i>\
 , and is highly and continuously researched out at the Elite Athletes Cente
 r in Chula Vista\, CA. It is what the Olympians do!</i></p><p><i>The 11 NTS
  Steps are cumulative with each step most successfully completed if the pre
 vious steps have been completed well. As you reach higher levels\, you will
  learn the NTS Steps in progressively greater detail.</i></p><p><b>Goals by
  the end of the summer semester (Aug 16)</b></p><p>Make a list of what you 
 want to accomplish by the end of the semester. Email it to Coach Racae\, so
  you can discuss it together. </p><p>Confidence and consistency in form and
  mind are your two main goals. Replicate the NTS step(s) mindfully and cons
 istently on every shot\, and build a strong mental program that is consiste
 nt on every shot. </p><p>Your conscious mind commands your subconscious min
 d to put your body into position\, after you train your body to be in those
  positions. When you stay in the present\, just doing what you need to do a
 s you need to do it\, your conscious mind will be occupied\, instead of ran
 dom thoughts entering your head or your being distracted by emotional or en
 vironmental elements. </p><p>You´ll need to build up your mental program al
 ongside your form knowledge\, so when your body is trained to shoot excelle
 nt shots\, your self image and subconscious support you\, instead of underm
 ining you. </p><p><i>Improving your training\, practicing\, and competition
  components\, process\, and skills is a perpetual lifetime quest\, which yo
 u´ll slowly learn to love. You´ll  realize what is under your control\, and
  you'll become your own best coach! Those who find all this fun and enjoy t
 he journey are the ones who win - the champions!</i></p><p><i>I know you ca
 n do it -  I'm your biggest fan!</i></p><p><i>​I'm also really looking forw
 ard to seeing you improve\, succeed\, and thrive !​</i></p><p><b><i>       
                                             Coach Racae</i></b></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260802T181452Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:FORM FOCUS - SUMMER
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
