DESCRIPTION:Registration form: OUTDOOR 3-9 at 13.5m-70m (<a href="https://d
 ocs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfx1RyOwd314Q4zXYiQ9rb_a3oe84E9dIYs8CN35Gin
