DESCRIPTION:<i>These are the results from competition scoring week from Sat
  9/26 to Thurs 10/2.</i><br><i>Thanks for participating !</i><br><i>Everyon
 e is progressing very well ! Keep going !</i><br><i>Work hard on your form 
 during the month\, and let's see what you can do next time!</i><i><br></i><
 br><i>If you shot on more than one competition day\, your best score is rec
 orded.</i><br><i>If you did not finish a complete round of 30 arrows\, your
  score was divided by the number of arrows you shot and then multiplied by 
 30 to obtain your averag​ed round score.</i><br><i>If your score differs fr
