DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260327T123000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260327T130000
DTSTAMP:20261004T164459Z
UID:cgqmacr56grj6b9hc5hjib9kcosjib9o6pgjgb9gcoomcc9m6osm4or568@google.com
X-GOOGLE-CONFERENCE:https://meet.google.com/jed-tuvf-uct
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Chicago:20260325T130000
CREATED:20260310T030602Z
DESCRIPTION:What we worked on today - back view due to glare<br>Do position
 ing one step at a time in sequence with steps of the NTS Shot Cycle:<br><sp
 an><br></span><b>Grip:</b> <br><ul><li>Read chapter on Grip in Inside the A
 rcher</li><li>Place your hand in the grip of the bow with the base of your 
 thumb in the center of the grip\, pressing on the pressure point\, but stil
 l in contact with pivot point. </li><li>The life line of your hand is the l
 eft edge of the grip. </li><li>Thumb pointing to target or thumbnail bendin
 g back towards you. </li><li>First finger pointing down</li><li>Other finge
 rs either relaxed down or rolled underneath themselves\, especially if you'
 re prone to grabbing the bow. </li><li>The "V" of your hand should be point
 ing directly at the target at full draw.</li><li>Knuckles at a 45 deg angle
  to the shelf. </li><li>Wrist bent so there is no gap between the base of y
 our thumb and the bow grip.</li><li>Slight pressure on the side of the bow 
 grip by the side of the thumb\, but you want the bow to leave your hand at 
 release.</li></ul><br><span><b>Coil:</b></span><br><ul><li><span>Rotate tor
 so around to the right\, so string is on left side of chest\, not across ch
 est</span></li><li><span>Hips and head stay in position</span></li></ul><sp
 an><b>Draw elbow:</b></span><br><ul><li><span>At arrow height\, not below a
 rrow or below shoulder</span></li><li><span>Draw around using coiling of to
 rso\, not down</span><span> with the draw elbow. </span></li><li><span>Fulc
 rum is right shoulder.</span></li></ul>\n\nJoin with Google Meet: https://m
 eet.google.com/jed-tuvf-uct\n\nLearn more about Meet at: https://support.go
 ogle.com/a/users/answer/9282720
LAST-MODIFIED:20260527T200302Z
SEQUENCE:3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Virtual Private Lesson with Coach Racae - Madeline
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
