DESCRIPTION:Mark your calendars as registration is now open for the 2026 Te
 xas State Archery Association Outdoor Championships!\n\nWhether you’re aimi
 ng for the world stage\, or you’re new to archery competition\, state champ
 ionships are a great opportunity to test your skills\, make new friends\, a
 nd prepare for USA Archery national events.\n\nWhat you need to know:\n\n· 
 2026 Texas State Archery Association Outdoor Championship\n\nDate: August 8
 -9\n\nFormat: 72 Arrow Outdoor Round\n\nContact: rstonebraker@gmail.com\, 8
 32-552-2096\n\nMore Information and Registration\n\nIf this will be your fi
 rst event\, the USA Archery Event Reference Guidebook is a great resource t
 o help answer questions you may have as you prepare for competition.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260731T224448Z
