 /i><br><br><b>Sign up for Indoor 2 at </b><a href="https://docs.google.com/
 forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfz1Ww1xFc_x-hCgXixX36YxyfAHlfAUMi-Hir24Fy7hLOzbw/viewform
 ?usp=sharing&ouid=104080193312046349991" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u><u>
 <u><u><u><b>2026 INDOOR 2-6 at 9m Registration Form</b></u></u></u></u></u>
 </u></u></u></u></a> <br><br><b>Prerequisites for Indoor 2:</b><br>Completi
 on of Indoor 1. <br>Adults do not need a minimum score in Indoor 1 to advan
 ce to Indoor 2.<br>Juniors &lt\;18 need a minimum score of 50 pts in Indoor
  1  to advance to Indoor 2.<br><br><b>Scores needed at 9m to advance beyond
  Indoor 2:</b><br>On 40-cm         On 60-cm<br>target face        target fa
 ce<br>   230 pts              240 pts           -&gt\; Indoor 3 and Outdoor
  3 at 13.5m <br>   250 pts              260 pts           -&gt\; Indoor 4 a
 nd Outdoor 4 at 18m/20m<br>   270 pts              280 pts           -&gt\;
  Indoor 5 and Outdoor 5 at 30m<br>   290 pts              300 pts          
 -&gt\; Indoor  6 and Outdoor 6 at 40m<br><br>You can shoot indoors indefini
 tely and use the range's equipment.  When you'd like your own bow\, ask Coa
 ch Racae for recommendations.<br><br>When you are ready to shoot outdoors i
 n Outdoor 3-9:<ul><li>You'll definitely need your own bow\, based on Coach 
 Racae's recommendations</li><li>You'll be granted access to the ATCI Calend
 ar via an email from Coach Racae\,so you can just add your name directly be
 low under "Registered Archers". </li><li>You will also be invited to join t
 he WhatsApp ATCI Community. </li></ul><b>INDOOR CLASS SCHEDULE : </b>(Fees 
 are below) <br>Register for ​​as many as your schedule and budget allows to
  progress faster:<br><b>Sat         4:00-5:30 pm - INDOOR 2-6</b><br><b>Sun
