 son with Coach Racae\, you can now book:<br><br><b>Outdoors</b>: You will a
 ttend the regular Outdoor 3-9 class. Book 30 min only during class times on
  Saturdays and Sundays. The first and last 30 min of the class Coach Racae 
 will coach the other archers in attendance. Add your name under Private Les
 sons on Sat/Sun next to one of the times for outdoor private lessons on the
  day.<br><br><br><b>Indoors at 9m</b>: 30 min or 1 hr during the <b>Monday<
 /b> indoor private lesson times  <b>(6:00-8:00) </b><br><b><i>NOTE: The ran
 ge will only be open on Mondays during the times private lessons are booked
 . When no one has registered for private lessons\, the range will be closed
 </i></b><b>Add your name next to one or more of following times for Indoor 
 private lessons TODAY</b>:<ul><li>6:00-6:30- Riley M.\,13\, OB\, paid</li><
 /ul><ul><li>6:30-7:00 - Lily R.\, 15\, OB\, paid</li></ul><ul><li>7:00-7:30
  Yugan.C\, 12\, OB\, Paid</li></ul><ul><li>7:30-8:00 Yugan.C\, 12\, OB\, Pa
 id</li></ul><b>Additional fees: </b><ul><li><b>Outdoors</b> : $12/30 min  (
 in addition to the regular Outdoor 3 class fee)</li><li><b>Indoors</b>: $40
 /30min or $75/hr. You can shoot before or after your private lesson time at
  no extra charge from 6:00-8:00\, if other archers are booked for private l
 essons otherwise the range will be closed.</li></ul><i>Priority will be giv
 en to archers who will participate/compete in TX State and National competi
 tions.</i>
