DESCRIPTION:First-time class for juniors age 8+\, optionally their parents\
 , and other adults who would like to try archery for the first time and joi
 n in future Junior Olympic Archery Development (JOAD) and Adult Training cl
 asses.   \n\nThis class is a prerequisite for all other training classes.  
  \n\nIf you have more than one year experience\, contact us for a placement
  evaluation ($45) instead of attending the Indoor 1 Class.   \n\nIf you wou
 ld like to schedule a birthday party during one of the Indoor 1: First-time
  Class times\, the minimum charge for booking the range is $200 for a max. 
 of 10 archers + $5/archer to cover additional supplies (balloons\, etc.). S
 end your request to racae@archerytrainingcenter.com.  \n\nRegistered archer
 s: \n1. Nicolas Quin...\, adult\n2.  Melissa R Z.\,  adult\n3.  Nolan Gra..
 \, adult\n4.  Greg Zyn...\, adult\n5.  Jericho Pat.....\, 9\n6.  Roger "Guy
 " Pat....\, dad\n7.  Cyrus Pro.....\, adult\n8.  Eduardo Urc....\, adult\n9
 .  Jenny Cha...\, adult\n10. Kendric Pat...\, 9   \n\nWaiting List:   \n1. 
 Siddhesh Kri...\, 14\n\nIf your name is on the waiting list\, you have a ch
 oice of  coming to see if a place opens up at the last minute\, or  resched
 uling your class for another date/time.  We can only take 10 archers on the
  shooting line at one time.  The instructor may also create two shooting li
 nes\, which may increase the length of the class for everyone and decrease 
 the number of arrows everyone has time to shoot. \nIf you prefer not to be 
 on the waiting list\, please reschedule your class for another date.
