UID:3hrilqpff0saoifoaqeoo3n47t_R20260802@google.com
CREATED:20260517T191158Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><b>SUMMER TRAINING PROGRAM - 11 weeks (June 1 - Aug 16)</b> 
 </p><p>We will go through the <b>National Training System (NTS) 11 Steps of
  Shooting</b> and <b>Building Your Mental Program</b> step-by-step during t
 he regular training classes\, covering each one in sequence during the foll
 owing weeks.</p><p>Learning\, understanding and doing the NTS and building 
 a strong mental program are ongoing quests that all archers are continuousl
 y trying to achieve - even at the highest levels !</p><p><b><i>What if you 
 miss some of the weeks?</i></b><i>  </i>We'll do our best to catch you up d
 uring your next sessions. </p><p><i><b>When do I score? </b>Scoring is only
  meaningful after you can group your arrows\, within the blue rings. You wi
 ll qualify to shoot outdoors at longer distances when you shoot inside the 
 inner red ring consistently. (See scores needed below.) When you are shooti
 ng groups like these\, you can always let the coach know that you'd like to
  score. Otherwise\, the main scoring week will be at the end of summer trai
 ning.</i></p><p><b><i>Also see important notes below\, under the schedule.<
 /i></b></p><p><b>JUNE</b></p><b>Wed 6/3 - Sun 6/7</b><br><ul><li><b>WELCOME
  </b>!    </li><li><b>NTS CONCEPTS</b> especially TRANSFER </li><li>Step 1<
 b> STANCE </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li></ul><p><b>Sun 6/7 -  Thur
 s 6/11</b></p><ul><li>Step 2 <b>NOCK</b> + Building Your Mental Program</li
 ><li>Step 3 <b>HOOK &amp\; GRIP</b> + Building Your Mental Program</li></ul
 ><p></p><p><b>Sun</b><b> 6/14 - Thurs 6/18 </b></p><p></p><ul><li>Step 4<b>
  SET </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li></ul><b>Sun 6/21 - Thurs 6/25</
 b><ul><li>Step 5 <b>SET-UP +</b> Building Your Mental Program</li></ul><b>J
 ULY</b><b><br></b><br><b>Sun 6/28 - Thurs 7/2 </b><ul><li>Step 6 <b>DRAW</b
 > to <b>LOAD </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li></ul><b>Sun 7/5 - Thurs
  7/9 </b><br><ul><li>Step 7 <b>ANCHOR </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</l
 i></ul><b>Sun 7/12 - Thurs 7/16 </b> <br><ul><li>Step 8<b> </b><b><b>TRANSF
 ER to HOLD</b> + </b>Building Your Mental Program</li></ul><b>Sun 7/19 - Th
 urs 7/23</b><br><ul><li>Step 9<b> </b><b>EXPAND / AIM + </b>Building Your M
 ental Program</li></ul><b>Sun 7/26 - Thurs 7/30 </b><ul><li>Step 10 <b>RELE
 ASE / FO</b><b>LLOW-THROUGH </b><b>+</b> Building Your Mental Program</li><
 li>Step 11 <b>FEEDBACK +</b> Building Your Mental Program</li></ul><b>AUGUS
 T</b><br><b><br></b><b>Sun 8/2 - Thurs 8/6  </b><ul><li><b>PUTTING IT ALL T
 OGETHER FUN ! (SCORING OPTIONAL)</b></li></ul><b>Sun 8/9 - Sun 8/16</b><br>
 <ul><li><b>SCORING WEEK - ATCI SUMMER COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b></l
 i></ul><b>INTRO</b><p><i>Each week the focus of your lessons will be on one
  or two particular </i><b><i>Steps of Shooting of the NTS (National Trainin
 g System) </i></b><i>shot cycle\, to help you focus and improve your form\,
  which\, as we all know\, leads to greater and more consistent precision (t
 ight groups of arrows) and ultimately greater accuracy (tight groups of arr
 ows dead center)</i>. <i>Concurrently you will be learning how to build a <
 /i><b><i>strong mental program</i></b><i>\, which will improve your focus\,
  awareness and confidence for competitions later.</i></p><p><i>The NTS is t
 he </i><b><i>most biomechanically efficient and least injurious method of s
 hooting</i></b><i>\, and is highly and continuously researched out at the E
 lite Athletes Center in Chula Vista\, CA. It is what the Olympians do!</i><
 /p><p><i>The 11 NTS Steps are cumulative with each step most successfully c
 ompleted if the previous steps have been completed well. As you reach highe
 r levels\, you will learn the NTS Steps in progressively greater detail.</i
 ></p><p><b>Goals by the end of the summer semester (Aug 16)</b></p><p>Make 
 a list of what you want to accomplish by the end of the semester. Email it 
 to Coach Racae\, so you can discuss it together. </p><p>Confidence and cons
 istency in form and mind are your two main goals. Replicate the NTS step(s)
  mindfully and consistently on every shot\, and build a strong mental progr
 am that is consistent on every shot. </p><p>Your conscious mind commands yo
 ur subconscious mind to put your body into position\, after you train your 
 body to be in those positions. When you stay in the present\, just doing wh
 at you need to do as you need to do it\, your conscious mind will be occupi
 ed\, instead of random thoughts entering your head or your being distracted
  by emotional or environmental elements. </p><p>You´ll need to build up you
 r mental program alongside your form knowledge\, so when your body is train
 ed to shoot excellent shots\, your self image and subconscious support you\
 , instead of undermining you. </p><p><i>Improving your training\, practicin
 g\, and competition components\, process\, and skills is a perpetual lifeti
 me quest\, which you´ll slowly learn to love. You´ll  realize what is under
  your control\, and you'll become your own best coach! Those who find all t
 his fun and enjoy the journey are the ones who win - the champions!</i></p>
 <p><i>I know you can do it -  I'm your biggest fan!</i></p><p><i>​I'm also 
 really looking forward to seeing you improve\, succeed\, and thrive !​</i><
 /p><p><b><i>                                                   Coach Racae<
 /i></b></p>
