DESCRIPTION:<p><b>SPRING TRAINING PROGRAM - 9 weeks (Mar 23 - May 31)</b> <
 /p><p>We will go through the <b>National Training System (NTS) 11 Steps of 
 Shooting</b> and <b>Building Your Mental Program</b> step-by-step during th
 e regular training classes\, covering each one in sequence during the follo
 wing weeks.. </p><p>Learning\, understanding and doing the NTS and building
  a strong mental program are ongoing quests that all archers are continuous
 ly trying to achieve - even at the highest levels !</p><p><b><i>What if you
  miss some of the weeks?</i></b><i>  </i>We'll do our best to catch you up 
 during your next sessions. </p><p><b><i>Also see more important notes below
 \, under the schedule.</i></b></p><p><b>MARCH / APRIL</b></p><b>Sat 3/28 - 
 Fri 4/3</b><span>  </span><br><ul><li><b>WELCOME </b><span>!  </span><span>
 Understanding  </span></li><li><b>NTS CONCEPTS</b><span> especially TRANSFE
 R </span></li><li><span>Step 1</span><b> STANCE </b>+ Building Your Mental 
 Program</li></ul><p><b>Sat 4/4- Fri 4/10</b><br></p><ul><li>Step 2  <b>NOCK
 </b> + Building Your Mental Program</li><li>Step 3 <b>HOOK &amp\; GRIP</b> 
 + Building Your Mental Program</li></ul><p></p><p><b>Sat</b><b> 4/11 - Fri 
 4/17</b><span> </span><span>  </span></p><p></p><ul><li><span>Step 4</span>
 <b> SET </b><span>+ Building Your Mental Program</span></li><li><span>Step 
 5 </span><b>SET-UP +</b><span> Building Your Mental Program</span></li></ul
 ><p></p><br><b>Sat 4/18 - Fri 4/24 </b><br><ul><li>Step 6 <b>DRAW</b> to <b
 >LOAD </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li></ul><b>Sat 4/25 - Fri 5/1 </b
 ><br><ul><li>Step 7 <b>ANCHOR </b>+ Building Your Mental Program</li><li><b
 >SCORING WEEK for OUTDOOR 3-9</b></li></ul><b>MAY</b><b><br></b><br><b>Sat 
 5/2 - Fri 5/8 </b> <br><ul><li>Step 8<b> </b><b><b>TRANSFER to HOLD</b> + <
 /b>Building Your Mental Program</li><li>Step 9<b> </b><b>EXPAND / AIM + </b
 >Building Your Mental Program</li></ul><b>Sat 5/9 - Fri 5/15</b> <br><ul><l
 i>Step 10 <b>RELEASE / FO</b><b>LLOW-THROUGH </b><b>+</b> Building Your Men
 tal Program</li><li>Step 11 <b>FEEDBACK +</b> Building Your Mental Program<
 /li></ul><b>Sat 5/16 - Fri 5/22  </b><br><ul><li><b>PUTTING IT ALL TOGETHER
  FUN !</b></li></ul><b>Sat 5/23 - Sun 5/31  </b><br><ul><li><b>SCORING WEEK
  - ATCI SPRING COMPETITION and STAR PIN SHOOT</b></li></ul><p><b>INTRO</b><
 /p><p><i>Each week the focus of your lessons will be on one or two particul
 ar </i><b><i>Steps of Shooting of the NTS (National Training System) </i></
 b><i>shot cycle\, to help you focus and improve your form\, which\, as we a
 ll know\, leads to greater and more consistent precision (tight groups of a
 rrows) and ultimately greater accuracy (tight groups of arrows dead center)
 </i>. <i>Concurrently you will be learning how to build a </i><b><i>strong 
 mental program</i></b><i>\, which will improve your focus\, awareness and c
 onfidence for competitions later.</i></p><p><i>The NTS is the </i><b><i>mos
 t biomechanically efficient and least injurious method of shooting</i></b><
 i>\, and is highly and continuously researched out at the Elite Athletes Ce
 nter in Chula Vista\, CA. It is what the Olympians do!</i></p><p><i>The 11 
 NTS Steps are cumulative with each step most successfully completed if the 
 previous steps have been completed well. As you reach higher levels\, you w
 ill learn the NTS Steps in progressively greater detail.</i></p><p><b>Goals
  by the end of the spring semester (May 31)</b></p><p>Make a list of what y
 ou want to accomplish by the end of the semester. <span>Email it to Coach R
 acae\, so you can discuss it together. </span></p><p>Confidence and consist
 ency in form and mind are your two main goals. Replicate the NTS step(s) mi
 ndfully and consistently on every shot\, and build a strong mental program 
 that is consistent on every shot. </p><p>Your conscious mind commands your 
 subconscious mind to put your body into position\, after you train your bod
 y to be in those positions. When you stay in the present\, just doing what 
 you need to do as you need to do it\, your conscious mind will be occupied\
 , instead of random thoughts entering your head or your being distracted by
  emotional or environmental elements. </p><p>You´ll need to build up your m
 ental program alongside your form knowledge\, so when your body is trained 
 to shoot excellent shots\, your self image and subconscious support you\, i
 nstead of undermining you. </p><p><i>Improving your training\, practicing\,
  and competition components\, process\, and skills is a perpetual lifetime 
 quest\, which you´ll slowly learn to love. You´ll  realize what is under yo
 ur control\, and you'll become your own best coach! Those who find all this
  fun and enjoy the journey are the ones who win - the champions!</i></p><p>
 <i>I know you can do it -  I'm your biggest fan!</i></p><p><i>​I'm also rea
 lly looking forward to seeing you improve\, succeed\, and thrive !​</i></p>
 <p><b><i>                                                   Coach Racae</i>
 </b></p>
