DESCRIPTION:<b>Google Maps</b>: We're next to <b>Donut Taco Palace</b> in A
 ustin Business Park in East Oak Hill in Southwest Austin\, 78735 near the i
 ntersection of Mopac (Loop 1) and 290W.<br><br>COME JOIN US AND REGISTER NO
 W !<br><br>Open to adults\, juniors 8+\, and parents! Please read all the i
 nfo below and in the registration and waivers. <br><br>The composition of t
 he classes are by skill level\, not age.. There is usually about an even sp
 lit between adults and juniors in each class.<br><br>More information\, reg
 istration forms and waivers are available at <a href="http://www.archerytra
 iningcenter.com"><u><u><u><u><u>www.archerytrainingcenter.com</u></u></u></
 u></u></a>.<br><br>Register here using ONE of these forms:<br><a href="http
 s://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeciOgkyuKTLZ5_ZaWCEyQKYSX1fWGpP5qakhT
 6OuAc6jJ_FQ/viewform"><u><u>2023 Indoor 1: First-time Class for Adults</u><
 /u></a>  OR<br><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSc_bYEFoE4
 oXkcm0T6fZK99fu_q6lL8wZGClXyfa1GZbahh-g/viewform"><u><u>2023 Indoor 1: Firs
 t-time Class for Juniors and Parents</u></u></a><br><br>Sign up for just ON
 E Indoor 1 class\, because most people graduate out of this class into Indo
 or 2 after the first lesson.<br><br>Your name will be added below and your 
 place reserved on a first registered and paid basis and after we receive 3 
 things:  <br><b>2023 OUTDOOR 1 REGISTRATION FORM   +  MEMBERSHIP AND WAIVER
 S PACKET +   FEE</b><b><br></b><u></u><br><b>USA Archery Level 4 NTS Coach 
 Racae Meyer and other instructors/coaches.</b><br><b>See </b><a href="https
