 r><br>5. <b>Asha B.\, </b>11\, on 60-cm target face\, pd <b>(W) - 37 pts -&
 gt\; Indoor 2</b><br><br>6. <b>Nikhita B.\, </b>9\, on 60-cm target face\, 
 pd <b>(W) - 57 pts -&gt\; Indoor 2</b><br><br>7. <b>Jeff B.\, </b>adult\, p
