 ill be two lines of 8 archers when the number of participants exceeds 8 arc
 hers.<br>Not more than 8 archers will be on the shooting line at the same t
 ime.<br>A = Line A<br>B = Line B<br><br>The archer and a maximum of one spe
 ctator will be allowed on the field until further notice or approved by Coa
 ch Racae. <br><br>Parents of juniors 10+ can sign up as an archer or watch 
 as a spectator. <br>Parents of juniors 8-9 years old need to register\, pay
 \, and shoot with their child for greater safety.<br><br>A maximum of one 8
 -year-old (+ parent) is accepted into each Indoor 1: First-time Class. <br>
