 ts over 30 arrows.<br>Adults don´t need a minimum score to graduate into In
 door 2.<br><br>At the end of each Indoor 1 class\, your scores will be post
 ed. If we did not finish a complete round (30 arrows)\, you may not recogni
 ze your final score\, because it will have been averaged by taking your rec
 orded score from your scorecard\, dividing it by the number of arrows you s
 hot to get an arrow average\, and then multiplying that by 30 to get a full
  round score.
