 nt</b> <br><ul><li>Draw elbow at height of arrow<ul><li>Moving around\, not
  down so elbow is lower than shoulder</li></ul></li></ul>2. <b>Flow</b> - R
 hythm and Timing<br><ul><li>Paying attention to flow from end of SET UP thr
 ough DRAW to LOAD\, so there is a continuous backward movement\, and the sa
 me every time</li><li>Reducing the "draw hand bounce" as LAN 2 is moving pa
 rallel to shooting line before ANCHOR</li></ul><br>3. Sent <b>video</b> of 
 M. showing above movements for self-correction between lessons<br><br><b>Re
