  (8.5 hrs/week available) Saturdays 3:30-5:30pm Sundays:  3:30-5:30pm  Sund
 ays:  6:00-7:00pm (Adults and Indoor 5 only) Tuesdays: 6:30-7:30pm  Tuesday
