 hrs) Indoor 4 at 18m:      $66/wk (min. 6 hrs) Indoor 5 at 18m:      $80/wk
  (min. 8 hrs)  USA Archery's Adult Training Program (ATP) follows a similar
  path to the Junior Olympic Archery Development (JOAD) program.   Your firs
 t step is to take an Indoor 1: First-time Class for Adults. Just click the 
 link or the Sign Up button at the top of this website.  Everyone starts out
  in our Recreational program at 9 meters. As you improve you progress to 13
 .5 meters then on to 18 meters indoors.   We welcome adult recurve and comp
 ound Olympic target archers at all levels of experience.  Recurve archers a
 ttend any of the group classes above or book private lessons with Coach Rac
