 3.5m <br>   250 pts              260 pts           -&gt\; Indoor 4 and Outd
 oor 4 at 18m/20m<br>   270 pts              280 pts           -&gt\; Indoor
  5 and Outdoor 5 at 30m<br>   290 pts              300 pts          -&gt\; 
 Indoor  6 and Outdoor 6 at 40m<br><br>You can shoot indoors indefinitely an
 d use the range's equipment.  When you'd like your own bow\, ask Coach Raca
 e for recommendations.<br><br>When you are ready to shoot outdoors in Outdo
 or 3-9:<ul><li>You'll definitely need your own bow\, based on Coach Racae's
  recommendations</li><li>You'll be granted access to the ATCI Calendar via 
 an email from Coach Racae\,so you can just add your name directly below und
 er "Registered Archers". </li><li>You will also be invited to join the What
 sApp ATCI Community. </li></ul><br><br><b>INDOOR CLASS SCHEDULE : </b>(Fees
  are below) <br>Register for ​​as many as your schedule and budget allows t
 o progress faster:<br><b>Sat         4:00-5:30 pm - INDOOR 2-6</b><br><b>Su
