 ish a complete round (30 arrows)\, you may not recognize your final score\,
  because it will have been averaged by taking your recorded score from your
  scorecard\, dividing it by the number of arrows you shot to get an arrow a
 verage\, and then multiplying that by 30 to get a full round score.
