DESCRIPTION:<b>WAIVERS:</b> Everyone needs to <b>sign the waivers in advanc
 e </b>of arriving at the range\, so we are not delayed in starting. Here's 
 the link: <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfsWlvFJhlvEMDP
 Iw2f8-x-Lwpwd06cVxvA7PGw-lgmRnD00w/viewform?usp=dialog" target="_blank"><u>
 <u>2026 Waives/Membership Packet for Corporate Team Events</u></u></a><br><
 br>As each participant signs the waivers\, it will be indicated below\, so 
 you will be aware of what we have received. <br><br><b>DIRECTIONS:</b> <b>G
 oogle Map "Donut Taco Palace"</b> to find us quickly - We are right next do
 or in Unit 102. (Some people are still being misdirected.) There is a targe
 t on the glass door and the unit is facing 290W service road going west on 
 the corner of Industrial Oaks Blvd and 290W. <br><br><b>ARRIVAL</b>: For a 
 12:30 pm start\, please <b>arrive by 12:15 pm</b>\, because we need to star
 t together at 12:30 pm. <br><br><b>CARPOOLING / PARKING:</b> Please meet an
 d carpool earlier from another location or from a big box store parking lot
  across the highway (like Target or At Home on the corner of Mopac and 290W
 ). It's easy and convenient to do. (Parking in front of the range and along
  Industrial Oaks Blvd may be limited\, depending on the number of participa
 nts.)<br><br><b>DRESS RECOMMENDATIONS: </b><br>Flat athletic shoes are best
 \, as we will be throwing our weight forward a little\, so balance and weig
 ht distribution is important. The bowstring can get slowed or entangled in 
 your clothing or hair\, so wearing tightly fitting clothes\, no wide skirts
 \, shirts without buttons on the front pockets and tying your hair back is 
 preferable. Longer brim baseball caps often prevent the string from reachin
 g your face\, so shorter brims or bucket hats are better.<br><br><b>All par
 ticipants need to complete waivers online before the event.</b><br><b>Here 
 is the direct link to complete: </b><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/
 d/e/1FAIpQLSfsWlvFJhlvEMDPIw2f8-x-Lwpwd06cVxvA7PGw-lgmRnD00w/viewform?usp=d
 ialog" target="_blank"><u><u>2026 Waives/Membership Packet for Corporate Te
 am Events</u></u></a>  <br><br>Waivers have been received from those shown 
 below in <b>bold with (W) - </b><br><b>Last update: Aug 6 at 4:20 pm - 21 s
 o far</b><br><ol><li><b>Aaron M. (W)</b></li><li><b>Alec M. (W)</b></li><li
 ><b>Andre S. </b><b>(W)</b></li><li><b>Blaine M. </b><b>(W)</b></li><li><b>
 Caleb F. (W)</b></li><li><b>Christi B</b>.<b> (W)</b></li><li><b>Christian 
 R. (W)</b></li><li>Christopher C.</li><li><b>CJ Melgar (W).</b></li><li><b>
 Devine F. </b><b> (W)</b></li><li><b>Devin B. </b><b>(W)</b></li><li>Gilber
 t Y.</li><li><b>Ian J. (W)</b></li><li><b>Jacob G. </b><b>(W)</b></li><li>J
 ames S.</li><li>Jariel V.</li><li>Jesse A.</li><li>Jesus O.</li><li><b>Jose
 ph F. </b><b>(W)</b></li><li>Julian L.</li><li><b>Krisheldon T. </b><b>(W)<
 /b></li><li>Lisa V.</li><li>Lorenzo A.</li><li><b>Martin R. (W)</b></li><li
 >Matthew G.</li><li><b>Michael</b> <b>L. (W)</b></li><li>Moe M. S.</li><li>
 Oscar R.</li><li>Raul S.</li><li><b>Renee M. </b><b>(W)</b></li><li><b>Samu
 el V.G. (W)</b></li><li>Savon B.</li><li>Thomas F.</li><li><b>Thorn S</b>.<
