 p\;ouid=104080193312046349991</a>) until you score  240 pts on the 60-cm ta
 rget face or 230 pts on the 40-cm target face. Then you will graduate to ou
 r outdoor classes !<br><br>After you graduate to Outdoor 3-9\, you will be 
 granted access to the ATCI Calendar via an email from Coach Racae\, and can
  just add your name under Registered Archers below..<br><br>SCHEDULE :<br>R
 egister for ​​as many as your schedule and budget allows to progress faster
 :<br>Sat/Sun   4:30-6:00 pm  <br>Wed         5:00-6:30 pm - Juniors &lt\;15
  and Parents.(Sign up at least 48 hours in advance (4:00 pm on Mondays) to 
 avoid cancellation)<br>                 6:30-8:00 pm <br><br>Always check t
 his calendar just before driving to class in case there are last-minutes ch
 anges or cancellations!<br><br>USA Archery Level 4 NTS Coach Racae Meyer un
 less otherwise noted above.<br><br>The level of each attending archer is no
 ted next to their name below\, to help you decide which classes to join. (E
 xample: Indoor 2 are beginners\; Outdoor 5+ (O5 @30m\, etc.) are competitiv
 e outdoor archers)<br>There is a minimum attendance of 3 registered archers
  for the class to be held.<br><br>Registered archers:<br>1. Stanley Y.\, ad
 ult\, pd (Indoor 2) 1.0 hr<br>2. Adit D.\, adult\, pd (Indoor 2) moved from
  cancelled  5/2 to 6/10 - 1.5 hrs<br>3. Abby - 1.5 hrs<br>4. Ellie - 1.5 hr
 s<br>5. Maxine -1.5 hrs<br>6 Emma A.\, 14\, pd (Outdoor 5) - 1.5 hrs<br>7.<
 br>8.<br>9.<br>10.<br>11.<br>12.<br><br>SINGLE Class Fees per archer for on
 e Indoor 2-6 class<br>Book and pay in advance.<br>$30 for 1 hr (book a 1-hr
  class\, or arrive 30 min after a 1.5-hr  starts or leave 30 min before cla
 ss ends)<br>$45 for 1.5-hr class<br><br>MONTHLY Discount Fee Packs<br>Pay b
 efore the 1st of each month\; book dates within the month<br>1 class/wk:   
    $218 (7.5 hrs\; 5 classes/mo)<br>2 classes/wk: $372 (13.5 hrs\; 9 classe
 s/mo)<br>3 classes/wk: $557 (21 hrs\; 14 classes/mo)<br>4 classes/wk: $675 
 (27 hrs\; 18 classes/mo)<br>5 classes/wk: $792 (33 hrs\; 22 classes/mo)<br>
 <br>MULTI-CLASS Discount Packets<br>Pay in advance and book when you're sur
 e of the dates.<br>  9 hours : $257 (6 classes)<br> 12 hours : $330 (8 clas
 ses)<br> 18 hours : $477 (12 classes) <br> 23 hours: $587 (15 classes)<br> 
 27 hours: $675 (18 classes)<br><br>There are 8 places on the shooting line\
 , but we often have double lines as in competitions\, depending on attendan
 ce.<br><br>Sign in/out upon arrival/departure<br>Coaching and whistle comma
 nds at all times.<br>Instruction in the National Training System.<br>Unfair
  games depending on attendance.<br><br>Please note: Youths &lt\;12 y.o. sho
 uld not shoot more than 100 arrows/day!<br><br>Prerequisites for Indoor 2: 
 <br>Adults: No min. score in Indoor 1 <br>Juniors: 50 pts in Indoor 1<br>Sc
 ores needed at 9m to advance to Indoor 3-6 and Outdoor 3-6:<br><br>        
          On 40-cm                  On 60-cm<br>               target face  
